window.FWN_IMMORTALITY_THROUGH_ARRAY_FORMATIONS_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_IMMORTALITY_THROUGH_ARRAY_FORMATIONS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1401,"title":"Chapter 1401 - 776 The Old Servant","paragraphs":["\"This little brat... what’s going on?!\"","His own magical White Bone Evil Sword, turned into tofu-like bits, crushed so easily by him?","This... is he really \"human\"?!","The old monster cultivator was shocked and confused.","But he was not willing to sit and wait for death.","This brat might be a formidable enemy, but after hundreds of years of planning and endless efforts, now having finally transformed into the Evil Spirit Sword Demon, he was definitely not an ant to be easily crushed!","Unless you break the cauldrons and sink the boats, fight a deadly battle, how would you know who will win in the end?","If you don’t fight hard, how will you know you can’t win?","\"Alright...\"","The old monster cultivator, with a bone for his body and sword remains for his limbs, revealed a strong fighting spirit in his fierce eyes. The bone sword was filled with venom-like demonic qi, his aura continually climbing higher, his skeletal body gradually became larger, surrounded by bloody sword qi.","\"Today, I will meet you, letting you know the terrifying body of a Sword Demon!\"","The old monster cultivator’s gaze turned fierce, moving swiftly from stillness, driving the force of the demon wraith, and with a strike.","The gigantic bone sword, condensed with boundless demonic qi, with a terrifying momentum, slashed toward Mo Hua in an instant.","This bone sword was immense.","Mo Hua’s body wasn’t even as tall as the bone sword.","But his expression was calm, just lightly throwing a punch.","A little fist against the gigantic White Bone Evil Sword.","In just a moment, the White Bone Evil Sword was shattered by Mo Hua’s fist.","The old monster cultivator’s expression was terrified, yet unwilling to give up, striking with all his might.","For a moment, the forest-white sword bones, demon thought sword qi, evil sword intent... were ceaselessly surging in the blood pool.","The old monster cultivator performing countless sword moves.","But whether it was sword bones, sword qi, or sword intent, however bloody or terrifying, however overwhelming, Mo Hua responded to all changes with constancy, with just a punch.","One punch, the sword bones broke, the sword qi dissipated, the sword intent vanished.","No move could not be resolved by his punch.","The old monster cultivator grew more aghast, yet more furious.","Must fight desperately!","If he doesn’t fight desperately, he won’t even have a chance to!","The old monster cultivator’s aura changed again, pupils turned pitch-black, sword bones continuously grew on him, like the segments of a centipede, his body transformed into a centipede, section by section climbing up, at the same time, his evil wraith telekinesis became more and more intense, almost reaching the peak of the Second Grade...","\"You forced me...\"","The old monster cultivator laughed fiercely.","Mo Hua looked at the old monster cultivator, his expression calm and unruffled, his gaze still indifferent, even with a hint of disappointment.","\"Tired of it...\"","Mo Hua said blandly.","The old monster cultivator’s sinister laughter abruptly stopped, followed by a bone-chilling fear in his heart.","The next moment, Mo Hua disappeared.","When he reappeared, he was already above the old monster cultivator’s head.","Mo Hua leapt high, gently stomping down.","This stomp was like a heavy hammer, powerfully smashing down.","The old monster cultivator was blasted into the ground like a cannonball.","He was in excruciating pain, even his skull cracked.","Before he could recover, he heard a \"creak, creak\" sound.","The old monster cultivator’s heart turned cold, glancing sideways, only to find in shock that all his bone sword segments had been completely snapped off by Mo Hua’s small pale hands, not a single one left.","The old monster cultivator struggled futilely.","At this moment, Mo Hua had already grasped his spine bone.","With a light squeeze, his spine bone would break as well.","The old monster cultivator was so frightened his soul was about to scatter, immediately he cried out in horror:","\"Little ancestor, spare me!\"","Mo Hua’s movement paused slightly.","Seeing this, the old monster cultivator immediately said:","\"Little ancestor, spare my life, I have great use!\"","Mo Hua stepped on his head, \"What use do you have?\"","With his head stepped on, the old monster cultivator felt humiliated, but his heart was more filled with despair:","\"This little brat, what is his origin, what kind of existence is he, how can he be so terrifying?\"","He had never expected that as a Sword Demon Evil Spirit, perfectly fused with his own evil sword, at the peak of the Second Grade, he would truly be like an ant, being effortlessly \"controlled\" by this little ancestor, without the slightest power to fight back.","Some people, unless they really take action, you wouldn’t know how terrifying they are.","Some things, unless you try hard, you wouldn’t know the despair.","The old monster cultivator quivered, said:","\"As long as you, as long as you don’t kill me, I’m willing to do anything.\"","\"What can you do?\"","Mo Hua looked down from above, with an interrogating tone, seemingly ready to kill and snap the old monster cultivator’s spine at any disagreement.","The old monster cultivator panicked: \"I can cast swords!\"","\"Oh?\" Mo Hua’s small eyebrows raised.","The old monster cultivator hurriedly said: \"I am a disciple of the Tai’a Sect, once of the Ouyang Family’s direct lineage, I’m skilled in the artifact refining technique, the sword casting Dao, over the years in the Ten Thousand Demons Prison, I’ve cast countless sword weapons, honing my skills to perfection...\"","\"As long as little ancestor you spare my life, I am willing to serve you, cast swords and refine artifacts.\"","Mo Hua shook his head and said: \"You forgot, you’re already dead, now you, as a Sword Demon, an Evil Spirit, how can you still help me cast swords?\"","The old monster cultivator’s expression trembled.","He forgot, he already isn’t human, not even a monster cultivator.","With an evil spirit body, how can he cast swords?","Mo Hua’s little hand, gestured to snap his spine bone.","The old monster cultivator shivered with dread, immediately said: \"I can teach!\"","\"Teach?\"","\"That’s right,\" the old monster cultivator said, \"Although I can’t personally refine artifacts and cast swords, my knowledge and experience in refining is abundant, anything you want to learn, I can tell you...\"","Mo Hua’s expression hesitated, as if contemplating something, his gaze occasionally dangerous, occasionally softening.","The old monster cultivator’s heart rose and fell with Mo Hua’s gaze, anxious and uneasy.","He thought for a moment, and immediately added:","\"Own Magical Treasure!\"","Mo Hua was slightly startled, his eyes slightly brightened."]},{"number":1402,"title":"Chapter 1402 - 776 The Old Servant_2","paragraphs":["The old monster cultivator saw this and was overjoyed, seizing his lifeline, he immediately said:","\"Own Magical Treasure! I have obtained the most orthodox inheritance of the Tai’a Sect, and I know how to refine one!\"","\"If you spare my life, I will help you refine your own Magical Treasure!\"","\"Sword, spear, blade, axe... any kind of Magical Treasure is fine, I know the refining techniques for all, I can tell you all of them!\"","Mo Hua looked puzzled, \"How do I know you won’t deceive me?\"","The old monster cultivator said: \"I can swear a deadly oath, swear to the Heavenly Dao, if I lie, then let heaven strike me down, let my soul scatter, and never reincarnate!\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then shook his head and said:","\"I have Junior Brother Mu, and when it comes to own Magical Treasure, he will help me refine it.\"","The old monster cultivator said urgently: \"He can’t do it!\"","Mo Hua was displeased.","The old monster cultivator hastily explained: \"That child’s talent is there, and he has enough resilience, but he is too young, lacking in refining experience, and hasn’t been taught the core refining technique of the Tai’a Sect.\"","Mo Hua raised an eyebrow, \"It wasn’t taught to him, but it was to you?\"","The old monster cultivator realized he misspoke and said awkwardly:","\"I... after all, I have lived longer, and knowing more about Artifact Refining is normal...\"","Mo Hua looked deeply at the old monster cultivator but did not pursue the matter further and instead asked:","\"What else? Just being able to cast a sword is not enough, you need to have other uses...\"","After all, I am not a Sword Cultivator.","Having an own Magical Treasure doesn’t necessarily mean using a Spirit Sword.","Besides, this old thing is an old swindler, not worth trusting, and I still have to discern the truth of his words, it’s too troublesome.","If he has no other use, I plan to kill and eat him.","After all, since being \"grounded\" by Elder Master Xun, I haven’t had a proper meal in a long time, and my Divine Sense is starving and thirsty.","In desperate need of \"eating\" something to fill the stomach first.","Mo Hua had a cute appearance with red lips and white teeth.","Especially his lips, which were strikingly red.","The old monster cultivator looked on and, for some reason, felt a chill down his spine.","He immediately said: \"I remember the way; I can tell you the way out of the valley!\"","Mo Hua was slightly stunned, a little surprised, \"You know the way out?\"","The old monster cultivator nodded, smiled bitterly: \"I have been in this valley for too long, most of what can be known, I know.\"","\"Especially in the first hundred years, I thought of escaping this Valley of Ten Thousand Demons every moment, so I put a lot of thought into figuring out the clear paths out.\"","\"But...\"","The old monster cultivator looked dejected, \"Even so, I still can’t get out.\"","Mo Hua asked curiously: \"Why?\"","The old monster cultivator said: \"The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons is vast, with complex paths, passing through the Ten Thousand Demons Prison, the slaughterhouse, as well as areas like the Demon Refining Pot, the Evil Pill Valley... monster cultivators everywhere, heavily guarded, if you don’t know the way, outsiders simply can’t get out...\"","\"And that’s the least of it...\"","The old monster cultivator’s expression grew grave, \"Even if you pass through these perilous places, at the end, there is still an insurmountable Heavenly Chasm.\"","\"Heavenly Chasm?\"","The old monster cultivator nodded, \"This Heavenly Chasm is a painting, and also the core of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons. The map nurtures ten thousand demons, filled with evil spirits, and the monster cultivators in the valley usually call it... the Demon Refining Diagram!\"","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat.","The old monster cultivator looked fearful, \"Although I don’t know... how you entered the valley, if I guessed correctly, you should be here to save someone.\"","\"To save someone, you need to leave the valley.\"","\"I can guide you, but if you can’t break the Demon Refining Diagram, you will still be trapped in this Valley of Ten Thousand Demons forever.\"","\"But that’s something I can’t account for...\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment, nodded and said:","\"Alright, I’ll spare your life.\"","Since the Demon Refining Diagram is right in front of me, I can endure for now.","The small fry before me can be left uneaten for now, lest I spoil my appetite and miss out on the grand feast.","The chill in the old monster cultivator’s heart lessened sharply, knowing that the Death Tribulation had passed, he breathed a long sigh of relief.","He raised his head and sneaked a look at the childlike Mo Hua, feeling sighs in his heart, the Cultivation World indeed is too perilous.","A little kid, more terrifying than even someone like him, a monster demon.","Mo Hua released its spine bone.","The old monster cultivator quivered as he stood up, though he dared not stand completely upright, choosing to half-kneel in front of Mo Hua, to avoid appearing disrespectful.","Mo Hua looked up, glanced at the surrounding Formation Patterns, and suddenly, out of curiosity, asked: \"I’ll ask you another question, be honest.\"","\"Yes.\" The old monster cultivator dared not refuse.","Mo Hua pointed at the surrounding Formation Patterns and asked:","\"Where did you learn these Formation Patterns?\"","The old monster cultivator shivered, dared not speak.","Mo Hua’s gaze grew increasingly dangerous.","The old monster cultivator could only bite the bullet and truthfully said: \"It’s... I learned it from the Demon Refining Diagram...\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, \"Learned from the Demon Refining Diagram?\"","\"Yes,\" said the old monster cultivator, \"This is a Formation Pattern from the Demon Refining Diagram, I do not know its origin, only know its profoundness, it can even... seal Remnant Souls.\"","\"I then took the opportunity to secretly copy it down for emergencies.\"","\"But I am not a Formation Master, not proficient in Formations, even after copying it down, I still couldn’t understand or replicate it.\"","The old monster cultivator sighed, \"So, I practiced daily, day and night practicing, as long as there was time, I would use human blood to inscribe these Patterns, and eventually, it became a habit ingrained in my bones...\"","\"Thus, after spending over two hundred years, practicing day and night, by some inexplicable impulse, somehow, I managed to learn this Formation Pattern.\"","Mo Hua understood, \"So you wanted to find a way to inscribe this Formation Pattern onto the Sword Bone. So that when your Divine Thought turns into Demon Thought after your death, it could be ’sealed’ in the sword by this Formation Pattern, becoming a ’Sword Demon’, living in an alternative way.\"","The old monster cultivator was stunned.","He did not expect his meticulous planning to be seen through by this little cultivator at a glance."]},{"number":1403,"title":"Chapter 1403 - 776 Old Servant_3","paragraphs":["Now that things had come to this, the old monster cultivator had nothing to hide, \"It’s like this, I... I had initially prepared for two outcomes.\"","\"In the best scenario, naturally, form the core, using... that Ouyang boy’s flesh as a medium, to cast a life-bound evil sword, I would then seize another opportunity to form a Golden Core, without having to abandon this mortal body.\"","\"If this plan failed... I had inquired within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons about some methods to transform the Divine Sense into an Evil Spirit, using this technique, after a gruesome death, when the corpse vanished, the remaining Divine Thought could then enter the Sword Bone, becoming a Sword Demon, residing within the sword.\"","Mo Hua’s gaze was sharp, \"I’m afraid that’s not all there is to it...\"","The old monster cultivator, resigned, could only speak with difficulty,","\"Yes... I originally also intended to use the fresh blood of that Ouyang boy to cast this sword, merging blood and sword. In this way, this Sword Bone would be nurtured into his life-bound evil sword, I would be the Sword Demon within the sword, and he would become my ’Sword Slave’, following my commands...\"","Mo Hua nodded, feeling a bit emotional inside.","This old thing really had a deep scheme.","Mo Hua estimated the time, thinking for a moment, then said to the old monster cultivator,","\"I won’t kill you for now, you let me out, guide me out of this Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, if I find out you dare deceive me...\"","Mo Hua clenched a small fist, smiling coldly, \"Even if you are an Evil Spirit, I will make it so you can’t live, and you can’t die!\"","The old monster cultivator said in fear,","\"I dare not, I dare not! I will comply with the little ancestor’s orders in all things!\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Let me out.\"","\"Okay, okay!\" The old monster cultivator, as if receiving a great pardon, immediately constrained all demonic thoughts, transforming into a white bone longsword, communicating,","\"Touch the White Bone Sword body, and you can leave this Blood Pool.\"","Mo Hua frowned, pondered for a moment, and roughly understood a bit.","This sword-casting Blood Pool was an illusionary realm within the sword.","The entrance and exit were the old monster cultivator himself transformed into the White Bone Evil Sword.","Once inside this Blood Pool, to get out, one must either kill this old monster cultivator or let him reveal his true form to open the door, there was no other way out.","Mo Hua glanced around, then thought to himself,","\"Perhaps... dismantling the Divine Formation Patterns around, making this Blood Pool illusionary realm unable to seal Divine Thought, allowing it to collapse on its own, would also permit exit.\"","However, since the old monster cultivator was so sensible, it was unnecessary to make things difficult for him.","Mo Hua’s fingertip touched the White Bone Evil Sword.","In an instant, the scenery changed, and upon opening his eyes again, he saw Ouyang Mu kneeling in front of him, his eyes red and full of worry.","Seeing Mo Hua open his eyes, Ouyang Mu was stunned, then rejoiced immensely.","\"Brother Mo, are you alright?\"","The old monster cultivator was dead, the blood mist dispersed, and Mo Hua fell unconscious to the ground, life and death unknown.","Ouyang Mu was unaware of the situation, not knowing what to do.","Seeing Mo Hua awaken at this moment, he finally breathed a sigh of relief.","Mo Hua nodded, \"It’s alright.\"","\"What exactly happened, is that old... old wretch completely dead now?\" Ouyang Mu still harbored some worry.","\"Sort of.\" Mo Hua said.","This matter was somewhat complicated and troublesome to explain, so Mo Hua didn’t tell Ouyang Mu.","Moreover, now was not the time to discuss this.","The old monster cultivator had sealed the main door, perhaps it could be covered up for a moment, but over time, it would surely be discovered.","Measures must be taken to cover up.","Others, especially Jin Gui, must not be allowed to know what happened here, otherwise, they would certainly become suspicious.","Saving Little Wood and the others would be all the more difficult.","Mo Hua looked around and frowned.","The Golden Lock Formation, Earth Fire Formation, Di Sha Formation, and Sword Control...","There were too many traces, impossible to erase in the short term.","These means of the cultivators differed from those of the monster cultivators, it could be discerned at a glance.","\"Since that’s the case, I can only blow it all up...\"","In the Chamber of Evil Instruments, there was greenish bone fire, a turbid Blood Pool, and all sorts of foul-smelling flesh, once exploded, and mixed together.","Evil Qi and Blood Qi would naturally pollute the Spiritual Power traces.","Even if traces of formations and sword control remained, they would be taken as remnants of evil formations and evil swords.","Having thought it through, Mo Hua glanced at Ouyang Mu, \"Little Wood, you’ll have to endure some hardship.\"","Ouyang Mu was startled, not quite comprehending, but nevertheless nodded resolutely, \"Brother, you just give the order.\"","Mo Hua then said, \"Later, I will blast this house apart to cover the evidence.\"","\"I’ll select a place for you, you stay inside, when the formations blow up, and rock walls collapse, it might bury you underneath.\"","\"When those monster cultivators dig you out, pretend to be unconscious.\"","\"If they ask you what happened, just say that the old monster suddenly went mad, lost his mind, like he had a Deviation, killed the guarding and watching monster cultivators, then closed the door, claiming to perish together with the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons...\"","\"You ran far away, so you survived.\"","\"As for the rest, you know nothing.\"","Ouyang Mu repeated Mo Hua’s words in his mind, silently memorized them, and then nodded.","Then Mo Hua began to prepare to blow up the house.","The house itself had formations, he only needed to make some tweaks on the original formation framework.","Once all was planned, Mo Hua chose a corner for Ouyang Mu to crouch, covering his head.","It was a place that would be untouched by the damage from the formation.","Even if some falling rocks descended, they wouldn’t harm him.","Then Mo Hua picked up the old monster cultivator’s life-bound Bone Sword.","The old monster cultivator turned into the White Bone Sword Demon resided within this Bone Sword.","Mo Hua stored this Bone Sword in his Storage Bag.","He was counting on this Bone Sword to guide him, after all.","Once everything was ready, Mo Hua stealthily left the Chamber of Evil Instruments, then outside, used Divine Sense to activate the formations within the house.","Instantly, fire and blood light rose in all directions.","The Chamber of Evil Instruments collapsed with a roar, debris flying, causing surrounding monster cultivators to be alarmed.","Before long, Jin Gui, the steward, rushed over.","His face looked worse than pig liver, immediately ordering numerous monster cultivators to unearth the collapsed ruins.","Mo Hua watched from afar.","When Little Wood was dug out and seemed unharmed, Mo Hua quietly left.","Little Wood had great use.","These monster cultivators wouldn’t make things difficult for him for the time being.","And finding out what really happened in the Chamber of Evil Instruments would occupy them substantially.","After leaving, Mo Hua returned to the Formation Pivot Secret Chamber.","He thought about it, then took apart the White Bone Longsword as well.","This sword was too long, carrying it around was inconvenient, so he used his best Artifact Refining skills to dismantle the sword body.","The sword blade was also mostly melted with formations, leaving only a hilt with a small piece of the broken sword.","The old monster cultivator’s evil thoughts now resided within the broken sword.","And it was near the hilt engraved with Divine Formation Patterns.","So even with the sword body broken, the impact wasn’t significant.","Mo Hua grasped the broken bone sword, nodding.","It was much more convenient to carry now.","Next, he had to have this old monster cultivator guide him, to find the route out of the labyrinthine Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","And to locate the final Heavenly Chasm within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons—","The Demon Refining Diagram.","Mo Hua’s eyes shone brightly in the dark night.","He was determined to try, to see if this \"Heavenly Chasm\" could indeed obstruct him.","And to see for himself if this Demon Refining Diagram truly housed many Demon Wraiths..."]},{"number":1404,"title":"Chapter 1404 - 777 Mural","paragraphs":["Mo Hua eavesdropped on the conversation between Jin Gui and the monster cultivator.","Everything was just as he had anticipated.","The Chamber of Evil Instruments had been blown up, leaving a scene of devastation.","The old monster cultivator, who was forging the Evil Sword, had gone insane, leaving behind a trace of his flesh, along with the corpses of two monster cultivators at the scene.","The two monster cultivators died miserably, with cuts from jointed limbs on their bodies, clearly killed by strangulation from a Centipede Demon.","It was evident that there had been a deadly battle during their lifetimes.","The old monster cultivator was the one who acted.","Besides that, the Artifact Refining Bone Furnace, Blood Pool, Evil Sword, Formation, everything was destroyed, tainted with dirty blood, making it impossible for anyone to distinguish what’s problematic and what’s not.","Jin Gui was furious, yet he could only smooth things over.","Being the one in charge, any slip-up would lead to the leader or the young master questioning his capabilities.","Therefore, it was best to keep this matter small.","He didn’t dare to make it a big issue.","As for Ouyang Mu, with his Mid-stage Foundation Establishment Cultivation, being taciturn, even if he luckily survived, he wouldn’t be suspected.","Jin Gui was also relieved that Ouyang Mu didn’t die when the Chamber of Evil Instruments collapsed, otherwise he would be in big trouble.","Thus, Little Wood was temporarily safe.","As for Ling Huxiao and Song Jian, their situation was still okay.","After all, it was not yet the time when \"the picture reveals the dagger\".","He could leave for a while.","Mo Hua went to see the three of Ling Huxiao, saying, \"I’m going to scout, and it might take a few days before I come back. Be careful, all of you.\"","Ling Huxiao nodded solemnly.","Ouyang Mu said, \"Brother Mo, take care.\"","Song Jian, though keeping a stern face and saying nothing, felt a sudden emptiness inside.","When Mo Hua was around, although he was often in hiding and unseen, Song Jian always felt much more at ease and even had some jerky to eat.","But now with Mo Hua gone, he suddenly felt particularly insecure.","Song Jian’s mood became tangled.","Mo Hua, being unconcerned about him, gradually hid his figure and disappeared.","Ling Huxiao and the others exchanged glances, feeling that with Mo Hua gone, the Ten Thousand Demons Prison seemed to have suddenly become \"ominous\" again.","...","In the Ten Thousand Demons Prison, at the top of a cell.","Mo Hua gradually revealed his figure.","Around him, there were no signs of monster cultivators, only the huge chained monster beasts growling softly by themselves.","Mo Hua took out half of a Bone Sword and asked, \"Where to go?\"","The half Bone Sword was silent, with no response.","Mo Hua threatened, \"If you don’t speak up, I’ll destroy you.\"","Sure enough, a vague, old voice came from the sword, \"Wait... little ancestor... I spoke...\"","The voice paused for a moment and then continued.","\"...you didn’t hear it...\"","Mo Hua listened intently, and after a moment, he realized that the old monster cultivator was indeed talking, but it wasn’t through \"speaking\", it was more like...","\"Divine Sense Voice Transmission.\"","Mo Hua was slightly stunned, \"You can use Divine Sense Voice Transmission?\"","The old monster cultivator sighed, \"I’ve already died, without the flesh, only residual thought force, so as long as I speak, it’s ’Divine Sense Voice Transmission’...\"","\"Oh, right.\" Mo Hua suddenly understood.","Then he asked again, \"If I don’t speak, can you perceive it when I use Divine Sense Voice Transmission?\"","The old monster cultivator was a bit speechless, but he didn’t dare call Mo Hua \"ignorant\", speaking tactfully:","\"Little ancestor, you jest, cultivators below the Feather Transformation Realm can’t ’Divine Sense Voice Transmission’.\"","\"Why can it be done only after Feather Transformation?\" Mo Hua asked seriously.","\"This...\" The old monster cultivator said awkwardly, \"I am merely at Foundation Establishment, thousands of miles away from the Feather Transformation Realm, the specifics in between... this old one is ignorant, not very clear...\"","\"Oh.\" Mo Hua was somewhat displeased.","This old creature was somewhat like a half-filled bucket, knowing the result but not the reason.","But it didn’t matter.","\"So the situation now is, you can quietly use Divine Sense Voice Transmission, and I can only speak to you?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Yes...\" the old monster cultivator said softly.","Mo Hua nodded, \"Alright then...\"","He pointed the White Bone Broken Sword forward again, asking once more:","\"Which way?\"","The White Bone Broken Sword was silent for a moment, seemingly in thought, or recalling the path, and after a while, the old monster cultivator transmitted to Mo Hua:","\"To the right, past the cell of the blood-red Wolf Demon, the second stone door, turn right and go inward...\"","Mo Hua glanced to the right and nodded.","He re-cloaked himself, preparing to move in the direction the old monster cultivator indicated.","Just as he took a step, he suddenly remembered something, shaking the White Bone Broken Sword in his hand, and warned:","\"Old creature, don’t deceive me, or I’ll let you know what real ’terror’ is.\"","The old monster cultivator hurriedly said:","\"I don’t dare, I don’t dare...\"","At least for the short term, it had been threatened by Mo Hua, not daring to entertain any plans of defiance.","Besides...","The old monster cultivator said softly, \"I am not called ’old creature’...\"","The voice was small, yet Mo Hua still heard it.","\"That’s right, you’re not called ’old creature’? Then what’s your name?\" Mo Hua asked curiously.","The old monster cultivator sighed, showing a sense of emotion, \"Before I became a monster cultivator, I was a disciple of the Tai’a Sect, surnamed Ouyang, named...\"","Who knew that as he was speaking, Mo Hua wasn’t listening at all, instead muttering to himself:","\"’Old creature’ isn’t a great name, it’s a bit impolite, I’ll give you a nickname, I’m really good at nicknames...\"","The old monster cultivator fell silent.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, a flash of inspiration, \"You’re the Sword Demon, originally a sword, and full of bones, I’ll call you ’Sword Bone’.\"","The old monster cultivator almost thought Mo Hua was calling him \"cheap bones\".","It felt a bit indignant.","Its dignity didn’t allow it to accept such a humiliating name.","But its courage was not enough to support even the slightest protest.","Sword Bone it is...","The old monster cultivator accepted the name, forced to also praise Mo Hua untruthfully:"]},{"number":1405,"title":"Chapter 1405 - 777 Mural_2","paragraphs":["\"Good name...the young master is indeed a ’master’ at naming.\"","Mo Hua gladly accepted the compliment and then said:","\"Lead the way, Sword Bone.\"","The old monster cultivator, named \"Sword Bone\" by Mo Hua, helplessly accepted his fate and said: \"Alright...\"","Then Sword Bone led the way.","Mo Hua concealed his presence, extending his Divine Sense to observe the surroundings while holding the White Bone Broken Sword and listening to the Divine Thought transmission from Sword Bone as he wandered through the complex Ten Thousand Demons Prison.","The entire Valley of Ten Thousand Demons was constructed within the hollowed-out belly of a mountain, enormous in scale, featuring numerous Stone Palaces and Stone Chambers, with densely interwoven corridors and passages, patrolled by monster cultivators, crisscrossing paths that can easily lead to confusion without guidance.","Fortunately, \"Sword Bone\" was very experienced and familiar with the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, and since he was under Mo Hua’s control, he dared not make any trouble, so he journeyed diligently and reliably.","After walking for an unspecified length of time, Mo Hua arrived at a large gate.","This gate stood tall and imposing, with two giant monster beast stone statues adorned with fierce and terrifying Monster Patterns.","This was the gate to the Ten Thousand Demons Prison.","In front of the gate, there was a locking Formation, though it wasn’t too advanced, but there were a few monster cultivators guarding it, which posed some trouble.","\"Every six hours, the monster cultivators change shifts, providing a gap of several breaths...\"","\"Sword Bone\" secretly transmitted.","Mo Hua didn’t have the patience.","He quietly hid in the shadows, selecting a red-haired hyena monster cultivator.","The Dog Pattern among the Four Symbols Monster Pattern, he had analyzed it, and the corresponding Formation Pivot had been categorized into his \"Four Symbols Demon Pattern Repository.\"","Taking advantage of its inattentiveness, Mo Hua started Ink Manipulation with his Divine Sense.","A mass of Spiritual Ink floated in the air, forming a thread of ink, quietly moving and winding, finally attaching itself to the leg of the monster cultivator, forming the Four Symbols Dog Pattern Formation Pivot.","The monster cultivator had rough skin and flesh, with dull senses.","The Dog Demon only felt a slight coolness on its leg, initially not paying much attention.","But when it noticed that the coolness had become a bit strange, it was already too late.","The Monster Pattern flashed, the demonic power instantly spiraled out of control, reversed upward under Mo Hua’s manipulation, and surged toward the top of its head.","The hyena monster cultivator’s Divine Sense became abnormal, exploding in ferocity, instantly pouncing on several nearby monster cultivators.","The scene descended into chaos.","The monster cultivators started killing each other.","Screeches and curses mixed together, blood splattered all over the ground.","Mo Hua swaggered out through the gate of the Ten Thousand Demons Prison.","Sword Bone, residing within the White Bone Broken Sword, witnessed all of this and felt a chill in his heart.","He hadn’t even noticed how this little ancestor silently caused the monster cultivators to lose control and start fighting among themselves.","Those gate-guarding monster cultivators were quite powerful, yet in the hands of this little ancestor, they seemed just like \"toys.\"","Too terrifying...","Sword Bone’s underlying thoughts dwindled further.","After leaving the Ten Thousand Demons Prison, there were several Great Daos in front.","Mo Hua asked again: \"Which path to take?\"","Sword Bone responded with a trembling voice: \"Left...\"","Mo Hua looked up, nodded, and stepped onto the left Great Dao.","As he proceeded deeper, the view became more expansive, astonishing Mo Hua increasingly.","The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons was indeed enormous.","The Ten Thousand Demons Prison was only a part of it.","Elsewhere, there were still numerous sinister Tao Cultivation buildings standing.","Exploring each one of them would take a very long time.","Under the constraint of time now, he could only bypass them.","After walking for a while longer, the scent of blood suddenly became extremely intense.","Mo Hua frowned and looked ahead, seeing a vast site filled with numerous large guillotines.","On the guillotines, there were chains as thick as a man’s arm, and giant guillotines driven by Formation were erected.","At that moment, a Bear Demon was shackled by thick chains on the guillotine.","Once the Formation was activated, the colossal guillotine swooshed past, chopping off the Bear Demon’s head, causing blood to gush like a spring, flowing down to the Blood Pool beneath the platform.","On other guillotines, there were also many monster beasts with their heads \"severed.\"","Currently, numerous monster cultivators were busy dissecting the bodies of these monster beasts.","The dissected monster beast skins, bones, heads, Demon Cores, viscera, and so on were being segregated and stored accordingly.","\"This is the slaughterhouse...\"","Sword Bone transmitted.","\"Slaughterhouse...\"","Mo Hua frowned, muttering silently in his heart.","Sword Bone added: \"This place didn’t have a name initially, ’slaughterhouse’ is a name agreed upon by the monster cultivators, where all the monster beasts caught in the Ten Thousand Demons Prison are dissected...\"","Mo Hua nodded and continued walking forward.","After another two hours, they saw a tower-like structure.","\"This is the Demon Refining Pot.\" Sword Bone said.","Mo Hua was somewhat puzzled and lowered his voice: \"Isn’t this a tower? Why is it called a Demon Refining Pot?\"","Sword Bone replied: \"It’s said that this Demon Refining Pot is a type of Tao Cultivation building from the Southern Barbarian Land in the Great Wilderness, cast in the form of a ’pot,’ forging a demon tower, serving as both a building and a Spiritual Artifact.\"","Mo Hua looked up and realized that the entire tower in front, adorned with demon statues of serpents coiled around, had an upper and lower belly with a narrowed middle layer, indeed resembling a ’pot.’","\"The naming habit in the Great Wilderness is really peculiar...\"","Mo Hua muttered silently.","The old monster cultivator named \"Sword Bone\" by Mo Hua froze momentarily, knowing not what to say.","\"Have you ever been inside this tower... this Demon Refining Pot?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"No,\" Sword Bone replied, his tone slightly heavy, \"I don’t know what’s inside, and I am an Artifact Refiner, casting swords daily, so I haven’t had the chance to enter the Demon Refining Pot.\"","\"Alright then,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"Let’s bypass it.\"","Everything requires assessment of priority."]},{"number":1406,"title":"Chapter 1406 - 777 Mural_3","paragraphs":["The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons is too big, I definitely can’t explore it all, so let’s not complicate things.","\"Lead the way.\" Mo Hua ordered again.","Sword Bone obediently continued to guide Mo Hua.","After walking a while, they encountered a large area of alchemy rooms, roughly estimating there were dozens.","Each alchemy room contained a White Bone Pill Furnace.","Many demon cultivators were tirelessly refining evil pills inside.","A portion of monster beast materials, especially the viscera, was brought in right after slaughtering, and while still fresh, was refined into pills, dripping with blood.","Mo Hua frowned, somewhat confused.","\"Why are there so many alchemy rooms in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons?\"","\"The more evil pills, the better, no matter how many, they’re never too much... After all, there are so many demon cultivators in the valley.\" Sword Bone said.","Mo Hua nodded slightly, then curiously asked:","\"What about artifact refining? Are you the only one refining here?\"","Sword Bone patiently explained: \"Pills are consumables, evil artifacts are durables, they’re not the same...\"","\"Moreover, most in this valley are demon cultivators, who kill relying more on their own henchmen rather than evil artifacts. Only those demon cultivators whose demon skills must be performed using evil artifacts, or those sword cultivators who, after becoming demon cultivators, still unwillingly abandon their swordsmanship, would use evil artifacts.\"","\"So, the consumption of evil artifacts is far less than that of evil pills.\"","\"Besides, it’s not just me here as an evil arms master, there used to be a few others, but they couldn’t last and eventually died one by one.\"","\"In the end, only I remain...\"","\"Oh.\" Mo Hua nodded, suddenly sensing something amiss, \"Could it be you killed the other evil arms masters?\"","Sword Bone quietly chuckled, \"To not hide from you, little young master, only one evil arms master can live long in the valley. Once there are too many, they aren’t valued anymore.\"","This Sword Bone, indeed not a good person...","Mo Hua silently criticized inwardly.","But it doesn’t matter, after all, those who died were evil arms masters.","Mo Hua asked again: \"In this valley, there are artifact refining rooms and alchemy rooms; is there a place for drawing formations?\"","Sword Bone was stunned, shook his head, and transmitted a message:","\"That, I don’t know. There are almost no formation masters among demon cultivators.\"","\"No formation masters?\" Mo Hua was somewhat shocked.","Sword Bone explained: \"Once demon cultivators enter the demon path, their bodies become stronger due to the amplification of demonic power, but correspondingly, their divine sense will decline and their mental state will become unstable.\"","\"The key to formation masters lies in the divine sense, not only must it be strong, but also the mind clear.\"","\"With declining divine sense, one cannot draw formations, and with unclear mind, even formation patterns will gradually be forgotten, hence, formation masters among demon cultivators are few and far between...\"","Sword Bone’s voice was slightly somber, \"At least I’ve lived through hundreds of years in this Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, and haven’t seen many formation masters.\"","\"Those few, either couldn’t adapt to the life of demon cultivators and died early, or entered the demon path, lost their minds, gradually forgetting they were formation masters...\"","Mo Hua frowned, \"Then where do the formations in this Valley of Ten Thousand Demons come from?\"","Sword Bone hesitated to speak.","Mo Hua grasped the sword hilt, striking the ground a few times.","Sword Bone relented, immediately said: \"It’s the leader.\"","Mo Hua’s heart tensed slightly, \"Leader? Golden Core Realm demon cultivator?\"","\"No, not him.\" Sword Bone shook his head, \"It’s Foundation Establishment, not yet Golden Core. In this Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, there are only three elders at Golden Core.\"","\"Why can a Foundation Establishment do the leader’s role?\" Mo Hua was puzzled.","Sword Bone solemnly said: \"Because all demon tattoos on the demon cultivators in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons are personally drawn by the leader...\"","Mo Hua frowned.","All demon tattoos on the demon cultivators were drawn by this leader?","This means this leader has mastered almost all kinds of Four Symbols Demon Arrays?","Also mastered Divine Tao Array?","Wouldn’t that make him... even more skilled than me?","A Foundation Building cultivator can possess such formidable formation skills?","Mo Hua didn’t believe it.","Of course, mainly he couldn’t accept it.","Until now, he hadn’t met anyone in the same realm more skilled than him as a formation master.","\"No...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a while, quickly realizing a question, frowned: \"You said all demon tattoos on demon cultivators were drawn by this ’leader’?\"","\"But this Valley of Ten Thousand Demons has been established for at least a few hundred years, right?\"","\"If this leader is only at the Foundation Establishment Realm, how can he have lived so long?\"","Sword Bone shook his head, \"This... I don’t know, the leader in the valley acts mysteriously, during my hundreds of years here, I’ve only seen him a few times, and from afar, never knowing his true nature.\"","\"A little strange...\"","Mo Hua muttered.","This \"leader\" definitely has some secret.","But time is urgent now, it’s not suitable to be too obsessed.","The urgent matter is something else...","Mo Hua didn’t plan to stay here in the alchemy rooms, because they were refining evil pills, even if he stole or took them, they were of no use.","\"Continue leading the way.\" Mo Hua said, \"Take me to see the Demon Refining Diagram.\"","Sword Bone was a bit apprehensive.","Especially now in its \"evil spirit\" state, for some reason, it feared the Demon Refining Diagram even more.","It reminded: \"That diagram is very dangerous, better not rashly...\"","Mo Hua asked: \"How dangerous?\"","Sword Bone still wanted to speak, then suddenly paused, only realizing that the Demon Refining Diagram is dangerous, but this little ancestor who \"held him hostage\" might not be.","Sword Bone sighed.","Fine, none of them are good.","Just lead him there.","Hopefully this wicked little ancestor would die in the Demon Refining Diagram, then he could be free.","By then, finding another \"Sword Slave\" might lead to surviving the ordeal and leaving this ghostly place, seeing the light of day again.","Afterwards, no one will dare call him \"Sword Bone\" anymore!","Sword Bone felt a glimmer of hope.","It devoted itself even more.","To it, Mo Hua seemed like an evil ghost.","The Demon Refining Diagram was purgatory.","Evil ghosts naturally should enter purgatory.","What he needs to do now is to lead Mo Hua, this \"evil ghost,\" into the \"purgatory\" of the Demon Refining Diagram, then he could seize the chance to escape.","\"Young master, follow me, I’m very familiar with this path, it absolutely won’t be wrong.\"","Sword Bone said.","Mo Hua nodded in satisfaction.","Afterwards, Sword Bone led the way, Mo Hua followed, passing through dozens of alchemy rooms, crossing several wide stone paths, avoiding numerous patrolling demon cultivators, climbing onto a cliff, and raised his eyes to look forward.","On the distant towering mountain wall, a huge mural of demons frantically dancing suddenly greeted his view.","Mo Hua’s mind couldn’t help but tremble:","\"This is... the Demon Refining Diagram?!\""]},{"number":1407,"title":"Chapter 1407 - 778 Formation Stone Palace","paragraphs":["Mo Hua initially thought that the Demon Refining Diagram should be like the previous Contemplation Map he had seen, just a picture. Unexpectedly, it turned out to be such a magnificent mural.","From afar, the blood mist obscured it, making the vision somewhat hazy.","But faintly discernible, the mural depicted a mountain range, and countless ferocious demonic creatures.","\"I must get a closer look...\"","Mo Hua silently thought to himself.","He turned his head and looked at the White Bone Broken Sword in his hand, and asked softly, \"Sword Bone, how do we get there.\"","The \"Sword Demon\" named Sword Bone, with a hint of fear in its voice, seemed to be quite apprehensive of this \"Demon Refining Diagram,\" but still replied truthfully:","\"Around the perimeter of the Demon Refining Diagram, there are monster cultivators guarding it. Sneak past them, go around the back, and there is a stone bridge. After crossing the bridge, there is a thorny stone forest, then go through...\"","It described with great detail.","Mo Hua memorized everything one by one and followed suit.","At the same time, he made a plan in his mind; if this \"cheap bones\" was not honest, he would dismantle the Sword Bone and swallow it whole, to have a taste.","After all, it was a treacherous villain before its death.","Fortunately, the Sword Bone was very honest.","The path it pointed out was correct.","Despite some detours, Mo Hua still managed to reach the front of the Demon Refining Diagram smoothly.","The smoothness of it was a bit surprising to Mo Hua.","He frowned and asked: \"The defense around the Demon Refining Diagram is so lax, and I got here so easily?\"","Sword Bone silently thought: \"That’s because I was leading you...\"","And to be honest, it’s not easy at all.","To truly infiltrate, one must not only have a clear understanding of the nearby terrain but also have mastered the Concealment Technique to a transcendent extent, and fully understand the habits of the monster cultivators. One must also have good movement technique and be bold, yet cautious.","\"This little ancestor, so proficient in sneaking and climbing, must have done quite a few stealing and shady activities in ordinary days...\"","Sword Bone silently criticized in its heart.","Of course, on the surface, it could only flatter shamelessly:","\"That is because you, young master, have mastered your movement technique, with excellent concealment skills, advancing and retreating with ease, being bold yet cautious... so it naturally wasn’t difficult.\"","\"Hmm.\" Mo Hua nodded.","The Sword Bone, it sure knows how to talk well.","\"Furthermore...\" Sword Bone continued, \"This Demon Refining Diagram is a place where monster cultivators are punished, countless of them have perished here, suffering the agony of being devoured by Ten Thousand Demons, so once they get close, they’ll instinctively feel fear, often hearing the murmurs and roars of demonic creatures.\"","\"Therefore, even the monster cultivator guards dare only to stay on the perimeter and do not dare to approach the Demon Refining Diagram truly.\"","\"I see...\" Mo Hua nodded slightly.","\"The murmurs of demon monsters...\"","He leaned closer to the Demon Refining Diagram, listened for a moment, and asked in confusion: \"The murmurs of demon monsters, why can’t I hear them?\"","Sword Bone was startled, it dared to sense for a moment, and suddenly froze.","No...","When it used to sneak closer, it was distinctly audible.","The sorrowful howls of ten thousand demons, ferocious and horrifying, made one’s Divine Soul tremble.","Why is it gone?","It glanced at Mo Hua again secretly, and thought: \"It can’t be that these demon wraiths are so afraid of this little ancestor that they dare not make a sound.\"","That should be impossible, right...","Even exaggeration has its limits.","Sword Bone smiled inwardly and shook its head.","\"Perhaps the time is not right, the demons are dormant.\"","\"Oh.\" Mo Hua stared at the Demon Refining Diagram again and then asked: \"By the way, where are the Formation Patterns?\"","\"Formation Patterns?\" Sword Bone was taken aback.","\"The Formation Pattern you spent two hundred years learning,\" Mo Hua said, \"didn’t you say you learned it from the Demon Refining Diagram?\"","Sword Bone paused, sensed the Demon Refining Diagram, and slowly frowned, \"It seems to be sealed...\"","\"Sealed?\" Mo Hua was slightly startled.","\"Yes...\" Sword Bone said, \"Two hundred years ago, the Demon Refining Diagram seemed incomplete. Some Formation Patterns were exposed, but now...\"","Sword Bone looked at the Demon Refining Diagram again, and its tone slightly tensed: \"This diagram seems to be completely finished, all the Formation Patterns are sealed.\"","Mo Hua’s expression showed some displeasure.","If I don’t come, you’re incomplete.","When I come, you’re finished.","Are you purposely making it impossible for me to learn?","\"Can this diagram be blown up?\" Mo Hua asked.","Sword Bone was frightened and trembled, quickly saying: \"My little ancestor, please don’t mess with it!\"","\"If it blows up, it will be a huge disaster!\"","No one knows what terrible things might happen if the Demon Refining Diagram is blown up.","Moreover, once it blows up, it will certainly attract the attention of monster cultivators. If the whole valley goes on alert, even with exquisite concealment and careful actions, it would still be a perilous situation.","\"I was just saying it in passing.\" Mo Hua said.","This Sword Bone is really getting old, out of touch, not even a joke can be told.","\"Then can this Demon Refining Diagram be entered?\" Mo Hua asked again.","He didn’t have any other thoughts, just wanted to go in and count how many demonic monsters were inside.","\"Enter?\"","Sword Bone was a bit confused, not knowing what exactly Mo Hua wanted to do.","Could there be any good places inside the Demon Refining Diagram?","Others dare not even approach, yet he wants to go in?","His heart is really bold.","What does he want to do? Go in to suffer the agony of \"Ten Thousand Demons’ Devouring Body,\" to have his soul shattered with no chance of reincarnation?","Or does he really think he’s invincible after gaining a Sword Demon, disregarding the countless demonic monsters in the Demon Refining Diagram?","Sword Bone sneered in its heart.","Just as it was about to persuade Mo Hua, it suddenly halted, a demonic thought from the depth of its heart surged forward unbidden.","\"This little anc...ugh, this little brat!\"","\"This little brat being so clueless about the vastness of the heavens and earth might not be a bad thing either.\"","\"As long as I find a way to send him into the Demon Refining Diagram, whether his Divine Thought dies inside or gets trapped, I can find a way to escape, perhaps even ’occupy the magpie’s nest,’ obtaining a fresh young host body, it’s not impossible...\""]},{"number":1408,"title":"Chapter 1408 - 778 Formation Stone Palace_2","paragraphs":["A desire began to grow in the heart.","Sword Bone still spoke respectfully, pretending to be nonchalant: \"There are only two ways to enter the Demon Refining Diagram, as far as I know.\"","\"One is to suffer extreme torture and die miserably in front of the Demon Refining Diagram. Before the physical body perishes, the extreme pain stimulates the Divine Thought, causing some kind of mutation, allowing entry into the Demon Refining Diagram after leaving the body, to endure even greater punishment...\"","\"This is the dual suffering of the physical body and Divine Thought, accompanied by death, akin to the agony of purgatory, so the monster cultivators of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons dread the Demon Refining Diagram.\"","\"The other way is sacrifice...\"","Mo Hua was startled, \"Sacrifice?\"","\"Exactly,\" Sword Bone nodded, \"Through a certain type of ritual, a person can be sacrificed to the Demon Refining Diagram.\"","\"But I have never seen this ’ritual,’ nor do I know the specific method.\"","\"Within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, ’sacrifices’ are rare, and ordinary monster cultivators aren’t qualified for sacrifices...\"","Mo Hua frowned.","This was troublesome.","He couldn’t enter the Demon Refining Diagram.","If he were to endure torture, he would lose his life, possibly in unbearable pain as well.","If it were to be a sacrifice, he didn’t know the sacrificial methods, nor was there anyone to take him as a ’sacrifice.’","He was hungry, and there was food in the pot, but the lid was on, keeping it out of reach.","Mo Hua felt a bit uncomfortable.","\"Let’s look around nearby. Maybe there are other clues, allowing me to ’infiltrate’ the Demon Refining Diagram quietly...\"","As Mo Hua’s Divine Thought moved slightly, he had an idea, reluctantly glanced at the Demon Refining Diagram, and then silently turned to leave.","But just several zhang away, a faint strange sound suddenly reached his ears.","Mo Hua turned his head to look, concentrating to listen closely.","It was then he realized it was the sound from within the Demon Refining Diagram.","It was like all kinds of demon monsters shouting together, chaotic and noisy, filled with arrogance, along with a trace of disdain and scorn.","It seemed to be mocking Mo Hua.","Mo Hua’s gaze turned slightly cold.","\"A bunch of wretches, wait until I enter, I’ll personally count your heads.\"","...","After Mo Hua left quietly, he began to stroll around the surroundings.","The Demon Refining Diagram was such a large mural, appearing mysterious, but at its core, it was a type of Taoist architecture.","Using the mural as media, the formation as the bones, and the Divine Soul as the guide.","However, the means were a bit bloody and malevolent, involving some unknown formation domains.","But the basic process wouldn’t change.","Constructing this diagram required a lot of manpower, numerous materials, and required a complete formation to be built.","This was a long-term project.","According to his experience and habits as a Formation Master from constructing large formations, there must be secret chambers nearby for Formation Masters to do Formation Painting.","According to Elder Xun Zixian’s speculation.","The formation construction in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons was an overall entity, and the Divine Tao Array within the valley was a complete inheritance.","And on this Demon Refining Diagram, there was the Divine Tao Array.","It was highly likely that this Demon Refining Diagram was the centerpiece of the entire Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","The Divine Tao Array was the core of the entire Demon Refining Diagram.","If he found a way to obtain the Divine Tao Formation Diagram and learn the inheritance of the Divine Tao Array, he would most likely unlock the secrets of the Demon Refining Diagram and thus control the entire Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","Of course, this was only speculation.","What exactly was the inheritance of the Divine Tao Array?","What role did the Demon Refining Diagram play as the centerpiece of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons...","There should be profound and possibly sophisticated mystical principles of formation here, awaiting his research and exploration.","\"I should be able to learn something good...\"","Mo Hua nodded.","He circled the giant mural of the Demon Refining Diagram twice nearby, finally finding a suspicious place.","This was a magnificent Stone Palace.","The palace had a strong presence of formations.","With one glance, Mo Hua could tell this was the formation stone palace of the entire Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","It was generally used to store formation media, accumulate formation Mo, design formation diagrams, and serve as a place for Formation Masters to research, rest, and paint formations.","At this time, the main door was tightly closed with a lock, and it seemed there was no one inside.","Moreover, there were no monster cultivators guarding outside.","It seemed just like the Demon Refining Diagram, this formation stone palace was also a ’Forbidden Land’ for monster cultivators.","\"Should I go inside and have a look?\"","Mo Hua felt a stirring in his heart.","He released his Divine Sense, sensing slightly inside, detecting no presence of living people or monster cultivators inside.","It should be safe.","But it was hard to say, as cultivators’ perception occasionally could not be relied upon either...","Mo Hua thought for a moment and then took out a Copper Coin, using Heavenly Secret Calculation for a divination.","This time, the divination lacked the previously felt clarity of understanding cause and effect, sensing the heavenly secret.","He did not see the vast grand scene of all cause and effect merging into a heavenly secret, flowing as if a river through the heavens and earth.","There was only a slight touch of cause and effect.","The movement was very minimal.","Perhaps the ’novice benefits’ were gone; for future calculations, it would depend on his own understanding of the heavenly secret.","But this was also good.","Always making such a big commotion, he wasn’t too comfortable himself either.","The Copper Coin turned in the air, landing on the palm.","It was heads.","That meant there was no danger inside.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but look forward, \"This Heavenly Secret Calculation is really useful. If I truly achieve insight into the heavenly secret, controlling cause and effect, avoiding misfortune and seeking fortune like my master, how powerful that would be...\"","He put away the Copper Coin and approached the main gate of the Stone Palace.","The main door had a massive beast-shaped lock, engraved with a Four Symbols canine-tooth Pattern.","Sword Bone said: \"This is a special formation lock within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons. With this formation lock sealing the main gate, you can’t go in, it’s better to find another...\"","But before it could finish, Mo Hua had already started to push the door.","The main door opened effortlessly.","Sword Bone was taken aback, and upon closer inspection, it found that the formation on the lock had been completely unlocked."]},{"number":1409,"title":"Chapter 1409 - 778 Formation Stone Palace_3","paragraphs":["In just a few breaths, it’s been... unlocked?","Is this little ancestor also a formation master?!","Sword Bone suddenly recalled that back when they first clashed, this little ancestor used a formation to blast him until he was nearly devoid of flesh.","But something’s not right...","This is the formation of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, how can he unlock it so quickly?","What is his true identity?","Have I underestimated this little ancestor?","Sword Bone was deeply worried at that moment.","\"No choice, I must find a way to escape from him quickly, or even if I become a Sword Demon, I’ll be suppressed eternally with no chance of a comeback.\"","Mo Hua ignored the thoughts of the Sword Demon, instead he erased the traces on the lock, quietly closed the door, then turned and walked into the Stone Palace of the Formation.","The Stone Palace of the Formation is spacious and magnificently decorated.","Just as Mo Hua expected.","Inside, there’s a large stockpile of formation materials and formation pattern drafts.","However, most of these materials seem made from the skin and bones, and blood of either humans or monster beasts.","The formation pattern drafts are chaotic and complex, but most of them are related to the Four Symbols Monster Pattern, filled with eerie and bizarre elements.","In the center of the hall, there is a massive stone table, likely used for drawing formations.","Aside from that, there are just some formation-related tools.","And at the deepest part of the hall stands a large, awe-inspiring, terrifying statue of a Sheep-Horned Demon Monster!","Mo Hua looked at it, and his heart trembled.","Sheep horns!","Great Wilderness Evil God!","After dealing with the Great Wilderness Evil God for so long, he naturally knew that the sheep horns symbolize this Evil God to a certain extent!","\"Finally, caught another of the Evil God’s ’weak points’!\"","Mo Hua stepped towards the statue.","The Sword Demon within the severed sword suddenly felt immense fear, hurriedly saying:","\"No, ancestor, don’t go over there!\"","Mo Hua ignored it, approaching the statue, looking left and right, and even touched it, sighing regretfully.","\"It’s a fake...\"","No evil thoughts are parasitic here, let alone any Evil God.","The Sword Demon broke out in a cold sweat — despite being just bones and unable to sweat — it was still utterly terrified.","Mo Hua glanced behind the statue, his eyes brightened.","\"An altar!\"","Behind the statue of the giant Sheep-Horned Demon Monster was hidden a small altar.","On the altar was a sheep skull, surrounded by offerings and lit with ghastly green candles.","Seeing the altar, Sword Bone’s pupils trembled, his entire skeletal body shaking, \"No... no...\"","But before finishing, Mo Hua lightly leaped onto the altar, touched the sheep skull, sniffed the offerings, and wrinkled his brows.","\"Is it fake?\"","What does it mean?","Mo Hua was somewhat perplexed.","Such a vast demon valley like the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, with so many monster beasts and nurturing so many monster cultivators, yet they’ve painstakingly arranged such tight formations.","But they don’t worship a real Evil God?","Even a polluted deity, an embodiment of an Evil God, or even divine remains would work.","Could it be...","Mo Hua pondered in his mind.","The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons is located at Refining Demon Mountain.","Refining Demon Mountain lies within the Fifth Grade Qianxue State Boundary, where there are many powerful cultivators, so the Evil God dares not descend in its true form?","Can only offer an empty altar?","Mo Hua thought it was very possible.","He rummaged around the Stone Palace looking for any other clues, especially concerning the Divine Way formation.","However, as he’s acting sneakily now, afraid of being discovered, he can’t search thoroughly, even less can he \"dig three feet deep,\" so his findings were minimal.","While searching, Sword Bone’s voice came from the severed sword:","\"Someone’s coming!\"","Mo Hua also sensed it, he glanced around to confirm he hadn’t left any too-obvious traces, then felt relieved.","Afterward, he flipped and jumped onto the head of the Sheep-Horned Demon Monster statue, slid down along the statue’s back, and quietly hid behind it.","Meanwhile, the Stone Palace’s door opened.","A man dressed in black stood at the forefront, of stout stature, and imposing presence.","\"This is the ’Leader’.\"","The Sword Demon whispered.","Mo Hua was slightly startled.","This black-clad leader wore a cloak, concealing most of his face, so his features were unclear, but his aura suggested he was far from an ordinary monster cultivator.","Even compared to monster cultivators, he seemed more like a \"sect disciple.\"","And not just an ordinary sect disciple.","More like a ’Big Senior Brother’ in the sect, with extremely high prestige.","Behind the black-clad leader was another person.","This person was also tall but slightly hunched, displaying a respectful attitude.","Mo Hua recognized him; it was the one who stole his Pig Monster, and was later hung up, stripped, and drawn with a turtle — the Sever Gold Sect senior brother, Jin Gui.","Concurrently, he was also the newly appointed \"steward\" who recently became a monster cultivator and was tasked with overseeing the Ten Thousand Demons Prison.","Mo Hua silently speculated in his heart:","\"This Sever Gold Sect’s Jin Gui shows such deference to this black-clad leader, and they seem quite familiar.\"","\"Could this black-clad leader also be from Sever Gold Sect?\"","On the other side, the black-clad leader and Jin Gui walked into the Stone Palace.","As they walked, they talked, continuing all the way to the center of the hall, still discussing some secret matters in low voices.","They were so focused that they hadn’t noticed the hall had already been infiltrated, let alone realized someone was hiding behind the sheep-horned statue.","\"...What happened?\"","\"Some anomaly...\"","\"Failing the task, I cannot explain to the young master...\"","\"Senior brother...\"","\"Don’t call me senior brother.\"","...","Hiding behind the statue, Mo Hua slightly paused upon hearing, thinking it confirmed his suspicion.","Sever Gold Sect...","This is going to be trouble.","In the hall, the two continued their conversation.","Mo Hua involuntarily perked up his ears, wanting to hear more secrets, but crouching like this to listen was slightly uncomfortable.","Mo Hua glanced back, grabbed the sheep horn skull from the altar central, placed it beneath himself, and sat down on it."]},{"number":1410,"title":"Chapter 1410 - 779 \"Gentleman","paragraphs":["The Sword Bone looked inexplicably terrified, his whole body trembling.","This little ancestor, what is he doing?!","The ram horn skull revered by the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, how can it just be casually sat on?","This is truly courting death, utterly reckless.","\"I must quickly get away, I cannot stay by this little ancestor’s side, or one day when he foolishly courts death without knowing his limits, suffers divine retribution, and a thunderbolt strikes him dead, I will suffer the consequences with him.\"","The Sword Bone thought anxiously to himself.","Mo Hua, however, paid no mind to any of that.","Sitting on the ram horn skull wasn’t exactly comfortable, icy and cool, with a bit of yin qi, but at least it was smooth, so sitting on it would suffice for now.","Given the limited conditions, there was no room to be picky.","So, Mo Hua used the ram horn skull revered by the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons as a small stool to eavesdrop on the discussion between the black-clothed leader and Jin Gui.","At this moment, Jin Gui was respectfully reporting something.","\"Leader, please forgive... that old Artifact Refiner somehow went mad, killed the monster cultivator guarding him, detonated the Chamber of Evil Instruments, and committed suicide, fortunately, the Ouyang Family’s young boy is unharmed...\"","\"But with that old Artifact Refiner dead, there is currently no monster cultivator within the valley to teach the evil sword forging technique, the young master’s plan might be delayed for some time...\"","\"Additionally, outside the gate of the Ten Thousand Demons Prison, suddenly there are monster cultivators dying violently and going mad...\"","\"This is already the seventh incident.\"","\"And for some reason, I occasionally feel like there’s something watching me, even watching... the entire Ten Thousand Demons Prison.\"","\"I suspect...\"","Jin Gui paused and didn’t continue.","The black-clothed leader’s gaze tightened, his voice deep: \"You suspect... there might be someone who has secretly infiltrated in?\"","\"Not necessarily someone,\" Jin Gui said, \"it could be... something from the Demon Refining Diagram that has escaped...\"","The black-clothed leader’s gaze grew more intense.","Jin Gui hurriedly explained, \"I’ve contemplated it, if these incidents were naturally occurring, the chances are too small, saying there’s ’someone’ behind it doesn’t seem likely either.\"","\"Not to mention that the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons is heavily guarded, whether anyone can get in.\"","\"Even if someone truly managed to enter the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, it’s absolutely impossible for them to do these things right under our noses without leaving a trace.\"","\"Especially causing monster cultivators to lose control like this.\"","\"The only possibility is... the Demon Refining Diagram!\"","Jin Gui looked up, glanced at the black-clothed leader, his expression extremely grave, \"So I speculate, that those terrifying things from the Demon Refining Diagram... have escaped, and because they are intangible and formless, any chaos they cause is not easily discovered.\"","The black-clothed leader’s pupils constricted, nodding slightly.","Hiding behind the ram horn sculpture, Mo Hua also couldn’t help but nod.","This Jin Gui is quite clever.","His explanation seems quite reasonable too.","The black-clothed leader pondered for a while, before saying slowly:","\"Alright, I understand, I’ll take responsibility for this, you need not concern yourself with it. Since it involves the Demon Refining Diagram, it’s dangerous and unpredictable, not something you can resolve.\"","Jin Gui bowed his head respectfully, \"Yes.\"","On the surface, he showed no emotion, but inwardly, he let out a long sigh of relief.","This \"burden\" has finally been passed on...","The Ten Thousand Demons Prison is having an unlucky day today, incidents happen frequently, as the manager, he couldn’t shirk responsibility.","If he tried to hide it all, this burden would only grow bigger, and one day, the truth would come to light, and he would face the young master’s punishment.","If he didn’t conceal it, he must find a way to pass on the burden.","The choice of whom to pass the burden to is very delicate.","First, exclude the monster cultivators within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","These monster cultivators are constrained by the Monster Pattern, daring not to defy, and since they stay in the valley all day, anything can be checked, they simply can’t lie.","Next, saying there’s an \"outsider\" infiltration is not very feasible either.","As everyone knows, since the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons was built, for hundreds of years, no \"outsider\" has ever entered.","How could it be such a coincidence that as soon as he became the manager, an \"outsider\" slipped in?","This excuse is too obvious.","Moreover, it can’t be verified.","Given that, the only reason is those frightening things from the Demon Refining Diagram.","This excuse was something he came up with after much deliberation.","If it were true, then he guessed correctly.","If not, then with the situation being so confusing, no one can say for certain.","No matter what, it couldn’t be blamed on him.","The Demon Wraith is intangible, disasters have no warnings.","The matter of the Demon Refining Diagram is mysterious and enigmatic, these are simply beyond his control.","So naturally, this burden was cast off.","The leader not only wouldn’t blame him but would even think he was meticulous and prudent.","These days, whether sect disciples or Demon Path monster cultivators, they all need to be able to handle matters.","Personal ability is one thing, being able to \"report\" is another.","The black-clothed leader indeed no longer dwelled on Jin Gui’s affairs, focusing entirely on the Demon Refining Diagram.","Perhaps Jin Gui was slightly evasive, but his speculation wasn’t without reason, the Demon Refining Diagram is the core of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, under no circumstances can anything go wrong with it.","The black-clothed leader frowned in thought.","At this moment, Jin Gui had a sudden thought, and said:","\"Leader, wasn’t there a monitoring formation in the Ten Thousand Demons Prison before? If we reactivated such formations, wouldn’t we know... what’s happening in the Ten Thousand Demons Prison?\"","The black-clothed leader shook his head, \"No, those formations can no longer be used.\"","Jin Gui was puzzled, \"Why?\"","The black-clothed leader said in a deep voice, \"You are not yet aware of the situation here... About two years ago, at a demonic lair in Bishan City at the Second Grade State Border, just as it was about to be completed, the Taoist Court came and destroyed it, and a Venerable lost their life as a result.\"","\"Afterwards, we learned that the Spirit Vision Formation used for monitoring in the heavily guarded Bi Mountain Demon Cavern was infiltrated and used by others, which gave the Taoist Court officials an opportunity they seized.\""]},{"number":1411,"title":"Chapter 1411 - 779 \"Gentleman\"_2","paragraphs":["\"Mr. Tu was concerned that the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons would repeat past mistakes, so he temporarily dismantled the entire Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation and sealed it completely to prevent future troubles.\"","\"So our own ’eyes’ won’t be used to see things for others...\"","The leader in black said.","Mo Hua, however, was stunned.","So that’s how it is...","Previously, he was puzzled as to why the Spirit Vision Formation of the Yuan Magnetic Formation was completely dismantled and sealed off.","It turned out to be the \"sin\" he had created back then!","Jin Gui was still a bit confused, \"The Yuan Magnetic Formation is an extremely obscure formation. The Spirit Vision Formation is an advanced compound formation. It’s unlikely the Sect would teach it, and the Taoist Court officials are too bureaucratic to have such expertise... Who exactly managed to infiltrate the Yuan Magnetic Formation and use it against us?\"","The leader in black said gravely, \"I don’t know either, but according to Mr. Tu’s deduction, this person must be a master in Formation Study with profound knowledge and expertise!\"","Mo Hua nodded in agreement.","This Mr. Tu is certainly correct!","The leader in black continued, \"Be cautious in your actions and keep a close watch on those three youngsters...\"","\"Find a way to have that Ouyang boy forge the Evil Sword. This way, with a brother forging the Evil Sword for us, his seemingly righteous older brother will have no choice but to serve us as well...\"","\"As for the Sword Dao genius from the Rushing Void Sect, the young master holds him in high regard. He can be brought aboard. After experiencing the luxuries and earthly pleasures, he will also become one with worldly desires.\"","\"As for the one from the Song family... see if his parents are cooperative. If they aren’t, just sacrifice him; there’s no use in keeping him.\"","The leader in black warned once more.","\"Understood.\" Jin Gui cupped his hands in response.","\"You may leave.\" The leader in black gestured with a wave of his hand.","Jin Gui bowed and withdrew.","Inside the grand hall, only the leader in black remained. He sat down in the center, took out a few scrolls of monster hide parchment, and began to peruse them.","Mo Hua was very eager to know what he was reading, but unfortunately, he was too far away to see.","\"He’s not reading the Divine Tao Array, is he...\"","Mo Hua felt an itch of curiosity.","Half an hour passed this way when there was another disturbance outside the door.","The leader in black closed the monster hide parchment and said:","\"Enter.\"","A figure in a black robe walked in, but compared to the leader in black, Jin Gui, or other monster cultivators, this figure appeared much more \"petite.\"","More like an ordinary \"person\" than a monster cultivator.","Mo Hua’s curiosity deepened.","At this moment, the figure in the black robe walked into the hall, lifted their hood, and complained:","\"This damn place is so eerie and reeking, cousin. How do you stand it...\"","Cousin?","Mo Hua frowned and took a closer look, suddenly startled.","This person, he also recognized.","Jin Yicai!","The very prominent direct descendant of the Jin family within the Sever Gold Sect.","Mo Hua clearly remembered that this Jin Yicai’s ancestor was the Sect Leader of Sever Gold Sect eight hundred years ago. His grandfather is now the Chief Elder, his father the Vice Sect Leader, and his mother the True Transmission Elder...","The whole family holds high positions in Sever Gold Sect.","It’s almost as if he was born with a silver spoon.","The last time by the Mistwater River, this Jin Yicai was caught red-handed smuggling cultivators and dealing Forbidden Pills, but still, it was suppressed from above.","Since then, he had appeared to lay low.","Yet who would have thought, behind the scenes, he was still stirring up trouble?","The leader in black glanced at Jin Yicai and asked, \"Is your conduct discreet?\"","Jin Yicai replied, \"Rest assured. My father has grounded me, but those assigned to watch over me are merely Guest Elders who act according to my will. Wherever I actually go, they dare not question. Otherwise, I would complain to my mother about those Guest Elders’ poor attitude and insubordination; they wouldn’t have a place in Sever Gold Sect.\"","Jin Yicai sneered, \"The saying ’close ties trump distant relations’ applies here.\"","\"If I give them face, they are Guest Elders and Elders; if not, they are no more than dogs our Jin family keeps.\"","As Jin Yicai said this, he walked to the center of the hall and sat down arrogantly.","The leader in black frowned, \"Be discreet and act cautiously. Even towards Guest Elders, show some courtesy. Whatever you think, at least pretend on the surface.\"","\"I can’t be bothered to pretend...\" Jin Yicai shook his head, then with a glint in his eyes, asked:","\"Cousin, you asked me here, could it be that you’ve made progress with that set of things?\"","Mo Hua raised an eyebrow upon hearing this.","That set of things? What things?","While he was wondering, he heard the leader in black say, \"There are some clues. You can try them first.\"","Jin Yicai was excited, \"Great!\"","The leader in black hesitated momentarily, then opened a scroll of monster hide parchment and spoke slowly:","\"Originally, direct descendants like you, living under the watchful eyes of the Ancestor and Family Head, would not bear Monster Patterns to avoid exposure.\"","\"But the upcoming Taoism Debating Conference is critical and cannot be delayed... Therefore, even if there’s a risk of being discovered, you must take this bold step.\"","Jin Yicai was momentarily dazed and appeared somewhat nervous, seemingly still concerned about the Ancestor and Family Head, and thus worriedly asked:","\"If it’s discovered...\"","The leader in black interrupted, \"The situation is special now. Even if it’s discovered, it’s fine.\"","Jin Yicai looked puzzled, \"Cousin, I don’t quite understand...\"","The leader in black cast him a meaningful glance and asked, \"Are you doing this for yourself?\"","Isn’t that obvious?","Human nature is self-serving to the core.","Jin Yicai nodded, then suddenly froze, slowly grasping the notion, \"It’s not for myself...\"","The leader in black nodded, agreeing:","\"Yes, with the Sword Discussion Conference approaching, you are doing this for the Sect, for the family, not for yourself!\"","\"No matter what methods you use, as long as you genuinely secure a place in the Sword Discussion Conference, bringing glory to the Sect and establishing significant contributions for the upcoming Sect reforms, even if the Ancestor and others find out, they will just turn a blind eye.\""]},{"number":1412,"title":"Chapter 1412 - 779 \"Gentleman\"_3","paragraphs":["\"In fact, not only will they not blame you, but on the contrary, they will think you have skills and are of great use!\"","\"Whether the methods are dirty or not does not matter, as long as they can be used. The victor becomes king, by any means necessary, is the iron rule of this world.\"","\"As long as you win, no matter how disgraceful your past, how heinous your actions, how filthy and sordid, there will still be foolish people who admire you.\"","\"Conversely, as long as you lose, no matter how noble your character, you will only be ridiculed and discarded by others.\"","Jin Yicai was still somewhat concerned: \"But what if the matter is exposed...\"","The black-clad Leader’s gaze slightly darkened, \"As long as you can win, even if the matter is exposed, Ancestor over there will cover for you.\"","\"Don’t forget, you are the direct lineage of the Jin family, with the Jin family and the Sever Gold Sect, sharing glory and loss together! How can Ancestor and the others not know?\"","Jin Yicai suddenly understood and completely put his mind at ease.","\"Alright, cousin, I will listen to you in everything.\"","The black-clad Leader slightly nodded, then opened the demon skin paper, saying:","\"This set of items still needs a demon skill or demon magic as a foundation.\"","\"In my opinion, it is best to paint a Monster Pattern. Here at the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, Monster Patterns are complete, various bone and blood materials are of superior quality.\"","\"The Monster Patterns in this diagram encompass fierce beasts like Bear Pi, tigers, leopards, or fierce birds like the golden eagles and falcons. Choose one, and I will tattoo it on you...\"","The black-clad Leader unfolded the Formation Diagram on the demon skin.","Jin Yicai looked at them one by one, feeling none were quite to his liking.","His gaze swept down, suddenly his eyes lit up, pointing at a Monster Pattern, saying: \"Cousin, tattoo this Dog Pattern on me.\"","The black-clad Leader was clearly stunned, \"What?\"","\"Dog Pattern.\"","Jin Yicai repeated again.","The black-clad Leader nearly thought he had misheard.","Jin Yicai chuckled, with a hint of sinister evil in his smile:","\"Cousin, to be honest, these days, there have been too many female cultivators sneaking into my cave mansion in the middle of the night, those bitches are quite annoying, yet they’re so youthful and enticing, they itch my heart, I must properly deal with them.\"","\"It’s said, Dog Demon...\"","Jin Yicai showed a look that could only be understood but not described.","The black-clad Leader’s expression was stunned, for a time somewhat incredulous.","Then his face sank like water, his heart both disdainful and enraged.","Indeed, spoiling creates useless brats!","In this world, even a running dog harbors the heart of tigers and wolves.","This young master born with a silver spoon, in his bones, is just a lustful wild dog?!","The black-clad Leader’s forehead twitched, suppressing his anger, he said:","\"Are you sure?\"","Jin Yicai was completely unaware of the Leader’s disdain, still looking self-satisfied, saying:","\"Cousin, I’m sure. In this world, there are so many who sell their lives, taking risks, charging into battle, such things don’t need me to do, as long as I live comfortably and happily myself, that is enough.\"","The black-clad Leader was silent for a long time, then finally said indifferently:","\"Fine.\"","Jin Yicai showed a look of joy, \"Thank you, cousin!\"","The black-clad Leader’s expression showed neither joy nor anger, only speaking in a deep voice: \"You chose this yourself.\"","\"Of course.\"","Jin Yicai looked expectant, he could almost envision himself indulging in nightly revelry, fighting tirelessly.","\"Good!\"","The black-clad Leader said indifferently.","Then he silently took out the pen and ink, following the line on the demon skin paper, drawing a Four Symbols Canine Pattern Formation on Jin Yicai’s back.","He used a Bone Pen, dipped in human blood, to draw the Monster Pattern.","This was a process of an Evil Formation, accompanied by sinister pain.","Jin Yicai grimaced in pain, several times trying to struggle to get up, shouting in a hoarse voice.","The black-clad Leader, however, ignored him, like slaughtering a pig, pinning Jin Yicai down on the table, his wrist steady, the pen like a knife, dripping with blood until a Four Symbols Canine Pattern Formation was completed.","After it was drawn, Jin Yicai was soaked in cold sweat, slumped on the ground, panting heavily, intermittently saying:","\"Cousin... It’s just drawing a Formation, why is it so painful? It’s as if my flesh and the Formation Patterns are forcefully sewn together...\"","The black-clad Leader’s expression remained unchanged, but his gaze grew more disdainful.","If he can’t endure this little pain, what kind of cultivator can he be?","How does he expect to achieve anything?","But he did not speak it out, instead simply saying:","\"This Four Symbols Formation is quite special, emphasizing the fusion of Formation and flesh. You have been negligent in Body Refinement, naturally, you feel pain, but it will get better afterward.\"","Jin Yicai’s face was somewhat pale, \"Cousin, this Formation only has to be drawn once, right...\"","This pain, he did not want to experience a second time.","The black-clad Leader nodded, \"Yes.\"","Jin Yicai breathed a sigh of relief.","Then he thought of having the Formation tattooed and soon being able to \"exert his might\", indulging in pleasures, and his displeasure quickly dissipated.","Enduring some suffering was not unacceptable.","Jin Yicai then asked: \"When can I leave the Valley?\"","Mo Hua, who was eavesdropping, stirred with this remark.","Leave the Valley?","The black-clad Leader replied: \"Not for now, wait for the next opening.\"","Jin Yicai nodded.","Although he was eager to immediately return to his cave mansion in the Sever Gold Sect — no matter how small his cave mansion, it’s still better than the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","But there are priorities, and he wasn’t really that brainless.","The black-clad Leader said: \"You go back first, wait for the Four Symbols Formation on your body to integrate with your flesh, then come again, the key part will come afterward.\"","Jin Yicai hesitated, \"Then...\"","The black-clad Leader understood his concern, snorted coldly in his heart, indifferently said: \"The formations to be used afterward are different, not as bloody and painful.\"","Jin Yicai felt relieved, cupped his hands and said: \"Cousin, I’ll let you get back to your work, I won’t disturb you further.\"","With that said, he turned and left.","After Jin Yicai left, the black-clad Leader looked at his departing back, stood there for a while, then couldn’t help but sneer:","\"Relying on this kind of character, it’s a wonder that the Sever Gold Sect hasn’t declined...\"","\"Constantly chasing fame and fortune, soaking in honey, fed with Heavenly Materials and Earthly Treasures... only to teach generation after generation of... what kind of things are these.\"","The black-clad Leader’s gaze grew colder.","Afterward, he walked to the center of the hall, continued to look at the Formation Diagram on the demon skin paper, seemingly studying something.","For a moment, the hall fell quiet.","Amidst the flickering lights, only the sound of paper shuffling could be heard.","No one was chatting, so Mo Hua had nothing to eavesdrop on.","Hiding behind the statue, he couldn’t do anything else, momentarily feeling bored.","He had no idea how much time had passed, just as Mo Hua felt idle, the black-clad Leader suddenly started moving again.","He glanced at the Sundial Plate on the table, closed the demon skin paper, and murmured softly: \"The hour has come...\"","Mo Hua paused.","The hour has come?","What hour has come?","Just then, as he wondered, he noticed the black-clad Leader suddenly walking towards him.","Mo Hua’s heart was slightly startled, but upon taking a closer look, realized that the black-clad Leader hadn’t noticed him after all, but walked straight to the statue of the Sheep-Horned Demon Monster, and slowly knelt down.","He knelt very devoutly.","At the same time, he mumbled solemnly: \"Boundless Wilderness, Supreme Divinity...\"","\"Its life immortal, its longevity infinite...\"","\"Seek blessings from Divine Lord, grant me great Divine Thought...\"","\"Seek guidance from Gentleman, grant me the essence of Formations Dao.\"","...","Yet Mo Hua listened, feeling increasingly uneasy, then at this moment, that black-clad Leader kowtowed three times before the Demon Monster statue.","After the three kowtows, a mystical and sinister Divine Thought Aura arose from his body.","On his shoulder and head, a blood-red silhouette slowly emerged.","This blood-red silhouette had an eerie and frightening aura, looking like a Gentleman, but the blood was blurry, unable to see the face clearly.","Mo Hua’s pupils suddenly contracted.","A familiar name slowly floated into his mind:","\"Mr. Tu!\""]},{"number":1413,"title":"Chapter 1413 - 780: Divine Formation","paragraphs":["Mr. Tu?!","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat.","Although he didn’t know the exact identity of this Mr. Tu, from past events, this \"Mr. Tu\" was very likely the number one \"dog\" of the Great Wilderness Evil God within the Qian Learning State Boundary.","If that’s the case, his cultivation realm must not be low.","The Formation must be profound, and his Divine Thought also very strong.","I may not be able to hide!","\"Not good!\"","Mo Hua felt a bit panicked, a chill creeping into his heart.","At that moment, the blood-colored figure possessing the black-clothed leader suddenly started, turning his head abruptly towards Mo Hua’s direction.","However, his gaze was blocked by the massive sheep-horned demon monster statue.","Mo Hua immediately retracted his head, concealing his presence, sitting motionless on the sheep horn skull, not daring to make any sound.","The blood-colored figure’s gaze was fixed intently on Mo Hua’s direction.","The black-clothed leader, being possessed, was somewhat bewildered and asked, \"Gentleman, what’s wrong?\"","The blood-colored figure was in a daze for a moment, then suddenly frowned.","It resided in the black-clothed leader’s body and could only speak through his mouth, appearing to talk to itself but with a completely different tone and expression:","\"On the statue, there’s a trace of ’deity’ presence.\"","The black-clothed leader was shocked, trembling with fear, and said:","\"Could it be... the ’Divine Lord’ has descended?\"","The blood-colored figure’s voice was somewhat twisted, with a peculiar rasp and a hint of confusion:","\"No... this altar has never been invoked to avoid being entangled in karma by those elders. Why then, is there a presence of the ’Divine Lord’?\"","The black-clothed leader frowned and said:","\"Gentleman, should we go check at the altar?\"","\"Presumptuous!\" The blood-colored figure’s voice suddenly became severe, \"The Divine Lord must not be desecrated! The altar’s holy land, is the supreme throne of the Divine Lord, beyond the reach of our mere mortal bodies!\"","The black-clothed leader, reprimanded, immediately bowed and said:","\"Gentleman, forgive me. It was the disciple’s ignorance that offended the Majesty of the Great Divine Lord, for which the disciple deserves to die a thousand deaths.\"","The blood-colored figure’s expression eased slightly.","\"But... where does this aura of deity come from?\"","The black-clothed leader pondered for a moment, then suddenly had an epiphany, speaking in a trembling voice:","\"Gentleman, could it be... that our long-planned grand scheme is coming to fruition, and the Divine Lord is gradually awakening?!\"","\"The mighty power of the Divine Lord is gradually awakening, thus the originally empty altar has also been graced with the Divine Lord’s presence?\"","The blood-colored figure was taken aback, then his eyes gleamed brightly, and he said:","\"Kneel!\"","The black-clothed leader immediately obeyed, kneeling with his head to the ground, along with the blood-colored figure on him, bowing respectfully three times towards the sheep-horned demon monster statue — and, unknowingly, towards Mo Hua behind the statue, while chanting:","\"My Lord is immortal, endless in longevity.\"","Mo Hua felt a bit conflicted inside.","After bowing, the black-clothed leader lowered his head, not daring to look directly at the sheep-horned demon monster statue, fearing he might anger the \"Divine Lord\" who was possibly present.","Afterward, the black-clothed leader respectfully walked back to the main hall.","He dared not look at the statue again.","Nor dared he approach the altar behind the statue.","Mo Hua slowly exhaled.","He was prepared that if discovered, he would immediately act, use his divine sense to control ink and draft a formation to blow up the statue along with the altar, and then make his escape in the chaos.","Fortunately, the believers of the Great Wilderness Evil God were devout enough.","And it was precisely their devotion that preserved their Divine Lord’s altar.","Mo Hua glanced at the White Bone Broken Sword in his hand.","There wasn’t a trace of aura in the sword.","Perhaps the Sword Bone within sensed the danger and was \"playing dead.\"","Mo Hua shook his head, then stealthily poked his head out again, glancing at the blood-colored figure on the black-clothed leader.","This blood-colored figure must be that \"Mr. Tu.\"","Within the figure, there was a mix of rationality and brutality, an eerie aura.","But strangely enough, this aura wasn’t particularly strong.","\"Not the true body?\"","Mo Hua murmured in his heart.","It looked more like a wisp of remnant soul, only at the Foundation Establishment level, at most the Foundation Establishment Peak.","It’s likely because it was possessing this Foundation Establishment Peak black-clothed leader; if the remnant soul’s realm was too high, exceeding Foundation Establishment, the burden would be heavy, and this black-clothed leader might not withstand it.","\"Just a wisp of remnant soul...\"","Mo Hua was a bit disappointed.","But at the same time, he felt a bit relieved.","If it were truly Mr. Tu’s true form, he’d probably be doomed.","Conversely, if Mr. Tu’s true form were indeed in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, the result of his Copper Coin Calculation of heavenly secrets would probably be \"great misfortune.\"","Good... my calculations were fairly accurate.","Mo Hua silently noted in his heart.","On the other side, the black-clothed leader walked to the center of the main hall, sat upright with a solemn demeanor, and then respectfully performed a disciple’s salute towards the opposite side, saying:","\"Disciple Jin Yixuan, respectfully requests Gentleman to impart the Formation.\"","Jin Yixuan?","Mo Hua was surprised.","Sure enough, a scion of the Jin family, the name only differing by a single character from that Jin Yicai, they were probably of the same generation, with a close blood relation.","Moreover...","Impart the Formation?","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat.","To request \"Mr. Tu\" to impart the Formation, could it be that what he was imparting is...","Mo Hua held his breath and listened attentively.","As expected, after a moment, \"Mr. Tu\" the blood-colored remnant soul spoke solemnly:","\"The Dao is not to be questioned lightly, nor the methods lightly imparted. Do you know what kind of legacy I am to impart to you?\"","As the black-clothed leader, Jin Yixuan bowed his head and said:","\"Disciple understands, what Gentleman imparts is the supreme Formation Ultimate Technique, perceived through the mortal’s sense, bestowed by the deity—\"","\"Divine Way Formation!\"","Mo Hua’s heart leaped with a \"thump.\"","It finally came!","Divine Way Formation!","In the main hall, Mr. Tu’s blood-colored remnant shadow nodded slightly and said solemnly:"]},{"number":1414,"title":"Chapter 1414 - 780 Divine Formation_2","paragraphs":["\"The Divine Tao Array is a spell point of stealing the way of deity.\"","\"The essence of the Divine Tao Array is to transmute the thought through the Patterns manifested by the Divine Way, thus contending with the deity.\"","\"This is a heretical Formation!\"","\"It is an evil path whereby humble cultivators dare to offend the majesty of gods, thereby desecrating the deity!\"","\"Such formations are intolerable by the Divine Lord!\"","Mr. Tu’s tone was angry.","He paused, waiting for his anger to subside, then continued:","\"But all things in the world balance each other, one positive and one negative, one smooth and one counter... \"","\"While the Divine Formation is a path of rebellion against the deity, it is also an unparalleled formation for serving the Divine Lord.\"","\"The heretical evil path attempts to use the Divine Formation to transmute thought, rebel against the deity, and seal my lord.\"","\"Yet we devoted believers can also use the Divine Formation to transmute thought and better serve the deity, submit to the immortal Divine Lord... \"","Mo Hua was enlightened upon hearing.","So that’s how it is...","No wonder, what was originally a \"Seal Evil God\" Divine Formation, is now instead wielded by evil god’s henchmen, aiding and abetting.","Mo Hua curled his lips.","One rope, some use to tether a dog.","Others use to tie it around their neck, becoming the dog themselves.","They even see it as honorable rather than shameful.","So despicable indeed...","Elsewhere, Mr. Tu continued:","\"But since it’s a formation that steals the way of deity, it means ordinary cultivators cannot learn it.\"","\"Except for some uniquely gifted Divine Fetus, natural mutants whose thoughts commune with deity, shamans who can sense with deity, or servants who have been possessed by deity... \"","\"Mortal cultivators simply cannot comprehend the Divine Tao Array.\"","\"I’ve told you these words before...\"","Jin Yixuan clasped his hands and said: \"Yes.\"","\"So,\" Mr. Tu said, \"you are neither Divine Fetus nor Shaman, your thoughts cannot commune with deity, nor have you been descended upon by the Divine Lord, if you want to learn the Divine Tao Array, there’s only one way...\"","Mr. Tu said: \"Borrow!\"","Jin Yixuan was stunned, \"Borrow?\"","\"Exactly,\" Mr. Tu nodded, \"Borrow from the Divine Lord, borrow the Divine Lord’s thought to form the Divine Tao Array!\"","\"In this way, even if you do not understand the core Law of the Divine Formation, you can still construct profound Divine Tao Array under the Divine Lord’s protection.\"","\"This is the Blessing from the Divine Lord!\"","Jin Yixuan immediately bowed deeply, expressing gratitude: \"Thank you for the Divine Lord’s Blessing!\"","Mr. Tu spread open a piece of demon skin paper, picked up a Formation Pen, and dipped it in Blood Ink, \"Now, I will teach you the formal Divine Formation.\"","\"This is the Divine inheritance of the Great Wilderness Clan, originating from a method greatly disrespectful to the Divine Lord known as ’Deity Seal’.\"","\"This type of inheritance consists of three formations:\"","\"First, the Divine Barrier Array.\"","\"Second, the Divine Mist Array.\"","\"And the third, also the most core, the Divine Lock Array.\"","\"The Divine Barrier Array controls the opening and closing of divine paths; the Divine Mist Array can evolve into a fog that conceals divine thought; the Divine Lock Array is a ’chain’ applied to the deity.\"","\"The three combined can, with the thought of mortals, seal the body of deity!\"","\"It’s a type of ’great disrespect’ formation for desecrating deity!\"","\"But nowadays, this Divine Tao Array has been improved many times, reborn into a path for worshiping the Divine Lord, concealing the Divine Lord’s grand design, and borrowing the Divine Lord’s great power to achieve the Divine Lord’s ambitious plan.\"","\"All mortals are mere straw dogs, with poor foundation and mortal bodies, unable to comprehend such great formations.\"","\"Without the Divine Lord’s Blessing, you similarly lack the qualification to witness these Formation Patterns. Remember this well!\"","After Mr. Tu finished speaking, Jin Yixuan again knelt and kowtowed, his forehead striking until blood was drawn, expressing gratitude tearfully:","\"Thanks for the Divine Lord’s Blessing, thank you, Gentleman, for the teaching!\"","\"Good,\" Mr. Tu said, \"I will now pass down the Formation Patterns, watch carefully.\"","Thereafter Mr. Tu, borrowing Jin Yixuan’s physical form, drew the Patterns of Divine Formation on the paper.","Jin Yixuan watched respectfully.","After the drawing was completed, Mr. Tu said: \"Familiarize yourself with the Formation Patterns first, the essence of the Formation will be taught later.\"","\"Yes,\" Jin Yixuan said.","Afterward, the blood-colored figure gradually faded away, a trace of Mr. Tu’s Remnant Soul also slowly sunk into Jin Yixuan, disappearing.","Jin Yixuan looked at the Formation Patterns in front of him, his expression extremely excited.","\"This is... the Divine Tao Array!\"","It is a Formation inheritance nearly extinct across the Qianxue state boundary.","Looking throughout the Nine State of the cultivation world, it’s also exceedingly rare.","And the condition for practicing Divine Tao Array is extremely demanding, even within a large state, one who can master Formation may be few.","And I am about to become a Formation Master!","He tenderly touched the demon skin Formation Paper before him, every Pattern on the paper is considered a treasure.","A moment later, he restrained his thoughts, began studying the Divine Tao Array.","After a moment of study, he took out paper and pen, starting to practice the Patterns.","Jin Yixuan furrowed his brows, again and again drawing, but the more he drew, the tighter his brows knitted, seemingly stumped by something, progress was exceedingly slow.","Unaware of how long it had passed, footsteps sounded from outside, followed by the voice of a Monster cultivator:","\"Leader...\"","Jin Yixuan rolled up the demon skin scroll, frowning with displeasure said:","\"What is it?\"","The Monster cultivator respectfully said:","\"A few new furnaces of Blissful Pill have been produced, need you to inspect.\"","Jin Yixuan \"tched\" in impatience, as this was the crucial moment of his Divine Formation comprehension, he didn’t want to be disturbed by anyone.","But the Divine Formation itself is profound and obscure, it requires diligent effort which cannot be achieved overnight, urgency is not needed at this time.","Instead, the affairs within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons cannot be delayed, if there’s a mistake, he’d not be able to explain to the young master.","\"Understood,\" Jin Yixuan said coldly, then rolled up the demon skin paper, preparing to carry the document with him, but just as he turned around, suddenly remembered, this formation came from the Divine Lord and was personally taught by Mr. Tu."]},{"number":1415,"title":"Chapter 1415 - 780: Divine Formation_3","paragraphs":["What qualifies oneself to pack such exalted formations into one’s storage bag?","If any mishap occurs and it gets lost outside, wouldn’t it be a \"great disrespect\" to the Divine Lord? And how would one explain it to Mr. Tu?","Jin Yixuan pondered for a moment, an idea flickered.","He took out an exquisite jade box and carefully placed the monster-hide paper with the Divine Tao Formation Patterns inside.","Afterwards, Jin Yixuan solemnly offered this jade box before the sheep-horned statue.","Also offered it under Mo Hua’s watch.","He even bowed, respectfully saying:","\"Divine Lord above, I beseech thee to bless thy believer to swiftly comprehend this Divine Tao formation and to brave through fire and water, offering sacrifices for the Divine Lord.\"","After speaking, he made three more bows.","Mo Hua felt quite embarrassed.","After bowing, Jin Yixuan departed, never daring to look directly at the sheep-horned statue.","After he left, the main hall became much quieter.","After a moment, Mo Hua stealthily peeked out from behind the fierce sheep-horned demon monster statue.","Jin Yixuan hadn’t turned back, and confirmed he had walked far away; Mo Hua was relieved.","He eagerly approached the offering table, scanned it with his Divine Sense, and found no formation, mechanism, or other irregularities on the jade box, thinking:","\"This Jin Yixuan is truly devout to the Great Wilderness Evil God, not daring to have any ulterior motives...\"","Since that’s the case, it’s convenient for himself.","Suppressing his excitement, he gently opened the jade box, took out the monster-hide paper inside, and then slowly unfolded it...","Blood-red patterns densely clustered, profound and complex formations appeared before his eyes.","Divine Tao Formation!","Moreover, there were three sets!","Time being tight, Mo Hua’s gaze was sharp as he quickly swept over these formations, attentively memorizing every detail of the formation patterns, one by one, etched firmly in his mind.","After memorizing, Mo Hua quietly closed the monster-hide paper, returned it to the jade box, ensured no trace was left, and hid back behind the sheep-horned demon monster statue.","Sitting back on his familiar \"sheep-head bench,\" Mo Hua took out pen and paper and transcribed the formation patterns he had memorized without error.","Then, Mo Hua started to calm his mind and carefully study these formation patterns.","Some of the formation patterns on the monster-hide paper were ones he was already familiar with.","Including formations from the small fishing village, and the dense forest formations outside the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, all were within.","According to the Divine Tao inheritance type mentioned by \"Mr. Tu\":","The Divine Tao formation of the small fishing village should be the \"Divine Barrier Array,\" controlling the closure of Divine Tao’s magnum opus.","Namely controlling the entrance to the Evil God Temple within the blood-colored fishing village.","Outside the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, the Divine Tao formation fused with the forest should be the \"Divine Mist Array,\" \"capable of transforming to obscure Divine Thoughts with mist.\"","Thus, unless one’s Divine Sense is exceptionally powerful, it is impossible to penetrate the mist and observe the truth within the Divine Mist Array.","The final one, the core Divine Tao formation mentioned by \"Mr. Tu,\" is named the \"Divine Lock Array.\"","This formation is almost entirely new.","Mo Hua had never seen it before, only witnessed the old monster cultivator, now the \"Sword Bone,\" draw a formation pattern on his Lifebound Sword Bone.","This formation pattern was \"stolen\" from the Demon Refining Diagram.","In other words, this Divine Lock Array should also be the core of the Demon Refining Diagram.","Mo Hua still remembers Mr. Tu saying earlier, \"The Divine Lock Array is a ’chain’ imposed upon the deity’s body...\"","Mo Hua pondered.","Does this mean the Divine Lock Array itself is the purest \"seal\" formation?","Therefore, it is the core of the Divine Tao formation?","\"Divine Lock Array, Divine Thought as lock, sealing deities...\"","Mo Hua slightly nodded, feeling he might have guessed correctly.","He began anew with pen and ink, attempting to learn this complete set of Divine Tao formation systems from scratch, from \"Divine Barrier Array\" to \"Divine Mist Array,\" and finally to \"Divine Lock Array.\"","The Divine Barrier Array and Divine Mist Array he had learned before, though the patterns were incomplete, he at least had a foundation.","Now that he had acquired the complete patterns, learning was twice as effective with half the effort.","The only challenge was the \"Divine Lock Array.\"","Mo Hua settled down to comprehend, pen in hand, practicing one stroke at a time...","The surroundings fell silent.","Only the gentle sound of pen and ink on paper could be heard.","The Sword Demon within the White Bone Sword finally dared to peek out, glanced at Mo Hua, and thought:","\"This little ancestor, still as daring as ever, actually dares to learn the formation under the monster cultivator leader’s eyes, isn’t he afraid of being caught and then being swallowed alive...?\"","The Sword Bone shook its head.","Seeing Mo Hua focused on learning the formation, it bravely peeked at the formation patterns under Mo Hua’s pen.","This glance made it shudder with surprise.","These formation patterns, it remembers!","They are the mysterious patterns within the Demon Refining Diagram!","At the time, it only secretly memorized one of them, but the others remained a vague impression, never fully remembered or learned.","But now, these patterns, precisely and accurately, are recreated under this little ancestor’s pen.","It’s the complete set of formations!","Moreover, what made it even more incredulous...","Of these patterns, it only learned one of them.","It studied and practiced daily, drawing for two hundred years, only barely comprehending seven or eight-tenths.","As for how it learned, it remains somewhat muddled, more akin to a \"practice makes perfect\" instinct.","This was just one formation pattern!","But now...","This entire mysterious, obscure set of formations flows smoothly and effortlessly from Mo Hua’s pen.","For a moment, a sense of terror arose within its heart.","Could the disparity in talent between people truly be so vast?","Even though it’s not a Formation Master, how could it take two hundred years to learn one pattern, while this little ancestor needs but a glance?","Is this truly reasonable?","And while the White Bone Sword Demon was mentally shaken, Mo Hua had already finished and softly murmured:","\"Just about done...\"","\"This Divine Lock Array seems not as difficult as I thought.\"","He felt somewhat uncertain.","Earlier hearing Mr. Tu speak so dramatically, he thought it would be a very advanced, obscure, and difficult formation.","But now it seems... maybe it’s quite manageable?","Having practiced twice, it feels almost complete.","\"Shouldn’t be this simple...\"","Mo Hua muttered.","He looked again at the patterns under his pen, slightly inferring them once more, perceived the flow of Divine Thought Power within, and felt... there wasn’t any apparent issue.","This is learned?","Mo Hua found it hard to believe.","Wouldn’t it be better to find something to test and practice?","Experiencing reveals true knowledge.","Testing it in practice would reveal if there are any issues.","\"Divine Lock Array, with Divine Thought forming chains, sealing deities. If deities can be sealed, logically, anything else should also be sealable...\"","Mo Hua contemplated, suddenly turning his gaze intensely onto the White Bone Broken Sword nearby.","The Sword Bone within the White Bone Broken Sword was struck with terror.","A sense of dread surged in its heart.","\"It’s over...\""]},{"number":1416,"title":"Chapter 1416 - 781 Law","paragraphs":["Sure, here is the translation:","\"You... What are you going to do?\" Sword Bone’s voice trembled slightly.","\"Nothing much, just need you to do me a little favor.\" Mo Hua said with a smile.","Sword Bone looked at the kind and gentle smile of Mo Hua, and for some reason, a chill surged from the depths of his heart.","Then Mo Hua did not wait for Sword Bone to refuse—of course, he had no room to refuse—and began to take out pen and ink, dipping it in Spiritual Ink, and began to draw a Divine Lock Array on the White Bone Evil Sword.","The first stroke fell.","The aura of the Demon sword dimmed a little.","Suddenly, Sword Bone, residing in the broken sword, felt the pressure multiply.","It was as if someone used a heavy chain to firmly lock its Blood Pool.","Sword Bone was aghast.","\"Little ancestor, please don’t...\"","But Mo Hua ignored this, continuing to draw stroke by stroke.","Each stroke seemed like a heavy chain, placed upon the Bone Sword.","Sword Bone felt increasingly suffocated.","Finally, after who knows how long, Mo Hua had completely drawn a Divine Lock Array on the White Bone Evil Sword.","\"It’s done!\"","Mo Hua lifted the broken White Bone Evil Sword, admiring the Divine Formation he had just drawn, looking very satisfied.","Then he said, \"Sword Bone, try to break free.\"","He wanted to see if Sword Bone, this Sword Demon, using its own Evil Spirit force, could break free from the \"Seal\" he just laid with this Divine Lock Array.","But after waiting for a long time, there was no movement inside.","Mo Hua was puzzled, \"What’s going on?\"","Could it be that Sword Bone was completely suppressed, its soul scattered?","Mo Hua used his finger to rub against the Formation Patterns, lightening one of the Patterns a bit, causing the seal to loosen slightly, and from within the sword, a faint voice of Sword Bone emerged:","\"...Sealed...\"","\"I can’t transmit sound...\"","\"Oh,\" Mo Hua suddenly understood.","He lightened another pattern, \"How about now?\"","\"It’s better...\"","Sword Bone’s voice was still very small, but barely audible.","Mo Hua continued, \"Try to break the ’seal’.\"","Sword Bone hesitated a bit.","It feared Mo Hua was toying with it.","If it really broke the seal, it might end up being held a grudge by this vindictive little ancestor, bringing misfortune upon itself instead.","Mo Hua, displeased, struck the Demon sword, \"When I say break free, then do it promptly!\"","\"Yes, yes...\"","Helplessly, Sword Bone could only muster its White Bone Sword Qi, hacking towards the Divine Formation Patterns constituted by Divine Thought.","After hacking a few times, the Patterns did not budge.","Sword Bone exclaimed, \"The Formation you laid is so sturdy, my White Bone Sword Qi can’t budge it at all!\"","Mo Hua could clearly see that this Sword Bone had not exerted its full strength, and frowned:","\"Stop fawning, dare to hold back again, and I’ll be unkind to you.\"","Sword Bone felt bitter in its heart.","After all, this little ancestor knew its full strength.","Though insignificant before this little ancestor, it shouldn’t be so useless.","It couldn’t hide anything...","Reluctantly, Sword Bone’s body expanded, the Bone Sword jagged, transforming into the complete \"Sword Demon\" form, not daring to hold back the slightest, going all out, using Sword Qi to attack the Divine Lock Array that \"sealed\" the Blood Pool.","Countless sinister white Sword Qi entangled with Demon Thought hacked at the pale golden sealing Patterns.","The Patterns remained unmoving.","But Mo Hua faintly furrowed his brows.","On the surface, the Patterns did not loosen, but he could perceive that the \"Sealing\" power of the Formation was being counteracted bit by bit.","Each Demon Thought Sword Qi would reduce a portion of the \"Sealing\" Telekinesis.","Although the reduction was negligible, like ants gnawing, only a bit, it indeed was diminishing.","An embankment of a thousand miles crumbles from an ant’s nest.","At this rate, eventually, the seal would be completely broken.","Above the Blood Pool, the Sword Qi was chilling.","Sword Bone hacked for a while, feeling somewhat exhausted, had to withdraw its \"Demonization,\" panting while resting aside.","Mo Hua said, \"Rest for a bit, then continue hacking.\"","Sword Bone mustered its courage, just about to protest, but upon meeting Mo Hua’s deep gaze, recalling this little ancestor’s \"terror,\" its mustered courage dissipated completely.","\"Yes...\"","So, resting for a while, it transformed into \"Sword Demon\" again, continuing to hack at the Divine Lock Array Patterns.","This time, it considered these Patterns as the detestable Mo Hua.","Hence it hacked with extra motivation.","\"Kill you, kill you, one day, I’ll slash you into a thousand pieces!\"","Sword Bone thought hatefully in its heart.","However, it only dared to bury this bit of \"defiance\" deeply in its heart, not daring to reveal even the slightest bit.","It knew all too well.","If it dared to reveal even a hint of this thought, the one to be \"slashed into a thousand pieces\" would be itself.","And so, hack for a bit, rest a bit, after resting, continue hacking.","It’s unclear how long it hacked.","Suddenly, a slight \"zzz\" sound occurred, and a crack appeared in the chains formed by Divine Thought.","Sword Bone was stunned, then overjoyed.","Mo Hua’s brows furrowed even more.","A crack had appeared on the Divine Lock Array, prompting Sword Bone to hack with even more vigor.","Soon, one of the Patterns was riddled with cracks, the sealing power completely dissipated.","Since the Patterns of the Divine Lock Array were connected, one breach drastically reduced the sealing effect of the other Patterns as well.","\"Kill you, kill you!\"","Sword Bone shouted weakly yet triumphantly in its heart.","After countless hacks, the Divine Lock Formation constructed by Divine Thought collapsed with a roar, and the sealing power completely dissipated.","Sword Bone stood straight, feeling immensely relieved.","It glanced at Mo Hua, a bit smug, \"Your Formation seems not so effective...\"","Mo Hua regarded it indifferently."]},{"number":1417,"title":"Chapter 1417 - 781 Law_2","paragraphs":["The sword bone suddenly shivered in fright.","What careless mistake!","Without thinking, it had blurted out those arrogant words.","It quickly wiped the nonexistent cold sweat from its forehead and chuckled awkwardly:","\"Your Formation is truly unfathomable, breaking it was just pure luck, just luck...\"","Mo Hua had already stopped paying attention to it, frowning and pondering to himself.","The sword bone silently breathed a sigh of relief, while inwardly grumbling:","\"You let me break the Formation, but when it’s really broken, you’re unhappy.\"","This little ancestor is so unpredictable, truly hard to serve.","Then it thought again:","\"However, the Formation just now seemed strong, the power of Divine Thought was terrifyingly concentrated, almost unlike a human’s Divine Sense, but overly rigid structures tend to break, overly strong ones don’t last long, like an unyielding stone barrage, seemingly solid, but water drops wear away the stone, eroding bit by bit, it will inevitably collapse...\"","Mo Hua realized this issue as well.","On the surface, his Divine Sense was strong and underwent a quality change, forming the \"seal\" chains through the Divine Patterns, solid as goldstone.","But this type of Divine Thought is \"dead\", a fixed quantity.","It’s hard to withstand the steady erosion by evil spirits over the years, and fundamentally it can’t achieve a long-lasting sealing effect.","A mere sword demon couldn’t be sealed.","Let alone sealing colossal evil entities like an Evil God.","The \"Divine Lock Array\" he created has only the form of a seal but lacks the actual essence of sealing.","\"But what exactly is the essence of sealing?\"","Is it some special Heavenly Dao Laws?","Similar to the Spiritual Power decomposition in the Reversed Spirit Formation.","The Earth Dao Meaning in the Thick Earth Formation.","The Spiritual Power manipulation in the Spiritual Pivot Formation.","And the fusion of Divine Thought and Spiritual Power in the Five Element Ultimate Formation?","What exactly are the laws of sealing?","Mo Hua was somewhat bewildered.","No one had taught him this, and no one had given him any hints, how could he possibly figure it out in a short while?","How could he have a true realization?","Mo Hua sighed with a headache.","Indeed, formations are vast and profound, even with his understanding, sometimes it feels as obscure as being enveloped in fog, with no clue on where to start.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and decided to train at the Taoist Stele to see if he could derive some other inspiration.","But the time was not yet right.","Mo Hua then took out the Taixu Token, transmitted messages to Elder Xun, and disclosed some of the intelligence he’s gathered.","Including some internal structures of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, and the identities of disciples from Sever Gold Sect – Jin Gui, Jin Yicai, and Jin Yixuan.","Of course, he didn’t mention issues about Mr. Tu and the Evil God, as the cause-and-effect was too deep, and hard to explain.","Upon receiving the news, Xun Ziyou’s expression was equally solemn.","Beside him, Shangguan Xuanjian couldn’t help but sneer coldly, \"What a Sever Gold Sect, truly audacious!\"","Xun Ziyou remained silent, eventually sighed, \"Let’s not make a fuss about this matter for now.\"","Shangguan Xuanjian frowned, and slowly said, \"If a cockroach is found in the house, it indicates...\"","Xun Ziyou nodded slowly.","Shangguan Xuanjian assumed a stern expression, \"Then the trouble might be big...\"","Xun Ziyou sighed deeply, looking up into the sky over the Qian Learning State Boundary, recalling the Ancestor’s words, a thought suddenly flashed in his mind.","\"Three feet of ice, doesn’t come from one day of cold.\"","\"Possibly, the troubles were already huge a long time ago...\"","Xun Ziyou muttered to himself silently.","...","After conversing with Elder Xun, Mo Hua sat cross-legged for a while, then looked through several Divine Patterns, waited until 1 p.m, and then his Divine Sense sank into the Sea of Consciousness.","Within the Sea of Consciousness, the Taoist Stele stood vast and ethereal, towering.","Mo Hua began to draw the Divine Barrier Array, Divine Mist Array, and Divine Lock Array on the Taoist Stele.","Soon, three faint golden Divine Arrays, purely composed of Divine Thought, emerged on the Taoist Stele.","Mo Hua gazed at the Formation and slightly shook his head.","\"It’s indeed not working...\"","The flow of Thought Power within the Formation was murky.","It possessed only the form, but lacked spirit.","When these patterns were inscribed on the White Bone Evil Sword to seal the sword bone, Mo Hua hadn’t noticed.","Now, within the Sea of Consciousness, presenting these patterns on the Taoist Stele, which contains the Dao Laws, the issues became very apparent.","The pattern gloss was dim.","Indicating that the Taoist Stele did not acknowledge it.","Meaning that his understanding of Divine Arrays was still very shallow, and he hadn’t yet grasped the essence of formations.","\"But what are the Formation Laws inherent in the Divine Arrays?\"","Mo Hua frowned and thought hard, but after much meditation, no clue could be grasped, inevitably feeling a bit dejected.","\"Seems that Mr. Tu wasn’t wrong, these Divine Arrays ’by human knowledge, steal the Divine Ways’, thereby mastering the power to seal divinity, are indeed abstruse and complex, not something easily learned.\"","That Mr. Tu, indeed hadn’t spoken falsely.","Mo Hua silently apologized to Mr. Tu.","Previously, he thought he was extraordinarily gifted, that he could learn it easily; but now it seems, he was indeed somewhat naive, had underestimated the world’s Formation Masters...","Mo Hua sighed.","What to do now?","The Formation Diagram is in hand, he can already perform the patterns, but the essential mysteries of the formation, the involved Formation Laws, he still doesn’t understand.","And even in the short term, he could not deduce any insights.","The situation was somewhat stalled...","Mo Hua furrowed his brows, suddenly had a flash of inspiration, recalling what Mr. Tu said to Jin Yixuan before disappearing:","\"You first familiarize yourself with the patterns, the essence of formation, and I will teach you later...\"","When Mr. Tu taught Jin Yixuan, could he stealthily learn it himself?","Since Mr. Tu could use these Divine Arrays, it implies he understands the Dao Laws contained within them.","As long as he teaches Jin Yixuan, it’s certain he will \"teach\" Mo Hua as well.","In this way, even if the complete understanding of such laws isn’t achieved, Mo Hua would at least know the direction, avoiding being completely clueless."]},{"number":1418,"title":"Chapter 1418 - 781 Law_3","paragraphs":["\"It’s just that, time might not be enough...\"","Mo Hua had some concerns.","He didn’t know how well Jin Yixuan’s formation comprehension was.","If he were a fool, just understanding the Divine Formation Patterns would take ten days to half a month, wouldn’t that be a bit too late?","But right now, there wasn’t any better way.","Mo Hua sighed again and could only continue practicing the divine formations on the Taoist Stele, hoping that drawing them several more times might lead to deeper insights, perhaps even some enlightenment.","On the Taoist Stele, the Divine Formation Patterns appeared stroke by stroke.","Mo Hua calmed his mind, heart, and mind clear, drawing the divine formations over and over again.","After completing the drawings, he would erase them, and after erasing, he continued to draw again...","Time passed bit by bit.","Mo Hua did not know how many times he had drawn them; while the formation patterns became more familiar, there was no progress in deeper comprehension.","\"So difficult...\"","Mo Hua, tired from drawing, lay down beside the Taoist Stele, clearing his mind, planning to rest for a while before drawing again.","He refused to believe that after a hundred or a thousand times, he wouldn’t gain any insight.","Mo Hua closed his eyes, spirit ethereal, abandoning distracting thoughts.","Gradually, the feeling of fatigue dissipated.","After lying down for a while, Mo Hua felt revitalized and planned to get up and continue drawing.","Just at that moment, Mo Hua caught a glimpse of a dark rift out of the corner of his eye, causing him to be stunned.","It was a rift in the void.","Since Mo Hua’s Divine Sense reached the peak of Seventeen Patterns, about to break through to Eighteen Patterns, this rift had suddenly appeared in his Sea of Consciousness.","Not knowing its origin or history, the rift was extraordinarily mystical, akin to the handiwork of the Great Dao, seemingly born to patch Mo Hua’s \"flaw.\"","Any growth in Mo Hua’s Divine Sense was devoured by the rift.","Thus, in the past year or so, all his hard-earned Divine Sense had primarily served to feed this \"uninvited guest,\" resulting in no advancement in his Divine Sense realm.","This rift was the \"culprit\" suppressing the growth of his Divine Sense.","Previously whenever Mo Hua saw this void rift, he felt quite unhappy.","But now, he was suddenly struck dumb.","\"Suppressing the growth of my Divine Sense...\"","In other words, could it mean... it has \"sealed\" my Divine Sense?!","In other words, this void rift is a layer of the Heavenly Dao \"seal\"?!","And the void rift evidently contained some kind of Heavenly Dao Laws.","That would mean, this rift was clearly a most vivid and straightforward Heavenly Dao \"sealing\" law?!","Mo Hua found it somewhat incredible.","Searched high and low in vain...","The core sealing principle of the Divine Tao Array, it turned out, had long been embedded in his Sea of Consciousness by the Heavenly Dao as a \"patch\"?!","Its purpose was to seal his Divine Sense, repairing his \"flaw\"?!","Mo Hua’s mouth hung open, heart filled with awe.","Then his eyes sparkled, thoughts racing:","\"To know how the Divine Tao Array can seal the Evil God, one merely needs to understand how this Heavenly Dao Law ’seals’ oneself...\"","This law can seal himself.","Once he comprehends this law and integrates it into the Divine Tao Array, naturally, it would also be able to seal other evil spirits, even the most formidable Evil Gods!","Mo Hua continued to ponder:","So how did this law seal his Sea of Consciousness?","Mo Hua immediately thought of a word:","Devour!","\"For this law to continue to exist, it must continually ’devour’ and absorb the Divine Thought of the sealed, achieving a cycle of strength to maintain its own stability and existence.\"","\"Similarly, the Divine Tao Array must ’devour’ the telekinesis of the sealed to maintain the formation’s existence, making the ’power of sealing’ continuous and enduring over the years.\"","\"So, the core of sealing lies in ’devour.’","Mo Hua suddenly realized.","Water without a source dries up.","All forces in the world are conserved and have their origins.","Spiritual power, demonic power, and even Divine Thought Power are all like this.","Ordinary formations can use Spirit Stones to provide spiritual power.","But there is no equivalent \"Spirit Stone\" for Divine Thought Power.","Divine Formation Masters cannot continuously provide telekinesis for formations.","Therefore, for a Divine Tao Array to achieve extended \"sealing,\" it must draw power from elsewhere, through devouring the telekinesis of sealed evil spirits, forming an \"internal cycle\" of the formation’s own power.","The more profound this devouring law, the stronger the Divine Tao Array, the more indestructible the seal.","To some extent, the Divine Tao Array, and the evil spirits and Evil Gods it seals, are one.","If the Evil God does not die, the evil spirit is not extinguished, the Divine Tao Array will similarly not perish.","Mo Hua was deeply shaken in his heart.","The Heavenly Dao Laws truly are wondrous.","And for the formation masters of the past who could embody these laws into formations, they are indeed shockingly talented, deserving of immense admiration.","Mo Hua’s expression was solemn.","\"Heavenly Dao is infinite, formation path vast, and there are always people beyond people.\"","\"One must not be arrogant and complacent; be humble and eager to learn, only then is it possible to truly master formations, comprehending the Heavenly Dao in the future.\"","Mo Hua nodded silently.","Then, his eyes gleamed brightly.","The Heavenly Dao Laws were already laid out before him!","Previously, he had considered probing into this law, but due to limited experience in Tao cultivation, he couldn’t discern what it truly signified.","Moreover, merely knowing the law, without a concrete \"form,\" it was of little use.","Now he completely understood.","The Divine Formation Patterns are the form, the sealing law is the essence.","Combined into one, this law then had a means to be embodied.","Mo Hua held his breath and focused, starting again on the Taoist Stele, drawing the Divine Formation Patterns, while envisioning the void rift-like laws, feeling the circulation of telekinesis within them.","Then, comparing them both, integrating them into each other.","Through the Divine Formation Patterns, understanding the Heavenly Dao Laws, and through the Heavenly Dao Laws, endowing the Divine Formation Patterns with true essence.","And so, it was unclear how long the practice lasted, Mo Hua’s brush paused, then completed the final stroke.","Then it was like the final touch on a dragon, a formation naturally taking shape.","A brilliant golden light flashed by, the condensed telekinesis circulating smoothly.","\"Succeeded!\"","The true Divine Tao Array containing the sealing principle—Divine Lock Array, with golden light flowing, like chains binding deities, now appeared before him!","Mo Hua beamed with a radiant smile.","At that exact moment.","In a place like a celestial marble palace, within a Sect as heavenly as a jade capital, an elder who was meditating peacefully suddenly opened his eyes.","A trace of fear suddenly flowed through his heart.","As if something extraordinary, a secret no mere mortal should violate, had leaked away..."]},{"number":1419,"title":"Chapter 1419 - 782: Great Calamity","paragraphs":["How could it possibly be leaked?","How could it be lost?","Wearing human skin, dressed in the Sect Elder’s Taoist Robe, Mr. Tu, with his fair and elegant appearance, looked somewhat incredulous.","His slender fingers pinched as he carefully deduced, and many unknown secrets flowed through his mind one by one.","\"Large Formation, Demon Palace, altar, blood pact list, Divine Fetus, Divine Servant, hidden henchmen, Four Symbols Formation...\"","Suddenly, his pupils shrank sharply.","Divine Formation!","\"Has the Divine Formation been lost?!\"","Mr. Tu’s expression changed drastically.","Impossible, absolutely impossible!","Without the favor of the divine, without the blessing of a deity, and not born as a Divine Fetus, how could an ordinary person possibly learn the Divine Formation?","How did this person learn it?","And where did they learn it from?","Could it be a... Divine Protege?","The unease in Mr. Tu’s heart grew increasingly stronger.","He paused in thought, then slowly stood up, left the Elder’s Residence, and walked on the exquisite white jade stairs, heading towards the Mountain Gate.","At this moment, dawn had just broken.","The bright morning sun shone down, and within the Sect, resembling a jade palace, scattered gold paved on white jade, it looked like a paradise on earth.","Within the Sect, the rules were strict.","Despite it being early, many disciples were already up for cultivation or body training.","Along the way, occasionally a disciple would encounter Mr. Tu and bow in greeting:","\"Greetings, Elder.\"","The scholarly-looking Mr. Tu wore an expression as gentle as a spring breeze, nodded in acknowledgment, and said, \"Good.\"","After walking for a while, he suddenly encountered another Elder at the corner.","This Elder had deep lines of authority, and on his Taoist Robe, there were four gold patterns, clearly indicating a high and dignified status.","Seeing Mr. Tu, the Elder looked somewhat surprised, \"Elder Shen?\"","Mr. Tu also cupped his hands in greeting, \"Elder Shen.\"","\"So early in the morning, Elder Shen, where are you headed?\" Elder Shen, dressed in a four-patterned gold-taoist robe, asked with a dignified expression.","Mr. Tu thought for a moment, then sighed and said:","\"An old Taoist Friend, whom I haven’t met for a long time, came from afar, bringing some remnants of a Formation Diagram. He wishes to have tea and converse on formations, so I’ll take some time to see him.\"","Elder Shen showed no emotion, \"Elder Shen, it really seems you are devoted to formations...\"","Mr. Tu replied with a smile, \"I’m afraid I’ve let Elder Shen see through my devotion, but I shall return soon, and the teaching affairs for the inner disciples will not be delayed.\"","Only then did Elder Shen slightly nod.","Within the Sect, the Elders’ movements were only under supervision and not strictly controlled by him, so thus he merely inquired.","Under normal circumstances, he wouldn’t have asked.","But now the Sect was on the verge of reform, and the upcoming Dao Debate Conference was crucial.","The entire Sect from top to bottom had to be strictly regulated, allowing no laxity.","The success of this matter would affect the sect’s fortune and the future of the entire Qian Taoist Sect. No negligence was allowed.","Elder Shen turned to leave, but still feeling uneasy, glanced back at Elder Shen and asked in a low voice:","\"Regarding the reform, is there no problem on your end?\"","Mr. Tu replied in a deep voice, \"Rest assured, Elder Shen, everything is under control.\"","\"That’s good...\" Elder Shen nodded.","\"If this matter succeeds...\" Mr. Tu, looking gentle and respectful, his gaze flickered slightly, speaking meaningfully, \"Elder Shen, perhaps you can go further...\"","Elder Shen raised an eyebrow and said solemnly:","\"All for the Sect’s service, personal gains and losses, are trivial matters.\"","Mr. Tu cupped his hands, \"Elder Shen’s noble integrity is admired by Shen.\"","Elder Shen slightly raised his forehead, the lines on his face appeared deeper, but his mood seemed much more pleasant, and his tone also softened.","\"Elder Shen, make an early return.\"","Having said that, he glanced at Mr. Tu, a trace of aloof benevolence in his expression, \"If this matter succeeds, there will undoubtedly be a place for you as a True Transmission Elder within the Sect.\"","\"The position of True Transmission Elder among the Four Great Sects at the Qianxue state boundary is a status that many Feathered Immortal Cultivators strive for all their lives yet cannot reach...\"","Mr. Tu was overjoyed, quickly bowed deeply, and said:","\"If the Sect favors me, and I’m fortunate to become a True Transmission Elder, it would be the joy of my life, enough to glorify my ancestors and die without regret! Elder Shen’s great kindness and virtue shall never be forgotten by Shen!\"","Elder Shen seemed very pleased with Mr. Tu’s words.","He nodded and then walked past Mr. Tu, up the high white jade stairs, fading into the distance among the jade palaces.","After Elder Shen departed, Mr. Tu’s expression lost its previous warmth and elegance, gradually growing cold.","He turned to glance at Mr. Shen, his gaze indifferent, as if looking at a \"toy\" driven by greed.","\"Those with a low Taoist Heart are only high-class behaving lowly people...\"","\"The fattest offerings for the Divine Lord.\"","Mr. Tu turned away, once again donning a refined façade, and walked down the white jade stairs, away from Elder Shen.","After leaving the Mountain Gate of Qian Tao Sect and reaching Qiandao City, Mr. Tu entered a tavern, then went to the Hundred Treasures Pavilion. After wandering around the city a bit and ensuring no causal links targeted him, he entered a luxuriously appointed cave mansion through a secret door.","Within the cave mansion, the scenery was beautiful, exceptionally luxurious, yet not a soul was present.","Mr. Tu passed through fake mountains and artificial waters, pavilions, and terraces until he reached the deepest and most concealed door within the cave mansion.","Over the door, eighteen layers of fourth-grade formations were overlaid.","Mr. Tu carefully and meticulously unlocked each formation.","Then, as light swirled and the formation patterns faded layer by layer, the door opened wide.","Mr. Tu stepped forward and walked inside.","Inside was a grand hall.","The hall was also filled with formations, but it was empty inside, with no furnishings except for a formation platform standing in the middle of the hall."]},{"number":1420,"title":"Chapter 1420 - 782 The Great Calamity_2","paragraphs":["The formation platform was ancient, engraved with simple patterns that appeared unremarkable.","Mr. Tu carefully took out three Spirit Stones.","These three Spirit Stones, dazzling in seven colors, glowing as if naturally formed, were extremely rare Innate Spirit Stones in the Cultivation World.","Mr. Tu placed the three Innate Spirit Stones at the formation eye of the platform, then walked to the center of the platform.","A moment later, the formation was activated.","The three Innate Spirit Stones hummed, their Spiritual Marrow gradually depleting, turning to ash.","The ancient and mysterious formation patterns flashed one after another.","Above the flowing light, black spatial fissures flickered, intertwining with each other.","The void flickered, space teleported.","Incredibly, the formation engraved on this platform was a void transmission array of the Fifth Grade Heaven Void level!","Strong void fluctuations emanated from the formation platform.","These surging fluctuations overflowed and were absorbed entirely by the densely packed formations on the four walls of the grand hall.","The aura of the formation was completely concealed.","Thus, during the transmission, no one noticed.","With a flash of the void, Mr. Tu’s figure disappeared.","Within the Qian Learning State Boundary, amidst another desolate and hidden barren mountain range, a void fissure flashed by.","Mr. Tu’s figure slowly appeared.","He stood upright, his expression cold, releasing his bloody and eerie Divine Sense to scan the surroundings. After confirming no one noticed, he walked into the deep mountains.","In the dead and barren mountains, sunlight reflecting off the mountain colors cast a grayish hue.","As Mr. Tu walked, he shed his human skin, his form twisting bit by bit, returning to his original withered and pale appearance.","The place he appeared was within the Fifth Grade Qianxue State Boundary.","But the mountains he headed towards were a Forbidden Land, enveloped in shadows and dense fog, with no clear direction.","Finally, Mr. Tu returned to the eerie grand hall.","Inside the hall, there was a secret chamber.","In the chamber, an altar was set up. Atop the altar, a grim and bloodied skull with human face and goat horns was enshrined.","Mr. Tu knelt before the skull.","His face was pale, with a faint green light, his voice old and hoarse:","\"Things have changed...\"","\"Divine Lord, grant me great power, to glimpse the heavenly secrets, and calculate fortunes and misfortunes.\"","After speaking, he kowtowed three times.","After kowtowing, a mysterious Evil Power descended, and the secret chamber was filled with a bloody aura.","Mr. Tu’s body constantly trembled, his bones shook, his teeth clattered, as if enduring immense burden and immense pain.","After 30 minutes, the bloody aura dissipated.","Mr. Tu’s pupils were hollow, as if something had parasitized him, looking indifferent as he took a piece of human bone from the altar.","Then he used his long nails to cut his palm, letting blood drip onto the human bone.","The blood fell onto the white bone, igniting a nameless evil fire.","The flames, like a serpent’s tongue, licked the bones, leaving crack after crack.","Mr. Tu’s hollow eyes looked at the bloody cracks, calculated with his fingers, and his expression suddenly changed:","\"A great calamity!\"","The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons is facing a great calamity!","His eyes became less hollow, but instantly shrouded with a layer of terror and confusion.","\"The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons has been hidden for eight hundred years, sheltered by the Divine Mist Forest, invisible to Divine Sense, with countless monster servants inside, invulnerable to external threats, how could there be a great calamity?\"","\"Where does this calamity come from?\"","Mr. Tu was baffled.","\"The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons is a place of monster cultivators, the foundation of demon monsters, the furnace of Demon Cores, the soul-returning ground of Ten Thousand Demons...\"","\"It is a crucial part of the Divine Lord’s great plan, there can be no mistakes, no leaks!\"","Mr. Tu’s expression was grave, hesitated repeatedly, finally gritting his teeth, and kowtowed three more times to the eerie skull with goat horns:","\"Once more, beseech the Divine Lord’s grace, with Blood Sacrifice, borrowing Divine Thought, using the Lord’s eye, to substitute my eye, to glimpse the ominous chance...\"","Mr. Tu pronounced each word slowly.","After speaking, he suddenly felt the pressure on his Sea of Consciousness multiply, as if a powerful evil thought forced itself onto his Heavenly Gate.","Mr. Tu couldn’t bear the load, blood flowed from his seven apertures.","Especially his eyes, blood streamed down, covering them in a bloody hue.","And through this bloody hue, he finally saw it.","He saw the calamity.","Saw the true crisis of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons!","At this moment, outside the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, in the Divine Mist Forest, hundreds of sect cultivators were covertly lurking!","Among them, a significant number were Golden Core!","This was an elite group of cultivators.","Even more than half were Inner Sect Elders of Great Sects!","At this time, they were like a pack of wolves and tigers, surrounding the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, intending to seize the opportunity to destroy the foundation of the Divine Lord.","This was a true great calamity.","Moreover, it was not about to come, but had silently already arrived!","Mr. Tu was both shocked and furious.","He ignored the continuous divination, the loss of Vital Energy caused by forcibly containing the Divine Lord’s Divine Thought in his Sea of Consciousness, took out an unknown piece of skin parchment that could avoid cause and effect, dipped it in the blood on the ground, and began to write a blood letter...","...","Outside the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","The Elders of Taixu Gate and Rushing Void Sect were meditating with their eyes closed.","A subtle blood light flashed by.","No one else noticed.","But the Elder of Formation Arts from Taixu Gate, Xun Zixian, a Third Grade Formation Master with considerable research in the Divine Thought, suddenly opened his eyes, his brows furrowed.","Xun Ziyou noticed the anomaly, asked: \"Zixian, what’s wrong?\"","Xun Zixian pondered for a long time, before saying slowly: \"Just now... it seemed as if something ’looked’ at me.\"","Xun Ziyou was slightly surprised, \"What thing?\"","Xun Zixian shook his head, \"I don’t know, I can’t tell, it might even be just my illusion...\"","Xun Ziyou’s gaze was solemn, looking at the distant bloody Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, he said in a deep voice:","\"I’m afraid it may not be an illusion.\"","Xun Zixian also had a grave expression."]},{"number":1421,"title":"Chapter 1421 - 782 The Great Calamity_3","paragraphs":["Xun Ziyou called over an inner sect disciple and instructed, \"Pass the order down, let everyone be alert. Perhaps, there might be changes...\"","\"Yes, Elder.\"","The disciple took the order and left.","Xun Ziyou and Xun Zixian exchanged a glance, then both looked towards the great gate of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons at the end of the White Bone Path, their nerves tightened.","...","Meanwhile, inside the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","In the deepest part, in a study burning sandalwood incense, luxurious yet simple, contrasting sharply with the strange atmosphere within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","A young nobleman, with fair hands, was holding a precious platinum formation pen, inscribing formation patterns stroke by stroke on paper as white as snow.","Suddenly, feeling something, he took out a piece of unknown parchment, spreading it before him.","A bloodstain appeared upon the parchment.","A line of blood red words emerged:","\"The great calamity is imminent, the hawks gather outside the valley, the matter is untenable, sacrifice the pawn to save the general...\"","Finally, there was another line, written carelessly, yet the strokes were like a knife, each character dripping blood, a decision as if carving the heart and dissecting the gall:","\"Destroy the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons!\"","The young nobleman was stunned for a moment, his gaze gradually turned cold.","\"Hundreds of years of effort, such a massive foundation, can be spoken of destruction just like that; Mr. Tu indeed makes a ruthless decision, a great resolve.\"","\"When the time comes, hesitation causes chaos...\"","The young nobleman’s elegant eyes reflected half-moon clarity, half-revealing an inscrutable mystical glow.","...","Inside the formation stone chamber.","Mo Hua was reflecting and integrating the void heavenly dao laws in his sea of consciousness with the formation patterns of the divine formation, understanding dao through formations, harmonizing formations with dao, finally gaining an initial insight into the \"Seal\" law, and mastering the divine lock array which is the core of the Great Wilderness divine formation inheritance.","Mo Hua was overjoyed, his eyes shining brightly.","Now, he could even consider himself an entry-level \"Divine Way Formation Master\"!","Mo Hua exited the sea of consciousness and glanced at the sword bone beside him.","The principle of formations emphasizes applying what’s learned.","Since he had learned it, he must use it.","He wanted to practice further with the \"sword bone,\" to see if this little sword demon could escape the divine lock array he laid down this time.","The sword bone, watched by Mo Hua, felt a chill deep within for some reason.","Intuition told it, whenever this little ancestor looked at it with glowing eyes, nothing good would happen.","Then it slightly tensed.","\"Come to think of it, this little ancestor only wants to use me to test his newly learned formation...\"","\"Since that’s the case, there’s nothing to fear.\"","Not even a night had passed, I bet this little ancestor couldn’t have learned anything profound.","I’ll play along with him, just to entertain him.","The sword bone thought to itself.","Mo Hua was just about to start, to experiment with the formation on the sword bone, when he suddenly paused and retracted his pen and ink, continuing to sit still atop the sheep horn skull, motionless.","He sensed that Jin Yixuan had returned.","Sure enough, after a moment, the door opened, and Jin Yixuan, clad in black, returned to the hall.","He looked exhausted, as if he had been busy all night.","Jin Yixuan was just about to sit down and continue learning the divine formation patterns when a monster cultivator walked in.","Jin Yixuan, interrupted, felt a bit impatient, just ready to sternly rebuke, but when he looked up and recognized the newcomer’s appearance, his expression immediately turned stern, retracting his arrogant posture, and appeared quite respectful.","This monster cultivator was an elder, his voice hoarse like a cracked bell.","He entered, said only: \"The young master requests your presence.\"","Jin Yixuan dared not be disrespectful in the slightest, bowed his hands in salute and said, \"Yes.\"","The monster cultivator said nothing more, simply turned, and left.","Jin Yixuan, eyes tightened, followed closely after this monster cultivator, leaving the formation stone hall.","Within the stone hall, now empty, only Mo Hua was left alone.","Mo Hua frowned, a vague unease rising in his heart.","He suddenly felt that there seemed to be some unexpected changes happening.","But what kind of changes?","Mo Hua couldn’t quite guess at the moment.","He was now hiding inside the hall, it wasn’t convenient to go out, if he wanted to find out what happened, he could only wait patiently.","Wait for Jin Yixuan to return, maybe there would be some clues.","After an hour, Jin Yixuan indeed returned.","Not only did he return alone, but he also gathered the officials from all regions of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons—Mo Hua guessed they were officials because Jin Gui was among them.","Jin Yixuan said nothing, seemingly afraid of something leaking out, just handed each official a jade slip, instructing:","\"Act according to the instructions in the jade slip.\"","The officials took the jade slips, their divine sense entering them, after just a glance, their expressions changed dramatically:","\"Official, this...\"","\"... why to this extent?\"","\"Could something major have happened?\"","Jin Yixuan’s gaze was as sharp as a sword, sweeping over them.","The gathered officials dared not speak.","Jin Yixuan then said in a stern voice: \"This is the young master’s instruction, whatever the young master orders, we do as commanded.\"","Seeing the varying expressions and differing thoughts among them, he softened his tone slightly, \"This is also an opportunity for you.\"","\"Follow the young master’s instructions, if successful, you can escape this cage, no need to keep guarding within the valley, henceforth the world is vast, another kind of freedom awaits...\"","This sentence struck a chord with several officials.","Even as officials, holding authority, no one wished to continue living this dark non-human life within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","In the colorful world, who wouldn’t long for it?","Although the officials didn’t show it outwardly, their eyes slightly wavered, finally one of them led, \"We faithfully follow the young master’s instructions!\"","Following the lead, others echoed:","\"We solely follow the young master’s lead.\"","\"Will serve the young master with utmost loyalty...\"","Jin Yixuan nodded with satisfaction, then his eyes glinted cold, \"There’s no time to lose, act now.\"","\"Yes!\"","After the discussion, Jin Yixuan and the officials all left.","The unease in Mo Hua’s heart grew more intense...","Escape the cage?","Another kind of freedom?","What on earth does this group of monster cultivators intend to do?","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then sent a message to Elder Xun:","\"The monster cultivators seem to be up to something, Elder, please be cautious...\"","After sending, Mo Hua continued waiting, intending to watch and see what happened.","But before long, great commotion arose within the valley abruptly.","There were sounds of buildings collapsing, cries from monster cultivators, even low roars from monster beasts, all mingling together.","Mo Hua frowned, and just at that moment, the Taixu Token vibrated.","Mo Hua took it out to see, a urgent message came from the Taixu Token, sent by Elder Xun:","\"Mo Hua, are you alright?!\"","Mo Hua: \"I’m fine, what happened?\"","Elder Xun, after a moment, sent a transmission: \"The great gate of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, opened...\"","Mo Hua, upon hearing this, felt a tremor in his heart.","-----------------","(ps. Barring unforeseen circumstances, there will be an additional Chapter released tomorrow, and another the day after, striving to conclude this segment of the plot~๑•.•๑)"]},{"number":1422,"title":"Chapter 1422 - 783 \"Mouse\" (Thanks to Catni’s Night for the Alliance Hierarch~)","paragraphs":["Elder Xun continued: \"Now these demonic cultivators are charging at us madly, and we have already engaged in combat...\"","Mo Hua frowned slightly.","Have Elder Xun and the others been exposed?","So these demonic cultivators want to fight to the death, a last-ditch battle?","But... how were they exposed?","How did the demonic cultivators know that Elder Xun and his group were stationed outside the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons?","Was it because Elder Xun and his group accidentally gave themselves away, or was it because... that mysterious Mr. Tu, who is also versed in causality and fate, can \"predict and calculate\"?","Mo Hua frowned.","However, given the current situation, it’s useless to dwell on it. I must quickly consider what to do next.","Mo Hua asked: \"Elder Xun, can you break through?\"","The Taixu Token paused for a moment; it seemed something delayed Elder Xun’s side, and after a while, the transmission came through:","\"It will take some time...\"","\"Zixian said we can only enter the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons through the Bone Path, and we must not touch the Blood Creek on either side.\"","\"Currently, the Bone Path is densely packed with demonic cultivators, like a tide; although we have the advantage in cultivation, we cannot break through at the moment.\"","At this moment, outside the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, a bloody aura filled the air, and evil winds howled.","On the Bone Path, demonic cultivators roared, clashing with the sect’s cultivators.","For a moment, the monster Qi soared into the sky.","The cultivators from both the Taixu and Chongxu sects either wielded sword Qi or cast spells, slaying the demonic cultivators one by one, staining the ground with blood.","Xun Ziyou slashed with his right hand, conjuring a blade of sword Qi, effortlessly killing a few demonic cultivators as he pushed further into the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","But at the same time, he sensed something was wrong and said to Mo Hua:","\"These demonic cultivators seem strange, with bizarre lines on their bodies, glowing red, it seems their demonic power is pushed to the extreme...\"","He looked around, frowned, and continued the transmission:","\"Once they die, the monster patterns will explode, leaving flesh and blood everywhere.\"","\"Some demonic cultivators don’t even have to die; their monster patterns go out of control, their demonic power becomes chaotic, and they die from self-destruction in madness...\"","Hearing this, Mo Hua’s heart trembled.","\"These demonic cultivators are being used as expendables.\"","Each of them has been marked with the Four Symbols Monster Patterns.","He himself can control the Four Symbols Monster Patterns, but altering each pattern one-by-one and controlling their demonic power through the Formation Pivot is required.","But those in charge inside the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons need not do so.","They possess demon banners integrated with the Formation Pivot for the Four Symbols Monster Patterns.","With these demon banners, the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons can command masses of demonic cultivators, forcing them to \"charge forward fearlessly\" and \"fight to the death\".","The controlled demonic cultivators are cannon fodder, meant to hinder Elder Xun’s group and buy time.","They were originally intended to \"be sent to their deaths\".","Jin Yixuan, or rather the master behind him, seeing the futility of the situation, wishes to annihilate all his underling demonic cultivators, leaving no survivors!","Truly ruthless.","Mo Hua sighed.","Xun Ziyou casually killed a few more demonic cultivators and asked Mo Hua:","\"Are you alright over there?\"","\"I’m fine,\" Mo Hua replied.","He had merely learned a little something.","Nothing else happened.","After all, before coming, he had calculated the causality, and this Valley of Ten Thousand Demons appeared to be a place of \"great luck\".","For others, it may be uncertain whether it’s a blessing or a curse, but for him, it should not pose too great a danger.","\"Alright, stay safe, I’ll push in as soon as I can...\"","Xun Ziyou was about to end the transmission like this, but then he turned to see the Chongxu Sect’s Elder Shangguan Xuanjian, looking at him expectantly.","Xun Ziyou paused, feeling somewhat helpless.","In a dire situation, he only hoped Mo Hua could ensure his own safety.","He would help others if possible, but he didn’t want Mo Hua to take risks or complicate matters, avoiding putting himself in danger, especially in such a chaotic situation.","However, Shangguan Xuanjian had a deep friendship with him.","The relationship between the Chongxu Sect and the Taixu Sect also had long-standing connections.","It’s indeed inappropriate to stand by and do nothing.","Xun Ziyou sighed, could only send another transmission to Mo Hua: \"If there’s a chance, look after Ling Huxiao...\"","Mo Hua: \"Okay!\"","He hadn’t intended to abandon his two companions either.","Shangguan Xuanjian clasped his fists to Xun Ziyou, expressing gratitude: \"I will remember this young brother’s kindness in my heart.\"","Xun Ziyou nodded, feeling slightly at ease.","Taking a little risk to gain the favor of the Chongxu Sect’s elders isn’t a bad thing.","Xun Ziyou pushed his Lifebound Spirit Sword to the extreme, saying in a deep voice: \"Quickly, we need to break in.\"","Shangguan Xuanjian responded solemnly: \"Understood!\"","Then the two worked together, using their Golden Core Realm cultivation, activated their sword techniques, condensing their sword Qi into substance, and forcibly carved a bloody path through the tide of demonic cultivators, charging toward the gate of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons...","...","Inside the Formation Stone Chamber within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, Mo Hua rested his chin on his hand.","He was considering what to do next.","Originally, if there had been enough time, he wanted to stay and listen to Mr. Tu’s lecture, to confirm if his so-called \"essence\" of the Divine Formation matched the Divine Seal Principles he comprehended.","To see if there was anything worthwhile to learn.","But now it seems, there isn’t enough time.","This group of demonic cultivators seems to want to \"fight desperately\".","\"Is the sense of vigilance that strong...\"","\"Or did I do something that got ’calculated’ by the other side?\"","Mo Hua shook his head.","It seems that in the future, he must be more careful, perhaps even taking into account a portion of \"Heavenly Mechanism Causality\" to prevent unseen surveillance and risks.","\"The path of the Heavenly Secret is arduous and long...\"","Mo Hua nodded, gradually gathering his spirits.","\"Since the gate of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons is open, and Elder Xun is breaking through, let’s first think of a way to get Little Wood and the others out, and deal with other matters afterwards.\""]},{"number":1423,"title":"Chapter 1423 - 783 \"Mouse\" (Thanks to Catni’s Night for the Alliance Hierarch~)_2","paragraphs":["Mo Hua quietly released his Divine Sense.","This was the Formation stone chamber, empty all around, Jin Yixuan was not present, and the other monster cultivators dared not enter rashly.","Mo Hua waited a moment, then put the \"sheep-head stool\" back to its original place, and quietly left from behind the Sheep-Horned Demon Monster statue, crossed the hall, unraveled the formation, opened the large door a crack, then concealed his presence, sneaking out.","Afterwards, the large door quietly closed.","No one knew he had been there.","Nor did anyone know he had left.","Leaving the Formation stone chamber, Mo Hua retraced the route pointed out by Sword Bone, heading back towards the prison.","The way was noisy and chaotic, a complete contrast to the deathly silence when he came earlier.","The monster cultivators were demolishing the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","Destroying whatever could be destroyed, blasting what could be blasted, destroying without the slightest hesitation.","Mo Hua felt somewhat lamented watching.","Though it was a building of the Evil Path, it was at least built with countless efforts and painstaking labor, didn’t they feel any heartbreak tearing it down like this?","He hadn’t expected that if he hadn’t snuck in and stirred up such chaos, the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons wouldn’t be dismantled...","Everything went smoothly along the way.","Relying on his Concealment Technique, the more chaotic the situation, the easier it was for him to hide, and the less likely he would be discovered.","Just like that, Mo Hua silently returned to the prison.","In the prison, the three — Little Wood and the others — were expressing anxiousness.","The commotion inside the valley was enormous, with shouts of killing outside, and the eerie Blood Qi slowly permeating inside, but they had no idea what exactly had happened.","As soon as Mo Hua appeared, Ouyang Mu’s eyes lit up.","The anxious Song Jian looked like he was about to cry, seeing \"a family member\".","Even Ling Huxiao took a big sigh of relief.","\"Brother Mo, what happened outside?\" Ouyang Mu asked.","\"A fight started, it’s a long story, I’ll explain later. I need to figure a way to get you all out first...\"","The spirits of the three lifted.","\"Here are your Storage Bags, I stole them back for you.\"","Mo Hua tossed the three Storage Bags to them.","These three Storage Bags, he had stolen from a nearby locked prison. He had marked them earlier, just hadn’t had the chance, also fearing to alert the enemy.","Now the snake den was in disarray, they were about to flee as well, it didn’t matter anymore.","The three showed grateful expressions.","Mo Hua briefly explained his plan to them, \"In a moment I’ll kill some monster cultivators, get a few black robes, you all put them on, smear some monster blood, pretend to be monster cultivators, blend in with the crowd and get out...\"","It was too chaotic at the time, and he didn’t carry a Concealment Spiritual Tool with him.","Besides, Ouyang Mu and the others lacked concealment experience, even if they used a Spiritual Tool, it would be easy to slip, better to sneak out mixed with the monster cultivators.","\"When the time comes, I’ll guide you.\"","Mo Hua finished, glanced at Song Jian.","Among them, Song Jian was the \"outsider\".","\"You better behave, otherwise I can’t save you,\" Mo Hua warned.","Song Jian obediently nodded.","At the moment, in the chaos of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, any crazy monster cultivator could tear him to pieces, so he didn’t dare to show any temper.","Whatever Mo Hua said, he followed.","Having explained everything, Mo Hua said: \"Alright, let’s move out.\"","But just as he took a step to leave, suddenly stopped, his expression turned somewhat subtle.","Ouyang Mu asked: \"Brother Mo, what’s the matter?\"","\"I suddenly have a feeling,\" Mo Hua furrowed his brows slightly, \"you all might... not escape.\"","The expressions of the three changed slightly.","Mo Hua furrowed his brows, thought for a moment, then flipped his palm and picked up a Copper Coin.","Ouyang Mu, puzzled, whispered:","\"Brother Mo, what are you... doing?\"","Mo Hua casually said: \"I’m telling your fortune.\"","Ouyang Mu and the other three: \"...\"","Then, in front of the three, Mo Hua flicked the Copper Coin.","But after flicking it, Mo Hua’s brows furrowed even more tightly.","\"Useless...\"","Despite flicking the Copper Coin, he didn’t have any sense of causality prediction, neither able to determine the omen of fortune or misfortune.","Why?","Was it because it was unrelated to himself, and he was divining another person’s fate, so it couldn’t be calculated?","Or was it because the Heavenly secret in this matter was too chaotic, involving too many characters, mixed causality, difficult to calculate?","Or perhaps, the true \"Heavenly secret Calculation\" couldn’t be calculated endlessly.","Human computational power is limited, after calculating once or twice, some time is needed to recover?","\"My paltry Heavenly secret Calculation really lacks fire control?\" Mo Hua sighed in his heart.","However, since there was a hint of omen in his heart, the situation was probably not optimistic.","Mo Hua glanced again at Ling Huxiao and the three, pondered briefly, then said:","\"I’ll take you out, there will be a Sect Elder waiting at the valley entrance, but if you truly can’t get out, if someone stops you, don’t be reckless, don’t think of anything like rather die than surrender, fight to the end, just admit defeat and let them take you back...\"","Although the three, Ling Huxiao and others, found Mo Hua’s words somewhat strange, the situation was urgent, no time for further questions, they took his advice to heart, and nodded.","Afterwards, Mo Hua used the Four Symbols Array Hub, \"named\" and killed three dog-head monster cultivators.","These monster cultivators were short in stature, and the black robes were more fitting.","Mo Hua stripped off their black robes.","Ling Huxiao and the others, wrapped in the three robes, smeared some monster blood on themselves, disguising the scent, and under Mo Hua’s guidance, headed towards the main gate of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","On the way, Mo Hua held a small Array Plate in his hand.","This Array Plate was derived by him from the Spirit Vision Formation Hub in the Yuan Magnetic secret chamber, a simplified Spirit Vision Formation Hub.","With this array hub, he could simply link up the \"Yuan Magnetic Spiritual Vision Formation\" he had activated earlier."]},{"number":1424,"title":"Chapter 1424 - 783 \"Mouse\" (Thanks to Cat Ni’s Night for the Alliance Hierarch Reward~)_3","paragraphs":["With the help of the Spirit Vision Formation, the movement of nearby monster cultivators can be monitored.","The Original Magnet View is certainly not as clear as the pivot of the Secret Chamber, but it’s sufficient.","Mo Hua concealed himself, with eyes watching in all directions and a spiritual sense covering eight areas, while simultaneously using the Spirit Vision Formation to guide Ling Huxiao and others.","He chose paths with fewer monster cultivators.","Along the way, they occasionally encountered large waves of demon tide, and sometimes some solitary monster cultivators.","In large waves of demon tide, the three blended in.","Solitary monster cultivators were simply ignored.","Occasionally, some isolated monster cultivators, being extremely vigilant, sensed something unusual about Ling Huxiao and others and raised a voice to question.","In such cases, Mo Hua decisively ordered them to strike ruthlessly.","Ouyang Mu’s cultivation was ordinary, but he had some grounding in swordsmanship.","Although Song Jian looked like a dandy, his Sever Gold Sword Jue was not poorly learned.","As for Ling Huxiao, being a Sword Dao genius of the Rushing Void Sect, required no further explanation.","Also, Mo Hua controlled the situation with some small spells from behind.","Even though the scattered monster cultivators they met along the way were not weak, they were fundamentally not opponents for the combined assault of the group.","Like this, dodging and killing, the group was gradually leaving the Ten Thousand Demons Prison and moving towards the gate of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons...","...","Deep within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","In a lavish and elegant study room.","The young noble sat gracefully like jade, occupying the upper seat.","Jin Yixuan stood below with his head bowed, hands clasped, saying:","\"Everything has been done according to the young lord’s plans; what needed to be destroyed has been destroyed, those who needed to die are dead, and the traces of artifact refining, alchemy, especially formations, will all be erased...\"","\"Mm.\"","The young noble nodded softly, then remained silent, with his fair fingers tapping the edge of the table, pondering something unknown.","Jin Yixuan respectfully asked, \"Young lord, is there something amiss?\"","The young noble pondered for a moment, then slowly spoke:","\"Why... were they discovered?\"","Jin Yixuan’s heart trembled.","The young lord continued, \"How did they know about the existence of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons? Why are they ambushed outside the valley?\"","\"Why not directly attack but wait outside?\"","\"What are they waiting for?\"","Jin Yixuan’s expression changed, his mind racing, \"The young lord means, these people are guarding outside, waiting for a chance, and this chance is inside the valley...\"","The young lord neither confirmed nor denied.","Jin Yixuan thought for a moment, startled, \"Reporting to the young lord, lately there indeed have been some abnormalities in the valley...\"","The young noble looked at him indifferently.","Jin Yixuan felt cold inside, afraid of the young lord’s blame, lowered his head even further, yet had no choice but to speak with courage:","\"A steward died, you know of this event.\"","\"Additionally, sometimes monster cultivators die suddenly.\"","\"Also, monster cultivators sometimes feel they are being watched by something unseen...\"","\"I suspected earlier that there might be demon wraiths escaping from the Demon Refining Diagram, causing chaos in the valley...\"","Jin Yixuan spoke softly.","The young noble coldly said: \"Demon wraiths are confined in the Demon Refining Diagram, controlled by formations, isolated from the outside cannot escape or cause havoc.\"","His lips curled into a cold smile, \"An ’old mouse’ has sneaked into the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.\"","\"The sect’s eagles are gathered outside the valley, waiting for this mouse to eavesdrop on intelligence, probe the reality...\"","Jin Yixuan’s face paled, hurriedly admitting fault:","\"It’s my negligence!\"","The young lord gazed at Jin Yixuan calmly, \"I’ve told you to stop saying such nonsense. What good is admitting fault or blaming negligence? It doesn’t help at all...\"","\"If I truly wanted to kill you, you’d be dead already, no need to make a show and beg for pity.\"","Jin Yixuan’s forehead beaded with sweat, immediately replied:","\"I will definitely make amends for my mistakes!\"","The young noble nodded slightly, thoughtfully, his eyes flashing:","\"This mouse surely wants to rescue someone.\"","\"Perhaps, has already begun rescuing...\"","Jin Yixuan was startled, promptly declared sternly: \"I will go immediately, capture those three brats, find the mouse, and kill him!\"","\"No,\" the young lord shook his head, \"That mouse must be caught and brought back; I want to see him personally...\"","His gaze was icy, yet intrigued.","\"Understood!\"","Jin Yixuan solemnly bowed, retreated respectfully; once out of the study, his expression instantly turned ferocious, cursing in a low voice:","\"What wretch dares to put me in trouble? Makes me a laughingstock in front of the young lord; truly seeking death!\"","\"The young lord says not to kill, I will spare your life, let you live neither in peace nor death!\"","He immediately summoned several stewards, declaring sternly:","\"Follow me to the Ten Thousand Demons Prison!\"","\"Yes.\"","The stewards, seeing his fierce demeanor, dared not ask detailed questions and could only respond unanimously.","Afterward, Jin Yixuan hurriedly used a movement technique, rushing towards the Ten Thousand Demons Prison like a burning leopard.","The group of stewards hurriedly followed suit.","Upon arrival at the Ten Thousand Demons Prison, entering the jail, Jin Yixuan found the cells empty.","Those three indeed had escaped!","And the few guard monster cultivators outside were nowhere to be found.","After careful examination, it was discovered that these guard monster cultivators had been stripped and fed to the nearby monster beasts.","In front of the cages of nearby monster beasts, there were still some uneaten remains of monster cultivator bones and flesh.","Jin Yixuan furiously ordered, \"Chase in different directions!\"","\"Yes!\"","Several stewards followed the routes of the Ten Thousand Demons Prison and went in separate directions.","Jin Yixuan also chose a direction and continued the chase, but after a while, he suddenly stood still, turning to look at the wall beside him.","On the wall, some new and old stones were mixed, with a faint trace of spiritual power present, sensed only by a Formation Master.","Jin Yixuan stepped forward and wiped it with his palm, seeing the sealed formations beneath the stone wall, his pupils shrunk suddenly.","The Original Magnet Spiritual Pivot Formation!","Activated by someone!","No wonder Jin Gui said in the Ten Thousand Demons Prison, he felt he was being \"watched.\"","Indeed, there was an invisible \"eye\" secretly watching him.","No, possibly not just one.","Jin Yixuan’s face grew somber, and he immediately searched the vicinity, finding several adjacent Spiritual Pivot Formations all activated.","These Spirit Vision Formations, like cold and eerie \"eyes,\" watching every move within the Ten Thousand Demons Prison.","And how many such \"eyes\" were still hidden in the corners of the Ten Thousand Demons Prison remains unknown.","Jin Yixuan felt a chilling sensation."]},{"number":1425,"title":"Chapter 1425 - 784 Sacrifice (Extra - for Heavenly Secret Dummy Meow Boss~)","paragraphs":["\"Mr. Tu was indeed right; monitoring one’s own Spirit Vision Formation, if encountered by a master of formations, will become someone else’s eyes...\"","Jin Yixuan’s expression was solemn.","He casually searched around again and discovered that most of the Spirit Vision Formations nearby had been quietly activated.","The Ten Thousand Demons Prison had almost become someone else’s territory.","Jin Yixuan was filled with anger, suddenly paused as if he remembered something, and immediately instructed the monster cultivators beside him:","\"You go after them, summon a few more people, and come with me.\"","The monster cultivator obeyed, called upon a group of monster cultivators, and split into two groups: one group went to chase people, while the other followed Jin Yixuan to the front of the Secret Chamber of the Formation Pivot.","The Secret Chamber of the Formation Pivot had been completely sealed.","Jin Yixuan and the group of monster cultivators exerted their demonic power with all their might and forcibly broke open the secret door.","Once the dust settled, Jin Yixuan walked into the secret chamber, looked around, and his expression became even darker.","As expected, all of the Formation Pivots had been altered by someone and had become completely someone else’s structure.","Jin Yixuan frowned for a moment and then sneered, \"Don’t think you’re the only one who can alter a formation.\"","The Yuan Magnetic Spiritual Vision Formation was already activated, with the pivots laid out in front of him; as long as he could revert them, the \"eyes\" spread throughout the Ten Thousand Demons Prison would become his once more.","Once he regained control of the Yuan Magnetic Spiritual Vision Formation Hub, those mere rats would have nowhere to hide.","Jin Yixuan stroked the Array Plate, releasing his Divine Thought to prepare to intervene in the Yuan Magnetic Formation Pivot.","But at the moment his Divine Thought connected, his expression changed, and he immediately retreated with a jump.","In that instant of his retreat, the Formation Pivot exploded.","The explosion wasn’t powerful enough to harm Jin Yixuan too much.","But it was enough to destroy the Array Plate and most of the central formations on it.","All the Yuan Magnetic Spiritual Vision Formations went out as well.","Jin Yixuan wasn’t injured, but he was covered in dust, looking quite disheveled, and his gaze couldn’t help but turn somewhat fierce.","\"Impressive trick, to leave a hidden danger in the formation in such a short time...\"","\"A mere rat dare to toy with me like this...\"","Suppressing his rage, his expression grew cold.","\"Don’t let me catch you.\"","Jin Yixuan looked again at the formations around him.","The Yuan Magnetic Spirit Vision Formation, centered around the pivot, controlled the terminal Spirit Vision Formations.","With the core destroyed, the formations became useless and couldn’t be used anymore.","Even if they needed repairing, they couldn’t be fixed in a short time.","This formation was already ruined.","However, as it is said, traces remain even when geese fly over, and footprints are left after snow passes.","The methods of a cultivator always leave traces, and so it is for a Formation Master.","As long as a formation isn’t completely annihilated, a series of clues will always be left behind.","A Formation Master may make use of any formation, but conversely, even just the remnants of your formation could be used by others.","\"Since he uses the Spirit Vision Formation as ’eyes’, his whereabouts will follow the layout of the Spiritual Pivot Formations in the valley, becoming a trace to be pursued...\"","And as familiar as he was with the layout of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","Jin Yixuan snorted coldly, a fierce glint flashing in his eyes, \"You won’t escape...\"","...","At the edge of the Ten Thousand Demons Prison, Mo Hua, who was directing the way, heard the \"swoosh\" of the Array Plate in his hand as the original magnet dissipated, and the formation lost its effect.","Mo Hua sighed.","This Yuan Magnetic Spiritual Vision Formation had still been discovered.","It seemed there was also an experienced Formation Master among the monster cultivators.","If his guess was correct, this person was most likely the leader of the monster cultivators, none other than the Big Senior Brother of the Sever Gold Sect—Jin Yixuan.","Luckily, he had left some contingencies.","That group of monster cultivators could destroy the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, but he too could destroy the Yuan Magnetic Formation.","It was just that such small tricks were ultimately only temporary solutions.","The situation after this was expected to be rather bleak.","Hidden in the shadows, observing everything, Mo Hua looked again at Ling Huxiao, Ouyang Mu, and Song Jian, who were covered in grime, blending in with the group of monster cultivators, feeling somewhat conflicted.","\"Well, let’s take it one step at a time.\"","\"If it doesn’t work out, we’ll just have to think of another way...\"","The journey ahead indeed became much more difficult.","There were significantly more patrolling guards along the way, and every monster cultivator passing by was forced to have their black robes lifted to reveal their faces.","There were even patrolling supervisors.","Some trap mechanisms and small gates along the side routes were also shut.","Occasionally, there were even leashed hyenas led by monster cultivators sniffing around for human scent.","They cautiously treaded for a while, and finally, at a stone bridge outside the Ten Thousand Demons Prison, Ling Huxiao and the other two were blocked.","At this moment, the Taixu Token in Mo Hua’s hand trembled, and he looked down to see Elder Xun’s transmission on it:","\"I have broken into the valley, where are you?\"","Mo Hua looked up. Opposite the stone bridge stood a tall, pale-faced supervisor with a fierce, wolven gaze.","It was Jin Gui of the Sever Gold Sect.","There was approximately still less than an hour’s journey to the main gate from here.","However, Jin Gui, like a \"vicious tiger,\" blocked the way.","Judging by his expression, he obviously wasn’t willing to let them off easily.","Jin Gui, looking at Ling Huxiao and the other two, let out a cold smile, \"I finally found you...\"","At this point, being exposed, Ling Huxiao and the others no longer needed to hide.","Song Jian stepped forward and said:","\"Jin Gui, you and I are both disciples of the Sever Gold Sect, why must we be so ruthless?\"","Jin Gui couldn’t help but sneer, \"Young Master Song, even now, you are still so naive, it’s quite laughable...\"","\"Being fellow disciples of the Sever Gold Sect, so what?\"","\"In this world, fathers and sons can turn against each other, siblings can fight to the death, what does mere sect affiliation count for?\"","Song Jian, born into a noble family and growing up sheltered by his parents, brought up his parents again, \"If you dare lay a hand on me, my parents won’t let you off!\""]},{"number":1426,"title":"Chapter 1426 - 784: Sacrifice (Extra for Boss Heavenly Secret Dumb Cat~)_2","paragraphs":["Jin Gui’s gaze even carried a hint of pity, \"You’ve been captured in this Valley of Ten Thousand Demons for some time now, haven’t you? Take a guess, why have your parents not made any moves?\"","\"Guess what they’re doing?\"","Song Jian was stumped by the question, momentarily bewildered.","He’s been locked in the valley, how would he know what his parents are doing.","Jin Gui smirked mockingly and said with scorn:","\"What else could they be doing? They’re weighing the pros and cons! Weighing whether to save you, their son.\"","\"If the cost is too great, they would rather you die, so it’s all settled, saving themselves the trouble!\"","Song Jian’s face turned pale, he shouted angrily: \"You’re talking nonsense, they are my parents, how could they not care whether I live or die?\"","Jin Gui shook his head, his tone cold, \"It seems you know nothing about the rules of the family.\"","\"Cultivators form families, families are maintained by bloodlines, but ironically, family affection is the coldest.\"","\"Most cultivators in the family value one thing above all, and that’s profit!\"","\"If interests conflict, even if you’re from the same family, the same lineage, or even the same parents, they will still hope for your death.\"","\"Your parents don’t just have you as a son, if you die, they might shed a few tears, and after some time, they might even forget you.\"","Song Jian urgently said, \"You’re lying!\"","Jin Gui sneered coldly.","Ling Huxiao’s gaze turned cold, he said to Song Jian: \"Don’t waste your breath on him, he’s stalling for time.\"","\"Stalling for time?\" Jin Gui’s expression was arrogant, \"To deal with you guys, would I even need to stall for time?\"","\"Yes, I’m of humble birth and my aptitude is poor, I can’t compare to you direct lineage disciples.\"","Jin Gui’s tone shifted, his gaze full of resentment, \"But now, I am not who I used to be, I’ve been reborn! Today, I will show you what it means to be the true king among demons...\"","Jin Gui’s voice grew increasingly rugged, until it no longer sounded human, but was instead like the roar of a fierce tiger.","His body, with a flash of robust unmatched monster patterns, gradually expanded, sprouting yellow-brown fur, transforming into the fangs and claws of a fierce tiger.","Jin Gui’s presence briefly felt like a powerful Tiger Demon, intimidating all around him.","Ling Huxiao and his companions all showed a change in expression, and they all drew their swords.","\"Take action!\"","All along the way, the three had already developed some tacit understanding in joint killing.","Song Jian used the Sever Gold Sword Jue to engage the demonized Jin Gui in close combat, while Ouyang Mu, not particularly skilled in the Taia Sword Skill, could only assist from the side.","Meanwhile, Ling Huxiao began gathering strength, concentrating intensely sharp Chongxu Sword Qi.","But Jin Gui, already demonized and bearing the Four Symbols Mysterious Tiger Demon Patterns, had greatly increased strength, and in just a few moves, he suppressed Song Jian in close combat.","Then, with a backhand, he knocked back Ouyang Mu.","Both Song Jian and Ouyang Mu spat blood from their mouths.","At just this moment, a luminescent as the moon, murderously sharp Chongxu Sword Qi, directly struck Jin Gui’s body.","The sword qi tore apart Jin Gui’s black robe, revealing the monster patterns on his back, simultaneously cutting a deep wound, exposing black-red flesh.","But in an instant, his wound was continually healing.","Ling Huxiao gritted his teeth, feeling a bit helpless.","The gap in cultivation levels was too obvious.","Moreover, along the way, he had already expended a significant amount of spiritual power, making it very difficult to condense sword qi at this point.","Mo Hua’s expression also faltered.","This Jin Gui, the patterns on his body, are they the rare \"Tiger type\" monster patterns?","This type of monster pattern, Mo Hua had never seen on any other monster cultivator’s body before.","Moreover, the tiger is the king of beasts, the augmentative power of this tiger pattern is clearly a notch stronger compared to the Four Symbols Patterns of other monster beasts.","The current Jin Gui, compared to before, was simply unrecognizable.","In the field, Ling Huxiao and the other two were not surprisingly embroiled in a bitter struggle.","Song Jian and Ouyang Mu in close combat were simply no match for the \"Tiger Patterns\" bearing Jin Gui.","And once Ling Huxiao was engaged in close combat, he had no chance to gather sword qi, and posed very little threat to the demonized, thick-skinned Jin Gui.","Jin Gui, fighting one against three, was at ease.","Mo Hua silently reached into the storage bag, took out a Sever Gold Sword, intending to try whether he could slay Jin Gui and copy down the Four Symbols Tiger Patterns on him.","But just as he had this thought, he silently put the sword away again.","Someone was approaching from the distance.","The leader was none other than the black-clad leader of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, also the senior brother of the Sever Gold Sect—Jin Yixuan.","Besides, there were several managers and seven or eight monster cultivators.","Mo Hua sighed deeply.","\"Now, truly, it’s hopeless...\"","Even with himself added, it would not be possible to match this group of monster cultivators.","Sword control could at most kill one or two, but it would also expose his whereabouts.","Moreover, the demonized Jin Gui was too strong.","Mo Hua estimated that even if he used sword control, it might not be able to kill him in one blow.","Not to mention, there were still a number of other managers, and the obviously more formidable leader of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons with Mr. Tu’s remnant soul attached—Jin Yixuan.","To put it another way, even if he could kill, it would actually be of no avail.","With so many monster cultivators surrounding, the three people including Little Wood, certainly wouldn’t be able to escape...","At this moment, seeing the people arriving, Jin Gui stopped holding back and resolved to end the fight quickly.","In just over a dozen rounds, Song Jian and Ouyang Mu were hit by Jin Gui’s palm, spitting blood from their mouths.","Ling Huxiao was also punched by Jin Gui on his spirit sword, his blood surged, leaving him unable to fight further.","All three remembered what Mo Hua had said:","\"If someone stops you, do not act rashly, don’t think of anything like rather die than surrender, fighting to the bitter end, just surrender honestly...\"","Therefore, none of them acted rashly and obediently gave in.","Ling Huxiao felt unwilling, yet truly had no choice.","Jin Yixuan led a group of monster cultivators forward, first praising Jin Gui with a sentence: \"Well done.\""]},{"number":1427,"title":"Chapter 1427 - 784 Sacrifice (Extra - for Heavenly Secret Foolish Meow Boss ~)_3","paragraphs":["Jin Gui’s expression brightened.","Jin Yixuan turned his head again, his gaze roving over the three of Ling Huxiao, frowning: \"Where are the others?\"","Where did that damned \"mouse\" go?","The matter of Mo Hua, Ling Huxiao and Ouyang Mu naturally wouldn’t mention.","Song Jian wasn’t stupid; he naturally wouldn’t disclose it.","The three of them merely sneered, not uttering a word.","Jin Yixuan’s anger rose in his heart, his eyelids twitching, he questioned: \"Who is secretly helping you?\"","Ling Huxiao sneered, \"With just one sword, I can enter and leave the Ten Thousand Demons Prison freely, who needs help?\"","Jin Yixuan knew he was bragging to evade the question, and ignored him, but his face still looked displeased.","Jin Gui, having long been displeased with Ling Huxiao, said: \"Should we cripple his hands and teach him a lesson?\"","Jin Yixuan’s gaze was cold, he pondered for a moment, but still shook his head:","\"These people are useful to the young master...\"","He glanced around and swept his Divine Sense repeatedly but still found no trace, his eyebrows furrowed.","Hidden quite deeply...","Even in this situation, not exposing any weaknesses?","Jin Yixuan snorted coldly, cursing in his heart:","\"As expected, a mouse, sneaky.\"","Later, still unwilling, he stated: \"Forget it, let’s report to the young master first, and discuss other things later.\"","\"Yes, Leader.\"","The other monster cultivators cupped their fists, then took out chains, locked up the three of Ling Huxiao, and headed deep into the Ten Thousand Demons Prison.","All of this was witnessed by Mo Hua.","\"As expected, can’t escape after all...\"","Mo Hua frowned, initially planning to follow, but then realized following might be futile.","Too many monster cultivators across, most being Foundation Establishment Late Stage, even Peak stage.","Plus, a mysterious \"young master.\"","Unable to win now, even following would be futile.","Moreover, hearing what Jin Yixuan just said, they seemed to have noticed someone secretly aiding the trio of Little Wood.","Thus, these monster cultivators must now be extremely vigilant.","If he followed, he might be discovered inadvertently, instead, it would be dangerous.","Mo Hua thought it over, realizing he needed \"help.\"","The depths of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons are perilous and unknown, not something he could handle alone.","He thought for a moment, then sent a transmission to Xun Ziyou:","\"Elder Xun, where are you now?\"","\"The three of Ling Huxiao have been captured again, I can’t manage, need your help.\"","In less than a moment, Xun Ziyou’s message came through the Taixu Token:","\"We’ve entered the main gate, passed the Great Dao, and are heading inside, now in... vicinity of a Wolf Fang Valley.\"","Wolf Fang Valley?","Mo Hua recalled the terrain inside the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, then said: \"Don’t wander around, I’ll come to meet you.\"","The terrain inside the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons is complex, paths are intricate, he worried Elder Xun and others might take a wrong turn, diverging from his path.","Xun Ziyou replied: \"Alright!\"","Thus, several elders of Xun Ziyou remained in place, cutting down monster cultivators.","Mo Hua concealed himself as he headed toward Wolf Fang Valley.","In less than an hour, Mo Hua arrived at Wolf Fang Valley, from afar seeing several elders of Xun Ziyou using Sword Control to slay monsters.","They all possessed Golden Core Cultivation, often needing only to condense a Sword Qi to slay a Foundation Establishment monster cultivator.","Nearby monster cultivators were slaughtered frightened by the news, barely daring to approach.","Seeing Elder Xun and others so strong, Mo Hua felt much relieved.","At the moment Mo Hua appeared, several of Xun Ziyou also noticed him.","They turned into escape lights, almost instantly meeting him.","\"Mo Hua, Xiaoer he...\"","The current person, an elder in the Taoist Robe of Rushing Void Sect.","Mo Hua guessed this elder was Elder Shangguan whom Elder Xun mentioned, the one secretly safeguarding Ling Huxiao.","Mo Hua succinctly said: \"The situation is urgent; Ling Huxiao has been captured, let’s talk while we move.\"","Several of Xun Ziyou nodded one after another.","The main force of the two sects was still heading into the valley, currently, manpower was not plentiful.","But with Golden Core, it was enough.","Xun Ziyou, Xun Zixian, and Shangguan Xuanjian—the three Golden Core Elders—led by Mo Hua, continued killing towards the interior of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","The three Golden Core Elders’ Escape Skills were fast; Mo Hua could barely keep up.","The slender Xun Ziyou grasped Mo Hua’s sleeve, taking him along to perform Escape Skill.","With three Golden Core \"protectors,\" Mo Hua felt much more at ease.","The group advanced forcefully along the way.","Facing obstacles, they broke them with one sword; encountering monster cultivators, they slew them with one sword, without dawdling, moving at a strange speed.","Soon, the group reached the stone bridge where the three of Ling Huxiao were captured.","Mo Hua slightly sensed the remaining Blood Qi and causal clues, pointing his hand right: \"This way.\"","Xun Ziyou and the others hesitated not a bit, turning into three escape lights, proceeding in the direction indicated by Mo Hua.","On the way, Mo Hua led the path.","Occasionally Mo Hua hesitated, but after slight contemplation, he could point out the correct direction.","The three Golden Core Elders felt quite amazed.","But the situation was urgent, not suited for much inquiry.","Moreover, having gone through these ordeals, they began to have a kind of unconditional, natural trust in Mo Hua.","Of course, in such circumstances, they had no choice but to trust.","Yet, no matter how correct the routes were, time continued slipping away.","As they plunged deeper, the terrain grew more complex, wasting more time.","The surroundings were a mess, all collapsed stone walls, frantic Monster Beasts, and variously dead monster cultivators.","But still, no sight of the three of Ling Huxiao.","The expressions of Xun Ziyou’s group were grave.","And in Mo Hua’s heart, a faint sense of foreboding began to rise."]},{"number":1428,"title":"Chapter 1428 - 784 Sacrifice (Extra - for Heavenly Secret Dummy Meow Boss~)_4","paragraphs":["Finally, two hours later, when he brought Elder Xun and the other two, passed through the Demon Refining Pot, Alchemy Room, and the Formation Stone Palace, and chased to the final destination, this uneasy premonition grew stronger.","The final location was a magnificent mural.","On the mural, valleys stood tall, treacherous boulders were menacing, and ferocious demonic creatures were dancing chaotically—it was that very... Demon Refining Diagram!","Outside the Demon Refining Diagram, there were many monster cultivators guarding it.","Near the Demon Refining Diagram, there were three coffins placed there.","The coffins were pitch-black, inscribed with monster patterns, cold and peculiar.","In front of each coffin, there were dim green candles lit, with all sorts of flesh, white bone, and evil fruit laid out as offerings.","In the center of the Demon Refining Diagram, there was a witch-like overseer, trembling all over, muttering something mysteriously.","It seemed as if some kind of \"ritual\" was being carried out.","Mo Hua took one look and saw it clearly, \"They are performing a sacrifice!\"","And at the same time, this group of monster cultivators also saw Mo Hua, especially Xun Ziyou and the others in their sect’s Taoist robes, and were immediately shocked, incredulously saying:","\"Golden Core?!\"","Xun Ziyou’s expression turned cold, and he decisively ordered, \"Kill!\"","Then he and Shangguan Xuanjian, with chilling sword intent, either controlling sword weapons or condensing sword Qi, slaughtered the surrounding monster cultivators one by one.","In front of the formidable late Golden Core stage sword cultivators, this group of monster cultivators had no power to fight back.","The witch monster cultivator seemed to want to overturn the altar and ruin the ritual, but was restrained by Elder Xun Zixian with a backhanded move.","A spiritual rope engraved with formations bound her firmly.","The witch could not move.","Elder Xun Zixian coldly questioned, \"What is the sacrificial ritual? How do you reverse it? How do you retrieve the ’offerings’?\"","The witch flashed a grin, revealing teeth black as Mo, and then a flash of evil light in her eyes, immediately causing an explosion of her orifices and the collapse of her sea of consciousness, dying on the spot.","Elder Xun Zixian tried to stop her but was helpless, his face turning ashen.","By now, the nearby monster cultivators were already dead.","The outer monster cultivators, unaware of the situation, were slain by the sword Qi.","This witch overseer who was conducting the sacrificial ritual obviously knew something, yet was destroyed by an evil thought, self-destructing her sea of consciousness and dying.","The surroundings were empty, with only the three coffins in the middle.","Not only Mo Hua, but even Xun Ziyou and the other two had a guess in their hearts.","Moments later, Xun Ziyou sighed:","\"Let’s open the coffins and take a look...\"","Xun Zixian hesitated for a moment, then broke the formations on the coffins and opened them one by one.","Inside the coffins lay three youths.","It was Ling Huxiao, Ouyang Mu, and Song Jian.","At this moment, all three had faces as pale as death, not a trace of blood on them, their life force extinguished, like corpses deprived of their \"divine souls.\"","Shangguan Xuanjian’s body trembled, his face turned ashen, eyes filled with despair.","Xun Ziyou and Xun Zixian remained silent, not knowing how to offer comfort.","The atmosphere was somewhat dead and silent.","It was at this moment that they heard Mo Hua beside them exhale lightly and say:","\"Thankfully...\"","Xun Ziyou and Xun Zixian were taken aback.","Shangguan Xuanjian also suddenly looked up, as if grasping at the straw to save his life, looking at Mo Hua with hope.","\"Mo...\"","His voice was somewhat hoarse.","Mo Hua nodded and said, \"The divine souls were sacrificed, but fortunately, it hasn’t been long since the sacrifice; they should still be able to be salvaged...\"","He was somewhat familiar with such matters.","Upon hearing this, the expressions of Xun Ziyou and the others were one of astonishment.","They were all serious cultivators, not very knowledgeable about the divine way’s studies.","Though Xun Zixian knew a bit, he was far from expert.","\"How... to save them?\"","Mo Hua looked up, glanced at the solemn and grand Demon Refining Diagram, which seemed to have countless demons howling, and casually said:","\"I just need to go in!\"","His eyes faintly lit up, showing a hint of excitement.","Originally, he was almost about to leave the valley...","But this group of monster cultivators coincidentally \"lured\" him here.","If he didn’t go into this Demon Refining Diagram to take a look, wouldn’t it be... ungrateful to their painstaking efforts of \"leading a wolf into the house?\""]},{"number":1429,"title":"Chapter 1429 - 785: Becoming an Accomplice to the Tiger","paragraphs":["Xun Ziyou and Xun Zixian were both silent.","Xun Ziyou shook his head repeatedly, \"No, no, you can’t go in.\"","Ling Huxiao, these three children, their life or death is uncertain, he felt regretful, and his heart was also heavy.","But after all, this is the matter of the Rushing Void Sect, Tai’a Sect, and the Song family of the Sever Gold Sect.","\"Pain\" cannot touch him directly.","Though he regretted it, that’s all.","But what if Mo Hua acts on his own accord, actually enters this Demon Refining Diagram, and with bad luck, an accident happens and he falls inside, then the Taixu Gate would also suffer greatly.","Even the Ancestor would not be polite to him.","He might even lose face to meet the Ancestor.","This \"pain\" would indeed touch him directly.","\"Even if going inside, it would be me going, you can’t.\" Xun Ziyou said again.","Mo Hua then said, \"Elder Xun, do you know what to do when you go inside?\"","Xun Ziyou was dazed for a moment, looked at the huge and eerie mural in front of him, thought carefully and then honestly shook his head:","\"I don’t know...\"","He didn’t even know what this Demon Refining Diagram really was.","And he absolutely wasn’t clear about what mysteries lay inside it.","As a Sect Elder, he spent most of his time in the sect, although he went out as well, he had considerable experiences, but these experiences were all with various types of cultivators, \"human\" experiences.","Not with evil spirits.","So far, he hadn’t really encountered many evil spirits, and knew very little about things concerning evil thoughts.","On the other hand, Elder Xun Zixian slightly furrowed his brows, pondered for a moment, and then asked Mo Hua seriously: \"Do you have confidence?\"","\"Yes!\" Mo Hua nodded.","Currently, it seems within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, there are no divine remains of the Evil God or incarnations.","Then, in this Demon Refining Diagram, although the demon wraiths are numerous, hideous and ferocious, in terms of power, they may not really be that strong.","I should be able to \"manage\"!","Mo Hua had a confident appearance, he seemed quite assured.","Xun Zixian was a bit surprised, pondered slightly.","Although he was uncertain about where Mo Hua’s confidence lay.","But since this child was valued by the Ancestor, he must have something extraordinary.","Moreover, since entering the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, Mo Hua’s intelligence, insight, sense of propriety in actions, and his understanding of formations were all seen by him.","Xun Zixian nodded and said:","\"I agree with you going in, if there is anything you need, just say it, I will help you.\"","Xun Ziyou was taken aback.","On the other side, Shangguan Xuanjian, upon hearing this, was excited and hurriedly said:","\"Little brother, as long as you can bring back Xiaoer, it counts as my Rushing Void Sect owes you big gratitude!\"","\"At least counts as I, Shangguan Xuanjian, owe you big gratitude!\"","\"In the future, as long as it does not go against morality, Taoist Law, harm personal virtue or sect interests, just say it, if I can achieve it, I will certainly and dutifully!\"","This promise bore significant weight.","Not to mention this was a promise from a Late Golden Core Stage Inner Sect Elder from the Tai’a Sect, one of the eight major sects.","Xun Zixian was slightly taken aback.","Xun Ziyou was even more surprised and exclaimed: \"Xuanjian, you don’t have to...\"","Shangguan Xuanjian shook his head, his expression solemn.","\"This is necessary!\"","Indeed, he was helpless.","The Cultivation World is vast and endless, with various complexities in the ways, and there are specialized skills.","He practices Sword Qi, on matters of demon wraiths, he is inherently clueless, not knowing at all what to do to rescue Ling Huxiao.","The Demon Refining Diagram is heavily laden with Monster Qi, inherently dangerous.","If Mo Hua didn’t personally speak up, naturally he wouldn’t have the nerve to ask Mo Hua, this young disciple of the Taixu Gate, to brave unknown dangers to rescue their Rushing Void Sect’s disciple.","But since Mo Hua spoke up, saying he was confident, and the formation studies knowledgeable Elder Xun Zixian also agreed.","Then, he naturally had to sincerely offer a heavy promise and ask Mo Hua to help.","Right now, it might be the last opportunity.","If not offering a heavy promise and asking Mo Hua, this mysterious young disciple, for help.","Once missing this opportunity, it could be very likely that their Rushing Void Sect’s once-in-five-hundred-years Sword Heart Clarity genius in sword dao would never be rescued.","By then, it would truly be a regret beyond measure.","Therefore, in front of even the slightest opportunity, it cannot be overlooked.","Xun Ziyou looked at Shangguan Xuanjian, empathizing with his mindset, couldn’t stop him, sighed: \"So be it...\"","He then looked at Mo Hua, \"Then you be careful yourself.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","On the side, Xun Zixian looked at the Demon Refining Diagram again, suddenly puzzled, asked Mo Hua a crucial question:","\"How... are you going to enter?\"","The mural was grand and vast, but there was no entrance, obviously not meant to enter with the \"body\".","Xun Zixian had heard Mo Hua mention the word \"sacrifice\".","But sacrifice requires a ceremony.","Different sacrifices have different ceremonies.","Currently, the specific ceremony isn’t clear, the witch has died, trying to enter the mural through a sacrificial ceremony seems hard to accomplish.","\"Wait a moment, let me think a bit...\"","Mo Hua pondered, his mind working.","Previously in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, when he first saw the Demon Refining Diagram, he had considered how he could enter it.","Preparing for a rainy day is a basic rule for a Monster Hunter.","When faced with something, you must plan early.","To enter the Demon Refining Diagram, generally speaking, one can only rely on a \"ceremony\".","Mo Hua originally planned to muddle through, hoping to join when the monster cultivators carried out the \"ceremony\", to sacrifice himself as an offering to \"sacrifice\" in.","But this condition is somewhat harsh.","It also requires a lot of chance and coincidence.","Monster cultivators aren’t all fools.","Once a slightest mishap occurs and is detected by the monster cultivators, his body would fall into their hands."]},{"number":1430,"title":"Chapter 1430 - 785: Abetting the Wicked_2","paragraphs":["This is how it ends.","Even if my divine soul enters the Demon Refining Diagram and consumes all the monster cultivator’s family wealth, it would be to no avail.","Without a physical body as a foundation, the divine soul naturally becomes a \"ghost.\"","From then on, permanently severed from the Great Dao.","Therefore, the best strategy is to bypass the \"ritual,\" not through sacrifice, but directly intervene in the Demon Refining Diagram with divine thought.","The ritual is someone else’s path.","Walking someone else’s path is never comfortable and not necessarily safe.","Mo Hua still wants to walk his own path.","\"How to bypass the ritual?\"","Mo Hua hadn’t thought of any good methods before, but lately, after experiencing some events, he gradually gained some insights.","Mo Hua walked around the enormous painting-like Demon Refining Diagram twice and then went to the corner, took out the White Bone Broken Sword, and secretly asked:","\"Sword Bone, can you enter the Demon Refining Diagram?\"","\"I’m not going in!!\" Sword Bone immediately replied.","\"I’m asking if you can enter, not whether you want to enter.\" Mo Hua’s tone was indifferent.","Sword Bone could clearly hear the underlying threat in Mo Hua’s calm words.","It wanted to resist but really didn’t have the strength to do so, so it could only quietly refute:","\"I... could indeed go in, but it would be pointless.\"","Sword Bone’s voice revealed a trace of fear, \"The Demon Refining Diagram is filled with demon wraiths, far too dangerous. Although I am a Sword Demon, inherently an evil thought entity, in front of so many demon wraiths, I’m indeed insignificant...\"","\"Moreover, even if I enter, I don’t have the ability to rescue those little ghosts.\"","\"Most likely, I’d be devoured by the many demon wraiths, alive...\"","Sword Bone was somewhat timid but did not speak falsely.","Mo Hua said: \"No need for you to save.\"","Sword Bone was taken aback, \"No need for me to save? Then what am I going in for?\"","\"Your primary role is to lead the way, to bring me in!\"","Mo Hua’s eyes gleamed slightly.","He had considered it thoroughly.","Primordial Spirit emergence seems to be a high-level cultivator ability.","I can’t do it now.","So, for now, my divine thought can’t actively leave the physical body.","But, it can be passively attracted to certain \"Contemplation Maps,\" \"Illusionary Realms,\" or \"nightmares\" by some evil spirits.","Similar to being \"soul dragging.\"","Mo Hua summarized some evil spirits he had interacted with, from the Landscape Taoist Child Painting at Black Mountain Stronghold, the Zombie Ancestor Picture of the Zhang Family, to the shrine in the Taoist Field of the Five Elements Sect...","They were generally like this.","This made things easier.","The physical body is the \"cage\" of the divine soul.","As long as I find an \"evil spirit\" to drag my \"soul,\" allowing divine thought to separate from the physical body, and then through some means, my divine thought can \"actively\" enter certain illusionary realms or nightmares.","This \"soul-dragging\" evil spirit serves as a \"guide.\"","And for this guide, Mo Hua chose Sword Bone.","Sword Bone was given this \"grave responsibility\" by Mo Hua and was instantly terrified.","Lead the way?","Guide this terrifying little ancestor?","Sword Bone immediately and tactfully declined: \"But... even if I pull you into the Blood Pool, I fear I can’t enter the Demon Refining Diagram...\"","\"You don’t need to worry about that,\" Mo Hua said, \"I’ve thought it all through; you just need to follow my instructions.\"","\"I’m afraid...\" Sword Bone was still stalling.","Mo Hua retorted, \"You don’t think I’m negotiating with you, do you?\"","Sword Bone said bitterly: \"Right.\"","If only he had made it clear earlier.","Pretending to ask so much when I can’t refuse?","Being a powerless evil spirit, what am I negotiating with this little ancestor...","Sword Bone mumbled inwardly.","\"Alright, then it’s settled.\"","Mo Hua unilaterally decided.","Meanwhile, Xun Ziyou and the others were somewhat baffled.","Mo Hua crouched in a corner, clutching a broken sword, muttering unknown things, with occasional eerie breaths emanating.","This commotion undoubtedly couldn’t escape their Golden Core Realm divine sense.","Yet they said nothing.","Whatever Mo Hua could concoct, it was his own skill; even if it was somewhat audacious, that would be for the Ancestor to handle, so they turned a blind eye.","Having secured Sword Bone’s \"consent,\" Mo Hua was ready to act.","He walked around the Demon Refining Diagram a few more times, carefully inferring the formation aura in the diagram, attentively perceiving the flow of the internal Divine Formation.","Then he found a relatively weak spot in the formation.","No formation is uniformly distributed.","Every formation media hosting a formation has its own weak points.","The Demon Refining Diagram is no exception.","Of course, identifying such flaws still tests a Formation Master’s divine sense, insight, and formation experience.","The most crucial factor is Inference Power.","Mo Hua pinpointed the weak point in the Divine Formation of the Demon Refining Diagram, took out pen and ink, marked an X, and then said to Xun Ziyou:","\"Elder Xun, help me break this spot, use Sword Qi to break it, about two inches thick.\"","Xun Ziyou was puzzled but still followed Mo Hua’s instructions, drew his sword, and scraped off a shallow layer from the place Mo Hua marked on the mural.","After scraping off, exposed the formation patterns inside.","The Divine Formation patterns were sparse here, and there was still plenty of space between each pattern.","Mo Hua first wiped off one Divine Formation pattern among them, then replaced it with a pattern he drew himself.","This way, the Divine Formation pattern he drew became an \"interface.\"","Mo Hua then drew another Divine Formation pattern on the White Bone Broken Sword.","These two Divine Formation patterns could interlock.","Mo Hua chose the position and inserted the White Bone Broken Sword into the Demon Refining Diagram mural, allowing the formation pattern on the broken sword to interlock with the pattern he left on the mural, connecting them to form a \"bridge.\""]},{"number":1431,"title":"Chapter 1431 - 785: Becoming a Tiger’s Accomplice_3","paragraphs":["This way, the White Bone Broken Sword becomes part of the Demon Refining Diagram.","The two are a whole.","Entering the White Bone Broken Sword naturally allows one to access the \"bridge\" of the Divine Way and enter the \"Demon Refining Diagram\".","His operation left Xun Ziyou and Shangguan Xuanjian at a loss.","Only Xun Zixian could see some of the mystery, roughly guessing Mo Hua’s intention, and his expression was momentarily dazed.","He looked at the mural, then at the broken sword, then again at the formation patterns forming the \"bridge\", and finally glanced at Mo Hua, his emotions fluctuating.","\"How on earth does this child’s mind work?\"","Mo Hua, having done everything, turned his head to look at Xun Ziyou and the others:","\"Elder, I’ll be going in a while, but my physical body will remain here, so I entrust you to protect it.\"","Xun Ziyou nodded, \"Rest assured, with us here, no one will touch your body.\"","He even silently grasped the \"Void Sword Order\" in his hand.","Logically, the three of them, at the Late Golden Core Stage, were more than enough to ensure Mo Hua’s safety.","But if an unforeseen event did occur, if a formidable enemy above the Golden Core arrived, he would crush the Sword Command and summon the ancestor.","Thus preventing any mishap.","Mo Hua was reassured.","The White Bone Broken Sword, embedded in the Demon Refining Diagram, was connected by two interlocking Divine Formation Patterns.","Mo Hua sat cross-legged, holding the White Bone Broken Sword, and whispered:","\"Sword Bone.\"","Sword Bone, reluctantly and with no alternative, could only use the spell point of the evil spirit \"Soul Grasping\" to draw this \"Little Plague God\" into its own Blood Pool.","A faint blood mist emerged atop the White Bone Broken Sword.","Under the blood mist, Mo Hua slowly closed his eyes. His divine thought gradually left his body, his complexion turned slightly pale, his breathing steady, his aura becoming barely perceptible.","Xun Ziyou still felt a bit worried, frowned, and said:","\"This bone sword... seems to carry some evil qi, not a righteous dao item. Will it be alright?\"","Xun Zixian shook his head, \"Since he is confident, it shows he knows what he’s doing. Let’s allow him to act freely, we just need to guard his body.\"","Shangguan Xuanjian solemnly nodded.","Then the three Inner Sect Elders at the Late Golden Core Stage formed a triangular defensive position, protecting Mo Hua in the center.","The three released their divine senses, their expressions alert, eyes vigilant, allowing no one to approach.","Meanwhile, Mo Hua, protected by the three, calmly kept his eyes closed.","His divine thought had already left his body, entered the Blood Pool, and transformed into a smaller \"Little Mo Hua\".","When Sword Bone saw him in this form, its entire skeleton ached.","The dozens of sword bones that Mo Hua had once broken one by one still throbbed faintly.","Mo Hua got straight to the point, directly ordering:","\"Lead the way.\"","Sword Bone showed a troubled expression, and said with an awkward smile:","\"Little Ancestor, the ’road’ leading to the Demon Refining Diagram is now complete and I’ve already brought you in, you can go yourself. Isn’t it unnecessary for a mere Sword Demon like me to follow...?\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"I have to bring you along, you’re a ’hidden danger’ that can’t be left behind.\"","Sword Bone’s mouth twitched:","\"Little Ancestor jests... I’m weak and definitely no match for you. I wouldn’t be of help going in, so why not leave me to guard the door for you...?\"","Mo Hua didn’t bother listening to its excuses, raised two white fingers:","\"You have two choices: one, come with me; two, I’ll crush you here to eliminate future trouble.\"","Sword Bone shivered instantly, rushed ahead, bowed, and said:","\"Little Ancestor, please, I’ll pave the way for you ahead.\"","Mo Hua nodded in satisfaction.","Sword Bone sighed inwardly.","It had originally planned to sever the divine bridge after this little ancestor entered the Demon Refining Diagram, trapping him forever.","But in the end, this little ancestor gave it no chance at all...","It could only resign itself to leading the way.","The golden Divine Formation Pattern, one end connected to the Sword Bone Blood Pool, the other to the Demon Refining Diagram, looked like an iron chain across a river, forming a golden pattern bridge.","The tall Sword Bone, bent over, walked ahead.","The small Mo Hua, head held high, followed behind.","As they walked, Sword Bone, leading the way, suddenly felt like a \"servant for the tiger\".","Mo Hua was that fierce tiger.","It was the tiny \"ghost servant\".","Except, this \"ghost servant\" wasn’t leading people to the tiger for consumption.","Rather, it was leading the tiger into a \"crowd\"...","It grew even more depressed, sighing inwardly:","\"It’s tough to be a human, and no freedom in being a demon. Now as a demon, I’m still not in control of myself...\"","\"Living is so hard...\"","Sword Bone lamented in its heart, yet outwardly remained increasingly respectful, not daring to slack at all.","Thus, one demon and one human, along the divine chains, left the Blood Pool and walked towards the wider, bloodier, more tainted with evil qi, and more filled with evil spirit aura of the Demon Refining Diagram.","No idea how long they walked before the surroundings gradually opened up.","The pitch-black misty sky, blood-red clouds, jagged and sinister mountains, creepy white bones, and numerous strange and malevolent auras were almost right in front of them.","Mo Hua, after a long time, felt a \"growling stomach\".","As if it had been ages since having a feast.","His crystalline eyes grew ever brighter.","The porcelain-doll-like face appeared increasingly rosy and charming.","Sword Bone sensed Mo Hua’s excited mood, felt odd, sneaked a glance, and seeing Mo Hua’s white and cute appearance, it, somehow, felt a chill deep inside.","\"Hurry up!\" Mo Hua said crisply.","\"Yes, yes!\" Sword Bone dared not delay.","Soon, the one human and one demon crossed the \"bridge\" of the Divine Way, stepping into the true Demon Refining Diagram.","Upon entering the Demon Refining Diagram, the atmosphere indeed changed.","It was eerie, gruesome, and oppressive.","The valleys were menacing, bones piled high, blood streaming everywhere, clearly a place long inhabited by evil.","Sword Bone’s Blood Pool, already potent with blood scent, was nothing compared to the Demon Refining Diagram, a minor witch meeting a major witch.","\"Just...\"","Mo Hua looked around, puzzled.","\"Where are the Demon Monsters?\"","Wasn’t it said that entering the Demon Refining Diagram would bring the torment of ten thousand demons devouring one’s soul?","Where are the ten thousand demons?","Where are they hiding?","Gone into hiding?","Mo Hua was a little disappointed.","The guests have arrived, shouldn’t they at least have a \"reception\"?","The evil spirits in the Demon Refining Diagram were truly rude.","Mo Hua’s eyes shone, silently thinking: \"If you won’t come to me, I’ll come to find you...\"","Yet, before that, it’s vital to rescue Little Wood and the other three.","Mo Hua extended his divine sense, lightly sensed, and then followed a path of white bones, heading forward.","Sword Bone, anxious due to the dense and eerie aura of the Demon Refining Diagram, was taken aback, but with no other option, it followed silently, steeling its nerves.","-----------------","Thank you, Yiqi Xiuxian, and Qingjiu Klarvin, for the reward~","It’s the beginning of the month, please spare a basic monthly vote~","There’s another update later.","(๑•.•๑)"]},{"number":1432,"title":"Chapter 1432 - 786: Tiger Pattern (Extra - for Alliance Hierarch Little Bai Bai’s Boss Carrot~)","paragraphs":["The dark clouds on the horizon resemble ghosts and specters, the distant mountains like demon wraiths, streams of blood flow on both sides, while the white bones pave the path beneath.","Mo Hua appears relaxed, his steps light.","Sword Bone feels anxious, following step by step.","After walking for a while, Mo Hua turns to look at Sword Bone, his tone carrying slight disdain, \"Didn’t you say the Demon Refining Diagram was full of evil spirits? Where are they?\"","He has walked quite a distance yet hasn’t seen a single evil spirit.","Could this Demon Refining Diagram be fake?","Should he not have come here for nothing...","Sword Bone responds awkwardly: \"How should I know...\"","It’s his first time in here too.","If he had a choice, he would never want to come in his entire life.","Mo Hua casts a glance around once more, shakes his head, and thinks to himself:","\"Forget it, let’s rescue them first. The temple is here, where could the ’monk’ possibly run to?\"","He focuses his mind and senses the aura along the White Bone Path.","Among these auras, some are tainted, mixed with evil thoughts of monster qi, but there are also a few strands of clean and pure cultivator thought power.","The three of them, Little Wood and others, if ’sacrificed’ into the Demon Refining Diagram, should be led along the White Bone Path, escorted by monster cultivators deep into the Diagram.","Mo Hua quickens his pace unconsciously.","Even though the scenery is eerie throughout, everything remains safe and smooth.","Continuing this way, he walks until reaching the end of the White Bone Path, where a gorge appears before him, its entrance resembling a giant mouth of monster beasts.","Mo Hua pauses, frowning slightly.","He proceeds inside to find a broad avenue, followed by some monster beast sculptures and jagged peaks and valleys.","Mo Hua watches and feels familiarity growing, thinks for a moment, and then understands.","Valley of Ten Thousand Demons!","The terrain within the Demon Refining Diagram is remarkably similar to the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons outside.","Although many differences exist, the overall layout seems carved from the same mold.","Mo Hua recalls the words of Elder Xun Zixian:","\"The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons Formation intertwines reality with illusion...\"","\"...It leverages some great power to initially merge reality with divine thought, constructing existence through formation.\"","Only now does Mo Hua understand what those words mean.","Intertwined.","Merging reality and nightmares.","The River God Temple in the small fishing village seems likewise.","Constructing certain nightmares through real existence, then using nightmares to counteract against reality.","\"Reality is the basis for nightmares, and nightmares react upon reality?\"","\"Is this the advanced application of Evil God Divine Thought Power?\"","Mo Hua looks up to survey the surrounding scenes.","Currently, the nightmares within the Demon Refining Diagram originate from reality, yet their impact on ’this world’ appears negligible.","Is it because the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons remains incomplete?","Or perhaps... the real Evil God has not awoken, hence true Evil God power remains unused?","Mo Hua can’t help but wonder:","If the Great Wilderness Evil God truly awakens...","And succeeds in constructing a demon monster purgatory somewhere, wouldn’t it be possible to summon this ’demon monster purgatory’ directly into the mortal realm through overwhelming evil thoughts?","At that point, it would truly be devastation of living beings, and the world would resemble purgatory?!","Mo Hua is startled by his own speculations, a wave of intense coldness rises within him.","Could the Evil God indeed... possess such terrifying power?","If it truly turns out so... truly awakens, spreading evil thoughts covertly.","Then even the seemingly prosperous Nine State Cultivation World may look tranquil but could be devoured by boundless nightmarish terror in an instant, shattered and strewn with corpses.","Prosperity on the surface with decay inside.","The towering structure collapses, merely in an instant...","Seeing Mo Hua’s grave expressions, he finally sighs.","The clearer the vision of this world’s reality, the more daunting it becomes, and under such crisis, ordinary cultivators may still indulge in idyllic years and revelry...","\"Life in adversity, death in comfort...\"","Mo Hua shakes his head, but upon reflection, realizes these matters are beyond his current capacity to influence.","If the sky falls, it is held up by the taller ones.","Such grand affairs of Nine State are not yet his concern as a Foundation Establishment Cultivator.","Rescuing people is imperative...","Mo Hua consoles himself briefly, and temporarily puts to rest these thoughts, continuing his search for traces of the three ’sacrificed’ into the Demon Refining Diagram, including Little Wood.","Thus he continues for a while, arriving at a stone path, where Mo Hua’s divine thought moves.","\"Found them!\"","The ground bears obvious traces of monster cultivator passage, with intense evil qi.","The cultivator divine thought aura is also very evident.","Mo Hua looks up.","Ahead on the wide stone path, several monster cultivators are carrying three strange coffins engraved with monster patterns, black as ink, stepping forward.","Leading the procession is a tall monster cultivator steward.","And this steward is precisely Jin Gui.","Or rather, Jin Gui’s monster cultivator divine soul.","Mo Hua makes no effort to hide his presence, nor does Sword Bone restrain its aura.","Both parties have sensed each other.","Walking ahead, Jin Gui suddenly waves his hand, saying \"Halt!\" and then turns to look at Mo Hua, naturally, more at Sword Bone beside him.","Sword Bone before Mo Hua appears meek.","Yet, during its lifetime, it was an old monster cultivator proficient in crafting evil swords, possessing sinister cultivation techniques.","Transformed in death, it becomes a formidable Sword Demon, completely skeletal evil sword, towering and brimming with demonic qi.","Its appearance alone is quite ’frightening’.","A glimpse of dread flickers in Jin Gui’s eyes, though he is not afraid, smirking coldly:","\"The master said, there’s a rat in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, secretly causing trouble, ruining the master’s grand plan... Little did I expect you to actually pursue it here...\"","Jin Gui’s gaze burns brightly, fixating intensely on Sword Bone."]},{"number":1433,"title":"Chapter 1433 - 786: Tiger Pattern (Extra - for Alliance Hierarch Little Bai Bai’s Boss Carrot~)_2","paragraphs":["The Sword Bone remained silent for a moment, suddenly dazed, the bone with the ominous face faltered.","Mouse?","Who?","Me?","\"No, I’m just a guide, it’s not related to me...\"","It wanted to clarify.","But thinking of Mo Hua right by its side, this little ancestor hadn’t spoken, so naturally, it dared not speak out of turn.","Most importantly, it glanced at its tall body, with the sharp bone swords and the sinister demonic qi, then looked at the side, at the tiny childlike figure of Mo Hua.","It felt that its clarification seemed utterly unconvincing.","After all, no matter how you looked at it, Mo Hua looked like the \"guide.\"","And itself, without even looking, appeared to be the \"Hidden Hand.\"","The Sword Bone only felt that a massive black pot had directly landed on its head.","Sure enough, all the monster cultivators’ venomous gazes converged on it.","The Sword Bone’s vision blackened.","Of course, it’s a bone, its eye sockets are hollow, naturally black.","Jin Gui looked warily at the Sword Demon before him. Seeing it motionless and speechless for some reason, he was puzzled.","It was only then that he noticed Mo Hua standing beside the Sword Bone, \"completely inconspicuous.\"","With just a glance, he overlooked him.","A Sword Demon and a little ghost, though this combination seemed somewhat odd, as long as he killed them, it didn’t matter.","But then he was stunned, turned back for another look, and was suddenly shocked, emotions a bit out of control, pointing at Mo Hua:","\"You... do you have a brother?\"","Mo Hua was also taken aback by his question.","Jin Gui spoke again with hatred: \"Is your brother named ’Mo Hua’?\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","Jin Gui scrutinized Mo Hua again, looking at his appearance and demeanor. His eyes suddenly widened, \"No, wait!\"","\"You... are Mo Hua!\"","He finally recognized him.","But then, he frowned again, \"You... how did you become small?\"","Mo Hua’s gaze involuntarily became cold.","Jin Gui stared at Mo Hua for a while longer, his expression suddenly enlightened, murmuring:","\"This is not the real world, entering here exists in the form of one’s own Divine Thought, that means...\"","Jin Gui coldly laughed, \"No matter how old you are, how your appearance changes, inside you’re still an innocent immature, never-growing little ghost!\"","Mo Hua looked at Jin Gui, his gaze icy, as if looking at a dead person.","Yet Jin Gui remained blissfully unaware.","He was still immersed in his former \"hatred.\"","He remembered clearly, at the time he led a group of junior disciples, hunting the Pig Monster.","By chance, this Pig Monster somehow fell into the hands of a few Taixu Gate disciples.","He merely took it back as a matter of course, but thus suffered an unspeakable humiliation.","This little ghost named \"Mo Hua,\" with a few of his fellow disciples, plotted against him.","Afterward, they even stripped him of his clothes, hung him on a tree, drew a tortoise on him, causing him great disgrace.","\"Mo Hua...\"","This little ghost, even if he turned to ash, he couldn’t forget.","Without cutting him into a thousand pieces, he couldn’t quench the hatred in his heart!","\"Alright, alright!\" Jin Gui’s expression distorted, grinning fiercely, \"It’s been hard to find him, but he came effortlessly!\"","\"I was long thinking of stealthily killing this little ghost to wipe out past shame, but I hadn’t got the opportunity.\"","\"Today, you actually came to me yourself! So don’t blame me for slicing you one cut at a time, swallowing your Divine Thought alive!\"","Mo Hua’s expression remained calm, devoid of joy or anger, he didn’t even regard Jin Gui.","Jin Gui instead thought Mo Hua was afraid, let out a cold smile, waved his hand, and commanded:","\"Attack!\"","The group of monster cultivators beside him put down the coffins and charged toward Mo Hua.","Mo Hua stood with his hands closed, unmoved, instead glanced at the Sword Bone beside him.","The Sword Bone hesitated for a moment.","What does it mean? To go up?","This little ancestor couldn’t even bother to lift a finger?","Seeing the group of monster cultivators about to rush before him, the Sword Bone had no choice but to draw two bone swords, summon strands of demonic qi, and fought with the group of monster cultivators.","After battling for over ten rounds, the monster cultivators were utterly defeated.","The Sword Bone suddenly hesitated again.","It suddenly realized that as a \"Sword Demon,\" it seemed... it was quite strong?","The battle with Mo Hua nearly shattered its Taoist Heart.","It almost believed it was a lowly, powerless, ant-like waste demon monster.","But now, after clashing with other monster cultivators, it suddenly found out, maybe it wasn’t that it was too weak, but that some people were just too strong?","The Sword Bone’s spirits lifted, the demonic qi rose, the aura instantly became arrogant.","With a reverse-hand sword, it slashed a monster cultivator into two.","Then its body swelled, bone swords on its body, like joints, completely slaughtered another monster cultivator.","Jin Gui saw this, his expression turned solemn.","He glanced at Mo Hua again, thought:","\"No wonder this little ghost is so fearless, turns out he has such a powerful ’Sword Demon’ as a guard.\"","\"But...\" Jin Gui frowned, \"Isn’t this Sword Demon a demon creature?\"","\"Why would a disciple of the Taixu Gate Righteous Dao have a demon creature as a guard? Could it be the self-proclaimed righteous Taixu Gate has also begun to fall?\"","Seeing the Sword Bone about to kill all the monster cultivators.","Jin Gui finally couldn’t bear it.","He still had to fulfill the young master’s orders, and send the Divine Souls of these three little ghosts into the depths of the Demon Refining Diagram, he couldn’t delay much longer.","Jin Gui’s gaze showed killing intent, emitting a low growl like a beast, then the roar grew louder, like a Fierce Tiger.","The Four Symbols Mysterious Tiger Monster Formation lit up.","At the same time, his body was gradually swelling, sprouting yellowish-brown fur, transforming into a bloodthirsty and powerful Fierce Tiger."]},{"number":1434,"title":"Chapter 1434 - 786: Tiger Pattern (Extra - for Alliance Hierarch Little Bai Bai’s Boss Carrot~)_3","paragraphs":["Then his figure flashed, a bloody wind surged, and in an instant, he pounced in front of Sword Bone.","A Tiger Demon and a Sword Demon engaged in a fierce battle.","Monster Qi and Demonic Qi intertwined.","Tiger claws clashed with Sword Bones.","Monster wind howled and Demonic Qi wailed, both Demon Monsters incited their ferocity, fighting evenly matched in a tense battle.","Mo Hua silently watched from the side.","At the same time, he also silently calculated in his mind.","While Sword Bone, as the \"Sword Demon,\" and Jin Gui, after \"Demonization,\" were engaged in a balanced battle, Mo Hua silently inferred the Four Symbols Tiger Pattern on Jin Gui’s back.","He had long set his eyes on this Tiger Pattern.","The tiger is the king of all beasts, and among the diverse Monster Beasts, it ranks as the top tier in strength.","Demon cultivators with \"Tiger Patterns\" in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons are also extremely rare.","Up until now, Mo Hua had only seen one on Jin Gui.","This is a rare Monster Pattern.","To obtain it, either kill Jin Gui, strip him, and copy it from his corpse.","Or let him exert himself fully, activate the Monster Pattern, and in engaging others, spend some time inferring and recording these \"Monster Patterns.\"","Both methods are quite troublesome, and there hasn’t been much opportunity before.","Now that Sword Bone is present as well, and it and Jin Gui, these two Evil Spirits are equally matched, \"weaklings pecking at each other,\" conveniently giving Mo Hua the chance to \"calculate.\"","Mo Hua’s gaze slightly deepened, calmly inferring.","Jin Gutou and Jin Gui, one transformed into a Sword Demon, the other into a Tiger Demon, their aura mighty, waging a fierce battle as if in a life-and-death duel.","As Mo Hua calculated, they continued fighting.","When Mo Hua finished calculating, they were still fighting.","Mo Hua silently memorized the complete \"Four Symbols Mysterious Tiger Demon Patterns,\" then looked up at these two Evil Spirits’ battle again, inevitably feeling somewhat bored, even a bit sleepy.","And the parties in the fierce battle were obviously not feeling well either.","Sword Bone, having been \"tormented\" by Mo Hua before, had its Vital Energy injured, making short-term engagement manageable but long-term combat often led to insufficient Evil Power.","Jin Gui realized that within a short time, he simply couldn’t defeat this \"powerful\" Sword Demon.","He must fight swiftly and decisively!","Jin Gui swung a tiger claw, opening up Sword Bone’s One Sword, and shouted loudly:","\"Taoist Friend, with such dao practice, why lower yourself to protect this little ghost completely?\"","Sword Bone was taken aback, speechless.","What foolishness is this fool saying?","Whence came his dao practice to completely protect this little ancestor?","Just hearing this made it feel embarrassed.","But despite many inner emotions, its skeletal visage remained grim and cold, none of it showing outwardly.","Jin Gui further advised: \"Taoist Friend, why not abandon darkness for light, forsake this little ghost, and join my Valley of Ten Thousand Demons? You might even become a dominant Demon Head someday!\"","Sword Bone sneered inwardly.","Ignorance knows no fear, becoming a dominant Demon Head?","What nonsense!","Jin Gui frowned, internally sighing:","What a loyal Old Demon!","Despite my verbal provocations, it doesn’t budge an inch? Insisting on protecting this little ghost completely?","What origin does this little ghost have to make a Sword Demon so fiercely loyal?","\"Since so, I’ll have to think of another way...\" Jin Gui silently mused.","Then he clenched his fangs, suddenly roared, voice like a fierce tiger.","The Tiger Pattern spread across his body, shining blindingly, demonic power surged, underneath the Blood Skin it churned, even rupturing his flesh to ooze blood.","Sword Bone felt a shiver.","This beast wants to fight desperately?","\"Damn, truly a year of bad luck, encountering such a reckless fool, without grievance or hostility, you could pretend, but why fight desperately?\"","\"Demon Cultivators truly have poor brains!\"","Sword Bone internally cursed, but did not dare relax at all.","As a surge of Demonic Qi rose, Sword Bone’s skeletal form transformed into the final \"Sword Demon\" form.","This battle, must determine life or death.","But just as Sword Bone stood ready to engage in a life-and-death duel with Jin Gui, Jin Gui feinted, bypassing it, directly pouncing towards Mo Hua a little distance away like a fierce tiger.","Sword Bone froze.","Not determining life or death with him, but wanting to kill that little ancestor?","Looking at Jin Gui, Sword Bone’s eyes showed a hint of confusion, then turned into deep \"admiration.\"","The aura Jin Gui emitted, with a \"none can stand against me\" spirit, perhaps could be called \"courage\"...","On the other side, Jin Gui sensed Sword Bone not following, thought to himself:","\"Indeed, this Sword Demon has formidable strength, able to match my demonized self, surely couldn’t lower itself completely.\"","\"It ’protects’ this little ghost, certainly with some inside story, beyond control.\"","\"Since so, ’capture the thief first, capture the king’, kill this little ghost first, maybe this Sword Demon would even thank me...\"","Thinking thus, Jin Gui’s figure accelerated.","Mo Hua’s irritating little face came increasingly close.","Jin Gui’s smile grew increasingly ferocious.","He could almost imagine that tender little face being torn apart by his claws.","Swiftly, as he neared Mo Hua, he gave a vicious smile, tiger claws enveloped in bloody wind, suddenly tearing at Mo Hua.","Yet in the next moment, the imagined scene did not happen.","Mo Hua remained unscathed, not even moving an inch.","Instead, Jin Gui himself felt sudden agony from his shoulder.","Turning his head to look, Jin Gui found, somehow, his entire arm had been sliced off!","Even he hadn’t seen how it had been sliced off!","\"Who is it?\"","\"Who sliced off my arm?\"","Jin Gui’s pupils dilated in shock.","The next instant, he saw Mo Hua standing calmly in front, looking at him as if at an ant.","A thought of incredulity rose in Jin Gui’s heart.","\"This... how could it be?!\"","\"Outside, to kill you takes effort...\" Mo Hua’s voice was crisp, tone unruffled:","\"But here, killing you isn’t much harder than crushing an ant...\"","And then Mo Hua pointed lightly.","A golden thread swept past.","An unresistable aura of killing intent descended.","Jin Gui’s ferocious expression remained, but in the next moment, he was shattered into pieces by the blades of golden light, completely dissipated.","All within less than three breaths.","Jin Gui’s Divine Soul was utterly annihilated.","Mo Hua hadn’t even taken a step.","The surroundings quieted significantly.","Sword Bone watched, its whole body of bones couldn’t help but tremble a bit.","Its strength was evenly matched with Jin Gui.","This little ancestor killed Jin Gui in three breaths, certainly wouldn’t take more than two to kill it.","Probably just an instantaneous matter...","Sword Bone’s expression grew solem, internally warning itself:","\"Indeed, my previous attitude towards this little ancestor was too arrogant, in future definitely more ’courteous’...\""]},{"number":1435,"title":"Chapter 1435 - 787 Extinguished Light (Thanks to Boss Xiao Bai Bai’s radish Alliance Hierarch~)","paragraphs":["Jin Gui was killed with a single finger by Mo Hua.","Several monster cultivators remained on the scene, all of whom were shocked and scattered to flee, but none could escape the lethal grasp of the Sword Bone, who hunted them down and killed them with the White Bone Sword.","After the monster cultivators died, quite a bit of evil thoughts remained.","The Sword Bone looked on greedily, but dared not move in Mo Hua’s presence, trying its best to pose as an \"honest being.\"","After all, devouring evil spirits is not something a proper evil spirit should do.","Mo Hua glanced at it and said:","\"Go ahead and eat.\"","\"No, no,\" the Sword Bone shook its head vigorously, \"One becomes red by being close to the vermillion, and black by being close to the ink. By staying with you, I will definitely forsake evil and follow the right path, never touching these demon monsters and evil spirits.\"","Mo Hua’s expression turned slightly complex, frowning as he spoke:","\"When I tell you to eat, you eat. Why so much nonsense?\"","\"I...\"","The Sword Bone was still hesitating.","It wasn’t sure if Mo Hua truly wanted it to eat, or was merely \"testing\" it to see if it could control its desires and resist the temptation of the \"evil spirits.\"","Sometimes, it’s hard to gauge the \"intentions from above.\"","The Sword Bone couldn’t make up its mind, so it sneaked a glance at Mo Hua, and seeing Mo Hua growing impatient, suddenly felt a pang of tension and quickly said:","\"Yes! Yes! Thank you, young master, for the reward. I will act according to your command.\"","The implication being, it wasn’t that it wanted to eat.","It was eating under your orders.","Please don’t turn against me...","Then the Sword Bone stopped hesitating and began to absorb the evil thoughts of the surrounding demon spirits into its belly.","At first, it was still somewhat refined, looking up at Mo Hua’s expression with every bite, pausing instantly if Mo Hua’s expression soured.","But after a while, it found that Mo Hua truly didn’t seem to care whether it consumed these evil thoughts, and it finally relaxed.","Once it relaxed, it felt the \"hunger\" becoming unbearable.","Since becoming the \"Sword Demon,\" it hadn’t \"fed\" on any telekinesis. Now with so much abundant monster cultivator evil thoughts laid before it, they appeared particularly \"delicious.\"","The Sword Bone could not resist indulging greatly.","Mo Hua indeed did not care.","These evil thoughts were beneath his notice.","Moreover, though monster cultivators were essentially \"half-demon,\" they still had human appearances, which Mo Hua found unappetizing.","He walked to a nearby coffin.","The three pitch-black coffins were engraved with Monster Patterns, cold and strange, identical to the coffins outside where the Little Wood and the other two were sacrificed.","There were indeed some formations on the coffins as well.","With a casual swipe, Mo Hua broke the formations and lifted the coffins open.","Sure enough, Linghu Xiao, Ouyang Mu, and Song Jian were inside.","Their faces were pale, eyes tightly shut, unconscious.","With a sweep of Divine Sense, Mo Hua discovered that the Divine Thought of these three was pure and untainted by demon monster qi.","It was likely just the first time their Divine Soul left their bodies, so they appeared a bit weak, but there was no harm.","Mo Hua nodded slightly, finally feeling relieved.","On the other side, the Sword Bone had devoured all the evil thoughts of the monster cultivators in a swift and gluttonous manner.","The wounds left by Mo Hua’s earlier \"maltreatment\" were gradually healing.","At the same time, its Demonic Qi, swirling around the White Bone, became increasingly intense, and its aura steadily rose.","A crimson, malevolent gleam shone in its eyes.","It felt its Dao cultivation greatly increasing, a savage intent brewing within, capable of tearing apart, devouring, and suppressing everything.","The aura of the Evil Demon grew ever more arrogant...","The Sword Bone lowered its head and glanced at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua returned the glance calmly.","Like a basin of cold water poured overhead, the Sword Bone’s pompous aura extinguished at once.","It bent over, awkwardly saying:","\"Young master, I’ve...finished eating...\"","\"Mm.\" Mo Hua nodded, pointing at Linghu Xiao and the others, \"Carry them, let’s go back first.\"","At the mention of going back, the Sword Bone quickly nodded, \"Alright! Alright!\"","Having consumed a substantial amount of evil thoughts, it had quite a \"nourishing\" gain, benefiting greatly.","Now that the people were rescued and it could safely escape from the dangerous Demon Refining Diagram, it was truly a win-win situation.","No risks incurred, abundant rewards received!","The Sword Bone was quietly delighted.","Even the \"Plague God\" that was Mo Hua seemed endearing to it now.","The tall and skeletal Sword Bone promptly hoisted Ouyang Mu and the others, following Mo Hua along the original path out of the valley, past the White Bone Path, along the Divine Chains, and back to the Blood Pool.","Peace reigned along the way.","The Sword Bone finally felt at ease.","It had finally \"come home\"...","But just as it set down Linghu Xiao and the others, Mo Hua said, \"You come with me for another trip back.\"","\"Back?\"","The Sword Bone was stunned.","\"Aren’t the people already rescued? What are we going back for?\"","Mo Hua gave it a faint look, \"Getting them out was just the beginning of the real business...\"","\"The rightful affairs\" hadn’t been done yet.","Real business...","The Sword Bone was left momentarily confused.","This little ancestor, what exactly does he intend to do?","The Sword Bone wanted to ask but didn’t dare, wanted to refuse but didn’t have the courage, not wanting to appear \"impolite,\" and could only hang its head and say:","\"Yes.\"","Little Wood and the others remained unconscious.","Mo Hua confirmed that their Divine Soul had no other issues and temporarily left them in the Blood Pool, drawing Formation Patterns of the Divine Way around them.","These Divine Formation Patterns were both to \"seal\" and to \"protect\" them.","Once everything was ready, Mo Hua again followed the Divine Chains back into the Demon Refining Diagram.","The Sword Bone hesitated for a moment, but could only grit its teeth and follow.","Inside the Demon Refining Diagram, the scenery remained the same.","But this time, Mo Hua, having no worries, had much more freedom of action."]},{"number":1436,"title":"Chapter 1436 - 787 Extinguished Light (Thanks to Boss Xiao Bai Bai’s radish Alliance Hierarch~)_2","paragraphs":["\"I want to see, where exactly the demon wraith in this painting is hidden...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes flickered slightly as he stepped towards the depths of the Demon Refining Diagram.","\"My Divine Sense has been stuck for too long.\"","\"This time, it should advance further...\"","...","While Jin Gui’s Divine Soul was obliterated by Mo Hua with a single finger.","In a grand hall, deep within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","A gust of sinister wind swept across an altar.","A lamp in front of Jin Gui’s physical body was instantly extinguished.","The more than ten bustling monster cultivators managing the hall fell silent in an instant, their expressions showing a hint of bewilderment.","\"What’s going on? The lamp... extinguished?\"","\"How could it be extinguished?\"","\"A person’s death is like a lamp extinguishing, did his Divine Soul... just die like that?\"","Some monster cultivator stewards immediately showed cold smiles.","One monster cultivator sneered and said:","\"He really was a useless waste!\"","\"The young master entrusted him with such a small task, yet he couldn’t even do it right and lost his life in there.\"","\"The demon wraiths in the diagram are all sealed and can’t come out. He only needed to deliver three Divine Souls, yet he messed up...\"","\"I wonder how that fool managed to die?\"","A monster cultivator chuckled coldly, \"Could it be that he slipped and fell off a cliff, smashing himself to death...\"","Other monster cultivators also began to mock.","In the center of the hall, behind beaded curtains, a young master with an indistinct, yet handsome figure sat there.","He was currently sorting through the scrolls within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","Upon hearing the conversation, the young master slightly frowned, his expression turning cold.","The crowd of stewards, realizing the atmosphere was not right, ceased their laughter and dared not speak further.","After a moment of silence, an elderly steward spoke:","\"Young master, I’m afraid there’s something fishy...\"","\"Though Jin Gui was incompetent, he bore the Four Symbols Mysterious Tiger Demon Patterns, and without being besieged by demon wraiths, it was absolutely impossible for him to die so easily within the Demon Refining Diagram.\"","\"I fear...\" The elderly steward paused briefly, then said solemnly, \"The Demon Refining Diagram has been ’infiltrated’ by something.\"","\"Infiltrated the Demon Refining Diagram?\"","The group of monster cultivators exchanged glances in astonishment.","Jin Yixuan’s gaze sharpened as he said, \"Young master, could it be... that ’rat’ lurking in the shadows?\"","The young master’s expression remained indifferent.","Jin Yixuan explained, \"Previously, when those three little devils escaped, it was evident someone secretly helped them.\"","\"But when we captured those three little devils, there were no other figures around. Clearly, that ’rat’, seeing the situation was unfavorable, fled beforehand.\"","\"Now, secretly ’infiltrating’ the Demon Refining Diagram, it seems still to recover those three little devils.\"","\"This ’rat’...\"","Jin Yixuan’s expression turned slightly somber, \"It’s probably more ’troublesome’ than we imagined.\"","Skilled in concealment, proficient in the Yuan Magnetic Formation, and even somewhat knowledgeable of the Dao of the Divine, capable of bypassing the \"ceremony\" and infiltrating the Demon Refining Diagram with Divine Thought... many methods, diverse strategies.","The young master’s gaze slightly narrowed, his tone chilling:","\"Find it, and kill it.\"","By this point, he had lost all patience.","This rat had meddled in his affairs repeatedly, and now there was no need to keep it alive.","From among the crowd, one person stepped forward arrogantly and said:","\"A mere ’rat’, I’ll light the lamp and enter the diagram to kill it.\"","This person, a young master in appearance with a charming yet wicked visage, was none other than Jin Yicai of the Sever Gold Sect.","Jin Yixuan slightly frowned, \"You’re going?\"","Jin Yicai grinned lightly and said, \"Cousin, don’t worry, I’m not like that useless Jin Gui, who died so inexplicably.\"","Jin Yixuan was slightly uneasy.","In his eyes, Jin Yicai was also a waste.","But, given his special status and noble bloodline, if something happened, it would be hard to answer to the family elders.","\"This ’rat’, might not be underestimated...\" Jin Yixuan said.","Jin Yicai shook his head, \"Cousin, you’re mistaken, only weaklings would be sneaky, how could a strong person be so secretive?\"","\"If this ’rat’ was truly strong, they’d have killed us all by now, how could they be so cautious?\"","\"Precisely because he’s not our match, he acts like a ’rat’, daring only to do these petty tricks in the dark.\"","Jin Yixuan appeared contemplative, nodded, and said:","\"Take a few stewards with you.\"","Jin Yicai hesitated for a moment, wanting to say it wasn’t necessary as simply his skill would suffice alone and calling more people would only split his merits.","But as this was his cousin’s wish, he could not refuse.","Moreover, since this was an order from the young master, if something went wrong, there would indeed be no explanation.","Jin Yicai then said, \"Alright, as my cousin wishes.\"","Jin Yixuan appointed four \"stewards\" to accompany Jin Yicai in sitting at the altar while facing an eerie mural, lighting the soul lamp.","Under the influence of the Divine Soul, they naturally entered the Demon Refining Diagram.","When they opened their eyes, they found an eerie valley shrouded in a black cloud of blood mist before them.","A bloody stream trickled, and white bones covered the ground.","This was truly the Demon Refinement Valley within the Demon Refining Diagram.","They followed the fixed path of \"sacrifice\", walking into the valley, searching for clues along the way.","Soon, they found the place where Jin Gui met his end.","\"There was a battle here...\"","\"The Demonic Qi is intense, mixed with Sword Qi; the enemy seems to be a ’Sword Demon’.\"","\"There’s another weak Divine Thought Aura, seemingly barely contributing in the battle; compared to the Demonic Qi, its presence is much fainter...\"","Jin Yicai was slightly stunned, \"Sword Demon?\"","Not human, not a monster, but a Sword Demon?","Which Sword Dao Sect cultivates this?","Jin Yicai was somewhat puzzled, looking into the distance, he continued:","\"Chase!\"","A group of five monster steward cultivators continued their pursuit."]},{"number":1437,"title":"Chapter 1437 - 787: Lights Out (Thanks to Xiaobai Bai’s Radish Boss Alliance Hierarch~)_3","paragraphs":["About thirty minutes later, they saw a towering Sword Demon on the road, its entire body transformed into white bones, exuding an imposing Demonic Qi.","Next to it was a \"little kid.\"","In Jin Yicai’s arrogant eyes, he only saw the \"powerful\" Sword Demon and didn’t care at all about Mo Hua. He immediately stepped forward and laughed coldly:","\"Did you kill Jin Gui?\"","At these words, Sword Bone was taken aback.","Who is Jin Gui?","It had no idea...","But on the surface, it remained silent, sullen and cold.","Seeing its \"swagger,\" Jin Yicai’s eyelids twitched slightly, then he laughed coldly:","\"Just killing a useless person, are you feeling proud?\"","With Mo Hua by its side, Sword Bone maintained courtesy, still not daring to utter a word, ignoring Jin Yicai’s ridicule.","Jin Yicai’s gaze sharpened.","Could this Sword Demon be a \"puppet\"?","He looked over at Mo Hua.","However, Mo Hua’s figure was even smaller than outside, so Jin Yicai didn’t recognize him and ignored him once again.","\"Although Jin Gui is indeed useless, this Sword Demon doesn’t seem completely without merit. Anyway, better to test it first...\"","Jin Yicai thought silently, then stopped wasting words and immediately revealed his Sword Qi, attacking the Sword Demon.","Sword Bone felt helpless.","Why do these people have such a death wish...","If you want to die, at least choose the right target.","If you attack that little kid next to me, you’ll die instantly, why bother with this \"shell\"...","However, with the opponent already attacking, Sword Bone had no choice but to fight back.","It transformed into the White Bone Evil Sword, and engaged Jin Yicai in battle.","Yet Sword Bone couldn’t grasp Mo Hua’s intentions, uncertain if it should give its all in the fight, so it fought half-heartedly with Jin Yicai for a while.","For a while, the battle was quite back-and-forth.","Jin Yicai was slightly surprised, \"This Sword Demon indeed has some skills, no wonder Jin Gui died at its hands...\"","After several rounds of fighting, just as victory seemed elusive, a streak of golden light suddenly swept by.","Jin Yicai felt an inexplicable chill, realizing something was amiss, he deflected Sword Bone and turned to look.","When he saw, it was as if he had fallen into an ice cave.","Behind him, the previously coldly observing four managers, had been somehow shattered by an unknown force.","What happened?!","Jin Yicai’s pupils trembled violently.","At this moment, a crisp but displeased voice said: \"Sword Bone!\"","\"Yes!\"","Sword Bone responded promptly.","It knew this little ancestor was growing impatient, unwilling to waste more time on these small fry.","Sword Bone stopped holding back, its pupils ignited with two flames of magic, and the white bone longsword in its hand suddenly enlarged, slashing fiercely.","Jin Yicai couldn’t block it at all, his shoulder instantly carved with a deep blood mark.","Only now did he realize that his Gold-Cutting Sword Skill was utterly useless against this Sword Demon.","\"Not good!\"","He roared in fury, the Monster Pattern on his back glowed, and the demonic power gradually gathered.","It was a Dog Pattern.","Sword Bone sneered contemptuously, without a hint of hesitation, it reversed its sword and thrust effortlessly, piercing Jin Yicai’s left chest and pinning him to the ground.","\"You wear a dog’s pattern, and yet try to act like a big bad wolf?\"","Jin Yicai’s face turned pale.","No, how could the battle of Divine Thought be entirely different from what he imagined?","Why was this Sword Demon so powerful?","And how did those four monster cultivator managers die?","While he was in a state of shock and confusion, he heard a crisp voice next to him questioning:","\"In Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, a place that nurtures ten thousand demons, where have you hidden all those demon wraiths? Why can’t I find them?\"","Jin Yicai glanced again at Mo Hua next to him, noticing that although his figure had shrunk considerably, his facial expression was very familiar. Suddenly, realization dawned, \"You, you are...\"","Jin Yicai was too stunned to speak.","Mo Hua shook his head, \"Forget it, I’ll find it myself.\"","\"Sword Bone, you can eat them all.\"","Eat?!","Jin Yicai’s eyes were filled with fear; before he could think further, the omen of death arrived.","The last thing reflected in his pupils was a white, grim bone sword and a pair of cold, hollow white bone eyes.","The Sword Bonesman killed Jin Yicai with one strike, shook his head, and murmured to himself:","\"The cultivation world is perilous, and the Divine Way is even more ruthless; it’s not something a young master like you can play with...\"","I, a dignified Sword Demon, still tread carefully; let alone you, an arrogant but ignorant fool.","...","The moment Jin Yicai died.","In the grand hall of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, all five soul lamps had extinguished.","The surrounding monster cultivators fell silent.","Even the young master behind the beaded screen slightly contracted his pupils.","They all sensed that something seemed amiss.","Jin Yixuan also furrowed his brow, not expecting such a situation at all.","He knew well that his cousin was useless, so he didn’t have any expectations.","But those who followed his cousin and lit the soul lamps to enter the Demon Map were all experienced monster cultivator managers with some experience in Divine Way combat.","These four managers’ soul lamps extinguished in an instant.","Which means, these four managers were almost simultaneously slain by something.","Jin Yixuan’s heart sank, only then did he realize that what entered the Demon Refining Diagram might not be just a \"rat,\" but quite possibly, a man-eating \"fierce tiger.\"","Moreover, this \"fierce tiger\"... if it just wanted to save someone, it could have left after killing Jin Gui.","But it didn’t.","It stayed in the Demon Refining Diagram after killing Jin Gui.","It even killed those who went to assist, including Jin Yicai and several managers.","Ruthless and vicious, it surely has... significant ambitions!","After all, within the Demon Refining Diagram, lies a big secret...","Jin Yixuan’s expression was grave, and he cupped his hands upwards, saying:","\"Young master, whether it is man, monster, or demon, we must kill the intruder in the Demon Refining Diagram as soon as possible!\"","The young master looked indifferent, without comment.","Jin Yixuan pondered for a moment, then said:","\"The greatest taboo in warfare is dispersal; entering in batches, we are easily defeated one by one.\"","\"Therefore, it would be better to act together; with thunderous might, thoroughly surround and kill it, or endless troubles will be in store!\"","The young master contemplated for a moment, then slowly nodded and said:","\"That’s the only way...\"","Jin Yixuan saluted the young master, then turned and said: \"Everyone, light the soul lamps and follow me into the diagram to kill the invaders!\"","\"Yes, Leader!\"","\"Understood!\"","More than ten managers cupped their hands in response.","Then, according to routine, each one lit a soul lamp, sat cross-legged, closed their eyes tightly, and their divine souls entered the Demon Refining Diagram.","Their expressions were solemn, knowing the situation was somewhat serious.","But what they didn’t know was just how serious it really was...","After the monster cultivators entered the diagram, the grand hall fell silent.","Only a few already extinguished soul lamps emitted wisps of white smoke, and ten-plus yet-to-extinguish soul lamps flickered slightly.","Within the screen, the young master continued with his own tasks.","The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons being destroyed, time was short, there were too many things to transfer out, not to be left behind in the valley, to avoid leaving any leverage.","Calmness in major events.","This was the teaching of the Ancestor to him.","The more critical the moment, the more one must maintain composure, to be poised and confident, to have the stature to accomplish great matters.","He aimed to use the Qian Learning State Boundary and the Four Great Sects as stepping stones, to one day stand atop the Taoist Court, high above, controlling the fate of countless cultivators in the cultivation world.","The young master’s emotions slowly calmed down.","He finished organizing rows of cultivation documents, formation diagram drafts, pills, evil artifacts, and other Tao cultivation materials, preparing to stash them in the storage bag to take away.","His expression focused, he checked each item one by one.","He didn’t know how much time passed, yet it seemed little time passed...","A gust of cold wind suddenly blew through.","The young master seemed to sense something, his fingers trembled, and his body froze.","Moments later, he slowly raised his head, his clear eyes gazing towards the grand hall, his pupils trembled violently.","Inside the grand hall.","The soul lamps... were all extinguished..."]},{"number":1438,"title":"Chapter 1438 - 788 Fierce God","paragraphs":["\"All... dead?\"","From the moment he was born, the young master had lived a life of privilege, always above others. For the first time, he felt the icy chill seeping from his bones.","How could they die?","How did they die?","And who was it that killed them?","What exactly is the \"thing\" in the Demon Refining Diagram?","The hall was empty, all the soul lamps extinguished, only a pale smoke rising slowly, with no one to respond.","At that moment, the soul lamp before Jin Yixuan suddenly emitted a red light, a sinister flame flickering and rising.","Jin Yixuan’s deceased body started to twist and convulse, then raised its head, slowly opening its eyes.","His eyes showed only the whites, filled with blood threads.","And on his shoulder, a fresh red \"Blood Shadow\" of Mr. Tu appeared.","The young master looked solemn, and asked in a cold voice:","\"Sir, what on earth has happened?\"","Possessing Jin Yixuan, \"Mr. Tu\" shed tears of blood, his voice aged and filled with fear:"]},{"number":1439,"title":"Chapter 1439 - 788 Fierce God_2","paragraphs":["\"Fortunately, I begged for mercy early on, and flattered well. If it weren’t for that, if my bone were just a bit harder, I would have been reduced to ashes long ago...\"","Moreover, more than a dozen Monster cultivators’ Divine Souls had perished, and the Sword Bone had another feast.","It was almost full, its strength now much greater than before.","\"If I keep eating like this, will there be a day when I become stronger than this little ancestor...\"","Treacherous thoughts crossed the mind of the Sword Bone.","On the other side, the focused Mo Hua furrowed his brows slightly.","Every possible place had been searched...","Yet, there was still no sign of the Demon Wraith.","\"Where on earth is it hiding?\"","Mo Hua continued deeper, and after a moment, he suddenly paused, feeling as if something deep within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons was \"luring\" him.","It was a strange attraction.","It felt like a sense of nostalgia for the \"ancestral land,\" causing a pang of restless longing and fervor in Mo Hua’s \"deity\" part.","Ancestral land of the deity?","Mo Hua frowned.","He looked up at this nightmare within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, his mind stirred.","The entire Valley of Ten Thousand Demons before him relied on the grand power of the deity, which shifted between the real and the imaginary, supported by the Divine Tao Array.","It was like a \"Divine Thought\" construct.","Externally made of the bricks and stones from the Demon Refining mural, internally fortified with the Divine Tao Array as the Golden Lock, it sealed a realm of Divine Thought that nurtured countless Demon Wraiths.","Between reality and illusion...","Everything in the image mirrored the existing world.","If so, should there not be another Demon Refining Diagram within the Demon Refining Diagram?","What would the image within the image look like?","Could it be that the entire Demon Refining Diagram, as well as the core of the entire nightmare?","Mo Hua recalled for a moment.","The Demon Refining Diagram above did have formations, but no obvious formation eye or central Formation Pivot.","His master once told him that the form of formations could vary infinitely, but their fundamental framework remains unchanged.","The formation eye, formation pivot, and Formation Patterns remain unchanged principles of formations.","\"The Divine Tao Array, being at the Divine Thought level, means its true core might not lie on the earth and stone Demon Refining Diagram but within the Divine Thought-built Demon Refining Diagram.\"","\"And for such a large Divine Tao Array, it certainly requires a grand formation eye, powered by inexhaustible telekinesis, to maintain its operation.\"","This implies...","Mo Hua’s eyes flashed with insight.","The Demon Refining Diagram relied on sealing numerous Demon Wraiths; they acted as the \"formation eye\" to build the Divine Tao Array, maintaining the stability of the entire realm of Divine Thought within the Demon Refining Diagram.","In other words, finding the formation eye would also reveal the location where the numerous Demon Wraiths are sealed.","He would also find where his \"grand feast\" was hidden...","\"Demon Refining Diagram, formation eye...\"","Mo Hua followed the route etched in his memory, heading into the depths of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","He was going to find the Demon Refining Diagram within the nightmare.","Just like this, after passing the Demon Refining Pot, Alchemy Room, and some Evil Path structures, Mo Hua suddenly realized that the surrounding terrain had changed.","The path ahead suddenly became chaotic.","He found himself a bit lost.","Instead of being upset, Mo Hua was rather delighted.","In theory, the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons within the Demon Refining Diagram and the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons outside should correspond one-to-one.","While the layout was similar and details might vary, the overall structure would definitely be the same.","Yet, the mountain path before him seemed to be artificially altered, tampering with the structural layout of the Divine Way Array.","Guilty conscience hides things by secretly changing things.","Trying to confuse others’ perception through modification to obscure something.","Mo Hua smiled subtly.","\"Found it...\"","He began to expand his Divine Sense, sensing the flow of telekinesis within the nightmare, and through Calculation, deducing the formation of Formation Patterns within.","Before long, he found the direction.","Seeing the scenery around him differ from his memory, while he puzzled over it, the Sword Bone noticed Mo Hua choosing a direction and moving forward, feeling helpless, he continued to follow.","After navigating through the intricate roads, breaking down several walls along the way, Mo Hua finally arrived in front of a magnificent mural.","This mural was the Demon Refining Diagram depicted in the painting.","However, the mural was empty.","There was nothing on it.","Mo Hua gazed at the mural for a moment, his eyes gleaming slightly, then clenched his fist and punched out, his fist enveloped in a layer of Golden Light, with a \"boom,\" it collapsed the entire stone wall.","As a Formation Master, he was supposed to resolve formations.","But pressed for time, he could only \"break\" the formation rudely.","Upon the mural’s collapse, it revealed a long passage behind it.","From the passage beyond, came the low growls of numerous Monster Beasts.","Mo Hua sighed in relief, smiling brilliantly, and stepped briskly onto the unknown passage ahead.","The passage was narrow, pitch-black.","He couldn’t tell how long he walked, but suddenly, the view opened up.","Mo Hua lifted his eyes and took a slight breath of the chilly air.","In front of him was a grand prison of Demon Wraiths!","The grand prison at this moment confined countless ferocious Demon Wraiths densely packed.","They bore intense Evil Thoughts, with blood-red eyes, bound by numerous Divine Chains, imprisoned within \"cells\" of Divine construction, securely sealed.","Upon seeing Mo Hua, thousands of Demon Wraiths lifted their heads.","Their bloodthirsty eyes lit up like blood-colored stars in the night sky.","\"So many Demon Wraiths?!\"","The Sword Bone trembled all over, its head bone numb with fear.","No wonder the Monster cultivators within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons dared not approach the Demon Refining Diagram.","With so many eerie Demon Wraiths, even ten of his kind would be ripped into Bone Fragments, devoured by demons, leaving no remains.","\"L-little ancestor...\"","The Sword Bone’s voice trembled slightly.","It wanted to say, stop playing, let’s head back early."]},{"number":1440,"title":"Chapter 1440 - 788 Fierce God_3","paragraphs":["So many Demon Wraiths, if they riot, no matter how strong your Divine Thought is, you’ll be devoured without a trace of bone left.","But before it finished speaking, it realized that Mo Hua was already gone.","Sword Bone turned its head and nearly had its soul scatter from fright, it discovered that this little ancestor had already charged into the group of Demon Wraiths, doing whatever he pleased.","Mo Hua grabbed the Divine Chains, and with a sharp pull, tore them apart.","The chains bound a Wolf Demon, and seeing its seal broken, it immediately snarled, opening its bloody mouth to bite Mo Hua.","Yet in the next moment, its large head was seized by Mo Hua’s small hand, then violently slammed to the ground, cracking it open.","Mo Hua, with a swift motion, snapped its neck.","The Wolf Demon turned into Evil Thoughts, slowly dissipating.","Mo Hua took a small breath and swallowed it whole.","\"Finally got something to eat...\"","It had been so long that Mo Hua almost forgot what it felt like to replenish Divine Sense by devouring an Evil Spirit.","After devouring the Wolf Demon, Mo Hua licked his lips, savoring briefly, before lining up to kill the next one.","He repeated the process, first breaking the Divine Chains, then twisting the Wraith to death; if twisting it wasn’t enough, he punched it a few more times until its soul scattered before swallowing it.","Just like that, killing one, eating one, freshly killed then freshly eaten.","These Divine Chains were originally meant to \"lock\" these Demon Wraiths, but now they protected them instead.","If not for the Divine Chains, Mo Hua could eat even faster.","The nearby Sword Bone was so shocked that its jawbone nearly fell off.","It thought, after devouring a dozen or so monster cultivators on its journey, that it had already feasted, but never expected this little ancestor to eat even more fiercely than it did!","That tiny belly, seemingly a bottomless pit.","No matter how vast the number of Demon Wraiths, how powerful, how robust, or how fierce they appeared...","This little ancestor just pulled, twisted, killed, and absorbed, then it was over.","\"Eating\" the Demon Wraiths faster than drinking water.","The crowd of Demon Wraiths was both shocked and furious, struggling against the Divine Chains, biting madly, roaring sinisterly at Mo Hua.","In an instant, the entire Demon Wraith dungeon echoed with howling winds and booming demon cries.","Mo Hua seemed oblivious.","The bigger the world, the bigger the meal.","No matter how these Demon Wraiths howled now, they quieted once in his stomach.","Mo Hua continued to eat while killing, but as he ate, his brows furrowed.","\"Too slow...\"","\"Eating them one by one like this, who knows when I’ll be done?\"","\"I need to think of a way...\"","Mo Hua looked up, surveyed the surroundings, and suddenly his eyes lit up, spotting a door on the far central high wall.","This was a door heavily reinforced by the Divine Tao Array.","There was even a carved, enormous black \"ram horn\" skull on the door, appearing solemn and terrifying.","Ram horns again!","Based on Mo Hua’s experience, ram horn skulls were closely related to the Great Wilderness Evil God.","In the Master of the Great Wilderness’ divine system, anything carved with ram horns was no ordinary item.","There had to be something good behind this door!","Moreover, it likely concealed the Formation Pivot structure, which was core to the Demon Refining Diagram.","By controlling the Formation Pivot and unlocking all the seals, he could feast to his heart’s content in one go.","Mo Hua got invigorated, leapt forward, stepping on the heads of various Demon Wraiths like Bear Pi, tiger, and leopard, and dashed forward.","The Demon Wraiths stepped on by Mo Hua could only howl impotently at him.","Soon, Mo Hua reached the ram horn door.","He punched the ram horn door.","The door didn’t budge an inch.","Mo Hua was not surprised; the seal on this door was perhaps the strongest Divine Seal he had encountered along his journey.","Surely it would take some effort.","Mo Hua held his breath; his small fists gathered blinding golden light, then with a crisp shout, his fists rained down on the ram horn door like a storm.","\"Boom boom boom...\"","The condensed Divine Thought Power constantly pounded the door.","Ripples of vibrations transmitted along the door to the walls, causing the entire Demon Wraith dungeon to tremble lightly.","After pounding for a while, Mo Hua paused.","He found there seemed to be activity inside the door, some presence, a breathing of Divine Thought.","\"Someone’s inside this Demon Refining Diagram?\"","Who?","Mo Hua thought.","Ordinary monster cultivators surely had no right to enter this ram horn door.","The managing level monster cultivators had almost all been killed by him.","The only ones left, and qualified to enter the ram horn door...","Were Mr. Tu’s Remnant Soul.","And the legendary \"young master\"?","Mo Hua squinted and smiled.","\"I just want to see what this young master actually looks like...\"","If outside, he likely wouldn’t be a match for this \"young master.\"","Not to mention, this young master was of noble identity, probably surrounded by a host of disciples and Elders for protection.","He would certainly hide as far away as possible.","However, now inside the Demon Refining Diagram’s nightmare, both sides were in a state of Divine Thought; he, having \"Divine Sense Proving the Dao,\" could kill Evil Spirits like slaughtering chickens, not fearing any \"young master.\"","Now this young master, by chance, was trapped inside the door, giving him a rare opportunity.","Once this door was breached, it would be equivalent to tearing down the mystery surrounding this \"young master.\"","\"I wonder if he has a special Eternal Life Rune on him?\"","\"If he does, probably can’t kill him...\"","Mo Hua muttered to himself.","But no matter, even if he couldn’t kill him, at least he could know his appearance.","Mo Hua’s white hand gently clenched, conjuring a golden sword from between his palms. Its shape was ancient, rough, but it was menacingly sharp.","Divine Thought into sword!","Far away, Sword Bone felt this incisive Sword Intent, its already white bones turned even whiter with dread.","And inside the ram horn door.","\"Mr. Tu\" also sensed this Sword Qi, his face changed instantly, yet a trace of clarity arose in his heart.","\"As expected, it’s the Taixu Gate’s... Divine Thought into sword!\"","Everything was orchestrated by Taixu Gate!"]},{"number":1441,"title":"Chapter 1441 - 789 19","paragraphs":["The Taixu Gate used some unknown means to raise a \"fierce god\"!","Using a deity to fight a deity.","They wanted to use this \"fierce god\" to sabotage the Divine Lord’s grand plan.","\"Truly a clever trick!\"","\"The Taixu Gate remains hidden without revealing their strength, yet unexpectedly possesses such profound divine foundation...\"","Mr. Tu sneered inwardly.","As he pondered, the next moment, a fierce golden sword qi suddenly struck the large horned door.","Even though the Divine Lock Array on the door contained the \"devouring\" sealing principle and absorbed part of the power of divine thought, it still couldn’t withstand it.","Several divine lock arrays immediately collapsed.","Mr. Tu’s expression turned sour.","The gentleman beside him also had a face as calm as water.","They were trapped in the hall, and at this moment, a fierce god was breaking in.","They didn’t know the true face of this \"fierce god\".","And once they confronted this fierce god, in an instant, they would be separated by life and death.","Then came the second sword...","\"Mr. Tu...\" The gentleman’s expression was stern.","He advanced with divine thought.","The special Eternal Life Rune was embedded in his flesh.","If he truly died here, all his talents, ambitions, and grand plans would be mere talk.","Mr. Tu’s pupils shrank, and he said coldly:","\"Unleash the divine arrays and release all the demon wraiths from the great prison to devour this ’fierce god’...\"","The gentleman frowned and said: \"Once the seal is broken and the demon wraiths are released, chaos will ensue in the Demon Refining Diagram, and the divine foundations here will be utterly destroyed.\"","These demon wraiths were refined from monster sensing into demon wraiths using the Demon Refining Pot and sealed with a divine seal.","The demon wraiths are ferocious, greedy, and murderous.","On usual occasions, only a small batch is daringly released.","If they were all released, the demon wraiths would go out of control, and no one would have the ability to reseal them.","As a result, the true \"Valley of Ten Thousand Demons\" would be utterly destroyed.","\"There’s no room for such considerations now...\" Mr. Tu said.","\"Can these demon wraiths really devour the ’fierce god’ outside?\" The gentleman’s eyes narrowed slightly.","Mr. Tu’s expression was solemn.","Generally speaking, even a fierce tiger fears a pack of wolves.","Surrounded by so many demon wraiths, even a true \"deity\" without a way to escape might be completely devoured.","But now, what was hovering outside was a \"fierce god\".","This fierce god was enshrouded in layers of mist, everything about it was unknown, its appearance, its level, its specific origins, and the divine skills it possessed...","Mr. Tu slowly said: \"Not necessarily... even if this ’fierce god’ cannot be devoured, at least it can be stalled, buying time, and that’s enough.\"","The gentleman slightly nodded.","The knowledge of the Divine Way naturally should be based on Mr. Tu’s judgment.","Mr. Tu made this decision, but for some reason, his heart suddenly sank.","He had a vague foreboding sensation.","He even felt, in some mysterious way, that even if he were to die, he shouldn’t break the seal of these demon wraiths, or it would definitely result in a great disaster.","But there was no other way at this time, the divine bridge had not broken, and the path to the Divine Land is here.","This is a top-secret that absolutely cannot be leaked.","And the noise of door breaking came one after another.","The divine lock arrays on the door broke one by one...","Mr. Tu didn’t have time to think carefully, gritting his teeth, he said:","\"Release the demon wraiths!\"","The gentleman’s expression intensified, and he nodded.","He took out a divine bone and used it to control the formation pivot, unlocking the divine arrays within the great prison, and thoroughly releasing thousands upon thousands of demon wraiths...","...","Outside the large door, Mo Hua wielded a golden sword, slashing vigorously, but suddenly felt a gust of demonic wind behind him.","He turned to look.","Within the great prison, a gigantic \"hum\" buzzed suddenly, abundant thought energy circulated, and then the formation patterns of the divine way shattered one by one.","One after another, the chains of the seal were lifted.","Inside the great prison, each demon wraith broke free from its shackles.","They stood up slowly, each with bizarre shapes, emanating monstrous qi, eyes scarlet, staring intently at Mo Hua.","The surrounding demonic aura grew increasingly intense.","In the corner, the sword bone trembled uncontrollably.","Mo Hua, however, paused, his expression peculiar.","\"Afraid of me going in, so you release demon wraiths to block me?\"","\"So many...\"","Mo Hua stopped what he was doing, no longer hacking at the door, but looked at the densely packed evil spirits like a surging black cloud, looked into those bloodthirsty eyes almost ready to devour people, and a bright smile suddenly appeared on his small face.","\"How very considerate.\"","\"Then I won’t be polite...\"","As soon as the words fell, countless demon wraiths surged towards Mo Hua like a tide.","Mo Hua spread his arms, with golden light contained in his eyes, and at the same time, Heavenly secret Calculation and Tricky Calculation churned simultaneously.","Three black shadows, like a mysterious Taoist robe, adorned Mo Hua’s body.","Mo Hua resembled a god, draped in a \"demon robe\".","His divine thought circulated rapidly, spreading around.","At the same time, the computational power of divine thought was rapidly consuming.","In an instant, a mottled light flickered on the ground.","Like lotus blossoming, series of dazzling formation patterns centered on Mo Hua spread outward layer by layer.","Li Mountain Fire Cremation Compound Formation!","In an instant, the formation exploded.","Within the formation’s range, some weak demon wraiths were immediately obliterated.","The remaining few strong, tiger-leopard-like demon wraiths were also significantly injured.","Mo Hua swiftly \"finished off\" with a profound and swift fireball technique.","In no time, many demon wraiths were dead or injured.","The surrounding fell into silence, the remaining demon wraiths all showed fear and dared not advance, but in the next moment, their gazes suddenly turned scarlet.","Slain demon wraiths, with evil thoughts spilling everywhere, provoked the ferocity in these demon wraiths."]},{"number":1442,"title":"Chapter 1442 - 789 19_2","paragraphs":["They became even more reckless, rushing towards Mo Hua to kill.","The Demon Wraiths arrived like tides again.","Mo Hua used the same technique as before, first using the Formation to kill on a large scale, then using the Fireball Technique to kill individually, thus killing yet another wave.","Afterward, Demon Wraiths continued to rush forward.","But Mo Hua noticed that his Divine Thought seemed to be somewhat lacking.","After all, employing Heavenly secret and counteracting the Formation in such a large range consumes an enormous amount of Divine Thought Power.","Mo Hua had no choice but to temporarily consume a few bites to replenish Divine Thought before killing again.","This temporarily consumed Divine Thought, without refining, contained the Evil Thoughts of the Demon Wraiths, and directly absorbing it would gradually pollute the cultivator’s Divine Thought over time.","However, Mo Hua’s Divine Thought was special, and he was accustomed to Evil Thought invading his mind due to his extensive battle experiences, so the temporary impact wasn’t significant.","Another wave was killed, and the surrounding Evil Qi grew stronger.","The brutality of the Demon Wraiths intensified.","Mo Hua felt it was about time, so he set up the Li Mountain Fire Cremation Formation again to \"clear\" the group of Demon Wraiths around him. Then, taking advantage of the gap when the old demons were dead and the new ones hadn’t yet arrived, his eyes flashed with Golden Light. Utilizing his understanding of the Heavenly Dao Seal, he operated his Divine Thought, manifesting several purer golden formations a few feet around him.","Divine Lock Array!","This is the core formation of the Great Wilderness lineage, a Divine Formation heritage.","It can seal the Demon Wraiths and even use the \"devouring\" of their Evil Power to form a Telekinesis cycle, maintaining the stability of its own Formation.","The Divine Lock Array encompassed Mo Hua like a golden cage.","Mo Hua \"sealed\" himself with this and also \"protected\" himself with it.","As expected, the Demon Wraiths rushing over were blocked outside the \"Divine Lock Array,\" unable to get near Mo Hua for the time being.","They bared their teeth and clawed, continuously tearing at the Divine Formation Patterns.","In the Divine Formation Patterns, the \"Sealing\" Principle understood by Mo Hua was infiltrated. While these Demon Wraiths attacked, a part of the Evil Power was also devoured and converted into the power of the Formation.","However, the \"Sealing\" Principle that Mo Hua comprehended was still quite rudimentary.","Although the Divine Formation blocked these Demon Wraiths, it still darkened and deteriorated bit by bit, only buying Mo Hua some time.","But the time gained was enough.","Mo Hua had long planned this in his mind.","Individually, Demon Wraiths might not be very strong, but when gathered in the thousands, they were not to be underestimated.","His slender arms and legs couldn’t withstand their attrition.","Therefore, in group battles, it was crucial to prepare room for him to \"breathe.\"","In this way, he would kill while \"eating.\"","After eating to replenish Telekinesis, he would continue to kill.","Just like the \"Sealing\" Principle contained in the Divine Formation, which converts devoured Evil Power for personal use.","Fighting to sustain fighting, eating to sustain killing, in a continuous cycle.","In this way, he wasn’t afraid of being \"exhausted.\"","And the \"Divine Lock Array\" for sealing was just right to buy himself room to breathe.","Of course, other defensive formations could be used, but none were as powerful as this Divine Formation like the Divine Lock Array.","This was a method that Mo Hua had been pondering in his heart since he learned the Divine Formation to cope with \"Demon Wraith group attacks\" and avoid being \"exhausted to death.\"","The nearby Demon Wraiths were sealed by the Divine Lock Array.","The distant Demon Wraiths, unable to charge through, trampled on each other, even tearing and devouring each other.","The scene instantly became chaotic.","Relying on the shelter of the Divine Lock Array, Mo Hua sat calmly amid the raging \"Demon Tide,\" beginning to sit cross-legged in meditation, taking advantage of this time to absorb the Telekinesis of the Demon Wraiths.","Once refined, the Telekinesis was integrated into him to replenish his Divine Thought.","The remaining few bloodthirsty desires would gradually corrode his Taoist Heart, temporarily suppressed by Mo Hua deep in his heart, to be gradually refined and discarded later through meditation.","Many Demon Wraiths had perished.","The vast Telekinesis converged into Mo Hua’s Divine Thought body.","Not only did it replenish the Divine Thought just consumed, but it also slightly enhanced Mo Hua’s Divine Sense.","But unexpectedly, the slight enhancement of Divine Sense disappeared in an instant.","Mo Hua closed his eyes and could perceive a void fissure streaking across his Sea of Consciousness.","In the fissure, the Law flowed, swallowing all of Mo Hua’s increased Divine Sense.","\"Divine Thought leaves the body, and the Heavenly Dao Seal is still present...\"","\"In other words, even if the Divine Thought leaves the body, it still maintains a certain connection with one’s Sea of Consciousness, not completely isolated.\"","Mo Hua thought silently in his heart.","In this way, unless he truly feeds this \"Heavenly Dao Laws,\" it would be impossible to resolve the \"Seal\" of the Heavenly Dao.","\"Not leaving any loopholes at all...\"","But it didn’t matter either.","Mo Hua opened his eyes and looked at the grand and drooling Demon Wraiths with fierce claws and teeth ahead.","\"With so many Demon Wraiths, I refuse to believe I can’t feed you!\"","As long as he fed this Heavenly Dao Seal, breaking the constraints of the Heavenly Dao, his Divine Sense would surge forward like a dragon into the sea, advancing further towards the Foundation Establishment Late Stage of Divine Thought Realm!","Mo Hua’s gaze was sharp, and once his Divine Thought was abundant, with a wave of his hand, he unlocked the seal of the Divine Lock Array.","Without the restrictions of the Divine Tao Array, the surrounding Demon Wraiths roared and rushed towards Mo Hua.","Unyielding, Mo Hua stood still with deep-set eyes.","The Separation Mountain Cremation Formation appeared once more, incinerating all the nearby Demon Wraiths.","The remaining few Demon Wraiths were also killed one by one by Mo Hua.","After that, like waves of the sea, another wave of Demon Wraiths attacked...","Then another wave...","Mo Hua continued like this, killing each wave as they came.","After a while, Mo Hua felt his Divine Thought a bit exhausted, so he set up the Divine Formation, rested for a while, ate a wave of Demon Wraiths, and replenished his Telekinesis.","After replenishing Divine Thought, the excess Telekinesis was refined and absorbed by Mo Hua, used to enhance his Divine Sense."]},{"number":1443,"title":"Chapter 1443 - 789 19_3","paragraphs":["In just a moment, these enhanced divine thoughts would be \"devoured\" by the laws of the Heavenly Dao seal.","Mo Hua kills more, consumes more.","The Heavenly Dao’s sealing laws swallow more.","Mo Hua was initially anxious, wanting to quickly feed this seal to break through the limitations, but as he fed, he suddenly paused.","Mo Hua found that each time he \"fed\" the Heavenly Dao seal,","the \"laws\" within the seal would circulate once.","The more he fed, the more frequent the display of laws.","Mo Hua suddenly realized...","This is the direct presentation of the Heavenly Dao Laws!","Also, it’s an intuitive display of the core laws of the Divine Tao Array!","In other words, this is a rare opportunity, even a great fortune that countless formation masters dream of!","To frequently and intuitively feel the circulation of the Great Dao Laws and comprehend the intricacies of the Divine Tao Array.","Mo Hua was suddenly enlightened like a baptism of wisdom and realized.","\"Such a great opportunity, I almost missed it...\"","\"Luckily, I’m clever!\"","Mo Hua couldn’t help but nod.","Comprehending this sealing principle might mean more to him than a simple divine sense breakthrough...","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, and he quieted his mind, refining evil thoughts while \"feeding\" these telekinetic powers to this \"seal,\" letting it eat slowly, circulate slowly.","Meanwhile, Mo Hua seizes the chance to engrave the images into his mind during the transformation between void and reality when the laws are circulating.","Deeply imprint this comprehension of the Great Dao Laws at heart.","Unknowingly, also integrating the comprehended laws more deeply into the Divine Tao Array he laid down.","The effect was immediate.","After fusing the comprehended laws into the Divine Tao Array, Mo Hua suddenly noticed that while the \"Divine Lock Array\" he laid seemed unchanged, its \"resilience\" became more robust.","The number of hits it could endure from demon wraith impacts increased.","This means if this \"Divine Lock Array\" were used to seal evil objects, it would become increasingly unbreakable.","Of course, for now, it would still break.","After enduring nearly a hundred impacts from nearby demon wraiths, the Divine Lock Array shattered again.","Yet the formation’s effectiveness was significantly enhanced.","Then, the demon wraiths rushed towards him again...","Mo Hua began to kill once more.","Though monotonous and seemingly dangerous, Mo Hua gradually found joy in it.","The more demon wraiths he killed, the stronger the devoured evil thoughts.","The telekinetic powers fed to the Heavenly Dao seal continued endlessly, and the power of laws he comprehended gradually deepened.","And so, as time passed...","The void fissure in Mo Hua’s sea of consciousness became shallower, like a torn wound in divine sense, slowly healing.","The \"sealing\" power in the sea of consciousness was gradually weakening.","While Mo Hua’s control over the sealing laws grew stronger.","Ultimately, the fissure disappeared completely.","The \"seal\" in the sea of consciousness was utterly erased.","At that moment, Mo Hua felt his divine sense suddenly become unblocked.","A chasm once blocking his sea of consciousness was completely filled in, disappearing without a trace!","He could sense his divine sense was growing again!","Telekinetic powers flowed into his sea of consciousness, nourishing his divine sense, slowly \"reviving,\" and the realm that had been sealed for ages finally began to loosen.","In an instant, the sea of consciousness quaked.","The bottleneck, just a step away from eighteen patterns, was burst through instantly.","Mo Hua’s expression was jubilant, his eyes shining like stars.","Finally, eighteen patterns of divine sense!","Yet it didn’t stop there!","After the Heavenly Dao seal was \"fed\" and utterly annihilated, the unending stream of telekinetic powers finally benefited Mo Hua himself.","His divine sense realm continued to climb...","From afar, the sword bone was left stunned.","This little ancestor... still growing stronger?!","Meanwhile, outside the nightmare, near the Demon Refining Diagram.","Xun Zixian, who was vigilantly protecting Mo Hua, suddenly paused, turning his gaze upon Mo Hua with a peculiar expression.","Xun Ziyou noticed the anomaly, his expression stiffening as he asked:","\"What happened?\"","Xun Zixian was silent for a moment before saying, somewhat incredulously:","\"Mo Hua’s divine sense... seems to have grown stronger?\"","\"Divine sense growing stronger?\" Xun Ziyou was puzzled, glancing at Mo Hua, questioning, \"How did it grow stronger? He didn’t break through his realm, did he? How can divine sense grow stronger in such a short time?\"","After all, divine sense differs from cultivation.","A cultivator’s cultivation can suddenly become stronger.","But divine sense, without any cultivation technique, grows exceedingly slowly, only suddenly diminishing, never suddenly growing stronger.","However, he was no formation master, didn’t study the ways of divine thought, so changes like this weren’t particularly apparent to him, certainly not as much as Xun Zixian, a third-grade formation master.","Xun Ziyou scrutinized Mo Hua again, nodding slowly, \"It seems... it has grown a bit stronger.\"","Xun Zixian suddenly shook his head, \"No.\"","Xun Ziyou was confused, \"Not what?\"","\"It’s not ’a bit’ stronger,\" Xun Zixian said solemnly, \"it’s grown a lot stronger, perhaps even...\"","\"Possibly it’s a breakthrough...\" Xun Zixian uttered deeply.","Xun Ziyou was stunned, his mouth agape.","\"...A breakthrough?\"","Divine sense breakthrough?","Xun Zixian’s eyelids twitched, his mind equally incredulous.","He was about to say something when he was startled again, gazing at Mo Hua with an expression he couldn’t hide any longer: shock.","This is...","Another breakthrough?","In such a short span, two breakthroughs in divine sense?!","Always composed, Xun Zixian was shaken, murmuring:","\"This... how is it possible...\"","This child, just how strong had his divine sense become...","...","Inside the Demon Refining Diagram.","Mo Hua opened his eyes, and in that instant, his gaze was radiant and complex, containing flowing stars, vanishing golden light, fluctuating heavenly secrets, and shifting Gui Tao.","His aura had become deeper.","An even greater power was his divine thought.","\"Nineteen patterns!\"","Mo Hua’s little divine thought form seemed to contain rivers of vast telekinetic power.","All around him lay in ruin.","Tens of thousands of demon wraiths had been killed, leaving scarcely any left.","Similarly, he’d \"eaten\" them until scarcely any were left.","By devouring countless demon wraiths in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, Mo Hua fed the Heavenly Dao seal, and beyond that, his divine sense soared.","Breaking through two realms in succession, advancing to nineteen patterns!","He had just entered the Foundation Establishment Middle Stage not long ago but already possessed the divine sense of a Foundation Establishment Late Stage cultivator, even a Foundation Establishment Peak cultivator.","Nineteen patterns of divine sense!","Only one pattern shy of the Golden Core Realm’s twenty patterns!"]},{"number":1444,"title":"Chapter 1444 - 790: Run Quickly","paragraphs":["Inside the prison, the Demon Wraiths were almost entirely slaughtered.","Mo Hua, at the Divine Sense Realm of Nineteen Patterns, had eyes blazing with light, his Divine Thought more refined, and his aura increasingly powerful.","No one, no Evil Spirit here, could stop him anymore.","He turned his head to look at the horned door.","Beyond the door, layers of Divine Seal still obstructed the way.","These Divine Tao Arrays, in Mo Hua’s eyes before, seemed tight enough.","But now, having swallowed countless Demon Wraiths, broken through the \"Seal\" of the Heavenly Dao, and digested the Law of the \"Seal\" of the Heavenly Dao, his understanding of the Divine Tao Array deepened further.","Looking at it now, he could vaguely sense the faint rules circulating between the Formation Patterns on the horned door.","Yet the Law of \"Seal\" on the door now seemed shallow to Mo Hua, full of \"flaws.\"","He raised his palm, condensed a Golden Sword in his hand, and struck down.","Although it seemed like an ordinary sword strike, it encompassed an understanding of the operation of laws within the Divine Tao Array, akin to a \"butcher dissecting an ox,\" avoiding the sturdy parts and striking the weak spots.","With just one sword, he pierced through the Formation Patterns, piercing the door.","Inside, Mr. Tu’s pupils suddenly contracted.","The Evil Qi outside the door faded...","The Fierce God was still breaching the door.","\"So many Demon Wraiths... all slaughtered?\"","This Fierce God, how terrifying it was?!","Despite already having some expectations, Mr. Tu still found it hard to believe.","What \"kind\" of Fierce God possessed such horrifying power, fearless of Demon Wraiths’ clutches, unafraid of Telekinesis depletion, slaughtering thousands of Demon Wraiths in such a short time?","Mr. Tu’s face turned somber, he turned to the empty fresco on the other side, slightly relieved.","\"The Divine Bridge is broken, the path to Divine Land is blocked.\"","\"This Fierce God, regardless of how terrifying, stops here, it can’t covet the Divine Lord’s homeland...\"","Mr. Tu glanced again at the pale young master beside him, solemnly said:","\"Young Master, go quickly.\"","The Young Master wanted to say something.","Suddenly, there was a \"pfft.\"","The horned door was pierced again, several Arrays shattered, revealing a portion of the golden sword tip.","This sword was crafted from Divine Thought, ancient and simple.","Yet it bore an astonishing aura of Divine Thought Slaughter.","Mr. Tu changed color, hurriedly said:","\"Go quickly! If you don’t, it’ll be too late!\"","\"The Fierce God is coming in!\"","The Young Master said: \"Then you, sir...\"","Mr. Tu said: \"I abandon this Remnant Soul to cover your retreat, otherwise none of us will escape...\"","With that said, several more holes were punched through the horned door, the Sword Qi chilling.","The Divine Tao Arrays on the door were almost gone.","The dreadful figure of the \"Fierce God\" outside the door started to become apparent.","The Young Master gritted his teeth:","\"Alright, thank you, sir!\"","He promptly took out a piece of Divine Bone, spilled the Blood of Divine Thought on the bone, and then used the virtual sensing of the Divine Bone to slowly escape the \"nightmare\" in the Demon Refining Diagram.","His figure started to disappear bit by bit.","The \"Fierce God\" outside seemed to sense something, and after a brief hesitation, refined stronger Sword Qi, accelerating the breach.","The horned relief on the door was hacked into mottled fragments.","The entire Gate of Divine Path, once the most unbreakable \"Seal,\" was now chopped like paper, leaking air everywhere.","Within a few breaths, the Gate of Divine Path, completely shattered.","A figure bearing dazzling Golden Light, was about to step inside.","\"Oh no!\"","Watching, the Young Master’s Divine Thought hadn’t completely escaped yet.","With only a Remnant Soul, Mr. Tu flipped his eyes upward, his eyes turning into deep red bloody cavities, revealing numbness and ferocity.","This was an Evil Path Secret Technique.","He extinguished his reason, pushing evil to the extreme.","On Mr. Tu’s head grew two black, filthy, broken horns, and the flesh of his Divine Thought began to twist, becoming grotesque and hideous.","Within moments, he transformed into a \"Horned Evil Demon.\"","Meanwhile, his Evil Qi climbed to the peak.","Before Mo Hua could enter, Mr. Tu transformed into an Evil Demon, charged towards Mo Hua with a gust of foul wind and intense Evil Thoughts.","But before he got close, his body suddenly stiffened, standing frozen.","Moments later, a streak of Golden Light appeared on his forehead.","A Golden Sword directly pierced Mr. Tu’s forehead, and then the Sword Qi spread outwards, dismembering Mr. Tu’s flesh into pieces.","\"No wonder... Fierce God...\"","\"With this Remnant Soul’s power, truly invincible.\"","\"The Divine Way, indeed grand and unfathomable...\"","Mr. Tu’s face was cut into pieces by the Sword Qi, his pitch-black pupils, blood gradually dissipating, madness fading, reason returning momentarily, somewhat restored.","He exerted all his might to look at the \"Fierce God.\"","He wanted to see the face of this \"Fierce God.\"","Wanted to see what the \"enemy\" of the Divine Lord looked like.","But his vision was blood-red, and all he saw was Golden Light, he couldn’t see the face of the Fierce God who pierced his head with one sword and killed him.","He could only see, amidst the blood and gold, a \"small\" figure, and a pair of cold and authoritative eyes.","This was a \"young\" Fierce God.","Seemingly just hatched from a Divine Fetus not long ago.","Yet his eyes already possessed divine majesty, indifference to all beings, and even more...","Vaguely, Mr. Tu also saw in those eyes, bizarre patterns alternating black and white."]},{"number":1445,"title":"Chapter 1445 - 790: Escape Quickly_2","paragraphs":["\"Died by the hands of a ’deity’.\"","\"Died at the hands of the Divine Lord’s formidable enemy.\"","\"Died for the great cause of the Divine Lord!\"","\"This remnant soul, died where it belonged...\"","Mr. Tu devoutly thought in his heart, and then his divine soul was completely shredded by the golden light, dissipating into nothingness.","Meanwhile, the figure of the young master was also gradually fading away, and before completely breaking free from the nightmare and his divine thought completely dispersing, he saw the figure of this ’Fierce God’ who killed Mr. Tu with a single sword.","Enveloped in golden light, it appeared like a child, yet possessed a deity-like commanding presence and a chilling indifference.","It made him feel so insignificant.","He even felt an inexplicable fear rising in his heart.","He only took one glance, and only dared to take that one glance, then hurriedly used the short time bought by Mr. Tu’s remnant soul with his life to escape from the nightmare.","He feared that with one more glance, he would be doomed at the hands of this terrifying fierce god.","...","Within the grand hall of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","The young master, who was sitting in meditation with eyes closed, suddenly opened wide his eyes, his hands trembling uncontrollably, gasping heavily.","His back was completely soaked with cold sweat.","As if having experienced a \"nightmare.\"","However, his eyes were full of ice-coldness and resentment.","\"For the first time in this life, I am so disgracefully defeated...\"","He firmly remembered the outline of that divine child in his heart, his gaze cold:","\"This kind of humiliation, I will never forget...\"","...","At the moment when the remnant soul was annihilated, within the Qian Learning State Boundary, inside the Qian Taoist Sect, an elder who was teaching disciples suddenly turned pale, feeling a sharp pain in his head.","It felt as if a wisp of soul was forcibly torn from his body.","His facial skin was slightly twisted, nearly losing its original form.","\"Elder Shen\" quickly covered his face with his sleeve, bowing his body as he couldn’t stop coughing, almost coughing up blood.","The disciples below were taken aback, looking at each other in confusion, not knowing what had happened.","One concerned disciple asked:","\"Elder, are you okay?\"","\"Elder Shen\" coughed a few more times, smoothing the skin on his face, then slowly raised his head.","His appearance was terrifyingly pale, like the skin of a dead man.","The entire person looked exceptionally haggard.","The disciples below were startled as they watched.","\"Elder, you...\"","\"Elder Shen\" quickly thought, his expression filled with bitterness, sighed, and slowly said:","\"Recently acquired an ancient scroll of formations, extremely profound and obscure. I exhausted myself in vain without sleeping, trying to comprehend it, unknowingly overextending my divine sense and depleting my vital energy.\"","After Elder Shen finished speaking, he glanced at the seated disciples, admonishing them earnestly:","\"...You should also take warning, when learning formations you must do so within your means, do not force comprehension if your divine sense is insufficient, do not be hasty, proceed gradually and methodically...\"","\"If you are reckless and push forward aggressively, you will end up like me...\"","Elder Shen coughed a few more times, his face turning even paler, \"...with divine sense damaged and the foundation harmed.\"","The disciples were deeply moved, bowing their heads in salutation:","\"Thank you, Elder, for your guidance; the disciples will surely remember.\"","\"Elder Shen\" nodded in satisfaction, \"Good, let us continue with the lesson...\"","\"Yes.\"","Elder Shen spread open the dossier, comparing it with the formation diagram on the array plate, explaining formations to the gathered disciples, his expression gradually returning to normal.","But in his heart, he was not at ease at all.","\"My wisp of a remnant soul... unexpectedly perished?\"","\"What exactly happened within the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons...\"","\"Who obliterated my remnant soul?\"","Elder Shen couldn’t help but slightly narrow his pupils, feeling a chill in his heart.","...","In the Demon Refining Diagram.","Mo Hua, radiant in golden light, swiftly erased a blood-red evil demon at lightning speed, and when he turned his head to look at another figure, it was already too late.","In a fleeting moment, he only caught a glimpse of a noble and elegant young master’s figure.","But before he could look closely at the specific features, it gradually blurred and completely vanished, its whereabouts unknown.","\"Such a pity...\"","Mo Hua gently sighed.","This blood-red evil demon suddenly charged with a fierce presence.","Momentarily caught off guard, he hadn’t thought of holding back, killing it with a single sword strike through its brain, leaving no survivors.","Thinking back now, it should have been that \"Mr. Tu.\"","And as for that \"young master,\" he also couldn’t capture him, allowing him to escape, and he hadn’t even seen his face clearly.","\"The plan was so meticulous, actions so clandestine, indeed not easy to capture...\"","Mo Hua lamented inwardly.","\"If they escaped, they escaped; there should be another opportunity later...\"","Mo Hua calmed his mind, turning around, looking around the surroundings, finding it empty and unremarkable, a puzzled feeling arose in his heart:","\"Mr. Tu and this young master, what exactly were they doing hiding behind this lamb horns gate?\"","They made it so secretive, it must be something significant.","Even if it means dying, they must complete it.","Mo Hua slightly frowned, scrutinizing the surroundings once again, suddenly making a light \"huh\" sound.","He discovered a small blank mural.","This mural, unlike the outside Demon Refining Diagram, was only person-high, completely bare, with nothing on it.","Mo Hua almost overlooked it, mistaking it for a regular \"stone wall.\"","Mo Hua released his divine sense, carefully sensing it, feeling a tremor in his mind.","\"There’s a... very peculiar aura...\"","Peaceful, tranquil, rich, sweet...","It seemed like a kind of aura close to the origin of a deity, making the divinity within Mo Hua’s divine thought arise with a longing restlessness.","\"What is this?\"","Mr. Tu and his accomplice, hiding here clandestinely, was to erase traces of this thing, not letting others...","Or was it, to not let himself discover it?","Mo Hua felt somewhat puzzled, and more curious."]},{"number":1446,"title":"Chapter 1446 - 790: Escape Quickly_3","paragraphs":["He really wanted to know what was hidden in this empty wall mural before, to have such \"rich and sweet\" divine essence.","Mo Hua inspected the wall mural inch by inch again.","He even used Divine Sense to carefully \"scan\" the other things in the temple.","Yet, still found nothing.","\"Pretty clean work...\"","Mo Hua shook his head, seeing that there were no more clues around, he could only sigh inwardly:","\"Forget it, it’s getting late, let’s head back first.\"","\"Anyway, I’ll be dealing with the Great Wilderness Evil God in the future, when there are clues, I’ll unravel them slowly.\"","\"Moreover, this time the demon wraiths ate too much, if I don’t return early to meditate and eliminate distractions, there will be issues with my Taoist Heart...\"","Mo Hua nodded slightly.","The air still carried the remnants of Mr. Tu’s Demon Thought after his death.","Mo Hua, somewhat disdainful of these demon thoughts, naturally wouldn’t consume them.","He formed a few strands of Sword Qi to eradicate the remaining demon thoughts completely, eliminating all future troubles, and then left the hall.","After leaving, Mo Hua found the Sword Bone hiding in a corner, \"minding its own business.\"","Since the demon wraiths surged forth, the Sword Bone had been \"playing dead\" here.","Of course, Mo Hua never expected it to help him.","Amidst the demon wraith rebellion in the great prison, it was fortunate enough to survive.","\"Let’s go back...\" Mo Hua said.","\"Yes, yes...\" The Sword Bone nodded repeatedly.","Its waist, reduced to just bones, bent even more.","Seeing countless waves of demon wraiths in the great prison, completely subdued and devoured by Mo Hua,","the Sword Bone was as silent as a cicada in winter, not daring to raise its head to look at Mo Hua.","Since becoming a Sword Demon, it had never seen a deity.","But thinking a \"deity\" was no more than this.","Thinking about the powerful Divine Thought of this little ancestor before me, comparable to a deity, the Sword Bone couldn’t help but bend its waist even lower.","All the way back, the little Mo Hua walked tall, while the tall Sword Demon bowed low.","Thus, one man and one demon returned the way they came, leaving the Demon Refining Diagram, back to the Blood Pool of the Sword Bone.","In the Blood Pool, Ling Huxiao and the other two were still unconscious.","Mo Hua checked their condition and found nothing unusual, then said to the Sword Bone:","\"Let me out first, then when I tell you to let someone out, do it. If you dare to play tricks...\"","The Sword Bone hurriedly said:","\"I wouldn’t dare, wouldn’t dare...\"","How could it dare to play tricks now?","Is that playing tricks? That’s playing with its own little life.","Mo Hua nodded in satisfaction, then reached out his small hand, saying to the Sword Bone: \"I’m going out.\"","The Sword Bone trembled instinctively at Mo Hua’s small hand, as the broken rib it cracked with these hands throbbed again.","But it managed to control itself.","The Sword Bone reverted to its true form, becoming a bone sword.","This bone sword was the key to entering and exiting the Blood Pool.","Mo Hua grasped the bone sword, focused his mind, and then blood mist spread, the scenery before him changed, when he opened his eyes again, he found himself inside the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","Right in front of him was the Demon Refining Diagram, like a wall mural.","And in his hand, he still held a White Bone Broken Sword, which was inserted on the wall mural.","At the moment Mo Hua opened his eyes, the three Golden Core Elders, Xun Ziyou and the others, sensed it.","Xun Ziyou and Xun Zixian both breathed a sigh of relief, their expressions slightly joyful.","Only Elder Shangguan Xuanjian of the Rushing Void Sect had a nervous look, his tone betraying a trace of hope, but mixed with a touch of despair:","\"Mo Hua, Xiaoer, he...\"","Mo Hua smiled brightly, saying: \"No worries, I brought him back.\"","Seeing this, Shangguan Xuanjian felt, for a moment, that there was no face more handsome than Mo Hua’s in this world.","Even a heavenly immortal’s smile was not as attractive as Mo Hua’s smile right now.","Shangguan Xuanjian deeply sighed in relief, like someone who had been drowning for a long time, finally struggled ashore after great effort, feeling both \"exhausted\" and \"liberated.\"","\"Xiaoer, he’s...\"","Shangguan Xuanjian glanced at Ling Huxiao, still unconscious, pale-faced and bloodless, his expression still worried.","Mo Hua said: \"Wait a moment.\"","He pulled out the White Bone Broken Sword and walked to Ling Huxiao, placing the bone sword on Ling Huxiao’s forehead, whispering:","\"Sword Bone, release them.\"","The Sword Bone inside dared not slack off in the least.","After a while, Mo Hua sensed a trace of Divine Soul aura on Ling Huxiao, some color returning to his face, and faint breathing at his mouth and nose.","Feeling this change, Shangguan Xuanjian couldn’t help but feel delighted.","Afterwards, Mo Hua similarly restored the Divine Souls of Ouyang Mu and Song Jian to their bodies.","Thus, all three were considered rescued.","However, they had been \"sacrificed\" into the diagram, their Divine Souls forced out of their bodies, now with the souls returned, they needed time to adjust and rest before waking up.","Shangguan Xuanjian clasped his fists towards Mo Hua:","\"Little brother, there’s no need for thanks for this great favor. If you ever need anything in the future, as long as it doesn’t violate the cultivator’s code, I will give my utmost effort!\"","Rescuing Ling Huxiao, this Sword Dao genius, in a sense, also saves the future of the Rushing Void Sect.","Mo Hua waved his hand saying: \"Elder Shangguan is too polite, I only did a trivial ’little thing’.\"","A trivial little thing...","The three elders, Xun Ziyou and the others, heard this and their expressions were a bit subtle.","Concerning the path of Divine Thought, this \"trivial little thing,\" at least for them, these three late-stage Golden Core Elders, wasn’t something they could do...","Xun Ziyou couldn’t help but pat Mo Hua on the shoulder, gritting his teeth saying:","\"Alright, a person should know humility, but excessive humility is arrogance.\"","\"Elder Shangguan is distinguished and reputable, he means what he says, if he tells you to seek him out when needed, don’t be too polite.\"","The subtext being, accept it quickly, lest they regret it.","A promise from a late-stage Golden Core Elder is something others would dream of but have no chance to get.","Mo Hua understood and returned the courtesy immediately, smiling:","\"Thank you, Elder Shangguan.\"","Shangguan Xuanjian nodded.","Since he said it, naturally there’d be no regret.","Besides, compared to Ling Huxiao’s safety, this promise wasn’t really significant.","\"Alright,\" Xun Ziyou said, \"now that all three children are saved, the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons breached, let’s return, the sect will handle the subsequent matters, you all...\"","But Mo Hua interjected: \"Elder Xun, wait.\"","Xun Ziyou was stunned, \"What’s wrong?\"","Mo Hua pondered briefly, then slowly said in a deep voice:","\"Nearby... there should be another door...\""]},{"number":1447,"title":"Chapter 1447 - 791: Li Valley","paragraphs":["\"Another door?\"","Xun Ziyou was a bit surprised.","\"Yes.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","He stared again at the Demon Refining Diagram in front of him.","In the nightmare constructed by the Demon Refining Diagram, most of the Divine Formation had been rendered useless by him, and the Demon Wraiths had mostly been devoured by him.","Now, the Demon Refining Diagram in reality appeared less sinister, with less of the formation’s mystical essence, like the remnants of formation media.","And the nightmare is a reflection of reality.","The \"nightmare\" in the Demon Refining Diagram was constructed based on the current world’s Valley of Ten Thousand Demons. There would be differences, but the layout was similar.","In the nightmare, the Demon Refining Diagram was a blank wall painting.","Behind the mural, there was another world.","In reality, there should also be something special behind the Demon Refining Diagram...","Mo Hua said to Xun Ziyou:","\"Elder Xun, break through this wall painting.\"","\"Break through?\"","\"Yes!\" Mo Hua nodded, \"There are things inside.\"","Xun Ziyou slightly frowned, pondered for a moment, then nodded, drew his Lifebound Spirit Sword, and with the spiritual power of the Golden Core Realm, unleashed Sword Qi, striking at the mural.","The mural cracked instantly but was deeply layered and impenetrable.","Xun Ziyou struck several more times, Sword Qi seeped into the stone wall, and after a dozen strikes, the mural was finally broken through.","Dust and stone fragments fell with a rustle, smoke and dust rising.","When the smoke and dust cleared, it revealed a narrow passage behind the mural, and beyond the passage, a door painted with the head of a Sheep-Horned Demon Monster.","\"Sheep-horned evil sculpture...\"","Xun Zixian’s face turned pale, and he exchanged a glance with Xun Ziyou.","Mo Hua pretended not to understand and quietly asked:","\"Elder Xun, do you know what the sheep horn signifies?\"","Xun Zixian frowned, slowly shook his head, and said in a deep voice:","\"The sheep horn is a symbol of evil desires. Resentment and jealousy in the world, various evil desires, feed the Evil Spirits that devour Divine Thoughts, corrupting the human heart.\"","\"And the Evil Spirits with sheep horns have ancient origins and are significant.\"","\"But this particular sheep-horned evil sculpture... I have never seen it before, and I do not know precisely what kind of Evil Spirit it symbolizes. I fear I must consult the Ancestor... \"","\"Oh...\" Mo Hua nodded.","After Xun Zixian spoke, he cautioned Mo Hua:","\"In the future, be extremely careful. If you encounter ’sheep horn’ statues or murals, be very wary. Avoid them if possible, don’t get involved if you can help it.\"","\"Elder, rest assured, I will definitely avoid them.\" He promised earnestly.","Xun Zixian breathed a slight sigh of relief.","However, Xun Ziyou’s expression was somewhat grave, \"Shall we go in?\"","Xun Zixian thought for a moment, then slowly said, \"Let’s go in and take a look first.\"","Mo Hua knew that behind this door, there should already be no danger.","The most dangerous things were all within the \"nightmare\" of the Demon Refining Diagram.","These dangerous things were either eaten by him, killed by him, or \"scared\" away by him.","However, the atmosphere had reached this point, so he still acted as if facing a formidable foe.","After all, if he said nothing about the Demon Refining Diagram, Elder Xun and the others wouldn’t know.","Shangguan Xuanjian stayed outside, watching over Ling Huxiao and the others.","The secrets behind the door weren’t critical to him.","Xun Ziyou, wielding his sword, struck open the sheep-horned door.","On the door was painted a Divine Formation, but this kind of formation warded Divine Thoughts and sealed Evil Spirits, naturally unable to block Sword Qi of the Golden Core Realm.","After the door was broken, a sinister green space lay inside.","When Xun Ziyou entered, he immediately saw a large hall.","In the hall, bone lamps were lit, flickering with forest green bone fire.","The decoration around was solemn and evil, with murals on the walls in the same style as the Demon Refining Diagram outside, obviously inherited from the same lineage.","And in the center of the hall, more than a dozen people sat in a row.","In front of each one was a lamp.","However, these lamps were all extinguished.","These dozen people were icy cold, without any breath.","Xun Ziyou and Xun Zixian exchanged glances, their expressions slightly surprised.","All dead?","This hall is sealed; no one broke in. How did they die?","Moreover, there were no wounds on them, seemingly their Divine Souls simply vanished?","The two couldn’t help but look back at Mo Hua.","Xun Ziyou asked, \"Mo Hua, do you know what happened here?\"","Mo Hua shook his head and \"guessed\":","\"Perhaps they did too many bad things and faced retribution, or perhaps they consorted with Evil Spirits, suffered backlash, and had their Divine Sense devoured by Evil Spirits.\"","He didn’t lie.","These people indeed faced retribution.","Their Divine Sense was indeed devoured by the Sword Bone, this Evil Spirit.","Xun Ziyou and Xun Zixian, seeing Mo Hua’s innocent look, didn’t know what to say for a moment and could only sigh.","Xun Zixian then said, \"Let us leave it at that, these people consorted with Evil Spirits and had their Divine Sense eaten by them.\"","This statement effectively \"concluded\" it.","These people died on their own, unrelated to others.","Xun Zixian silently glanced at Mo Hua.","Also unrelated to Mo Hua...","Xun Ziyou understood his meaning and nodded.","Mo Hua glanced silently at the more than a dozen dead monster cultivators, his eyes moved slightly, discovering Jin Gui, Jin Yicai, and Jin Yixuan, these three Sever Gold Sect disciples, shockingly among them, and slightly nodded.","\"Sever Gold Sect can’t escape this now...\"","\"Even if they don’t die, they’ll lose a layer of skin.\"","But he didn’t say this, acting as if it had nothing to do with him.","Anyway, the identities of these people, once the elders investigate, will be found out.","Mo Hua’s gaze shifted away from the more than a dozen dead monster cultivators and looked upward.","Above were luxurious screens, with jade bead curtains.","Behind the screens and bead curtains, a glimpse of a magnificent monster-skin chair could be seen."]},{"number":1448,"title":"Chapter 1448 - 791: Li Valley_2","paragraphs":["Xun Ziyou and Xun Zixian also noticed, their gaze darkened immediately.","Having such a chair here means that behind the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, there’s still a figure of high status working behind the scenes.","The two figures flashed, breaking through the screen and lifting the bead curtain, entered the upper part of the great hall.","The surroundings were empty, with no one around.","At the same time, not a trace was left behind.","Mo Hua’s Divine Thought moved slightly, secretly using a bit of Heavenly secret Calculation, able to see a thread of causality lingering nearby.","These remnants of causality were faint, not yet completely dispersed.","This indicates that someone was here just now.","Soon, Elder Xun Zixian’s gaze focused, looking toward a seemingly ordinary screen in the corner, painted with a beautiful landscape. He slapped his palm, letting Spiritual Power seep through.","The screen was under force, and the formation patterns on it flickered, supporting for only a moment before completely shattering, revealing an entrance.","\"Quick! Go check it out!\"","Xun Zixian said in a deep voice.","Then he was the first to step into the entrance.","Xun Ziyou and Mo Hua followed behind.","But after taking a few steps, they reached a dead end, and everyone looked up in surprise.","In front was a secret chamber, over two zhang in length and breadth.","It clashed with the atmosphere outside in the great hall.","The great hall was gloomy and oppressive, but inside this secret chamber, it was luxurious and elegant, with sandalwood incense burning, feeling more like a young master’s \"study room\" rather than a demon valley’s secret chamber.","However, there wasn’t a single book or Jade Slip inside the study room at this time.","It seemed that, to avoid being tracked, everything had been destroyed cleanly, without leaving a trace.","All that lingered was a faint scent of sandalwood incense.","\"Escaped?\"","Xun Zixian frowned.","Xun Ziyou snorted coldly, \"He escaped really fast.\"","Mo Hua wasn’t surprised.","He guessed that this young master had already escaped long ago.","In the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, the only chance to capture this mysterious young master was in a nightmare, capturing his Divine Soul, using the Divine Lock Array to seal him, making him a \"plaything\" in his grasp.","Once the young master managed to escape from the nightmare, there would be no chance to capture him.","Unless this \"young master\" was a fool.","But that was certainly impossible.","Since he was revered as a \"young master,\" his origins must be notable, with extraordinary talent, intelligence, and skills.","Otherwise, he would never be chosen by the Great Wilderness Evil God, nor feared by so many monster cultivators, earning the admiration of so many sect disciples who have fallen into demonhood.","Even Mr. Tu would destroy his remnant soul to protect him.","The young master’s true origins must be extraordinary.","Of course, to truly capture the \"young master\" in a nightmare, there is one prerequisite:","That in the nightmare, the \"young master’s\" Divine Thought is not protected by the special Eternal Life Rune.","Otherwise, Mo Hua would have no way to deal with him.","But on this matter, Mo Hua was quite uncertain.","After all, he was a loose cultivator, not of a great family’s direct lineage, had no Heaven Void Realm ancestor, and no ancestor willing to implant a special Eternal Life Rune for him.","His understanding of the Eternal Life Rune was very limited indeed.","\"If there’s a chance in the future, I should ask Elder Master Xun about the Eternal Life Rune.\"","\"In case I really face a similar situation in the future, encountering someone with a significant background, one with the special Eternal Life Rune, I’d better be prepared...\"","Mo Hua pondered intently.","Meanwhile, Xun Ziyou and Xun Zixian searched the study room again, still finding nothing.","\"The gecko escaped by severing its tail, really clean...\"","Xun Ziyou shook his head with a cold smile and said in a deep voice, \"Let’s go back first, later we’ll call people from the sect over, dig three feet into the ground, and search inch by inch. I refuse to believe that we can’t find other clues...\"","\"Hmm.\"","Xun Zixian nodded slightly.","But Mo Hua suddenly said, \"No, something’s not right.\"","Xun Ziyou paused for a moment, \"What’s not right?\"","Mo Hua pondered, \"There should be some sort of ’secret passage’...\"","From when he scared away the \"young master\" in the nightmare, to when he left the nightmare, helped Little Wood and the others \"restore their souls,\" to breaking through the mural, entering the great hall, and finding the study room...","These matters altogether took about an hour.","In that hour, if the \"young master\" wanted to escape, he must have left a hidden passage.","This secret passage that could leave the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons and avoid the Golden Core cultivators, led by Elder Xun, who had already entered the valley...","It’s just that Mo Hua didn’t find this secret passage earlier.","\"Secret passage...\"","Xun Zixian’s gaze was stern. He unleashed his Divine Sense to sweep through again, suddenly noticing something, he walked to a wall on the right side of the study room with nothing on it, wielded Spiritual Power, letting a faint white crystalline light flash in his palm, then struck it with a slap.","But the wall didn’t even budge.","Xun Zixian’s expression changed, and immediately said, \"Call people! Summon the other Late-stage Golden Core Elders as well!\"","Xun Ziyou didn’t delay, immediately using Transmission.","Within a few minutes, a few more Taixu Sect Elders walked in.","Most of them Mo Hua knew.","There were also a few who looked unfamiliar to him, probably newly promoted elders.","These elders, however, all knew of Mo Hua.","After all, in the Taixu Sect’s hundreds of years, there were disciples that Ancestor Xun was biased towards, but none to the extent of Mo Hua.","A group of elders came in, all first silently glanced at Mo Hua, and then began to discuss with the two Elder Xun Zixian.","Xun Zixian said, \"There’s a high-grade formation behind this wall.\"","Everyone was taken aback upon hearing this.","Mo Hua was also stunned.","Even Elder Xun, a Third Grade Formation Master, called it a \"high-grade formation\"...","An elder asked, \"What grade?\"","Xun Zixian shook his head, \"It’s hard to say.\"","\"What do we do now? Break the formation?\"","\"Can’t break it.\"","\"Then... break the formation?\"","\"Can’t break it... This formation is very strong, and the disturbance would be too great. If forcibly broken, the outcome is unpredictable.\" Xun Zixian said."]},{"number":1449,"title":"Chapter 1449 - 791: Li Valley_3","paragraphs":["\"...What should we do then?\"","Xun Zixian said in a deep voice:\"Dismantle it.\"","\"Dismantle?\"","\"Yes,\" Xun Zixian nodded, pointing out a rough scope,\"although this Formation is strong, it doesn’t cover a large area. We can dismantle from the side wall and avoid this Formation...\"","\"It seems troublesome, but it’s currently the only feasible solution.\"","The crowd pondered briefly and nodded in agreement.","Xun Zixian then looked at Mo Hua and said:\"Mo Hua, you should go outside first. Everyone here is Golden Core; once they make a move, the Spiritual Power will be overflowing, and I don’t want you to get accidentally hurt.\"","\"Alright, alright.\"","Mo Hua obediently nodded his head.","He was quite aware of his own physical strength.","Afterward, Mo Hua left the study and waited for a while in the main hall.","The Golden Core Elders of Taixu Gate, using either their physical bodies, Sword Qi, or various Spiritual Artifacts, began according to Xun Zixian’s defined Formation scope to avoid Formation Patterns and carve through the walls.","Though Mo Hua was waiting outside, he was still curious and kept paying attention to the commotion inside.","After thirty minutes, the noises inside ceased.","Mo Hua blinked his eyes and quietly sneaked back in.","The whole study had been dismantled beyond recognition, leaving only one wall intact while the other two walls were completely hollowed out.","Behind the wall, a passage had indeed been carved out.","Xun Zixian said:\"Let’s go in and see...\"","He turned his head and saw Mo Hua again; before he could say anything, Mo Hua had already run behind Xun Ziyou, looking obedient.","Xun Zixian couldn’t do anything about him, so he didn’t say more.","The Golden Core Elders remained vigilant with each other as they proceeded inside.","As they walked, they entered a small cave.","The cave was narrow and simple.","It was equally empty around, with only a simple and ancient stone platform left in the center, appearing plain and unremarkable.","Upon seeing this stone platform, Xun Zixian sensed the remaining Formation marks on it, and his pupils immediately contracted as he said coldly:","\"Fifth grade... Void Formation?!\"","Fifth grade?!","A Formation of Heaven Void Realm!","Everyone’s expression changed upon hearing this.","Xun Ziyou broke into a cold sweat and immediately wanted to crush the Void Sword Order to summon the Ancestor, only to be stopped by Xun Zixian.","Xun Zixian shook his head,\"The Formation has already been destroyed...\"","Only then did Xun Ziyou let out a long sigh of relief.","A perfectly intact fifth grade Formation, if it contained a Killing Formation with Void Power, this group of Golden Cores, upon touching it, would certainly die without a doubt.","If it were a transmission type Formation, bringing strong enemies to kill them and then leaving through the Formation, they would have no recourse and die for nothing.","Life and death were almost decided in a single thought.","So in the first instance, Xun Ziyou had reacted critically by wanting to crush the Void Sword Order to call upon the Ancestor.","But since this fifth grade Formation had already been destroyed, there was no need to summon the Ancestor for now, lest the situation escalate unnecessarily.","Xun Ziyou frowned,\"When was this Formation destroyed?\"","Xun Zixian’s gaze slightly darkened,\"Not long ago...\"","\"No commotion at all?\"","\"There was a Formation Master who anticipated setting up a mechanism, once it self-destructs, the Formation Patterns are erased automatically, making little noise, and won’t leave too many traces, especially the core Formation...\"","Xun Ziyou furrowed his brows tightly, then slowly sighed and said:","\"The depths of this matter are frighteningly deep...\"","\"The exposure of this Formation means that, at the very least, there is a Fifth Grade Formation Master at the Heaven Void Realm behind these cultivators.\"","\"A Fifth Grade Formation Master, in the entire Qian Learning State Boundary, is rare.\"","\"And this Fifth Grade Formation Master managed to bypass the scrutiny of numerous great cultivators within the Qian Learning State Boundary to secretly set a fifth grade Formation within the Refining Demon Mountain. It’s likely...\"","Before he could finish, Xun Zixian gave him a look.","Xun Ziyou turned his head and saw Mo Hua beside him, listening attentively with a serious expression, feeling slightly pained in his head.","Xun Zixian then said:\"Let’s talk about it when we’re back.\"","He said this while looking at Mo Hua.","The implication was to hurry and take Mo Hua back.","Xun Ziyou naturally understood. Matters at the Heaven Void level, even they, as Golden Core, could easily be wiped out if not careful.","Let alone Mo Hua, a small Foundation Establishment disciple.","\"I’m alright, don’t worry about me...\" Mo Hua said.","Hollow Void Formation Master, fifth grade Formation, Void Transmission...","He wanted to hear more about the secrets behind it.","But just as he finished speaking, suddenly his Sea of Consciousness trembled, bringing a sharp pain.","It seemed as if thousands of demons were roaring and howling beside his ears.","The Demon Wraiths were ferocious, evil shadows overwhelming, a malicious intent clinging to him, slowly eroding his Taoist Heart.","At the same time, a \"bloodthirsty\" impulse involuntarily surged within him.","It was as if he was about to become a \"Monster Beast.\"","Noticing Mo Hua’s abnormality, both Xun Ziyou and the others were startled.","\"Mo Hua, what’s wrong with you?\"","\"I, no...\"","Mo Hua gritted his teeth, frowned, desperately suppressing the vicious intent in his heart, but ultimately failed to control it.","His gaze suddenly turned fierce, he opened his mouth and bit down on Xun Ziyou’s arm.","Like a \"Little Tiger\" about to devour someone, his expression also turned ferociously fierce.","Xun Ziyou: \"...\"","Mo Hua gnawed twice but couldn’t bite through.","Xun Ziyou was bewildered, not knowing what to do.","Beside them, Xun Zixian’s expression tensed, and his sleeve brushed past Mo Hua, a soft Spiritual Power gently brushing the acupoints between Mo Hua’s eyebrows.","Mo Hua’s gaze gradually became blank, then he fell into a deep sleep.","Xun Ziyou glanced at the unconscious Mo Hua, with a somewhat grave expression asked Xun Zixian:","\"What’s wrong with this child? Possessed?\"","Xun Zixian frowned and said, \"A little bit...\"","Xun Ziyou thought for a moment, and then exclaimed, \"Could it be he’s infected by some Evil Spirit in the Demon Refining Diagram?\"","Xun Zixian slowly said, \"Very likely...\"","\"Then what to do? Can it be cured?\"","Xun Zixian thought for a moment, sighed and said, \"Let’s take him back and let the Ancestor have a look...\"","He did know some ways to deal with Evil Spirits, but these methods varied from person to person, and depending on the \"evil,\" they weren’t always effective.","They worked for some people, and for some \"Evil Spirits,\" sometimes effective and sometimes not, the effect unpredictable, and he couldn’t guarantee it.","Moreover, Mo Hua was a bit special, and he didn’t dare to act rashly.","If any problem arose, they couldn’t bear the responsibility.","It was safest to knock him out first and take him back to the Sect for the Ancestor to examine.","Xun Zixian pondered in his heart.","\"Alright!\" Xun Ziyou nodded and said.","\"By the way,\" Xun Zixian suddenly remembered something, and said, \"this child bit you...\"","Xun Ziyou calmly said, \"I’m fine.\"","Xun Zixian shook his head, \"No, see if his teeth are alright...\"","Xun Ziyou was stunned, \"He bit me...\"","Xun Zixian nodded, \"I know, but if you broke his teeth, the Ancestor probably wouldn’t give you a kind face.\"","Xun Ziyou’s scalp tingled, pinching Mo Hua’s cheek, he checked the teeth, and then breathed a sigh of relief, \"Fortunately, they’re not broken.\"","\"That’s good then...\"","Xun Ziyou carried Mo Hua on his back and said to Xun Zixian:","\"There’s no time to lose, I’ll take this child back to the Sect first, as for the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons here, I’ll leave it to you guys, be careful.\"","\"Mm.\" Xun Zixian nodded.","Then Xun Ziyou stopped talking nonsense and directly took the \"possessed\" Mo Hua back to the Sect.","Xun Zixian stayed in place, looking at the destroyed Fifth Grade Array in front of him, in a trance, finally sighed and murmured lowly:","\"The mountain rain... has already arrived...\"","...","Two days later.","Taixu Gate.","In a tranquil Pill Room.","Mo Hua opened his eyes, seeing a vast whiteness.","He still felt his head dizzy, with indistinct sounds of Demon Wraiths, like ghosts wailing, making his head ache.","This seemed like an \"aftereffect\" of consuming too much at once, too full to digest.","Mo Hua hadn’t recovered yet.","Just at this time, an elderly but kindly voice slowly sounded:","\"Awake?\"","Mo Hua lifted his head, squinting to see Elder Master Xun, with white hair, sitting by his bed, holding a red pen, marking something on a thick pile of Formation Paper, seemingly correcting formation assignments."]},{"number":1450,"title":"Chapter 1450 - 792: The Situation (Thanks to Boss pharcyde for the Alliance Hierarch reward~)","paragraphs":["\"Elder Master...\"","Mo Hua spoke softly, his voice somewhat hoarse due to the dryness, seemingly the aftereffect of residual Divine Thought affecting his body.","\"Hmm.\" Elder Master Xun continued to use a vermilion brush, marking something on the Formation Paper, then looked up slightly, glanced at Mo Hua, and asked:","\"How is it?\"","Mo Hua’s Divine Sense observed within, perceiving his own Sea of Consciousness, discovering the persistent presence of demon wraiths’ \"Evil Thoughts,\" which were gradually eroding his Taoist Heart, though already much weaker.","It seemed that while he was unconscious, his Sea of Consciousness was persistently, autonomously \"digesting\" these mottled bloodthirsty desires.","\"Much better,\" Mo Hua said.","Elder Master Xun nodded.","Mo Hua glanced at the Formation Paper in Elder Master Xun’s hand, \"Elder Master, these are...\"","Elder Master Xun sighed softly:","\"You took such a long leave, and then fell unconscious for two days, I had to grade these Formation coursework myself...\"","Even if I wanted to be lazy, I couldn’t.","Mo Hua smiled a little awkwardly.","Elder Master Xun looked at Mo Hua again, various thoughts flashed in his eyes, but ultimately all were silently hidden.","\"Ziyou told me about the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons matter.\"","\"You did well.\"","\"But about this matter, do not mention a word to the outside. I have instructed all Inner Sect Elders and disciples involved not to disclose your ’name’.\"","\"I’ve also informed those at Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect.\"","\"Not just you, but also Ling Huxiao, Shangguan Mu, and Song Jian, none of these kids’ names will be mentioned outside...\"","Mo Hua was a bit puzzled, \"For the sake of confidentiality?\"","\"Not entirely,\" Elder Master Xun sighed, \"Confidentiality is necessary.\"","\"The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons incident is a significant scandal, but precisely because it is a ’scandal,’ it is not advisable to make it public, or else there would be...\"","Elder Master Xun paused, then continued, \"...some unpredictable consequences, with uncertain fate.\"","\"Moreover, this is also for your own good.\"","\"You are Sect disciples, focusing on cultivation is the main task, there’s no need to get involved in these bloody conspiracies.\"","\"What’s more, this matter also involves some from the Monster Gate Demon Path.\"","\"Once tainted by such matters, it’s easy to draw other people’s criticism. Too much gossip can negatively affect your own Tao cultivation journey, and it would be a bad bargain...\"","Elder Master Xun’s expression was somewhat solemn.","He only hinted slightly.","Yet Mo Hua roughly understood.","Once the matter of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons is revealed, it would be hard to explain.","How did three Foundation Establishment Middle Phase disciples survive from the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, full of Foundation Establishment Late Stage and even Peak evil spirits, with the help of another Foundation Establishment Middle Phase disciple?","This sounded somewhat like a fantasy.","Normally, such a scenario seems impossible.","Others would find it hard to believe.","Moreover, once trapped in a land of evil spirits, living with monster cultivators every day, would there be situations under duress or temptation, where evil pills were consumed, human flesh eaten, demon skills practiced, or an evil sword forged?","All of this would arouse baseless suspicion.","Words are terrifying.","Once someone with ill intent spreads slander and fans the flames, tossing dirt onto them, it would be impossible to prove their innocence under the scenario of three people making a tiger.","People demanding you to cut open your stomach for the truth don’t actually care if you are innocent.","As for himself, coming from a Loose Cultivator background, his relationship with fellow disciples is pretty good, so he’s not afraid of such rumors.","He’s also unconcerned about slander from other Sects.","But for the others, it’s different.","Ling Huxiao is a Sword Dao genius of Rushing Void Sect.","Though Shangguan Mu appears unremarkable, he’s a direct lineage of the Ouyang Family and has an outstanding brother.","Moreover, the personalities of both are either reclusive or wooden, and their relationships with fellow disciples are not good, nor are they eloquent.","Once rumors start, they might not even know how to defend themselves.","And then there’s Song Jian...","Oh, as for Song Jian, it doesn’t matter.","Mo Hua suddenly realized.","He always thought of himself as an obscure little disciple, not famous, and thus believed others wouldn’t pay attention to him, so he never considered such matters.","Now that Elder Master Xun mentioned it, he realized that sometimes causing harm doesn’t require weapons or facts, just knowing how to \"spread rumors\" is enough.","Mo Hua nodded solemnly, \"Elder Master, I understand, thank you for your concern.\"","Elder Master Xun nodded.","Smart children are indeed good...","Just a slight hint, and they comprehend it themselves.","Mo Hua then whispered: \"Elder Master, how will the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons incident ultimately be resolved?\"","He was quite curious.","Within the Qian Learning State Boundary, where Sects are numerous and the academic atmosphere is flourishing, setting up bases, raising monster cultivators, and enticing disciples into the Demon Path.","The Sever Gold Sect has made such a big blunder, no matter how they cover it, they can’t possibly keep it covered, right?","Elder Master Xun hesitated, then suddenly paused, and asked Mo Hua in return:","\"What do you think?\"","Mo Hua was startled, \"What do I think?\"","Elder Master Xun nodded, \"If you were the ’ancestor’ of the Qian Learning State Boundary and the Sects, how would you handle it? And if you were a high-level of the Taoist Court, what would you do?\"","Mo Hua furrowed his eyebrows, following Elder Master Xun’s train of thought:","\"If I were the ’ancestor’ of the Qian Learning State Boundary...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and couldn’t help but admit: \"...then this matter, surely must be as ’covered’ as possible.\"","\"Though the Sever Gold Sect made a mess, when one is damaged, the whole Qian Learning State Boundary suffers.\"","\"If others know, within the Qian Learning State Boundary, there are people setting up demon valleys, coercing and enticing disciples into the Demon Path, then all Sects within the Qian Learning State Boundary would be implicated.\"","\"Sever Gold Sect lures disciples into the Monster Path, then other Sects are unlikely to be clean either.\"","\"After all, in the eyes of outsiders, the Qian Learning State Boundary is united. They aren’t aware of the disputes and contradictions among the Sects, they would only think the entire Qian Learning State Boundary is in collusion, murky, and thereafter wouldn’t send disciples here to study anymore.\""]},{"number":1451,"title":"Chapter 1451 - 792 Situation (Thanks to Boss Pharcyde for rewarding the Alliance Hierarch~)_2","paragraphs":["\"Therefore, such matters are the ’family scandal’ of the entire Qian Learning State Boundary. Since it’s a family scandal, it shouldn’t be exposed.\"","Elder Master Xun nodded.","\"And suppose I were among the upper echelons of the Taoist Court...\" Mo Hua continued, \"Regarding the matter of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, if I were unaware, it would be fine. But once I know...\"","Mo Hua raised an eyebrow, his tone turning harsh, \"Then I will definitely ’handle it’ severely!\"","\"Using the Taoist Law as a ’pretext’, take this matter as a ’leverage’, and ’extort’ the relevant Sects of the Qian Learning State Boundary to squeeze out a lot of benefits, then find an excuse to pretend to be magnanimous and let it pass lightly.\"","\"Handling such matters impartially is very difficult and would offend various Sects.\"","\"Why not do it this way, gaining face and benefits.\"","\"And for a Sect like the Sever Gold Sect, if they know there is no room for maneuver, they will naturally adopt a ’desperate’ mindset.\"","\"But if the Taoist Court displays a greedy face, only demanding ’benefits’, they will hold onto a fluke mindset, painfully ’ceding land and compensating’, rather than resisting too much...\"","Mo Hua spoke with clarity and logic.","Elder Master Xun looked at Mo Hua, his gaze becoming somewhat complicated.","Mo Hua noticed Elder Master Xun’s gaze, slightly startled, somewhat unsure, and softly asked:","\"Gentleman, am I wrong?\"","Elder Master Xun sighed, \"Right.\"","It’s more or less like that.","An adequate ’Ancestor’ would indeed consider matters in such a way.","Elder Master Xun asked again, \"Then from your own perspective, what were you thinking before?\"","Mo Hua was startled, then somewhat embarrassedly said:","\"As a disciple, I thought simply... just to make a big fuss, let the Sever Gold Sect suffer greatly!\"","Elder Master Xun asked, \"Why do that?\"","Mo Hua thought for a while, frowning, \"Because the Sever Gold Sect doesn’t distinguish right from wrong, acting against the Taoist principles...\"","Elder Master Xun nodded, \"Then your thinking isn’t bad either.\"","Mo Hua was somewhat surprised, \"That’s not bad?\"","Elder Master Xun said seriously, \"A Sect that doesn’t distinguish right from wrong and violates Taoist principles, what’s the use of keeping it?\"","Mo Hua’s expression became solemn.","Elder Master Xun said, \"Since you are neither an Ancestor of the Qian Learning State Boundary nor among the upper echelons of the Taoist Court, why bother considering their interest issues?\"","\"You have your ideas, and if those ideas aren’t wrong, then naturally you should act upon them.\"","Mo Hua was momentarily confused, \"Then...\"","Elder Master Xun said, \"I asked you to consider yourself an ’Ancestor’, to put yourself in that position, so you would know that you shouldn’t only consider matters from your own perspective.\"","\"You can’t just base things on ’you think’, otherwise your thinking becomes limited, and your vision will be narrow, eventually becoming someone else’s ’pawn’.\"","\"Understanding others is wisdom. The more you know about others, the stronger your control over the situation.\"","\"But you don’t have to deny your thoughts.\"","\"If your thoughts align with ’Taoist principles’, then you are right, and the others are wrong.\"","\"However, your strength is too weak, and the Ancestors who speak of interest and reality are too strong, so things won’t develop according to your thoughts, but according to those Ancestors’ plans.\"","\"This you must understand.\"","\"Sometimes, it’s not that you’re wrong, but that you’re too ’weak’.\"","\"If one day you advance to Heaven Void, or even surpass that to possess supreme power, many things in the world will naturally develop according to your wishes...\"","\"But now you’re not strong, the progress of matters is dictated by others, so when encountering matters, you need to think more about how others think, this way you’ll know how things will actually develop, and you can know what you should do.\"","Elder Master Xun gave Mo Hua one last meaningful look.","\"You need to learn to view from an ’Ancestor’s’ perspective, standing above, and looking down.\"","\"But I am not hoping for you to only become such a condescending ’Ancestor’ in the future...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes flickered, slowly nodding.","\"Alright,\" Elder Master Xun’s tone relaxed a bit, sighed, \"Getting older, sometimes I ramble on a bit.\"","Mo Hua, however, solemnly said:","\"Thank you for the instruction, Gentleman.\"","Elder Master Xun’s eyebrows moved slightly, his gaze gentle.","\"By the way, Gentleman,\" Mo Hua suddenly blinked, \"Regarding the Sever Gold Sect, hasn’t our Taixu Gate ’squeezed’ any benefits?\"","Elder Master Xun was startled, then a faint smile appeared, \"I am also an ’Ancestor’, this benefit, if others squeeze it, how could I let it pass?\"","After Elder Master Xun finished, he glanced at Mo Hua, calmly said:","\"From now on, those things you have from the Sever Gold Sect, be it Sword Jue or Sword Array, you can use them.\"","Mo Hua was slightly stunned, only then realizing that Elder Master Xun possibly knew everything.","But it seemed normal, too.","Elder Xun Ziyou was watching him, so these techniques he often used, he couldn’t be unaware of them.","Since he knew, naturally, Elder Master Xun would know as well.","Mo Hua was still somewhat uneasy:","\"Can I really use them... the Sever Gold Sect is quite stingy...\"","\"Just use them without worry,\" Elder Master Xun said, \"Between the Sever Gold Sect and our Taixu Gate, adhering to the principle of ’abandon sect biases, exchange Daoist cultivation methods’, we exchanged some inheritances.\"","\"Their Sect Protecting Faction’s inheritance included some beginner-level Second Grade Sword techniques and Sword Arrays, all of which have been included in our Taixu Gate’s Book Pavilion.\"","\"Exchange of inheritance?\"","Mo Hua was somewhat dumbfounded, then asked again, \"What inheritance did our Taixu Gate give to the Sever Gold Sect?\"","Elder Master Xun disdained, \"A pile of common rubbish Spells, who would even remember those...\"","Mo Hua froze for a moment.","Alright, so this is how they ’exchanged’ them.","\"So... only beginner-level Sword techniques?\"","Mo Hua asked quietly again.","He felt that in his hands, whether it was the Sever Gold Sword Jue or the Sever Gold Sword Formation, they didn’t seem like beginner-level inheritances of the Sever Gold Sect."]},{"number":1452,"title":"Chapter 1452 - 792 Situation (Thanks to Boss Pharcyde for rewarding the Alliance Hierarch~)_3","paragraphs":["Now carrying these inheritances with him, he feels even more \"direct lineage\" than some Sever Gold Sect’s direct lineage disciples.","\"Entry-level is enough,\" Elder Master Xun said confidently, \"Even if you only learn the ’entry-level,’ you’re still better than them.\"","\"Even if their inheritance is excellent, if they’re not ambitious themselves and can’t learn beyond you, then there’s nothing that can be done.\"","Mo Hua felt a bit embarrassed but understood somewhat.","This is just an \"excuse.\"","The moves he possessed from the Sever Gold Sect had a background, a story, and that’s enough; the reality doesn’t truly matter.","Elder Master Xun thought for a moment and then advised:","\"This matter is too significant and all winds have been blocked externally while it appears calm on the surface, there are turbulent undercurrents beneath.\"","\"The Taoist Court, the Four Great Sects, and various sects, especially the Sever Gold Sect, and even my Taixu, Tai’a, and Chongxu Gates, are engaged in open and covert struggles continuously until the issue settles down; it likely won’t quiet down anytime soon.\"","\"So during this period, keep a low profile and don’t let anything slip.\"","\"As for the reason for requesting leave, if fellow disciples inquire, just say I gave you a task to travel far and spent about seven or eight days drawing formations.\"","\"Regarding specific reasons...\" Elder Xun looked at Mo Hua meaningfully, \"You can make it up yourself, you’re quite familiar with that.\"","\"I’m not... very experienced...\"","Mo Hua said somewhat guiltily.","Elder Master Xun raised his eyebrow slightly and didn’t pursue further, instead, he asked the last question with a solemn expression:","\"Has your Divine Thought been stained with some evil spirit in the Demon Refining Diagram?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded slowly.","To be precise, it’s \"devoured,\" not stained.","But even Elder Xun didn’t think along those lines.","\"Stained\" with evil spirits was already a situation he could conceive of as quite dire.","He never witnessed it firsthand, so he couldn’t imagine just how \"ferocious\" Mo Hua was in Divine Thought state.","\"Stained with evil spirits...\" Elder Master Xun frowned.","\"It’s fine,\" Mo Hua said, \"Gentleman, through meditation, I can gradually purify these evil thoughts.\"","\"Meditation?\" Elder Master Xun was stunned, his heart stirred.","Could it be... the Meditation Technique imparted by that person?","Elder Master Xun pondered slightly, then nodded:","\"Alright.\"","However, he still felt uneasy, retrieving from the storage bag a stick of sandalwood incense with golden patterned borders and a simple jade box containing an ancient scroll.","\"This Calming Incense is top-grade, light it during your meditation; it will help you focus your mind and discard distractions.\"","\"As for this scroll...\"","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat upon seeing this scroll, blurting out:","\"Contemplation Map?!\"","Elder Master Xun raised his eyebrow, slightly surprised but not entirely so, \"You’ve seen a Contemplation Map?\"","\"Yes, seen some.\" Mo Hua replied honestly.","Elder Master Xun listened, slightly astonished.","Seen \"some.\"","More than one?","\"So young yet has such notable experiences...\"","Elder Master Xun thought.","\"Since you know, I won’t say much more. This Contemplation Map is a Divine Way treasure of our Taixu Gate; don’t open it lightly, especially not in front of outsiders.\"","\"When you return to the Disciple’s Residence, light the incense, then open this map, contemplate on this map, it will benefit your Divine Thought.\"","\"In this world, ’clean’ Contemplation Maps are rare, you should cherish it.\"","Mo Hua, somewhat feeling overwhelmed with honor, said: \"Gentleman, such a precious thing, are you really giving it to me?\"","Elder Master Xun hesitated, glared at Mo Hua frustratedly:","\"What do you mean ’giving’? I’m temporarily lending it to you, read it, restore your Divine Sense, then return it.\"","\"Oh...\" Mo Hua nodded.","Lending is better than not having it.","Elder Master Xun handed the Contemplation Map to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua solemnly accepted it.","But at the moment Mo Hua received it, Elder Master Xun felt a sudden pang, as if he was \"sending a sheep into a tiger’s mouth.\"","His hand froze, holding onto the Contemplation Map, not letting go.","Mo Hua held the Contemplation Map with both hands but saw Elder Master Xun’s reluctance, feeling puzzled, \"Gentleman?\"","Elder Master Xun snapped back, looked at Mo Hua with a subtle expression, hesitated for a moment before solemnly saying:","\"Remember to return it.\"","\"Do not, by any means, damage it for me...\"","\"Mm, mm.\" Mo Hua promised earnestly, \"Gentleman, rest assured.\"","Though until now, any Contemplation Map seen or touched by him hadn’t remained \"intact.\"","But those were others’ Maps.","And the ones from his own Sect, surely, would be different.","Receiving Mo Hua’s assurance, Elder Master Xun no longer hesitated and temporarily handed the Contemplation Map to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua solemnly accepted it and treasured it carefully.","Then Elder Master Xun gave a few more instructions before getting up to leave. Before departure, he said:","\"Take care these days, recover well before returning to class, but make sure to catch up on any missed lessons.\"","\"Cultivation is like rowing upstream, if you don’t advance, you will regress, do not slack off.\"","\"Okay, Gentleman.\" Mo Hua responded obediently.","\"By the way...\"","Elder Master Xun was already standing, took one last look at Mo Hua, recalled something, hesitated repeatedly before confirming:","\"Your Divine Sense, has it strengthened again?\"","Before, when Mo Hua lay in bed afflicted by evil spirits, his Divine Thought was weak, thus his aura wasn’t apparent.","After chatting for a while, Elder Master Xun could clearly sense that Mo Hua’s Divine Sense was evidently more profound and refined compared to before.","\"Yes, my Divine Sense accidentally broke through again...\" Mo Hua said.","Even though anticipated, Elder Master Xun couldn’t help but his heart stirred.","Another breakthrough.","Though Cultivation doesn’t grow much, the Divine Sense keeps breaking through consistently, truly...","\"Good, good,\"","Elder Master Xun nodded cheerfully.","With this, his arrangements have taken a step forward.","The previously impossible seemed now, to have some prospects.","Elder Master Xun felt deeply gratified, full of hope and said:","\"Recuperate well, wait till your Divine Sense is fine again, then come find me, I’ll teach you the eighteen-pattern formation...\"","Mo Hua, however, shook his head, \"Not eighteen-pattern.\"","Elder Master Xun was taken aback.","\"I accidentally broke through a bit more...\" Mo Hua said quietly, \"Now it’s nineteen patterns...\"","Nineteen...","Elder Master Xun felt a tightness in his chest, nearly lost his breath.","Divine Sense at nineteen patterns?","From seventeen directly to nineteen, breaking through two realms in one go?!","Elder Master Xun took a deep breath, filled with disbelief.","The Cultivation just reached the Foundation Building Middle Stage, yet the Divine Sense already neared the Foundation Establishment Peak level?","That boy named Zhuang... where did he find such a disciple, one who remains low-key, yet possesses such \"defiant\" Divine Sense talent?"]},{"number":1453,"title":"Chapter 1453 - 793 Tai Xu Diagram","paragraphs":["Until he returned to the Elder’s Residence, Elder Master Xun remained somewhat distracted.","Disciples with good Spiritual Root talent are rare, but not nonexistent.","Especially within the great families and the great sects, every generation has a few disciples with Superior-Grade Spirit Roots.","He has even seen, within his lifetime, the legendary, scarcely seen Heavenly Spirit Root.","However, disciples with good talent in Divine Thought are truly hard to encounter.","The talent in Divine Thought doesn’t show itself obviously, and is usually undetectable.","Moreover, there’s no \"Divine Sense Cultivation\" method in the cultivation world; the inheritance of the Divine Way is scarce, and some disciples with Divine Thought talent, unaware of how to cultivate their Sea of Consciousness and train their Divine Sense, often waste their gifts without realizing it.","And even if they cultivate, the path is difficult.","The path of Divine Thought is ethereal and mysterious, full of unforeseen dangers.","If one cultivates Divine Thought, all abilities will focus on Divine Sense, leading to extreme imbalance and serious drawbacks.","Even with this talent, few cultivators choose this path.","Thus, disciples with good Divine Thought talent are hard to discover, cultivate, and help to grow.","So far, the only disciple he has seen with extraordinary Divine Thought talent is Mo Hua.","But Mo Hua’s situation is quite unique.","It’s beyond the question of good or bad talent.","At his realm, with his Divine Sense, he’s reached a point that is \"against the heavens,\" exceeding the understanding of ordinary cultivators, and even beyond what this Heaven Void Ancestor knows.","Elder Master Xun drew a slight breath of cold air.","At the same time, he became more convinced of his previous suspicion:","\"That person intends for this disciple to take the path of ’Divine Sense Proving the Dao’!\"","Elder Master Xun felt a sense of wonder.","For a Loose Cultivator to embark on such a solitary, obscure, treacherous, scarce path with an unknown future...","It is truly whimsical.","The courage is indeed great!","Nevertheless, it indeed seems like something that person would do.","Moreover...","Elder Master Xun thought of Mo Hua, thought of his Nineteen Patterns of Divine Sense, and felt a slight tremor in his heart.","He actually managed to make it!","Mo Hua is still during Foundation Establishment and yet has such profound Divine Sense, and with time, as his Divine Thought is further refined, the future is unimaginable...","While Divine Sense is difficult to cultivate, difficult to practice, and with obscure methods, its use is peculiar.","But this is only true for ordinary cultivators.","If one can really \"leave others far behind\" on the Path of Divine Sense, achieving great mastery in Divine Thought, that would be the truly terrifying \"monster.\"","Elder Master Xun’s eyes slightly contracted, and a name floated up in his mind.","\"The Trickster Taoist...\"","This name is a taboo in both righteous and evil paths.","This person is also the first, and possibly the only Evil Monster in the Demon Sect, to have been awarded the title ’Taoist’ with a Feather Transformation Realm cultivation.","This \"Trickster Taoist\" walks the path of Divine Thought, his realm mysterious and inscrutable.","Although he is now only in Feather Transformation, he is already elusive and strikes terror in all who hear his name.","Many powerful beings want him dead, but none know how to make a move against him.","If in the future he breaks through to Heaven Void, who knows how he might die...","Moreover, Elder Master Xun always has a foreboding sense.","With the Trickster Taoist’s wit and cunning, the day he achieves Feather Transformation and breaks through the void is not far off...","And then, who knows what heaven-defying disaster will unfold.","\"So many calamities...\"","Elder Master Xun sighed deeply.","He then lifted his head, gazing through the floating clouds and white mist of Taixu Mountain, looking towards the sky over the Qianxue state boundary, and sighed in his heart.","Setting aside the matters of the Trickster Taoist for now.","The disasters in the Qianxue state boundary today might also be no small matter...","...","Mo Hua rested for a day, and his body was no longer in distress.","His problems lay mainly on the level of Divine Sense.","The gentle and beautiful Third Grade Pill Master, Elder Murong, checked Mo Hua’s meridians, smoothed his Spiritual Power and bloodline, massaged the acupoints on his back and forehead, and then gently said:","\"I will give you some pills for activating blood circulation, dissipating bruises, calming the mind, and concentrating. Take them every morning, and if you feel any discomfort in your body afterward, remember to see me again.\"","Mo Hua moved his arm and indeed felt much more at ease, so he happily said:","\"Thank you, Elder Murong.\"","Elder Murong smiled and nodded as well.","Mo Hua gave a bow and then left the Pill Room.","After returning to the Disciple’s Residence.","Mo Hua meditated for a while, then eagerly took out the Contemplation Map that Elder Master Xun had given him—not given, but temporarily \"loaned.\"","The Contemplation Map was placed in a jade box, the paper old and somewhat wrinkled, giving the appearance of ancient relics.","Mo Hua stretched out his palm, gently stroking the Contemplation Map, vaguely feeling the ancient aura condensed over time.","However, he did not rush to open it, but first followed Elder Master Xun’s instructions to bathe, calm his mind, and then ignite a stick of top-grade Calming Incense.","The Calming Incense was placed in the incense burner.","The flame flickered, and wisps of white smoke rose up, transforming into a fragrant and tranquil aroma, slowly drifting through the room.","Mo Hua took a breath of it, indeed feeling refreshed in mind and soul, his thoughts clear.","\"What Elder Master Xun gave me is indeed good stuff, though I wonder how many Spirit Stones it costs; it probably isn’t cheap...\"","In the ethereal smoke of the Calming Incense, Mo Hua again sat in meditation for a while before he respectfully unrolled the \"clean\" Contemplation Map, preserved for many years by the Taixu Gate and gifted to him by Elder Master Xun.","On the drawing.","He was greeted with a view of lush green mountains.","The mountains were ancient and verdant, with greenery tinged with deep ink hues, exuding an air of archaic charm.","Amidst the mountain forests lay ancient, majestic Taoist temple courtyards.","The palace buildings and towers stood tall layer by layer, cloaked among the mountains, forming an integral whole with the ancient mountain range, having weathered countless storms and endured numerous vicissitudes."]},{"number":1454,"title":"Chapter 1454 - 793 Tai Xu Diagram_2","paragraphs":["Above the mountains and forests, white clouds and mist float.","Immortal cranes fly across, exotic beasts vanish into hiding, adding a touch of vivacious immortal aura.","...","\"Is this... Taixu Gate?\"","Mo Hua stared at the Contemplation Map for a while, feeling it’s somewhat similar, but not quite.","It indeed seemed to depict a sect.","But this sect was obviously larger than Taixu Gate; the style of the halls and pavilions seemed similar to Taixu Gate, yet appeared older and more ancient.","Especially the sky above the sect, reaching higher, with a clearer and purer aura.","\"Is it the Taixu Gate of the past?\"","Mo Hua pondered for a while, shook his head, and stopped fixating on it.","\"Better to focus on contemplation first...\"","He released his Divine Sense, sensed the Contemplation Map, and truly found no trace of evil spirits or ghosts, just as Elder Master Xun had said, it was a \"clean\" Contemplation Map.","\"Rare...\"","Mo Hua gathered his thoughts and began to contemplate calmly.","The mountain scenery, floating mist and pavilions; the ancient and elegant style of the Ancient Mountain Daoist Court; each unique element instilled serenity within.","A clear and lofty desire to seek the Dao, like gentle rain, nourished his heart.","In just a moment, Mo Hua felt that all malicious thoughts, hostile energy, fleeting thoughts, greed, and other distractions within him had been cleansed.","His Divine Thought barely grew.","But his Taoist Heart became much clearer.","\"This is...\"","Mo Hua’s heart was startled.","Could this be the true \"Contemplation Map\"?","Sitting in contemplation, comprehending the essence within the map, purifying the Divine Thought, cleansing the Taoist Heart?","Were all the ones I encountered before merely corrupt and demonic counterfeits?","Mo Hua slowly nodded.","No wonder the master previously told him, the Contemplation Map is the treasure of cultivators, a secret of large families and even the Taoist Court.","Yet also warned that the Contemplation Map harbors dangers, difficult to distinguish between real and fake, extremely perilous...","The true Contemplation Map contains a righteous essence, can enhance Divine Thought, refine the Taoist Heart, indeed a peerless treasure.","The fake Contemplation Map harbors evil spirits and corpse ghosts, can devour Divine Sense, stain the Taoist Heart, truly extremely perilous.","Hard to distinguish truth from falsehood, fortune and misfortune coexist.","Ordinary cultivators truly find it difficult to differentiate.","\"However...\" Mo Hua frowned slightly, \"After contemplation, my Divine Sense barely increased?\"","\"Am I using the wrong method, or is it that our Taixu Gate’s Contemplation Map only refines the Taoist Heart, with tiny benefits to Divine Sense growth?\"","Mo Hua raised his head again, glanced at the Contemplation Map, found it hard to comprehend, then said:","\"Forget it, be content with what you have. It’s enough to cleanse the Taoist Heart and rid oneself of evil thoughts, one must not be too greedy...\"","Mo Hua calmed his mind and continued to contemplate.","Contemplating for two hours like this, Divine Thought was clear, without obstacles, and devoid of evil and distracting desires.","Mo Hua felt it was adequate, then respectfully and carefully stored the Contemplation Map away.","Elder Master Xun had instructed him, every day for two hours, neither less nor more, just right is the best.","Listening to advice brings food on the table.","After storing the Contemplation Map, Mo Hua took out his Storage Bag, and from within retrieved a broken sword.","This was a White Bone Broken Sword, entirely white, appearing somewhat eerie.","It was precisely the broken sword housing the Sword Bone.","Such an eerie bone sword, under normal circumstances, should not be allowed into the sect.","Mo Hua pleaded with Elder Master Xun, stating that keeping this bone sword could be greatly useful, also ensuring it wouldn’t cause any issues.","Elder Master Xun pondered for a moment, then nodded, allowing Mo Hua to bring the bone sword into the sect.","The other elders could only turn a blind eye.","However, some rules still needed to be adhered to.","This sword was \"registered\" at the mountain entry elder’s location.","Entering the mountain might not be checked, and it could be brought into the Disciple’s Residence.","But should anything evil or bizarre happen within the sect, the first suspect would naturally be Mo Hua.","Mo Hua did not want to take the blame.","Therefore, to be safe, he added a Divine Lock Array on the White Bone Broken Sword, to seal evil thoughts, and added a Divine Mist Array, to conceal its aura.","Not giving the Sword Bone a single chance to act up.","After ensuring there were no risks, Mo Hua gently unsealed a tiny part of the formation, subtly moved his Divine Thought, sensed the aura inside the broken sword, and then softly said:","\"Hello...\"","There was no response.","\"Sword Bone, are you dead yet?\"","Sword Bone: \"...\"","\"Speak up!\"","\"Oh oh,\" Sword Bone immediately responded, \"Thanks to the little ancestor, still alive...\"","Mo Hua frowned, \"Stop calling me ’little ancestor’, I’m not old, nor an evil spirit, why are you calling me ’ancestor’?\"","You might not be an \"evil spirit\", but you eat \"evil spirits\"...","Sword Bone silently retorted in its heart.","\"Then... how should I address you?\" Sword Bone whispered.","\"Call me what you see fit.\" Mo Hua said.","Sword Bone instantly understood, feeling bitter inside.","This was a test of its awareness, seeing if it recognized the situation, had any sense of timing, and could discern the circumstances.","The current circumstances were crystal clear.","Sword Bone respectfully said: \"Then, may I call you... ’Master’?\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"I don’t like those two words... In this world, no one should be anyone else’s master.\"","Sword Bone was stunned.","What does he mean?","It was a bit confused.","Then it continued: \"Then may I call you... ’Sir’?\"","Mo Hua’s expression turned stern, \"Are you mocking me for not growing up?\"","In reality, he could grow, although not evidently, but his height indeed increased year by year.","Yet his Divine Thought’s incarnation seemed to remain at the Foundation Establishment stage, before the \"Divine Sense Transformation\" state.","He wasn’t sure if he could grow in the future.","Therefore, Sword Bone’s calling him \"Sir\" made Mo Hua very unhappy."]},{"number":1455,"title":"Chapter 1455 - 793 Tai Xu Diagram_3","paragraphs":["\"I don’t dare, I don’t dare...\"","The Sword Bone sensed Mo Hua’s displeasure. The scene of thousands of demon wraiths dying miserably and being swallowed by Mo Hua floated before its eyes again, making its skull tingle.","This won’t do, that won’t do either...","The Sword Bone’s mind raced, and quickly said:","\"Then, how about I still call you ’Young Master’?\"","Mo Hua was about to say it was not good.","There are so many young masters in the Qian Learning State Boundary, and the mastermind behind these bad deeds is also a young master, which sounded unpleasant to him.","However, Mo Hua had a second thought, dismissed the idea, and nodded, saying:","\"Fine, from now on, you can call me ’Young Master’.\"","The Sword Bone let out a long sigh of relief.","This little ancestor is really hard to please.","Being around a \"monarch\" is like being around a tiger.","More importantly, he really is a man-eating tiger, so he couldn’t afford to be careless.","The Sword Bone quickly pledged its loyalty, saying:","\"Then I will call you ’Young Master’. In the future, should the Young Master have any orders, the Sword Bone will go through fire and water without hesitation.\"","\"Hmm.\"","Mo Hua was a little more satisfied, and said:","\"Just stay inside honestly, don’t come out, and don’t make any small moves, or if discovered by the Sect Elders or the Ancestor, I won’t be able to save you.\"","\"And if it really comes to that, I will have no choice but to squeeze you to death and destroy the evidence.\"","\"Remember!\"","The Sword Bone shivered inwardly and hurriedly said:","\"Yes, yes, I will remember the Young Master’s words!\"","Mo Hua nodded, then resealed the Formation, checked it, and found no trace of evil Qi exposed, finally feeling relieved.","The Sword Bone indeed had great use.","The first, is the own Magical Treasure.","My artifact refining experience is insufficient.","But the Sword Bone’s former self was a seasoned Sword-Casting Master who had forged countless evil swords with an orthodox heritage.","In the future, nurturing my own Magical Treasure, including casting the embryo for the own Magical Treasure, would rely on it.","Moreover, there is Spiritual Invasion.","Mo Hua’s own Divine Sense can’t actively leave the body.","When encountering some evil spirits in the future, if these spirits are sensible and can actively pull him into a dream, that’s fine.","But if these spirits are not sensible, he can only stare helplessly without any solutions.","Even for Divine Thought Objects like the Demon Refining Diagram, if he didn’t know the \"sacrifice\" ritual, he couldn’t invade them.","With the Sword Bone and this White Bone Broken Sword, he then has a \"medium\", through the Divine Tao Array, he can construct a divine lock bridge, connect the medium, intervene in other Divine Thought Objects, and achieve Spiritual Invasion.","Of course, this is just Mo Hua’s plan.","Implementing it will likely still have many troubles.","But having a way is better than having no way.","Mo Hua put away the White Bone Broken Sword, seeing it was getting late, he submerged his Divine Sense into his Sea of Consciousness, and continued practicing Formation on the Taoist Stele...","...","In the Elder’s Residence.","Even though it was deep into the night, Elder Master Xun, with graying hair, was still bent over the desk organizing some files and formations.","After a while, Xun Ziyou came over.","He had been handling affairs outside these days, and having just returned to the sect, not caring about the late hour, he came hurriedly to visit Elder Master Xun.","He knew, given the current troublesome times, the Ancestor definitely hadn’t rested yet.","Xun Ziyou waited respectfully outside the door.","\"Come in.\"","Elder Master Xun said faintly.","Xun Ziyou saluted, entered the room, and relayed all the gathered news in detail to Elder Master Xun:","\"The Taoist Court already knows, likely an insider was planted within the Qian Learning State Boundary. Despite the information blockade, it couldn’t be kept from the Taoist Court...\"","\"But this matter was still suppressed by the joint efforts of the Four Great Sects.\"","\"After all, once this matter is exposed, it would inevitably lead to a wave of panic, and a thorough investigation would be unavoidable. The sect reform matters would also inevitably be postponed.\"","\"Reform is a matter that should happen sooner rather than later; delayed by several years or decades, the situation might change, making it impossible to push through.\"","\"Therefore, the Four Great Sects don’t want any additional complications. In their eyes, the reform of the Sect system is currently the biggest matter. They naturally won’t let the affairs of Refining Demon Mountain affect the overall situation and ruin their schemes.\"","\"Of course,\" Xun Ziyou was somewhat schadenfreude, \"a major loss of blood is inevitable.\"","\"If they want to suppress this matter, they must satisfy several big mouths above.\"","\"The Taoist Court has a big appetite; it’s not easy to satisfy...\"","Elder Master Xun slightly nodded, \"What about Sever Gold Sect over there?\"","Xun Ziyou said, \"Because of these few disciples, the Jin family has completely collapsed, the Chief Elder has retired, and the positions of other Jin family elders will not change temporarily— this is Sever Gold Sect’s way of maintaining stability, to avoid causing a commotion and arousing others’ suspicion...\"","\"But these Jin family elders have no further possibility of advancing, and these positions will not be succeeded by Jin family disciples in the future.\"","\"After the Jin family fell, the Song family rose to power.\"","\"The original Vice Sect Leader Jin, also the direct descendant of the Jin family who died in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, Jin Yicai’s father, was the most hopeful, to succeed as the Sect Leader of Sever Gold Sect.\"","\"Now that’s simply impossible.\"","\"For the next position, whether Sect Leader or Elder, it will be chosen from the Song family.\"","\"In the coming years, or even decades, Sever Gold Sect will gradually ’reshuffle,’ washing out Jin family disciples and gradually elevating the Song family.\"","\"In the future, Sever Gold Sect will probably bear the surname ’Song’...\"","Xun Ziyou sighed.","The influence of the Jin family in Sever Gold Sect was the culmination of their ancestors and elders’ efforts over hundreds of years.","Now, because of the misconduct of a few disciples, it was all buried in an instant.","Xun Ziyou watched and suddenly felt a sense of high towers rising, only to suddenly collapse.","After this, it will be difficult for the Jin family to regain their strength.","And the Song family, who they had suppressed for hundreds of years, now turned the tables and naturally won’t let the Jin family have it easy.","Xun Ziyou was moved and whispered to Elder Master Xun:","\"Ancestor, now that the situation in Sever Gold Sect has changed, should we...\"","Elder Master Xun understood his meaning and immediately shook his head:","\"Don’t think about it.\"","Xun Ziyou was puzzled.","Elder Master Xun calmly said, \"When Sever Gold Sect was under the control of the Jin family, they were at odds with our Taixu Gate. Now with the Song family in charge, they will likewise target our Taixu Gate.\"","\"The lineage of Sever Gold Sect is close to the Four Great Sects.\"","\"They have to act according to the will of the Four Great Sects, and moreover...\"","Elder Master Xun paused slightly.","Moreover, from the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons and the affair of sect reform, there might be deeper ’collusion’ involved.","But with no evidence at present, Elder Master Xun didn’t state it clearly.","He glanced at Xun Ziyou and said:","\"Do you think that in the affair of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, the Jin family fell at our hands, and the Song family rose to power, benefiting from our Taixu Gate, so we have a favor on them?\"","Xun Ziyou slowly nodded.","Elder Master Xun sighed, shook his head, and said, \"You’re thinking too simply...\"","\"Whether the Jin family holds power or the Song family rises, Sever Gold Sect is still that same Sever Gold Sect.\"","\"The country’s foundation is easy to change, but its nature is hard to alter.\"","\"Moreover, now in the Qian Learning State Boundary, the situation is unstable and turbulent. For the sake of stability, the Song family is even more unlikely to change their approach and associate with our Taixu Gate, with whom they have had little interaction.\"","\"Internally, they will suppress the Jin family; externally, they will continue to associate with the Four Great Sects, using the name of ’Sever Gold Sect’ to draw in all of the Jin family’s old connections under their own family.\"","\"That is the correct approach.\"","Xun Ziyou realized, then looked at Elder Master Xun with admiration in his eyes.","The Ancestor certainly deserves to be called an Ancestor.","\"Then regarding this negotiation with Sever Gold Sect...\" Xun Ziyou asked.","Elder Master Xun’s gaze was sharp, and he said seriously:","\"Don’t hold back, ruthlessly strike a deal!\"","\"If you hold back, they may not appreciate your favor; instead, they might think that our Taixu Gate is weak and easy to bully.\"","\"Strike them hard so they feel the pain. Even though they may hold a grudge in their hearts, they’ll also know that our Taixu Gate is not to be trifled with.\"","Xun Ziyou clasped his hands and said, \"Yes, Ancestor.\"","\"There’s one more thing...\"","Elder Master Xun appeared thoughtful, then said, \"After this negotiation, set aside a portion of the assets gained from Sever Gold Sect and record it under...\"","Elder Master Xun paused for a moment and slowly said:","\"record it under ’Mo Hua’s’ name.\""]},{"number":1456,"title":"Chapter 1456 - 794 Deceitful Shadow","paragraphs":["\"Registered under Mo Hua’s name?\"","Xun Ziyou was taken aback.","Elder Master Xun glanced at him indifferently, \"What? Not possible?\"","\"No,\" Xun Ziyou replied awkwardly, \"It’s not that it’s not possible. This time, discovering the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, eradicating this group of monster cultivators, and rescuing those three children of Ling Huxiao, it was indeed thanks to Mo Hua, but...\"","Xun Ziyou hesitated, \"This is somewhat against the rules. I fear it won’t convince everyone...\"","Elder Master Xun’s expression darkened slightly, \"Convince who? Those who are capable should do more, those who work hard should gain more. If our Taixu Gate could carve fat meat from the Sever Gold Sect, isn’t it thanks to this child, Mo Hua? If anyone has objections, tell them to come to me, I’ll see what excuse they can find.\"","Xun Ziyou smiled bitterly, \"Yes...\"","Elder Master Xun said, \"When the time comes, you handle it yourself, pick some clean ones with fewer entanglements, allocate the Tao cultivation industries first to my side, then transfer them to Mo Hua’s name.\"","\"If people ask, just say it’s my decision. Of course, if no one asks, don’t publicize it, less fuss is always better...\"","After speaking, Elder Master Xun sighed mildly and remarked:","\"It’s not easy being a loose cultivator, especially without spirit stones, you can’t move an inch.\"","\"Now his realm is low, it may not be obvious, but in the future, when his cultivation rises, his every breath will consume massive amounts of spirit stones. Without some family’s wealth, how can he manage...\"","\"You are right, Ancestor.\" Xun Ziyou replied.","Yet in his heart, he still felt some grumbles.","If these words were heard by others, and they didn’t think Mo Hua was your own grandson, that would be strange...","However, this time at the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, Mo Hua’s contributions were substantial, rewarding him is indeed reasonable and fair.","Xun Ziyou cupped his hands and said:","\"Once the matters with the Sever Gold Sect are discussed, I’ll follow your instructions, pick some industries, allocate them to Mo Hua’s name, and the annual spirit stone profits will be given directly to him...\"","Unexpectedly, Elder Master Xun interrupted, \"Not now.\"","\"Not give?\" Xun Ziyou was somewhat surprised.","Elder Master Xun nodded and said, \"Keep it for now, don’t give him.\"","Seeing Xun Ziyou’s confusion, Elder Master Xun continued, \"He’s still young, what does he need so many spirit stones for?\"","\"Too many spirit stones can easily lead to corruption and laziness, losing the will to strive.\"","\"In the future, when he truly lacks spirit stones for cultivation, then give them to him.\"","\"Offering timely help is always better than adding a decorative touch.\"","The same favor, an offering in times of need, is what people remember.","In times of abundance, people might not be so attentive.","This was a bit of Elder Master Xun’s private concern.","He wanted Mo Hua to remember more of Taixu Gate’s kindness.","Of course, he also held some apprehension in his heart.","And that is \"Gui Tao’s people\"...","Mo Hua’s Divine Thought talent was incredibly strong, even potentially stronger than Gui Tao’s people. If he strayed, the consequences would be unimaginable.","He might even become a Demon Head more terrifying than Gui Tao’s people...","Therefore, these spirit stones should only be given when Mo Hua truly grows up and steadfastly holds onto his Taoist Heart.","Otherwise, it would be creating a \"great calamity\".","These words, Elder Master Xun did not voice out.","Xun Ziyou didn’t understand the underlying issues, he just nodded and said, \"The Ancestor’s considerations are correct.\"","Then the two chatted for a while longer.","When the matters were mostly discussed, Xun Ziyou cupped his hands and said, \"It’s getting late, I shall take my leave first.\"","\"Hmm.\" Elder Master Xun nodded.","Xun Ziyou paused for a moment, a question lingering in his mind, but after much hesitation, he didn’t voice it.","Fifth grade Void Formation...","He didn’t ask, and Elder Master Xun didn’t mention it.","It seemed everyone had forgotten.","But Xun Ziyou knew clearly in his heart, this was the most crucial point. However, this level, involving the fifth grade array and Heaven Void powers, was not something he could inquire about, much less touch upon.","Even if the Ancestor found something, it wouldn’t be said.","But Mo Hua...","\"Ancestor,\" Xun Ziyou began slowly, \"that child Mo Hua, is his path different from ordinary cultivators?\"","Elder Master Xun maintained a calm expression, \"Different how?\"","Xun Ziyou frowned, \"His Divine Sense seems much stronger than cultivators of the same realm, and he can even use Divine Thought to invade certain objects of visualization, he seems very familiar with the esoteric paths of evil spirits as well...\"","\"These wouldn’t be something you taught him, right?\"","Xun Ziyou looked somewhat solemn, \"What exactly is this child’s background? Where did he get this inheritance?\"","Elder Master Xun evaded the question, only saying:","\"You need not ask much, it’s enough to know in your heart, and don’t mention it to others.\"","\"Ancestor...\" Xun Ziyou was somewhat puzzled.","Elder Master Xun said profoundly, \"If you don’t ask, you won’t know, and if you don’t know, there’s no karma.\"","\"Sometimes, no karma is ’good karma’...\"","Xun Ziyou stood still, then nodded solemnly.","Elder Master Xun waved his hand, \"Go about your business.\"","\"Yes.\" Xun Ziyou saluted, \"I take my leave, Ancestor.\"","After Xun Ziyou left, Elder Master Xun remained silent.","Some things about Mo Hua, he was aware of, but he never questioned.","The person surnamed Zhuang approached the Heavenly secret Calculation mastery.","Before dying, he must have done something to the child, using the heavenly secret mist to obscure some significant karma.","The secrets on Mo Hua, as long as he remains silent, are safe.","But once spoken, even if told to himself, it might no longer be safe...","Elder Master Xun’s gaze was profound, and he sighed slowly.","...","The night was deep.","In a secret chamber of a grand hall.","Mr. Tu was \"undergoing a punishment.\"","The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons was eradicated, and over the years, the cultivated monster cultivators were almost completely wiped out, and the bred demon wraiths were devoured entirely."]},{"number":1457,"title":"Chapter 1457 - 794 Deceitful Shadow_2","paragraphs":["A wisp of his remnant soul was obliterated, gravely injuring his vital energy.","It was barely a breath away from the \"Young Master’s\" divine soul being eternally trapped in the nightmare.","This was the most tragic loss to date.","Losing the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons within the Refining Demon Mountain meant losing an inexhaustible treasury.","A massive number of monster cultivators, the \"henchmen\" driven by the Divine Lord, along with beast materials, demon monster flesh, and evil spirits’ evil thoughts, all lost their supply.","Although there was a cause, a divine punishment was unavoidable.","This was also, to date, the most severe \"cruel torture\" Mr. Tu had ever received.","He witnessed and personally experienced all sorts of cruel punishments within the Great Wilderness, where the human world was like a prison.","After the punishment, Mr. Tu’s skin was tattered and his bones exposed, collapsing to the ground, almost unrecognizable as a human, like a lump of ravaged \"flesh.\"","At the same time, what was even more painful was his divine soul.","It was unclear how long had passed before Mr. Tu recovered from the endless pain.","The pain of the divine punishment was branded into his divine soul.","Yet, his skin and flesh gradually revived, returning to their human form.","Mr. Tu trembled as he knelt before the forest-white sheep bone divine statue, his voice quivering, \"The guilty slave, thanks... thanks Divine Lord for your grace...\"","Although the Divine Lord imposed cruel torture.","The divine punishment was unprecedented in its severity.","But Mr. Tu knew in his heart that the Divine Lord had actually shown mercy.","The Divine Lord understood him.","The root cause of this defeat was because the opponent was a \"Fierce God.\"","How can mortals compare to deities?","It was the Fierce God who was too strong, rather than his own weakness.","In the face of a deity, no matter how thorough the preparations, how meticulous the plans are, sometimes they are all in vain.","And this battle, despite the heavy losses, also yielded significant gains.","Mr. Tu prostrated himself, speaking with fear:","\"The true enemy of the Divine Lord revealed itself before this guilty slave...\"","\"This is a recently hatched, young Fierce God!\"","\"The divine skill of this deity is a golden divine sword, but its structure is ancient, the sword body is crude, resembling a sword yet not a sword.\"","\"Using the sword as a divine skill indicates its heavy deathly nature!\"","\"The myriad evil spirits in the Demon Refining Diagram were slaughtered by it, revealing its profound ferocity!\"","\"This deity must be a Fierce God among the Evil Gods.\"","\"And the henchmen and followers of this Fierce God, the ones at the forefront, are the Taixu Gate!\"","\"Even the Rushing Void Sect and the Tai’a Sect cannot escape their connections!\"","\"Among the three sects of this line, there must be high-ranking cultivators secretly worshiping this ’Fierce God,’ driven by this Fierce God, doing their utmost to protect this young Fierce God as it grows safely, ruling a region.\"","\"And the goal of this Fierce God...\"","Mr. Tu bowed his head, his teeth chattering, \"is precisely the Divine Lord!\"","The room suddenly darkened.","In fear, Mr. Tu spoke faster: \"The Divine Lord slumbers, the Divine Thought is silent, the divine might unflaunted.\"","\"This Fierce God dares to be so audacious, seeking to seize the opportunity to covet the Divine Lord, covertly usurping the Divine Lord’s authority, conspiring to rob the Divine Lord of rank, and even...\"","\"to reach for the Divine Marrow of the Divine Lord!\"","A sudden gust of wind arose, the chamber steeped in blood, as though supreme oppression descended, suffocating.","The Divine Lord was angry!","Mr. Tu knelt on the ground, not daring to raise his head.","A moment later, everything dispersed.","It seemed there was a \"divine sign\" in Mr. Tu’s heart.","It was as if the Divine Lord had given him some revelation.","For a moment, Mr. Tu’s eyes showed a void and cruelty, revealing an eerie majesty, only to return to normal shortly after.","Mr. Tu stayed dazed for a while, then became wildly joyful.","Suppressing his fear and excitement, he knelt reverently, saying:","\"Blessed by the Divine Lord, this old slave will spare no effort to set up a heaven-earth snare, to capture this ’Fierce God.’","\"Let this youthful Fierce God become the most bountiful ’sacrifice’ at the grand ceremony of the Divine Lord’s revival!\"","\"Let him know, that even if one offends my Lord’s divine might, even if they are deities, they will undoubtedly die!\"","As Mr. Tu finished speaking, the blood in the room gradually faded.","The oppressive atmosphere completely disappeared.","Mr. Tu slowly stood up, but his expression remained grave.","Hunting the ’Fierce God’... is inevitably extremely difficult.","It is unknown how many prices must be paid, how many lives lost, how many demon monsters and evil spirits will be obliterated...","But all of this is worth it.","Moreover, that Fierce God is still young, the divine rank is only second grade, and the innate divine ability is not yet fully developed; no matter how strong, it is limited.","If not killed now, it will undoubtedly become a great threat in the future!","That Fierce God...","Scenes of what he saw at the disappearance of his remnant soul involuntarily floated in Mr. Tu’s mind.","Golden light filled the sky, a young divine body, a simple yet terrifying \"divine sword.\"","This vision was what he ’inferred.’","After the remnant soul’s death, all relating to it would vanish.","He was not supposed to know.","He borrowed the Divine Lord’s telekinesis to infer about himself, to see the visions his remnant soul saw before dying.","He dared only to infer about himself.","Even with eighteen times more courage, he dared not infer about a Fierce God.","Yet, inferring about his own remnant soul, this was the scene beheld.","Apart from this, there were no more clues.","Unable to see the Fierce God’s face, nor its form.","This might have been inconsequential, but what truly caught Mr. Tu’s attention was the vague sight of the Fierce God’s eyes.","These eyes, deep like a cold pond, with shimmering lustre, complex and bizarre, seemed to contain multiple layers of different powers.","And the most unsettling was a layer of \"black shadow.\"","This was no ordinary black shadow.","Within the black shadow of the Fierce God’s eyes, there seemed to be a faint mix of some kind of deceitful divine thought algorithm.","A name surfaced in Mr. Tu’s heart."]},{"number":1458,"title":"Chapter 1458 - 794 Deceitful Shadow_3","paragraphs":["He felt icy cold all over.","Mr. Tu immediately shook his head saying, \"Impossible, that man’s Dao, no matter how terrifying or deceitful, his influence could never extend this far...\"","\"Especially under the Divine Lord’s watchful eyes.\"","\"Impossible...\"","Mr. Tu murmured.","In the depths of mystery, with causality swirling about, Mr. Tu cast aside this suspicion, letting it slip from his mind.","Only, he never realized whether he forgot it willingly or was forced to forget...","...","At the boundary of Qianxue State, various undercurrents surged.","Mo Hua’s days, on the contrary, became peaceful.","He lit calming incense daily, contemplating the \"Tai Xu Diagram\" given by Elder Master Xun — Mo Hua didn’t know what the diagram was called, he simply used his specialty and gave it an arbitrary name.","Contemplating Tai Xu Diagram, refining the Taoist Heart.","Besides that, attending classes, cultivating, learning formation techniques, continued as usual.","After several days, the remnants of some chaotic and corrupt desires from the sea of consciousness, were purified almost completely.","Mo Hua spent some time reinforcing his sea of consciousness.","In such a way, his realm of divine sense thoroughly stabilized.","Nineteen Patterns!","Mo Hua felt delighted in his heart.","A Foundation Establishment Realm cultivator’s divine sense, generally speaking, this was the strongest level achievable.","His senior brothers, even those a level above him, didn’t possess divine sense as strong as his.","Even some inner sect disciples at the Foundation Establishment Peak, if they didn’t study formations or walk the path of divine sense, wouldn’t have divine sense surpassing his own.","Mo Hua was very pleased.","Moreover, although his cultivation level had not increased, thanks to breaking through two divine sense realms, his divine thought grew significantly stronger, and most of his Tao cultivation methods, including formations, spells, and even rudimentary \"Divine Thought Sword Transformation\", showed obvious improvement.","Only...","Thinking about Divine Thought Sword Transformation, Mo Hua frowned slightly.","His Divine Thought Sword Transformation was \"crippled\".","It could only be used within the divine thought world, including contemplation maps, illusionary realms, dreamlands or nightmares.","It couldn’t be used in reality.","But the orthodox \"Taixu Mind Transforming Sword True Jue\" should not be like this...","Mo Hua recalled the sword cultivator elder from the small fishing village.","That elder’s Divine Thought Sword Transformation could be used in the real world.","Using sword technique as support, through externalizing divine thought, condensing into sword intent, merging with sword qi, it could slash through blood and flesh demons, even ghostly specters.","But his own could not.","Mo Hua had tried many times; no matter how he attempted, it didn’t work.","Foundation Establishment Stage cultivators indeed could externalize divine thought.","But this externalization could only be used passively for sensing, not actively for slaughter.","At most, it served for active \"object manipulation\".","However, the manipulation itself is not based on divine thought slaughter, but relies on the object controlled by divine thought, like spirit swords or other spiritual artifacts, to perform offense and defense.","Mo Hua sighed.","\"How exactly can I learn the true ’Divine Thought Sword Control’?\"","\"Is it because my divine sense isn’t strong enough?\"","Mo Hua paused, suddenly remembering, a long time ago, Lord Yellow Mountain indeed mentioned the divine sense requirement for Divine Thought Sword Control:","\"At least Golden Core, above twenty patterns...\"","\"Furthermore, even Golden Core might not achieve it...\"","\"After all, Divine Thought Sword Transformation is sword qi transforming into sword intent, sword intent representing sword qi, not merely using ’divine thought’ to represent sword qi...\"","Mo Hua scratched his head.","Twenty patterns, Golden Core divine sense, who knows when that day will come.","Those who have proven the Dao with divine sense know, that one pattern divine sense from a breakthrough in a great realm requires an extremely terrifying amount of divine sense.","From nine patterns to ten patterns divine sense, he had tempered for quite a while.","From nineteen patterns to twenty patterns, not to mention, the gap is as vast as a sea.","Mo Hua pondered again:","\"My divine sense is unique, perhaps I don’t need exactly twenty patterns, maybe once nineteen patterns grow a bit stronger, I can try again?\"","Yet this provoked another question.","How to break through beyond nineteen patterns?","The fact that he attained nineteen patterns might largely be due to his good luck.","Mr. Tu, in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, unbeknownst how long he reared a large wave of demon wraiths, was ultimately to Mo Hua’s benefit, as he devoured them in one swift breath.","Refining so many evil spirits, only then he fed the Heavenly Dao Seal, allowing his divine sense to break through eighteen patterns, then together breaking through to nineteen patterns.","But there is only one Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","Even if Mr. Tu’s divine skills were extensive, it would be impossible within the Qianxue State Boundary, to cultivate a second \"land of demon wraiths\".","If so, he could only leave the state boundary.","Yet he still was under house arrest...","Mo Hua was stirred, \"Perhaps, when I have the chance, I should ask Elder Master Xun, if he can lift my house arrest?\"","\"But what excuse should I give?\"","Mo Hua was somewhat perplexed.","As he hesitated, unsure of what \"legitimate reason\" to use to persuade Elder Master Xun, Elder Master Xun unexpectedly sought him out first.","\"This is Formation Diagram with eighteen patterns.\"","Elder Master Xun handed over a thick stack of formation diagrams incorporating some Five Elements and Eight Trigrams formations to Mo Hua, and reminded:","\"Though your divine sense is nineteen patterns now, formations should be learned step by step, start with eighteen patterns, master them steadily, then learn nineteen patterns, do not aim too high and far.\"","\"Yes, Elder Master.\" Mo Hua respectfully replied.","Elder Master Xun glanced at Mo Hua and suddenly asked, \"Can your divine sense... become stronger?\"","Mo Hua was stunned.","Nineteen patterns, still not strong enough?","\"Are you saying... twenty patterns?\" Mo Hua asked softly.","Elder Master Xun replied irately:","\"How can it be twenty patterns? Even if your opportunity is good and talent extraordinary, Foundation Establishment Realm won’t reach twenty patterns!\"","There is a vast gulf between possessing Foundation Establishment Middle Stage divine sense and holding Golden Core Realm divine sense.","The gap between Foundation Establishment and Golden Core is significant.","Both in cultivation and divine sense.","\"Oh, oh.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Elder Master Xun, observing Mo Hua, showed a hint of discreet desire in his eyes, \"Just stronger than now will be enough.\"","Stronger, to ensure greater security.","The sect’s future is at stake, the more secure the better.","\"Stronger?\" Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, and he nodded, \"I can do that!\"","Mo Hua then deliberately appeared troubled, whispered, \"But within Qianxue State Boundary, it’s unlikely, I need to go out, find some opportunities, undergo some ’tempering’...\"","He didn’t specify what this \"opportunity\" was, nor what this \"tempering\" entailed.","Elder Master Xun didn’t ask; he merely gave Mo Hua a look filled with intriguing meaning, nodded, said:","\"Very well, I won’t restrain you; after the new year, you may roam freely.\"","He wanted to see, once left to his devices, to what extent Mo Hua could \"temper\" his divine sense..."]},{"number":1459,"title":"Chapter 1459 - 795: Fish Dragon Lamp","paragraphs":["Elder Master Xun officially lifted Mo Hua’s confinement.","Mo Hua was liberated.","He no longer needed to be trapped within the Qian Learning State Boundary, playing with the \"Junior Brothers\" in the sect every day. From now on, like a fish returning to the sea, a Little Tiger returning to the forest, the sky was high, the seas vast, and it was a whole new world.","A smile that couldn’t be suppressed overflowed on Mo Hua’s face.","\"Thank you, Elder!\"","Elder Master Xun, unable to help himself, shook his head at the sight of Mo Hua’s beaming appearance and advised:","\"Be careful, and whatever you do, do not slack on the Formations.\"","\"Uh-huh, rest assured, Elder!\"","Mo Hua nodded repeatedly in assurance.","After bidding farewell to Elder Master Xun, Mo Hua returned to the Disciple’s Residence, still feeling a bit elated in his heart.","\"Finally, I can go out...\"","He had been confined in the Qianxue State for too long; he almost forgot what the outside was like.","Now that he had the rare chance to go out, he had to plan well.","Mo Hua silently calculated in his mind.","First of all, he had to figure out a way to enhance his Divine Sense further.","Although his Divine Sense, with a total of Nineteen Patterns, was already very strong, it was clearly still far from enough.","Since he needed to Prove the Dao with his Divine Sense, the stronger his Divine Sense, the better.","With a strong Divine Sense, he could learn those more advanced Formations.","Moreover, this was also Elder Master Xun’s plan.","When Elder Master Xun said this, he seemed somewhat serious, with hope in his eyes, suggesting there was something significant.","Although stern, Elder Master Xun had an upright heart, and whatever weighed on his mind should also be related to the Sect.","Being a disciple of the Taixu Sect, Mo Hua had received great care from the Elder over the years.","There were times when Mo Hua felt that Elder Master Xun was a bit partial to him.","\"A drop of kindness should be repaid with a fountain of gratitude.\"","This was something his mother had taught him since he was a child.","Mo Hua nodded.","Since Elder Master Xun hoped that his Divine Sense could be \"a bit stronger,\" he decided to work hard to achieve that \"bit\" of improvement.","He must not let Elder Master Xun down.","And in the short term, to make his Divine Sense a bit stronger...","It seemed he could only visit an altar to \"order a dish.\"","\"The Evil God’s altar...\"","Mo Hua pondered silently.","The only clue he currently knew regarding the altar was \"Water Yama.\"","The culprit of the Yu Family’s water village extinction case, replacing the vanished Demon Head, Fire Buddha on the Blood List —","Water Yama.","The Evil God preached bloodily and cruelly, inevitably accompanied by large-scale slaughter and even the tragic extinction of entire families.","Wherever there was extinction, there must be an altar.","The location of this altar was definitely known to Water Yama.","Mo Hua thought to himself:","\"We cannot let the Evil God spread any further. We cannot allow their henchmen to continue their wanton slaughter. Otherwise, countless cultivators around the Qian Learning State Boundary will fall victim to their evil deeds...\"","Being a disciple of the Taixu Sect, one of the Eight Great Gates of the Qian Learning State Boundary, he was a Righteous Cultivator, naturally responsible for exterminating demons and removing evil spirits.","Of course, having undertaken such arduous work himself.","Afterwards, it’s only right to \"order a dish\" and reward himself!","Mo Hua nodded confidently.","Eliminate the Evil God’s henchmen, destroy the altar, swallow evil spirits, and nourish one’s Divine Sense.","\"Once the Divine Sense is a bit stronger, try practicing the true Divine Thought into Sword art to see if the Sword Intent can be externalized...\"","Moreover, taking time to visit his old friend, Lord Yellow Mountain.","Thinking about Lord Yellow Mountain, Mo Hua couldn’t help but sigh.","\"It’s been so long since I last visited him; I wonder if Lord Yellow Mountain misses me...\"","As a downcast Mountain God, he lived in a dilapidated temple, rain leaking from the roof and wind through the walls, eating stale buns and drinking water from uncertain sources daily, without incense offerings, his days were truly bleak.","Mo Hua sighed in his heart.","Who else but him has a heart so kind, always thinking of visiting him...?","Previously confined, he had no way, but now that he was free, it was only natural to visit the old friend and ask him for other clues about the Divine Thought into Sword.","Having gone through some experiences, Mo Hua gained some insights and understanding in the knowledge of the Divine Way, which he meant to verify with this Mountain God, Lord Yellow Mountain.","But there’s no time now.","Wait until after the New Year...","Mo Hua decided inwardly.","...","Unknowingly, another year was about to pass.","In ten days, it would be the New Year festival.","And at the end of the year, naturally, it was time for the Sect’s examination.","Previously, Mo Hua had stayed in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons for a long time.","Consuming too many Demon Wraiths, his Divine Sense had some minor issues, and he had to recuperate in the Pill Room for a few days.","Altogether, it took about ten days.","Among the fellow disciples, it was easy enough to gloss over.","Mo Hua used the excuse taught by Elder Master Xun, claiming he was ordered by the Elders to go out and draw Formations.","This was not unheard of before.","Every time he took leave, it was mostly for this reason.","Cheng Mo and Situ Jian didn’t suspect a thing, only lamenting how their Junior Brother’s status in the Sect was truly unusual.","The Elders actually allowed him over ten days of leave.","But in those ten odd days, quite a bit of work was missed.","Mo Hua had no choice but to study day and night to catch up on his coursework.","Even at night, he was in front of the Taoist Stele, reviewing some courses on Tao Cultivation.","Soon, it was time for the Sect examination.","After the exam, results came out.","The joys and sorrows among disciples varied.","Despite all his hard work, Mo Hua managed to maintain his \"Grade A and Grade C\" results.","If he had slackened even a bit during this period, he might not have been able to keep even a \"Grade C\" in courses like Artifact Refining and Alchemy.","Fortunately, his efforts paid off.","As for the \"Grade A\" in Formations, needless to say.","With his current level in Formations, within the Sect, even if he missed a few days or years, he would still achieve a \"Grade A.\""]},{"number":1460,"title":"Chapter 1460 - 795 Fish Dragon Lantern_2","paragraphs":["Just like that, another year has slipped by.","The Sect is on holiday now.","The journey is mountainous and far, Mo Hua is alone, still unable to return home to see his parents, or celebrate the New Year with the neighbors and friends in Tongxian City, but he can head over to the Gu Family and join their New Year’s Eve dinner.","After all, the Gu Family has many people, so his presence or absence doesn’t really make a difference.","His physical appetite isn’t as large as his Divine Thought, he won’t \"eat\" the Gu Family poor.","After a few days, Mo Hua packed up his things, bid farewell to Elder Master Xun, and then set off with Yu Er to the Gu Family in Qingzhou City.","Yu Er couldn’t be happier.","\"We’re going home!\"","He spread his arms wide like a little bird, running back and forth along the path.","A Jade Pendant hung around his neck, a gift from Mo Hua, within which was painted the newly learned Divine Lock Array by Mo Hua, truly a \"repelling evil\" object.","These days, without the disturbance from Evil Spirits, Yu Er hardly had any nightmares.","And with the Jade Pendant Mo Hua gifted him, Yu Er felt even more at ease.","Eating well, sleeping well, full of spirit, and learning Formation with Mo Hua every day, he was entirely full of vitality, his eyes flickered bright and clear, appearing even more lively and spirited.","The group entered Qingzhou City and arrived at the Gu Family.","At the sight of Yu Er’s state, Wenren Wan felt a warm relief in her heart and immediately smiled to Mo Hua and said:","\"Treat this as your own home, whatever you want to eat or play, just say so, don’t stand on ceremony.\"","Mo Hua smiled happily, \"Thank you, Aunt Wan.\"","He didn’t hold back then.","Previously immersed in hunting Monster Beasts on Refining Demon Mountain, later venturing into the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, dealing with fierce Monster cultivators, returning to the Sect, he had to review lessons and prepare for exams, constantly busy.","Having rare time off for the New Year, Mo Hua decided to balance work and leisure, breaking the norm to relax a bit.","So he took Yu Er to explore Qingzhou City, where lanterns were hung everywhere, festive and lively, Market Towns bustling endlessly.","By evening, he even took Yu Er to make a fish dragon lantern.","The lantern was helped made by Gu Family cultivators.","Mo Hua was responsible for painting the Formation and guiding it.","This fish dragon lantern was something he stumbled upon in the Taixu Gate’s miscellaneous notes around the holiday season.","The \"miscellaneous notes\" contained the method to make the fish dragon lantern, along with an accompanying brilliant Fire Formation of the same name.","The main Formation was painted by Mo Hua himself.","But several detailed Patterns were drawn by Yu Er.","Having learned Formation from Mo Hua, Yu Er could now draw about five to six Patterns.","Yu Er drew with great focus and happiness.","As night fell, the fish dragon lantern was finished.","Mo Hua activated the Formation, raising the fish dragon lantern.","The fish dragon lantern stretched three zhang long, entirely crimson, covered in fish scales and Dragon Patterns. Once lit, the brilliant Fire Formation within activated, heat rose, and the entire fish dragon lantern floated up into the night sky.","It resembled a crimson koi, transforming into a dragon, swimming across the pitch-black heavens, colorful and exquisite.","Yu Er’s mouth gaped wide, his eyes shining brightly.","Beside them, the invited Wenren Wan gazed at the crimson bright \"fish dragon\" in the night sky, her eyes revealing awe.","Yu Er snuggled up to Wenren Wan’s embrace, his voice clear, \"Mom, I also painted Formation up there! Even though most were done by Brother Mo, I helped too!\"","Wenren Wan looked at Yu Er with a grateful gaze, praised with a smile, \"Yu Er is really awesome!\"","Yu Er was even happier, his face smiling, his eyes curling into little crescents.","...","After releasing the fish dragon lantern, it was time for the evening banquet.","This time, no one bothered them, guests and hosts enjoyed themselves, harmonious and merry.","Mo Hua ate happily, his cheeks puffed full.","Yet during eating, his eyes kept looking around for something. After a moment, he quietly asked Wenren Wan:","\"Aunt Wan, where’s Uncle Gu? How come I don’t see him?\"","Wenren Wan’s expression was slightly nuanced, \"He... maybe has some matters at the Taoist Court, don’t worry about him, eat more...\"","\"Oh oh.\"","Mo Hua stuffed what seemed like a Spirit Beast’s elbow into his mouth.","After finishing the meal, Mo Hua’s stomach was stuffed full.","He strolled in the Gu Family’s backyard to aid digestion.","The Gu Family now, apart from some warehouses, rear residences, Ancestor’s residence, and other Forbidden Lands, he could go wherever he wanted, and no one would stop him.","There were even quite a few cultivators actively greeting him.","Some even offered to guide him.","Along the way, upon seeing some Elders, they’d kindly nod to Mo Hua, some Elders even gifted him presents.","\"A small holiday gift, not precious, young friend please don’t disapprove.\"","The gifts indeed weren’t too valuable.","Considered gifts exchanged between family members, they were meticulously crafted, exceedingly thoughtful, and probably hard to purchase.","Mo Hua reckoned, he probably didn’t have such significant Face.","These Elders likely gave him gifts due to Elder Master Xun’s influence.","But rejecting these small gifts would mean disrespecting them.","Thus, Mo Hua accepted them all graciously.","Meanwhile, he’d offer compliments with a smile, such as wishing male seniors \"successful Tao cultivation,\" \"early Feather Transformation,\" \"prospects of Heaven Void,\" \"eternal life in sight,\" etc.","Or wish female seniors \"youth everlasting,\" \"beauty like a flower,\" \"years permanently secure,\"...and so on.","Making all the Gu Family Elders beam with joy.","Thus, Mo Hua wandered around, ending up with a whole Storage Bag full of \"small gifts.\"","He found a secluded spot and began to inspect each one, checking these small gifts to see if there was anything fun.","As he flipped through, a cool voice sounded by his ear:","\"Are you here to rob our Gu Family?\""]},{"number":1461,"title":"Chapter 1461 - 795: Fish and Dragon Lantern_3","paragraphs":["Mo Hua looked up and saw the tall, handsome but displeased face of Gu Changhuai, as if someone owed him money.","\"Uncle Gu?\"","Mo Hua felt guilty, instinctively wanting to stash away the storage bag.","But halfway through, he realized something.","Why is he feeling nervous?","Mo Hua smugly said, \"These are the New Year gifts given to me personally by the elders of the Gu Family, and out of politeness, I accepted them!\"","Gu Changhuai heard this and couldn’t help but twitch his forehead.","This little rascal Mo Hua is getting along better and better in the Gu Family.","Even better than him, a direct member of the Gu Family.","At least in celebrations, he never received so many \"gifts\" from so many elders.","Gu Changhuai’s feelings became complex for a moment.","Mo Hua ignored him and continued examining his \"little gifts,\" when suddenly he looked up and asked in confusion:","\"Uncle Gu, when did you return?\"","\"What return? I never went out.\" Gu Changhuai said.","\"Never went out?\" Mo Hua was stunned, \"Then how come I didn’t see you at the banquet?\"","\"No appetite.\" Gu Changhuai’s face showed unhappiness.","Mo Hua looked at him suspiciously and couldn’t help but sigh:","\"Uncle Gu, I must say, you’re so old now, and your cultivation has reached the Golden Core stage, yet you still act like a child, sulking with your family...\"","Gu Changhuai felt his teeth itch, and he rubs Mo Hua’s head in irritation, \"You’re just a little brat with less than two decades of cultivation, what do you know?\"","Mo Hua rubbed his forehead and tidied his hair, muttering softly:","\"Less than two decades, I’ll be twenty after the New Year!\"","Gu Changhuai sneered, \"I’m over two hundred years old.\"","\"That’s why I say, you’re over two hundred years old, you should be as mature as I am...\" Mo Hua said earnestly.","Gu Changhuai was annoyed.","Were it not for Mo Hua’s weak constitution and lack of body refinement, he would have \"sparred\" with him vigorously.","Currently, he can’t hit, can’t scold, and there’s also a cousin protecting him.","The group of elders in the Gu Family also treat him with respect.","Gu Changhuai’s face darkened, and he shook his sleeve saying, \"You play here by yourself, I’m leaving.\"","If I can’t provoke him, can I at least avoid him?","As Gu Changhuai turned to leave, Mo Hua suddenly remembered something and hurriedly shouted, \"Uncle Gu, I have some serious business to discuss with you.\"","\"Serious business?\" Gu Changhuai paused, frowning slightly, \"What serious business?\"","Mo Hua looked around and saw no one else, then beckoned Gu Changhuai closer.","Gu Changhuai stood still for a while before reluctantly walking over and sitting down beside Mo Hua.","The two sat side by side on the steps.","Mo Hua whispered, \"It’s about the Yu family’s water fort.\"","Gu Changhuai’s gaze tightened slightly.","Mo Hua said, \"This case has dragged on for a long time, is there any progress over at the Taoist Court?\"","\"This is the Taoist Court’s business, don’t meddle in it,\" Gu Changhuai said.","This answer from Gu Changhuai was expected by Mo Hua.","Uncle Gu’s personality is sometimes quite coy; when asked, he might obfuscate, hesitating to share.","This character trait is quite troublesome.","Mo Hua then asked, \"What about ’Water Yama’?\"","\"That’s also the Taoist Court’s...\"","\"This time it isn’t!\" Mo Hua said.","Water Yama was a name he deduced while calculating causality from that blood oath list.","He could assert that Water Yama was surely related to the massacre at the Yu family’s water fort.","But currently, there’s no obvious linkage between the two.","This matter isn’t included within the Taoist Court’s investigation scope.","Gu Changhuai paused and said helplessly, \"I can only say a little about Water Yama...\"","\"Hmm hmm,\" Mo Hua nodded.","Gu Changhuai thought for a moment and then slowly said:","\"In the past half year, outside the Qianxue state boundary, the name ’Water Yama’ has indeed appeared in some smaller state boundaries.\"","\"But this Water Yama’s whereabouts are equally secretive, and their appearance and origins are unknown.\"","\"But there are some clues...\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"Several murder cases showed victims drowned by unknown Water Series spells, seemingly tortured before death, restrained by unknown chains while kneeling, dying like sinners bearing guilt...\"","\"This manner of death closely resembles that of the Fish Cultivators massacred at the Yu family’s water fort.\"","\"Based on this, these cases might very well be perpetrated by Water Yama...\"","Gu Changhuai’s expression turned somewhat grave.","Mo Hua said, \"And then?\"","\"There’s no ’and then’.\" Gu Changhuai said.","Mo Hua was taken aback, \"No ’and then’?\"","Gu Changhuai sighed, \"It’s not within my control, how would I know the ’and then’...\"","\"Not within your control?\" Mo Hua didn’t understand, \"Uncle Gu, aren’t you a Supervisor?\"","Gu Changhuai’s face looked unpleasant, \"There’s more than one Supervisor in the Taoist Court.\"","Mo Hua wanted to say something but suddenly hesitated, realizing, and exclaimed in shock:","\"Uncle Gu, you’ve been ’dismissed’!?\"","Gu Changhuai felt a headache coming on and said with slight anger:","\"I wasn’t dismissed!\"","Without committing any major mistake, a Supervisor isn’t so easily ’dismissed.’","\"Oh,\" Mo Hua understood, \"then you’re ’sidelined’!\"","Gu Changhuai didn’t want to admit it.","But strictly speaking, Mo Hua wasn’t wrong.","Mo Hua nodded and said, \"Someone doesn’t want you to investigate the case further, or maybe it’s purely targeting you, not wanting you to continue in the Taoist Court...\"","Gu Changhuai’s expression turned icy.","Obviously, what Mo Hua said was correct.","Mo Hua sighed again and asked, \"If you aren’t allowed to investigate, who is handling the Yu family’s water fort case?\"","Gu Changhuai just wanted to answer but suddenly realized that they circled back to the original topic because of Mo Hua.","This kid’s mind is so engrossed with all these twisting turns.","But since things have reached this point, Gu Changhuai decided not to hide it anymore.","Gu Changhuai said, \"It’s handed over to the Xiao family.\"","\"The Xiao family?\" Mo Hua said, \"The ’Smiling Tiger,’ and that ’Howling Celestial Dog’?\"","Gu Changhuai said irritably, \"Don’t randomly assign nicknames!\"","\"Hmm hmm,\" Mo Hua agreed readily, then asked, \"Did the Xiao family find anything?\"","Gu Changhuai said, \"I don’t know.\"","It’s possible they found something but haven’t disclosed it, thus Gu Changhuai doesn’t know.","Or perhaps, the Xiao family worked ineffectively, discovering nothing.","In any case, once the case is handed over to the Xiao family, Gu Changhuai can’t interfere temporarily.","Moreover, he’s \"sidelined\" now.","Mo Hua sighed.","The trail has gone cold.","Uncle Gu can’t interfere, and Mo Hua has even less means to probe the Xiao family, needing to think of another plan.","Mo Hua stole a glance at Gu Changhuai, thinking it’s no wonder Uncle Gu is in a bad mood, even skipping dinner, no blame on him.","Presumably, he faces more targeting within the Taoist Court.","He just never said it out loud.","\"Uncle Gu, have a break, I won’t bother you anymore,\" Mo Hua said considerately.","At times like these, one needs a moment of solitude.","Mo Hua stood up, ready to leave, when a clear voice suddenly rang out:","\"Changhuai, why are you here? I’ve been looking for you all day...\"","Mo Hua looked up to see a female cultivator in red garments with fair skin, surprisingly, Uncle Gu’s aunt, Elder Gu Hong.","Elder Gu Hong said to herself, \"This time you can’t escape, you’re all grown up, after the New Year, go matchmaking for me...\"","Matchmaking?!","Mo Hua, who was about to leave, paused and silently sat back down, quietly pricking up his ears."]},{"number":1462,"title":"Chapter 1462 - 796: Hundred Flowers","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai immediately looked at Mo Hua with disdain and said unhappily, \"Weren’t you going to leave? Why aren’t you leaving now?\"","\"I’m tired from walking, need to rest for a while.\" Mo Hua looked innocent.","\"Go rest somewhere else.\" Gu Changhuai frowned.","\"I can’t walk anymore...\"","Mo Hua cast his clear, spirited gaze towards Elder Gu Hong nearby.","Elder Gu Hong’s heart softened instantly and she reproached Gu Changhuai, saying:","\"This child is just resting for a moment, what’s it to you? You’re rushing him away for this? Such a small-minded, bad-tempered person—no wonder you’re this old and still can’t find a Dao companion.\"","After reprimanding him, Elder Gu Hong smiled at Mo Hua and said:","\"Don’t mind your Uncle Gu, that’s just how he is. Stay here as you wish, rest wherever you like, I dare anyone to chase you away!\"","Mo Hua grinned, \"Thank you, Elder Gu Hong.\"","Gu Changhuai couldn’t stand it anymore and stood up, saying, \"Fine, then I’ll leave.\"","But just as he got up, Elder Gu Hong pressed him down with a palm and said, \"Where are you running off to? I haven’t finished talking yet.\"","Gu Changhuai couldn’t move.","Mo Hua watched with a schadenfreude expression.","Elder Gu Hong said, \"I used to hurry you, and you always said you were busy with Daoist Court. I didn’t want to nag too much, but now I’ve heard from your Court Leader over there...\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"Aunt, you know our Court Leader?\"","\"Of course,\" Elder Gu Hong said, \"I introduced the Dao companion for his youngest son; after it worked out, he personally came to thank me. How could I not know him?\"","Gu Changhuai was at a loss for words.","\"Don’t interrupt,\" Elder Gu Hong continued, \"where was I?\"","Mo Hua quietly reminded, \"The Court Leader said...\"","Elder Gu Hong remembered, \"Right, your Court Leader told me in secret, saying your work lacked prioritization, and unknowingly offended someone. It seems someone is secretly plotting against you. He couldn’t figure it out, so he suppressed you for a while, preventing you from handling cases...\"","At this point, Elder Gu Hong sighed, \"Working at Daoist Court won’t be smooth sailing, ups and downs are common. Don’t be troubled by a temporary setback.\"","\"Moreover, you could say this is a good thing...\"","Elder Gu Hong fixed her gaze intensely on Gu Changhuai, \"Now that you have time, hurry up and go on a date!\"","Gu Changhuai felt a headache and remained silent.","\"Why don’t you get it, child?\"","Elder Gu Hong shook her head, took out a portrait, and pushed it in front of Gu Changhuai.","Gu Changhuai looked coldly, not even glancing.","\"Look at it.\" Elder Gu Hong glared and said.","Gu Changhuai reluctantly glanced at it, but after one look, turned his head away dismissively.","Curious, Mo Hua also leaned over and peeped.","Elder Gu Hong, seeing Gu Changhuai’s lack of sense, was a bit angry and turned to ask Mo Hua, \"How is it, isn’t she beautiful?\"","Mo Hua scrutinized it.","The portrait indeed depicted a very beautiful woman, with a flower-like, jade-like appearance, her face resembling a peach blossom with curved eyebrows.","In terms of appearance alone, she could indeed be considered stunning.","However, the heavy makeup made her look somewhat seductive.","And in Mo Hua’s eyes, she’s not as beautiful as Little Mistress.","Mo Hua nodded, \"Beautiful.\"","Elder Gu Hong beamed with happiness, \"You have an eye for beauty, unlike your Uncle Gu, as indifferent as a stone.\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, suddenly remembering something, and asked:","\"Elder, is this the person you previously introduced to Uncle Gu, the flower-like, jade-like, heavenly immortal Inner Gate Instructor from Hundred Flower Valley?\"","Elder Gu Hong was a bit surprised and nodded, \"You actually remember, yes, that’s the girl...\"","\"Later, I made careful inquiries, this girl’s name is Hua Ruyu, she’s from the direct lineage of the Hua family in Hundred Flower Valley. Though her line is somewhat distant, she’s definitely of direct lineage, her bloodline is fine...\"","After speaking, she was somewhat disgruntled, \"Changhuai, this Supervisor, all day fighting, coupled with his bad temper, those direct-lineage daughters from bloodline-perfect, high-status families definitely wouldn’t marry him.\"","\"This is already the best I could find, not needing to marry far away, right within the Qianxue State Boundary, in one of the Twelve Streams, Hundred Flower Valley. A Daoist Court Supervisor, an Inner Gate Instructor, maybe she might even become an Inner Gate Elder in the future; how well-matched they’ll be...\"","\"Indeed...\" Mo Hua nodded.","\"Moreover, the appearance is good too...\" Elder Gu Hong emphasized again.","Gu Changhuai calmly replied, \"Aunt, don’t judge by appearances alone. It’s hard to know the heart, people who look good aren’t necessarily nice.\"","Elder Gu Hong, exasperated, immediately said, \"Then look in the mirror, check your own appearance, are you not something nice either?\"","Gu Changhuai was rendered speechless.","Elder Gu Hong pointed at Mo Hua, \"And look at Mo Hua, such a handsome and adorable child, isn’t he nice?\"","Gu Changhuai muttered, \"He’s not really ’nice’ either...\"","Elder Gu Hong almost wanted to pinch his ear, \"You’re already a grown-up, still badmouthing children.\"","Mo Hua quietly reminded, \"Elder, let’s focus on the main issue; my matters are not important.\"","\"Look, Mo Hua is so generous!\"","Elder Gu Hong commented again on Gu Changhuai and then looked at Mo Hua, her expression gentle, unable to help but sigh, \"If Changhuai were half as sensible as you, I’d be satisfied.\"","\"He’s over ten times your age, yet not a tenth as thoughtful.\"","Mo Hua nodded instinctively.","Gu Changhuai’s face was expressionless, full of a feeling of helpless despair.","\"Alright, it’s getting late, I have matters to attend to.\" Elder Gu Hong glanced at Gu Changhuai, her tone carrying a hint of warning:"]},{"number":1463,"title":"Chapter 1463 - 796 Hundred Flowers_2","paragraphs":["\"This time, you can’t brush me off again. Anyway, over at the Taoist Court, you’ve already been ’marginalized,’ so you have more time now. After the new year, come with me to meet that girl and get along well. If suitable, settle down and start a family so I can... have some peace of mind...\"","Elder Gu Hong’s expression suddenly turned a bit forlorn, and before Gu Changhuai could say anything, she added:","\"Also, you are not allowed to ’bully’ Mo Hua anymore. I won’t say anything if you’re grumpy with others, but you should at least treat Mo Hua decently. Isn’t it unreasonable to give that child a dirty look? Let me find out, and I won’t let you off.\"","\"Yeah, exactly!\" Mo Hua echoed.","Elder Gu Hong spoke clearly and briskly. After saying a bunch of stuff, she pulled out a box of pastries and handed it to Mo Hua, mentioning that it was a wedding cake sent by a prominent family. The ingredients were exquisite and rare, something she wanted Mo Hua to taste, considering it as a New Year gift.","\"Thank you, Elder Hong!\"","Mo Hua thanked her politely.","Elder Gu Hong smiled at Mo Hua and glanced at Gu Changhuai, as if to say, \"Remember what I said, don’t forget,\" before turning around to leave.","Left on the steps were Mo Hua, beaming with joy while holding the pastries, and Gu Changhuai, whose face was gloomy as if he had sucked on a lemon.","Mo Hua tasted the pastries.","They were fragrant, glutinous, soft yet chewy, with a mix of mild sweetness and aroma filling his mouth. Though not as delicious as the ones made by his mother, they were still very good.","After finishing, Mo Hua sighed, looked at Gu Changhuai, and said with great anticipation:","\"Uncle Gu, when can I have your wedding cake?\"","Gu Changhuai’s face instantly turned as black as the bottom of a pot.","This little rascal Mo Hua can really drive a person up the wall sometimes, even more so now that he’s gotten older!","\"I’m leaving. You play by yourself.\" Gu Changhuai said with a stern face.","Mo Hua, however, replied, \"Uncle Gu, don’t be so hasty...\"","His eyes suddenly lit up, \"Let’s make a deal.\"","\"What deal?\" Gu Changhuai frowned.","Mo Hua whispered, \"You secretly investigate ’Shui Yanluo’ for me, and I’ll handle Elder Hong. Of course, you still have to go on the blind date at least once—I’m too young to do it for you...\"","Gu Changhuai’s frown deepened, \"You?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"With Elder Gu Hong, my words carry more weight than yours! Let’s help each other.\"","Though Gu Changhuai’s face turned a shade of iron blue, he had to admit that Mo Hua’s words made sense.","With his aunt, he really had no means of dealing.","And this child Mo Hua is very good at smooth talking, always full of clever ideas...","Gu Changhuai sighed, \"Alright.\"","Mo Hua extended his hand.","Gu Changhuai was momentarily confused, but then understood. Reluctantly, he extended his hand and shook with Mo Hua.","Mo Hua grinned and said:","\"Deal!\"","...","With Court Official Gu Changhuai, Uncle Gu, investigating Shui Yanluo for him, Mo Hua was much more at ease than if he, a mere Sect Disciple, had to do it himself.","As for how to handle Elder Gu Hong, Mo Hua already had his plans.","He spent a joyful day playing at the Gu Family.","Later, Aunt Wan was going to take Yu Er back to the Shangguan Family to pay respects to the ancestors, while Uncle Gu was nowhere to be found. Who knows if he was busy investigating Shui Yanluo or avoiding the blind date.","Feeling a bit bored, Mo Hua returned to Taixu Gate.","Back at Taixu Gate, he resumed cultivation and studying formations as usual.","Although refining evil spirits to enhance Divine Thought was quicker, the enhancement through formation grinding made the Divine Sense much more solid.","Therefore, both should not be neglected.","Since there were no evil spirits to consume, Mo Hua had to continue grinding his Sea of Consciousness through the \"silly method\" of drawing formations, advancing his Divine Thought.","Moreover, he now had Eighteen Patterns to study in Formation.","Mo Hua spent two days learning formations, initially mastering a set of Eighteen Patterns Eight Trigrams Array. In his spare time, he visited the Pill Room to find Elder Murong.","This was Elder Murong’s instruction.","Elder Murong was worried that after Mo Hua’s trip to the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, he might still not have fully recovered, so she reminded him to come over periodically for a check-up.","After checking the operation of Mo Hua’s body’s meridians, the circulation of Spiritual Power, and the state of the \"weak\" Blood Qi, Elder Murong nodded.","\"There’s nothing serious anymore, you can stop the Pills. Also, don’t overeat during the New Year. Your Blood Qi is weak, your digestion isn’t great; overeating will harm your spleen and stomach.\"","Mo Hua felt slightly embarrassed.","Elder Murong handed him another bottle of Pills, \"For digestion, take them after meals.\"","Mo Hua took the bottle and curiously opened the jade bottle. The Pills inside were a verdant green, with the fragrance of herbs, prompting him to ask:","\"Can I take one now?\"","Elder Murong was momentarily taken aback, then chuckled:","\"You may.\"","So, Mo Hua took one and put it in his mouth to taste.","It was bitter, but mildly so, with a predominant sweet herbal aroma and a unique medicinal flavor. After eating it, he felt his Blood Qi circulate somewhat faster.","Mo Hua smiled, \"Thank you, Elder Murong!\"","Elder Murong’s expression was gentle, and she gave a slight nod.","Just then, her gaze shifted slightly, catching sight of a jade pendant on Mo Hua’s neck.","It was a light white jade pendant, simple in appearance, and carved plainly, with faint green spiritual Patterns within, its jade type unknown.","Mo Hua had always worn this pendant on his neck.","Elder Murong had seen it before but hadn’t paid much attention. Now, however, her heart skipped a beat.","\"That jade pendant is...\"","\"Jade pendant?\"","Mo Hua was startled, looked down at it, and realized.","\"This is...\" Elder Murong’s gaze sharpened, her voice slightly peculiar, \"Pill Jade?\"","\"Mm.\" Mo Hua nodded and asked, \"Elder Murong, do you also know about Pill Jade?\""]},{"number":1464,"title":"Chapter 1464 - 796 Hundred Flowers_3","paragraphs":["Mo Hua spoke, only to realize that this Pill Jade was given to him by Grandpa Feng, a first-grade alchemist.","And Elder Murong, being a third-grade alchemist, knowing about the Pill Jade was nothing unusual.","Mo Hua asked again, \"Is there any problem with this jade?\"","Elder Murong’s eyes glimmered, then she shook her head, \"Nothing...\"","But after a moment’s hesitation, she still asked, \"You’re not an alchemist and not very good at alchemy, so how do you have Pill Jade on you?\"","\"It was given to me by someone else.\"","\"Given?\"","There was obvious surprise in Elder Murong’s eyes.","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua thought for a moment and didn’t hide it, he said:","\"When I was in Tongxian City, an elderly man who watched me grow up, renowned and revered, gave it to me.\"","\"This elderly man, though only a first-grade alchemist, spent his life healing and saving people, beloved by many.\"","\"This Pill Jade was always with him while he cured and saved lives and he later gave it to me when I started learning formations...\"","Mo Hua paused to recall.","He remembered that at that time, Grandpa Feng also mentioned that this Pill Jade was given to him by his master.","Among the Pill Masters, there’s a saying that healing and saving can accumulate merit.","The Pill Jade carried with it the meritorious deeds of the Pill Master.","Grandpa Feng gave him the Pill Jade hoping it could protect him, turning misfortune into blessings, and letting him grow up safely.","\"Pill Masters save people, but can’t save too many; Formation Masters don’t save people, but they can save many...\"","Grandpa Feng said so.","And wearing this Pill Jade indeed brought peace of mind.","But as Mo Hua had worn it for too long, coupled with nothing causing him unrest now, over time, he didn’t feel anything unusual and wore the Pill Jade as a ’Blessing’ from an elder, hung around his neck as a keepsake.","Of course, these things he didn’t share with Elder Murong.","It wasn’t that he didn’t trust Elder Murong, but many things have their causations and connections, so in speaking, it’s prudent to leave some things unsaid.","Elder Murong didn’t press further but advised:","\"It’s fine within the Sect, but outside, especially in front of some Pill Masters, don’t reveal this Pill Jade...\"","Mo Hua thought of asking why, but Elder Murong’s expression was already one of gentle elegance, and not speaking further, so Mo Hua wisely stayed silent and nodded:","\"Mm, I understand.\"","Afterward, Elder Murong gave Mo Hua several more bottles of commonly used pills, after which Mo Hua took his leave.","After Mo Hua departed, Elder Murong was lost in thought for a moment, her expression one of either envy or sigh:","\"Indeed... a child blessed with great fortune...\"","...","Leaving the Pill Room, Mo Hua walked alone on the path back to the Disciple’s Residence.","Elder Murong’s words lingered in his mind.","\"Pill Jade...\"","Could it be that the Pill Jade... is something valuable?","Or perhaps, the \"Pill Jade\" that Grandpa Feng gave him is rather rare?","Otherwise, Elder Murong, a third-grade alchemist elder of the Taixu Gate, wouldn’t have specifically inquired about the jade pendant on him...","Mo Hua walked with his head down, lost in thought, when a crisp and melodious voice suddenly called out to him:","\"Junior Brother Mo...\"","Mo Hua was so preoccupied with thoughts of the Pill Jade that he didn’t hear, and after a moment, the voice carried a hint of playful reproach:","\"Junior Brother Mo!\"","Mo Hua was startled, looked up surprised:","\"Senior Sister Murong?\"","Before him was a woman wearing the Taoist Robe of the Taixu Gate, with gentle demeanor, composed and beautiful, it was Murong Caiyun.","Murong Caiyun gave Mo Hua a gentle yet reproachable look, \"What are you thinking about? I called you several times, and you didn’t hear.\"","Mo Hua embarrassedly smiled, just about to say something when he turned his head and found that behind Senior Sister Murong, there were several female disciples.","And they didn’t belong to the Taixu Gate.","They were in brightly colored dresses, resplendently adorned like a cluster of flowers, wearing Hundred Flower Valley’s Taoist robes.","Among them was Hua Qianqian, whom he knew.","Mo Hua was a bit surprised, \"Senior Sister Qianqian is here too?\"","Hua Qianqian, with a cheerful face, looked at Mo Hua, \"Junior Brother Mo, long time no see.\"","Her gaze lingered on Mo Hua for a moment, very satisfied, she said: \"You’ve grown a bit taller, you’ll definitely look even better in clothes now...\"","Mo Hua was wary.","Murong Caiyun sighed, helpless with her behavior.","Mo Hua then turned to Murong Caiyun and asked: \"Senior Sister Murong, what brings you here...\"","\"I’m going to visit my aunt.\" Murong Caiyun said.","\"Aunt?\" Mo Hua paused, then remembered, \"Elder Murong?\"","\"Yes.\" Murong Caiyun nodded, \"My aunt is an Elder Alchemist, skilled in various pills. Qianqian and the others want to inquire about alchemy knowledge, so I’m taking them to seek guidance from my aunt.\"","\"Oh.\" Mo Hua understood.","After Murong Caiyun finished, she introduced the other female disciples from Hundred Flower Valley:","\"This is Junior Brother Mo Hua, whom I mentioned to you, Junior Brother Mo is excellent at Formation Painting. If you need help, you can ask him to draw formations for you.\"","Then, she introduced to Mo Hua:","\"These are disciples from Hundred Flower Valley, they are in the same cohort as Qianqian, technically, they are all your senior sisters. This is Senior Sister Hua, Senior Sister Ye, Senior Sister Mu...\"","Murong Caiyun introduced them one by one.","Mo Hua, somewhat shy, saluted:","\"Greetings, senior sisters.\"","The few female disciples from Hundred Flower Valley, upon seeing Mo Hua, their eyes lit up with admiration.","\"What a handsome and adorable junior brother!\"","\"And he’s proficient in formations, formations are so hard to learn...\"","\"Truly, one can’t judge a book by its cover...\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","\"Alright, alright,\" Murong Caiyun said, \"it’s getting late, if we’re late, my aunt might blame us.\"","The female disciples from Hundred Flower Valley were reluctant as they bid farewell to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua took a moment to look at the appearances of these senior sisters, each with fair skin and beautiful features, and in their Hundred Flower Valley robes, standing together, they were like a splendid cluster of flowers.","Mo Hua momentarily felt a bit face-blind.","But one of the senior sisters was distinctly more beautiful.","Mo Hua remembered, she seemed to have the surname \"Ye\".","This Senior Sister Ye had an oval face, exquisite features, skin like creamy jade, and her eyebrows and eyes bore a trace of melancholic charm, her character was more introverted, not fond of speaking, adding a sense of cool aloofness.","Mo Hua glanced briefly, then waved farewell to the senior sisters.","He hadn’t thought much about this encounter.","But, several days later, before the festival was over, while Mo Hua was painting formations, he heard dreadful news:","This Senior Sister Ye from Hundred Flower Valley...","had committed suicide."]},{"number":1465,"title":"Chapter 1465 - 797: Suicide","paragraphs":["This message was obtained by Mo Hua from Hao Xuan—mainly from his cousin, Hao Se.","Hao Xuan’s year-end evaluation was poor.","Especially in swordsmanship.","Ever since he got addicted to sneak attacks, he rarely used the sword, and over time, his swordsmanship became rusty.","In a sect full of geniuses, not improving in swordsmanship equates to regression.","As a result, Hao Xuan only got a \"Grade C\" in swordsmanship, although he was actually a bit stronger than Mo Hua, their ratings were indeed quite similar.","But Mo Hua’s brilliance overshadowed his flaws; he excelled in formations, and his aptitude in other areas was limited, so no one blamed him.","Moreover, he doesn’t have a family, his parents aren’t around, his cultivation relies entirely on self-discipline, and no one supervises him.","To take it even further, even if his parents were around and knew Mo Hua could achieve \"Grade A1 and Grade C6\" in the Qian Learning State Boundary full of sect talents, they would only feel proud of him.","After all, his starting point was too low, so achieving anything is not easy.","Hao Xuan is different.","He has a family; competition within the family is fierce and expectations are strict, his parents place a high value on his academic scores.","At his age, a cultivator’s \"academic scores\" in the sect is often his entire \"meaning of existence.\"","Therefore, getting a \"Grade C\" is akin to the sky falling down for Hao Xuan.","His parents, including elders of the same lineage, didn’t show him a warm face.","Hao Xuan’s year was spent in fear and trepidation.","He increasingly didn’t want to stay in the family, so he took the second-best option and ran to Taixu Gate \"seeking refuge.\"","His excuse to his parents was:","Didn’t do well in the exam, felt very ashamed, wanted to strive for progress, hence staying in the sect to diligently cultivate, make up studies, and wouldn’t return home for New Year.","This excuse was something he specifically learned from \"Junior Brother\" Mo Hua.","And indeed, Hao Xuan’s parents didn’t oppose it.","They weren’t just non-opposing; they even felt Hao Xuan was \"motivated by shame.\"","Although his exam was poor this time, knowing he strives, it’s not too late.","His parents were quite pleased.","Thus, Hao Xuan stayed in Taixu Gate, spending New Year with Mo Hua.","He indeed practiced in his daily life, either learning swordsmanship, practicing staff skills, or consulting Mo Hua on formations, never slackening, hence not lying to his parents.","Approaching the New Year, his parents, after all, cared about this \"motivated to advance\" son, so they let his cousin Hao Se specifically return to the sect to bring him some good food.","At this moment, Hao Xuan was at the Disciple’s Residence, learning formation from Mo Hua.","Hao Se placed several food boxes with dark red linings on the table and said: \"Hao Xuan, I brought you some food.\"","After saying this, he bowed to Mo Hua, \"Junior Brother, Happy New Year.\"","\"Happy New Year...\"","Mo Hua returned the gesture, but his expression was a bit bewildered.","He wasn’t very familiar with Hao Se, only remembering that in the same year within Taixu Gate, there seemed to be such a disciple, but he wasn’t deeply impressed.","In daily life, whether doing sect rewards or monster hunting in Refining Demon Mountain, they seemed to have minimal intersection.","He couldn’t even recall the name.","Hao Xuan then said: \"This is my cousin, his surname is Hao and his name is Se, he is one year older than me, but his Tao Cultivation enlightenment was with mine, we are similar in age, cultivation is also roughly the same, so we entered Taixu Gate together.\"","\"Oh.\" Mo Hua nodded.","\"Hao Se...\"","Just this name felt rather strange no matter how it was heard.","Hao Se was lively in temperament and somewhat familiar.","Mo Hua didn’t really know him, but he knew Mo Hua.","After all, among more than a thousand disciples in Taixu Gate, there was only this one \"Junior Brother.\"","The family New Year gatherings have too many people and are too noisy, with many cumbersome formalities as well.","Hao Se rarely ran out, temporarily didn’t want to return, so he stayed with Hao Xuan and Mo Hua to eat spiritual meals, drink spiritual wine, and chat at the Disciple’s Residence.","While chatting, Hao Se suddenly looked desolate and sighed, saying:","\"A senior sister died in Hundred Flower Valley.\"","This statement was very abrupt.","Mo Hua was happily eating a drumstick and suddenly froze for a moment, \"What?\"","Hao Se repeated, \"A senior sister died in Hundred Flower Valley...\"","Mo Hua was stunned for a moment, looking at Hao Se, his mind racing with many thoughts but unsure where to start questioning.","How could a senior sister die in Hundred Flower Valley?","You’re not even a disciple of Hundred Flower Valley... how do you know such things?","Moreover, what’s the connection between a senior sister’s death in Hundred Flower Valley and you?","Hao Xuan sighed, somewhat reluctant to speak, but in the Disciple’s Residence, there were no outsiders, he said:","\"My cousin’s lifelong wish is to become a disciple of Hundred Flower Valley...\"","Mo Hua was stunned for a moment, \"Does Hundred Flower Valley accept male disciples?\"","Hao Se shook his head, disappointedly saying: \"No.\"","Mo Hua curiously asked: \"How do you plan to become a disciple of Hundred Flower Valley?\"","Hao Se solemnly said: \"Precisely because Hundred Flower Valley doesn’t accept male disciples, my lifelong ambition is to push for Hundred Flower Valley’s reform, to have Hundred Flower Valley accept male disciples, or at least male cultivators as elders. So after graduating from Taixu Gate, even if I can’t be a disciple, I can have ’becoming an elder of Hundred Flower Valley’ as a lifelong aspiration...\"","Mo Hua opened his mouth but didn’t know what to say.","The world is vast and filled with all kinds of people...","\"But such reform isn’t feasible, right? Hundred Flower Valley seems to be unlikely to admit male cultivators as guest elders,\" Mo Hua added.","\"Yes, the future is bleak...\"","Hao Se looked desolate, finally gritting his teeth, \"If all fails, I heard Hehuan Sect has a cultivation technique that reverses Yin and Yang, I...\"","Hao Xuan immediately covered his mouth, \"Stop it, cousin! Stop talking! If Uncle or Aunt hears, they’ll definitely break your leg.\""]},{"number":1466,"title":"Chapter 1466 - 797 Suicide_2","paragraphs":["Mo Hua was also shocked, feeling admiration.","In a sense, this brother is also a tough person.","But he was also quite puzzled and asked, \"Why do you want to go to the Hundred Flower Valley so much?\"","Hao Se replied earnestly:","\"There isn’t any special reason, just an ordinary ’life goal’, since it’s a life goal, why would it need a reason?\"","Mo Hua found himself speechless.","Off to the side, Hao Xuan sighed, \"My cousin is actually quite talented, but he is... a bit abnormal...\"","Hao Se looked displeased but did not refute.","Hao Xuan continued, \"Logically, if he worked a bit harder, and if the family pulled some strings, it wouldn’t be impossible for him to be accepted into one of the Four Great Sects, but because he always ’makes shocking remarks’, the family feared he’d cause trouble, so they had to put him into the Taixu Gate to keep me company. We grew up together, so I understand his temperament and can keep an eye on him...\"","So that’s how it is...","Mo Hua nodded slightly.","Hao Se, however, \"persisted in his opinion\" saying, \"What’s the big deal about the Four Great Sects? If I could enter the Hundred Flower Valley, who would care about the Four Great Sects?\"","Hao Xuan tore off a drumstick and handed it to Mo Hua, \"Junior brother, have some chicken, just ignore him.\"","\"Oh...\" Mo Hua took the drumstick, took a bite, and suddenly asked curiously, \"Hao Se...\"","Because he was munching on the drumstick, his speech was unclear, and the \"Hao Se\" in his mouth turned into \"lustful\"...","Hao Se quickly corrected him:","\"It’s Hao Se, not lustful!\"","\"Mm-hmm.\" Mo Hua nodded, then asked, \"Hao Se, you said a senior sister in the Hundred Flower Valley committed suicide, what exactly happened?\"","Hao Se’s expression turned sorrowful.","Though he was in the Taixu Gate, his heart was in the Hundred Flower Valley, so he was always concerned about matters there.","\"I often roam around near the Hundred Flower Valley, so I also befriended a few senior sisters from there...\"","\"How did you make their acquaintance?\"","\"After getting beaten a few times, we got to know each other...\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","Hao Xuan felt very embarrassed but still explained:","\"My cousin would roam around the Hundred Flower Valley whenever he had time. The disciples there discovered him and, thinking he was up to something, beat him up a few times. After the misunderstanding was cleared, they got to know each other...\"","This really was a case of \"no beating, no acquaintance\"...","Hao Se waved his hand and said, \"Those are just minor issues, whose life doesn’t have a few small setbacks. The important thing is what happened next...\"","Hao Se took a sip of wine, frowned, and said, \"Last year, when I gave some New Year gifts to the senior sisters in the Hundred Flower Valley, I noticed something was off with their expressions, so I asked if anything had happened. They wouldn’t say, but after I reassured them repeatedly that I wouldn’t leak it to outsiders, they finally told me...\"","Reaching this point, Hao Se said to Mo Hua and Hao Xuan, \"You guys also have to promise not to leak this, then I can tell you...\"","Hao Xuan and Mo Hua silently nodded in agreement.","Hao Se, satisfied, continued:","\"The senior sisters said that during the New Year, most of the sisters returned to their families to celebrate, but some stayed at the Hundred Flower Valley due to the long journey, needing to retake exams, or being delayed by personal matters.\"","\"On the festive day, everything was going well, until suddenly, a fire broke out in one of the Disciple’s Residences.\"","\"The fire wasn’t large, and the Elder on duty quickly extinguished it. It didn’t spread, nor did it cause much damage.\"","\"Initially, the Elder was a bit angry, thinking some disciple had been negligent and hadn’t shut off the Pill Furnace properly before leaving, causing the furnace to catch fire and lead to the blaze.\"","\"But when the Elder entered the Disciple’s Residence, his expression changed dramatically.\"","\"Inside the Disciple’s Residence was a charred body. A female disciple had been burned alive during the New Year... just like that.\"","Mo Hua’s gaze intensified, \"Was it suicide?\"","Hao Se shook his head, \"I don’t know either, but the Hundred Flower Valley investigated and found no signs of anyone else being involved. The room had been occupied by the senior sister alone the entire time.\"","\"This incident even alerted the Sect Leader.\"","\"Yet neither the Sect Leader nor the other Elders could find any other clues, and they finally concluded unanimously that it was a suicide...\"","Hao Se recounted the information he had heard.","Mo Hua furrowed his brow.","He kept feeling that something about this matter seemed odd.","But this was an issue for the Hundred Flower Valley.","Mo Hua was very busy. He had to balance cultivation, classes, learning formations, and investigating the Water Yama case, leaving him with no time to meddle in such matters.","Moreover, the Hundred Flower Valley not only prohibited male disciples but also barred any male cultivators from entering.","Even if he wanted to get involved, he couldn’t.","As for the promising senior sister who had immolated herself, he could only sigh and feel a sense of regret in his heart.","Hao Se also showed a saddened expression.","Seeing the atmosphere turn somber, Hao Xuan said, \"Let’s not talk about this anymore. The Hundred Flower Valley will naturally give an account of the matter. Let’s discuss something else.\"","Hao Se nodded in agreement.","He had been feeling sad himself, and now that he had spoken about it, he felt a little relief.","Moreover, cases of sect disciples committing suicide or dying weren’t unheard of in the Qian Learning State Boundary.","There were even cases where some male and female disciples, dissatisfied with marriages arranged by their families since childhood, had eloped in a suicide pact...","With so many people, anything was possible.","Hao Xuan picked another topic, letting the matter pass.","The three of them ate meat, drank wine, and chatted for a while before Hao Se needed to return to the clan.","Before leaving, Mo Hua suddenly paused, as if driven by a mysterious force, and asked:","\"Hao Se, do you know who that senior sister who committed suicide was?\"","Hao Se thought for a moment, shook his head, and said, \"I don’t know. I never met her, but I heard that this senior sister’s surname was ’Ye’...\"","Surname Ye...","Mo Hua’s pupils contracted."]},{"number":1467,"title":"Chapter 1467 - 797 Suicide_3","paragraphs":["A face appeared in his mind.","An oval face, delicate features, skin smooth as jade, with a touch of melancholy between the brows, seeming both introverted and somewhat aloof.","Senior Sister Ye?!","A few days ago, he had seen Senior Sister Ye, dressed in vibrant colors, with a beauty that surpassed the flowers. And just within days, she suddenly died?","Mo Hua frowned.","\"Could it be I’ve guessed wrong... It wasn’t that Senior Sister Ye?\"","In Hundred Flower Valley, there might be more than one ’Ye’ Senior Sister; the one who committed suicide could be someone else.","But even so, Mo Hua had a bad premonition in his heart.","...","Mo Hua couldn’t let this matter go.","A few days later, he sought confirmation from Senior Sister Murong.","Murong Caiyun looked shocked, \"Who did you hear this from?\"","\"A friend I met by chance, who has some association with Hundred Flower Valley said it.\"","Mo Hua didn’t mention Hao Se’s name.","Murong Caiyun’s expression turned somewhat melancholy, she sighed softly, \"Yes, it’s Sister Jin...\"","\"Jin Er?\"","\"The one you mentioned as Senior Sister Ye, her surname is Ye, and her given name is ’Jin’. So she’s...\" Murong Caiyun’s expression became pained, \"The female disciple who committed suicide in Hundred Flower Valley...\"","\"Was it really suicide?\" Mo Hua frowned.","Murong Caiyun nodded slightly, \"Hundred Flower Valley investigated, it should be suicide. As for the reason, it’s hard to say...\"","\"There’s talk of her family forcing her to marry, others say the pressure of cultivation was too great, and yet others say she was heartbroken and couldn’t cope, so she ended her life.\"","\"But these are all rumors, whether they’re true or not is hard to determine.\"","Mo Hua was a bit puzzled, \"Her family forced her to marry? She’s supposed to marry this early?\"","\"Yes,\" Murong Caiyun replied, \"The Ye family is a third-grade family, elsewhere they might be considered a great family, but in Qianxue Territory, they’re only a medium-sized family at best.\"","\"Such families live in the crevices between great families, moving forward is difficult, but stepping back is easy, and once you step back, you may never climb up again.\"","\"Therefore, families like the Ye family have a strong sense of crisis, specializing in flattering and clinging wherever they can.\"","\"Girls within the clan, beautiful in appearance, outstanding in talent, able to be accepted into a Great Sect, are eyed for marriage early.\"","\"Marriage might not happen, but the engagement must be arranged, and the sooner the better, that way they can...\"","Murong Caiyun hesitated to continue.","Mo Hua then said, \"...sell for a good price, right?\"","Murong Caiyun blinked slightly and sighed deeply, nodding:","\"Yes.\"","Marriages within the clan, whether in great families or small ones, most are a form of ’transaction’.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but recall listening to An Xiaofu discussing family ’eight trigrams’ back in Tongxian City.","And possibly Uncle Zhang Lan who fled to Little Immortal City to avoid marriage, making his heart feel melancholic.","It seems there are many helpless situations within clans.","Mo Hua subtly probed further, trying to gather more news about Senior Sister Ye’s suicide from Hundred Flower Valley, but Murong Caiyun didn’t know much, most of the information matched what Hao Se said.","The only new clue was the Ye family.","\"The Ye family...\"","Mo Hua softly muttered the name, strangely feeling the surname \"Ye\" was familiar.","But ever since entering Qianxue State Boundary, he had been exposed to many families and cultivators, numerous great families and small clans, even with the same surname, having ancestry traced back to the same origin, complicated and intricate.","Mo Hua, originally a Loose Cultivator, felt a bit confused dealing with these complex family names.","For a moment, he couldn’t recall if he had contacted any cultivators or clans with the surname \"Ye\".","\"By the way, Senior Sister Murong,\" Mo Hua finally asked, \"Where is this Ye family located? It shouldn’t be within Qianxue State Boundary, right?\"","\"Yes, the Ye family is a third-grade family, not qualified to establish itself in Qianxue State Boundary. As for where...\"","Murong Caiyun frowned slightly, \"Wait a moment, I’ll check.\"","She took out a map from a golden phoenix-patterned storage bag, looked through it for a while, and pointed with her slender, fair finger to a spot:","\"Here... Mistwater City.\"","Mo Hua’s pupils suddenly trembled.","\"Mistwater... City?\"","\"Yes.\" Murong Caiyun nodded, \"Mistwater City is a third-grade Immortal City, located beside Mistwater River. The river flows through the city, hence the name ’Mistwater City’.\"","\"The Ye family is among the top-ranking families in Mistwater City...\"","Murong Caiyun finished speaking and noticed Mo Hua’s unusual expression, so she asked:","\"Is there something wrong?\"","\"Nothing...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, shaking his head.","He silently memorized the words \"Mistwater City\", then thanked Murong Caiyun, exchanged a few more courtesies, and took his leave.","Back to the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua sat at the desk, furrowing his brow even tighter.","Mistwater City...","The Ye family, Senior Sister Ye, Hundred Flower Valley.","Suicide...","He sensed there were significant issues within.","But there were too few clues, somewhat difficult to piece together.","Mo Hua sighed lightly.","He had only met ’Senior Sister Ye’ once, barely exchanged words, never intended to meddle, and this was an internal affair of Hundred Flower Valley.","Yet now, with ’Mistwater River’ involved, it seemed different...","He needed to figure out what truly transpired...","\"But, how to investigate?\"","Hundred Flower Valley was definitely out of reach, unable to investigate there.","The only viable path was through the Ye family in Mistwater City.","\"I’ll make time to visit Mistwater City soon...\"","Mo Hua murmured internally.","A few days later, the holidays fully concluded, Taixu Gate ’opened school’ again.","A new academic year began.","This marked Mo Hua’s fifth year at Taixu Gate.","At the start of school, there were numerous tasks, the elders began teaching, disciples had to focus, along with various miscellaneous errands.","Mo Hua spent seven or eight days handling chores, and life at the sect fell into routine.","Soon, it was the first ten-day break.","Mo Hua decided to set off for Mistwater City.","But before heading there, he wanted to take a detour, going a bit further to visit the broken temple on Kushan Mountain and check on Lord Yellow Mountain.","After all, it had been a long time, he didn’t know how Lord Yellow Mountain was faring.","Whether there was incense offering, whether the temple was in disrepair, and so forth.","Of course, he also intended to inquire about certain things, like the path of deities, and...","Divine Thought into Sword."]},{"number":1468,"title":"Chapter 1468 - 798 Eyes","paragraphs":["Kushan Mountain, secluded and tranquil.","Sunlight filtered through the deep forest, cutting into fragmented shadows, spreading on the ground, bright yet cool.","On the mountain steps, fallen leaves piled up, soft and cushy when stepped on.","The rarely-visited mountains exuded a unique hidden charm.","Mo Hua stepped on the fallen leaves on the mountain steps, and arrived at the decaying temple once more.","Inside the decaying temple, it remained as usual, still as run-down.","The roof continued to leak, the walls continued to let in drafts, and there was nothing on the offering platform, not even stale steamed buns, only aged rainwater settled at the bottom of a bowl, dirty and murky.","Lord Yellow Mountain’s clay statue wore a bitter expression.","When people are poor, life is hard.","When the Mountain God is poor, life is equally tough.","The moment Mo Hua entered, the smoke-like form of Lord Yellow Mountain slowly floated out from the clay statue, bowing to Mo Hua, forcing a smile:","\"Hello, young friend...\"","Mo Hua also smiled happily, waving to him:","\"Mountain Lord, long time no see, did you miss me?\"","I missed you, you big-headed ghost.","Not at all...","If you didn’t come, I could finally have peace.","Lord Yellow Mountain thought, but smiled even more on the surface, cheerfully saying:","\"Naturally, it’s been a while since I’ve seen you, young friend, I’ve truly missed you...\"","Mo Hua nodded, very pleased.","Lord Yellow Mountain secretly sighed in his heart.","No wonder he’s been feeling uneasy these past few days; it turns out this \"Little Plague God\" is about to visit again.","But there’s no way around it, the temple is here, he can’t run away, just has to resign himself to fate.","Mo Hua glanced around the decaying temple, feeling some sympathy for Lord Yellow Mountain’s hard days, then placed the offerings of chicken, duck, and fish he’d prepared on the offering table.","Although Lord Yellow Mountain didn’t like Mo Hua coming, he couldn’t refuse the chicken and duck offerings.","In the sparsely populated Kushan Mountain, no one offered sacrifices, leaving him hungry to the point of being just a shadow.","Even knowing Mo Hua \"comes with ill intentions,\" he was powerless to do anything about it.","Mo Hua placed the offerings, then asked: \"By the way, doesn’t the Mountain God need incense?\"","\"Yes...\" Lord Yellow Mountain said contentedly.","\"Well, that’s perfect,\" Mo Hua said, \"I’ve also brought you some incense; wait and I’ll light it for you.\"","Lord Yellow Mountain’s incense burner was already in a sorry state, originally copper-colored, now coated with a layer of black grime.","Mo Hua washed the incense burner and then refilled it with some grain at the bottom, sprinkled a layer of incense ash, and then lit a stick of incense, inserting it into the incense burner.","But just at the moment Mo Hua personally inserted the incense into the burner.","Lord Yellow Mountain felt as if a giant iron hammer had slammed into his chest, his heart about to leap out of his throat.","He immediately cried out in shock:","\"No!\"","Mo Hua’s incense lighting motion paused, turning his head, somewhat puzzled, looking at Lord Yellow Mountain, \"Don’t you want the incense?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain’s heart still trembled with fear, eyes lingering with panic.","Just that instant, he was scared to the point his Divine Soul nearly scattered.","It felt as if that wisp of incense was as heavy as a mountain, weighing him down, leaving him unable to breathe, utterly unable to bear it.","What does this mean...","The incense from this young friend... he can’t afford it?!","Lord Yellow Mountain gazed deeply at Mo Hua, then tugged at the corners of his mouth, forcing a smile:","\"The good intentions of a young friend, this Minor God appreciates, but let’s skip the incense for now. Hungry for so long, eating some offerings suffices, eating incense might just make me overfull...\"","\"Overfull?\" Mo Hua asked, puzzled, muttering, \"Can deities also be overfull?\"","Well, if you don’t want it, fine then.","Maybe accustomed to poverty, suddenly having a full meal means they can’t eat too well.","Mo Hua nodded.","\"Then eat the offerings.\"","Lord Yellow Mountain bowed: \"Many thanks, young friend.\"","Thus, in the decaying temple, on the clay statue, Lord Yellow Mountain slowly floated out, descended onto the offering table, and began enjoying the offerings laid out by Mo Hua.","As he ate, Mo Hua couldn’t just sit by idly.","He also took out the \"snacks\" he’d prepared for himself from his storage bag, jumped onto the offering table, and sat alongside Lord Yellow Mountain, eating together.","Lord Yellow Mountain ate the offerings while discreetly observing Mo Hua.","Only then did he realize Mo Hua was different from before.","His aura was restrained, his Divine Thought coherent, making him feel close, yet faintly exuding a sense of \"awe,\" instilling fear.","Lord Yellow Mountain was inwardly startled.","If he remembered correctly, it had only been a year...","A year without seeing, this young adolescent seemed to have undergone yet another transformation.","More bizarrely, Mo Hua’s Divine Sense was clearly stronger.","But just how strong... Lord Yellow Mountain was unsure at the moment.","Most of a person’s Divine Sense is sealed within their Sea of Consciousness, only a small portion is externalized.","Foundation Building Cultivators cannot perform Primordial Spirit Emergence; to glimpse the true nature of their Divine Sense requires either leading them into dreams or invading their Sea of Consciousness.","Lord Yellow Mountain sneakily glanced at Mo Hua.","\"Lead him into dreams, or invade his Sea of Consciousness?\"","This thought emerged, yet he immediately extinguished it.","When one acts foolishly, death is assured.","The same applies to gods.","\"One must be dutiful as a human, and the same applies to being a god. I’m no longer what I used to be; I must be more ’law-abiding’...\"","Lord Yellow Mountain silently chanted in his heart.","Then he calmly began eating the offerings.","Mo Hua ate quickly, wolfing down his food; Lord Yellow Mountain, as a Mountain God, had to maintain composure, so he ate slowly, deliberately.","Mo Hua finished eating, and with nothing to do, began asking Lord Yellow Mountain:","\"Mountain Lord, can I ask you about Divine Thought into sword?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain gracefully ate a chicken leg, feeling a bit surprised at the words, \"Haven’t you asked before?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"I did ask before, but recently I thought of some new questions.\"","Before, he couldn’t perform Divine Thought into sword at all, purely an outsider.","But now things are different; he learned a bit of the Sword Transforming Skill, one foot barely stepping through the threshold, with a foundational understanding, naturally asking different questions."]},{"number":1469,"title":"Chapter 1469 - 798 Eyes_2","paragraphs":["Lord Yellow Mountain did not want to answer.","Especially about the matter of \"Divine Thought into Sword,\" which was a lifelong pain.","But having eaten, it was difficult to refuse.","Moreover, the aura of majesty around Mo Hua was becoming more intense, and it dared not refuse.","\"Ask, young friend, this minor god will tell you everything.\"","\"Hmm.\" Mo Hua nodded and asked Lord Yellow Mountain the questions he had pondered early:","\"Mountain Lord, for Divine Thought into Sword, must it be used with a sword?\"","\"Of course, otherwise, how can it be called Divine Thought into ’Sword’?\"","\"What I mean is, after transforming Divine Thought into ’Sword Intent,’ must it be attached to Sword Qi or Spirit Sword in order to be performed? Can it be used directly?\"","\"This...\" Lord Yellow Mountain hesitated, somewhat troubled:","\"I haven’t learned it, so I’m not sure, but the Sword Cultivator I fought did indeed use a sword to carry Sword Intent.\"","\"Moreover, without relying on Sword Qi or Spirit Sword to perform Sword Intent, even if it’s possible, you would need to cultivate the Divine Thought into Sword method to a very advanced level...\"","\"If you are just starting, having just learned everything, and your Sword technique is not yet proficient, considering using Divine Thought Sword Intent directly without relying on Swordsmanship, isn’t it like trying to run before learning to crawl?\"","Mo Hua realized, \"That’s true...\"","Sword Qi and Spirit Sword are like crutches.","With crutches, one can better control Sword Intent and activate the Divine Thought into Sword spell point.","Once cultivated to a deep level, with Sword Dao being extremely proficient, one can consider abandoning the crutches and relying solely on Divine Thought Sword Intent for attacks.","Furthermore, even then, when facing a strong enemy, one cannot solely rely on Sword Intent.","It still requires merging Spirit Sword, Sword Qi, and Sword Intent into one to unleash the greatest power of the Taixu Mind Transforming Sword True Jue.","\"Taixu Divine Thought Sword, requires ’sword’ as a medium...\"","Mo Hua muttered softly, and then asked again:","\"If not using the sword as a medium, what is Divine Thought into Sword like? Is it like this...\"","Mo Hua pointed his fingers, gesturing stylishly in the air.","\"... With one point, ’whoosh,’ Divine Thought into Sword flew across, just like Sword Control?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain rubbed his chin, \"It should not be... but I don’t remember clearly.\"","\"Think carefully,\" Mo Hua said, \"recall more, especially when you were slashed by Divine Thought into Sword, what was the scene like.\"","Lord Yellow Mountain: \"...\"","This kid always likes to rub salt into people’s wounds.","So it endured the heartache and tried to recall, bringing out that unwanted memory of a deadly battle from almost forgotten recollections.","Little bits of past events surfaced in its heart.","The aura of Lord Yellow Mountain changed, seemingly no longer a destitute minor mountain god, its brows and eyes gaining an unfathomable majesty.","Lord Yellow Mountain spoke slowly:","\"In that battle, I was polluted by evil thoughts, lost my mind, and fought to the death with that expert Sword Cultivator, almost battling purely by instinct.\"","\"And back then, that Sword Cultivator relied on an ancient treasure sword bound to his life and spirit.\"","\"His Sword Intent was vast, seemingly like the void, merged within the ancient sword, extremely sharp. With mere human flesh and the spell point of Sword Dao cultivators, he could injure me, this deity.\"","\"I’m unfamiliar with this Sword technique, but from the experience of engaging him, the Divine Thought into sword True Jue is still considered a special type of Sword technique. It’s just that on the sword, it has the ’Sword Intent’ attached to the Divine Thought, and when performed, it still must involve the ’sword.’","\"On the outside, it seems like an ordinary Sword Cultivator using swordsmanship.\"","\"Only deities or cultivators in Divine Thought can perceive its might...\"","Mo Hua sighed, somewhat disappointed, \"No matter how you say it, still can’t get away from swordsmanship...\"","This is considered his weakest among weaknesses.","Although his Sword Control is impressive, Mo Hua also knows in his heart, his \"Sword Control\" is merely surface-level, essentially not swordsmanship, but a method of \"Divine Thought Object Manipulation,\" which merely appears like Sword Control.","\"Not exactly...\"","Lord Yellow Mountain frowned.","Mo Hua was astonished, \"What do you mean?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain tried recalling again, its gaze was dignified, and then it exclaimed:","\"I remembered, when I fought that Sword Cultivator, my fierce nature erupted, and I once slapped his ancient sword away.\"","\"That Sword Cultivator’s ancient sword was knocked out of hand, losing its dependency on the sword, immediately falling into a disadvantage. I wanted to seize the opportunity for a thorough kill, but at that moment, the Sword Cultivator’s eyes shone brightly...\"","Mo Hua was shocked, \"Eyes?\"","\"Yes,\" Lord Yellow Mountain nodded, \"...Eyes shone brightly, as if Sword light condensed in them, extremely sharp. I just glanced, felt my eyes stinging, and my whole divine thought felt the pain of being ravaged by a thousand swords...\"","\"Taking advantage of this gap, that Sword Cultivator used Divine Sense Sword Control to summon the ancient sword back to his hand, reorganized his stance, and continued fighting with me.\"","\"But this move of condensing sword light in the eyes, he only used it once at that critical moment. After that, when fighting to the exhaustion of each other’s oil and light, he never used it again.\"","\"Which means...\" Mo Hua’s gaze widened, \"In the true technique of Divine Thought into Sword, even without a sword, one can use ’eyes’ to perform the attacking Sword Intent?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain shook his head, \"I don’t know, I just saw that person use this move, but only that one time.\"","\"I don’t even know if this is a move from Divine Thought into Sword true jue...\"","But regardless of what Lord Yellow Mountain said, Mo Hua already considered along this line of thought by himself.","Eyes, sword light, attacks...","Yet he still couldn’t understand, so he asked Lord Yellow Mountain:","\"Why the eyes? Not the mouth, nose, or ears? Because the eyes are the window of Divine Sense?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain nodded, \"Correct, a cultivator’s Divine Sense resides in the Sea of Consciousness, can sense external surroundings through externalization, and the strongest place to externalize a cultivator’s Divine Sense is the eyes.\""]},{"number":1470,"title":"Chapter 1470 - 798 Eyes_3","paragraphs":["\"The human eye is the window to Divine Thought.\"","\"Conversely, the flaw in a cultivator’s Divine Sense also lies in the eyes.\"","\"Some ghosts and specters like to hook the divine soul, or use demonic sounds to confuse the ear, or enticing fragrances to lure the nose, but the most indefensible tactic is the appearance in the eyes.\"","\"There are some ghosts and specters, just one glance and your soul is hooked away.\"","Mo Hua suddenly realized, \"So that’s how it is...\"","He silently took note, deciding to try it out back home, to see if he could train his eyes to emit sword light.","If he could emit sword light, he wouldn’t even need the \"sword\".","Mo Hua wanted to ask more about the matter of Divine Thought into sword.","Yet no matter how he \"pressed\" Lord Yellow Mountain to recall those unbearable past memories, he couldn’t get any more clues.","Lord Yellow Mountain looked pitiful.","Mo Hua couldn’t bear to force him further, so he asked another question:","\"Mountain Lord, the path the deities walk, what is it exactly?\"","Deities are born with the Dao, although they are long-lived, they cannot live forever.","Since they cannot live forever, certainly they must attain the Dao and ask the immortal, to truly live as long as heaven and earth.","So in this way, deities also have to cultivate \"Dao\"?","\"What ’Dao’ do deities cultivate?\"","\"Is it the Dao of Divine Thought advancement, constantly undergoing quality change?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain said: \"I am not clear about the cultivators’ viewpoint, but according to the deities’ inheritance, the so-called quality change of Divine Thought refers to the progress of Divine Thought, constantly ’merging with Dao’, which is referred to as... ’Dao Hua’.\"","Dao Hua?!","Mo Hua’s expression shook.","He suddenly recalled, that when he absorbed the Divine Marrow, and fused divine nature with human nature, it seemed he received some kind of \"illumination\" from the mystic, and in his mind, a word naturally emerged as if by instinct:","\"Divine Thought Taoism!\"","These four words seemed to be engraved in the \"Divine Marrow\" and as the understanding of Great Dao deepened, naturally appeared.","As if it were a kind of...","deity’s inheritance?","And not only that...","Mo Hua vaguely recalled that a long time ago, in a desolate mountain, he had tricked and killed a black-clothed trafficker leader.","On this leader was a parasitic sheep-horned demon monster related to the Great Wilderness Evil God.","This demon monster seemed to possess a Divine Remains and it seemed to have spoken to him:","\"... You have the foundation of Divine Thought Taoism, but why is your Divine Marrow so thin?\"","\"Why is there no sign of ’ritual offering’?\"","\"Why is human nature abundant, while divinity is minuscule?\"","\"This is impossible...\"","Back then, when he heard these words, he knew very little about the path of deities and none of these terms made any sense to him, so he didn’t pay attention.","But now as he connected everything, Mo Hua began to understand...","The so-called path of deities was the process of turning their Divine Thought into \"Dao Hua\"?","And he, unknowingly, had Dao Hua-ed his own Divine Sense?","Mo Hua furrowed his brow, murmuring:","\"... Divine Sense Sublimation?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain heard and shook his head to correct, \"Not ’Divine Sense’ sublimation, but ’Divine Thought’ Taoism.\"","Mo Hua was startled, somewhat confused, \"Is there a difference?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain said: \"Cultivators’ Divine Sense is called ’Divine Sense’, but all other Telekinesis within the timeline is called ’Divine Thought’, and among the various Divine Thoughts, those of deities are supreme.\"","\"Only the Divine Thought of a deity can undergo ’Dao Hua’, which is why it’s called ’Divine Thought Taoism’, but a cultivator’s Divine Sense cannot.\"","Mo Hua asked quietly, \"Are there exceptions?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain shook his head firmly, \"People are people, deities are deities. If there were exceptions, wouldn’t it mean there’s no distinction between people and gods? This does not conform to the laws of the Great Dao...\"","After saying this, it glanced at Mo Hua, suddenly surprised.","Various strange signs on Mo Hua’s body began to surface in its mind...","Lord Yellow Mountain’s heart suddenly skipped, \"You wouldn’t be...\"","Mo Hua looked innocent, \"I am what?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain was taken aback.","Is he what?","If he were a mere mortal, could he have Dao Hua-ed his Divine Thought?","No... That should be impossible. Such a shocking matter, it has never heard of in all its years of existence.","At the root of it, how could a cultivator with a mortal body perform Divine Thought transformation to complete \"Dao Hua\"?","This process not only requires a massive amount of Divine Sense, quality change in Divine Thought, understanding of the \"Dao\", but also exceedingly rare \"Divine Essence\"...","Even for deities, to further \"Dao Hua\" is laden with challenges.","Let alone a mere little cultivator.","Lord Yellow Mountain relaxed, sighed, \"Nothing.\"","It was overthinking...","Mo Hua blinked, afraid to ask more, fearing that if he did, he might reveal too much.","Despite Lord Yellow Mountain’s destitution, it has lived long, and its experiences are still exceedingly rich; if he says too much, it might just be able to figure things out.","This matter of \"Divine Sense Sublimation\", Mo Hua doesn’t know its implications.","What if it’s something truly significant, a forbidden secret that can’t be disclosed, can’t be known by anyone or any deity.","If leaked out, it could result in a deadly disaster.","And if Lord Yellow Mountain guessed it...","Then, he’d have no choice but to silence it!","Mo Hua sighed.","He didn’t have many deity friends.","Unless absolutely necessary, he didn’t really want to lose this \"good friend\".","Lord Yellow Mountain suddenly felt a cold wind blowing across, making it feel chilly at the neck.","It couldn’t help but glance at Mo Hua, somewhat anxious, saying:","\"Little friend, maybe you are...\"","\"Nothing.\" Mo Hua smiled reassuringly, then looked up at the sky and added: \"It’s getting late, I have to go, there’s more to do next...\"","Lord Yellow Mountain felt a weight lifted from its shoulders.","It seemed as if the bloody guillotine hanging over its head just faded away like that.","\"Little friend, take care!\" Lord Yellow Mountain chuckled.","Mo Hua nodded and walked out, but just when he stepped one foot outside, he suddenly looked back at Lord Yellow Mountain.","Lord Yellow Mountain’s heart tightened, forcing a smile, \"Little friend, is there anything else?\"","Mo Hua glanced around, asking: \"Mountain Lord, your temple is quite rundown, should I find someone to fix it?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain’s expression turned slightly stern, hurriedly saying: \"Mountain Lord appreciates the kindness, but although this temple is dilapidated, leaking wind and rain, I am used to residing here.\"","\"As the saying goes, a grand temple for the major god, a small temple for the minor god; this rundown temple is just right for this destitute minor mountain god.\"","\"Oh...\" Mo Hua nodded, his gaze toward Lord Yellow Mountain suddenly intensified, slowly asking:","\"Mountain Lord, are you... hiding from something?\"","As soon as these words were spoken, Lord Yellow Mountain’s face instantly changed."]},{"number":1471,"title":"Chapter 1471 - 799 Blood Sacrifice","paragraphs":["Lord Yellow Mountain’s expression changed, but only for a moment before he returned to normal, smiling awkwardly at Mo Hua:","\"This minor god is down on luck now and naturally has to hide from everything.\"","\"Afraid of passing cultivators tearing down my clay sculpture; afraid of wolves and insects in the mountains stealing my offerings; afraid of unknown ghosts and evil spirits staining my temple and occupying my Taoist field...\"","\"This temple is built deep in the mountains; being a bit broken is fine, but if it’s too exquisite and luxurious, it’ll definitely be coveted by others.\"","Lord Yellow Mountain looked bitter as he spoke.","Mo Hua silently watched Lord Yellow Mountain, saying nothing.","With a glance, he could tell that Lord Yellow Mountain was lying.","However, Mo Hua did not blame him.","Whether one is a person or a god, who doesn’t have hidden difficulties?","The secrets on my own body are far more numerous than Lord Yellow Mountain’s.","For a friendship to last long, you must give each other space to keep secrets.","If he doesn’t speak of it, then don’t force him.","After all, it’s him who’s dining on the wind and drinking the rain in the broken temple, not me...","Mo Hua took a deep look at Lord Yellow Mountain and nodded, saying: \"You’re right.\"","Lord Yellow Mountain, caught by Mo Hua’s deep eyes, felt a shiver run down his spine, and was very uneasy in his heart. Hearing this, he breathed a huge sigh of relief.","Mo Hua looked up at the broken temple, pondered for a moment, and said again:","\"Mountain Lord, hiding like this isn’t good, do you want me to help you?\"","\"Help?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain was taken aback, not understanding what Mo Hua meant.","\"How would you help me hide?\"","Mo Hua said: \"I’ve learned some new formations; they can obscure Divine Thought perception. I can paint it on the divine statue, and if you hide inside, it will be hard for others to find you.\"","Lord Yellow Mountain was very surprised but did not want to reject Mo Hua’s kind offer, and bowed his hands, saying:","\"Then many thanks, little friend.\"","Mo Hua surveyed the surroundings for a while and said:","\"The clay sculpture in the temple is too conspicuous as soon as you enter. Even with a formation, it won’t work. Mountain Lord, do you have any other statues you use for hiding?\"","\"This...\" Lord Yellow Mountain was silent for a while.","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, \"The little dog behind the temple, are you fond of hiding inside that one? I...\"","Lord Yellow Mountain shook his head repeatedly, \"No, no...\"","To avoid Mo Hua, and reside in hiding inside a little dog statue.","Such an embarrassing event, he never wanted to mention it again in his lifetime.","No matter how down on luck he was, he was still a Mountain God, and a Mountain God also has pride.","Lord Yellow Mountain looked at Mo Hua, hesitating repeatedly before finally gritting his teeth and saying: \"Little friend, come with me.\"","Mo Hua’s expression shifted slightly, and he nodded.","Lord Yellow Mountain gracefully drifted out from the clay sculpture, leading Mo Hua out of the broken temple to a cliffside behind the temple.","\"A cliff?\"","Mo Hua looked at Lord Yellow Mountain.","Lord Yellow Mountain, somewhat embarrassed, pointed downward, \"There’s a cave below, this way, little friend...\"","Lord Yellow Mountain moved towards the edge of the cliff.","Mo Hua followed, then noticed that the overgrown old vines at the cliff’s edge concealed a steep stone staircase.","Following the stone steps down for several feet, there was a cave.","The cave wasn’t large and was quite shallow.","Mo Hua entered the cave, only then discovering a divine statue hiding inside.","This divine statue was tall and majestic, with a narrow face, stern eyes, resembling Lord Yellow Mountain somewhat, and the entire statue was cast from fine bronze, with some parts even gilded, making it far superior to the clay sculpture in the broken temple.","Mo Hua was quite surprised, looking at Lord Yellow Mountain, \"This wouldn’t be your lifebound divine statue, would it?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain smiled slightly, not speaking.","Mo Hua thought it over and decided it couldn’t be.","No matter how much Lord Yellow Mountain trusted him, it couldn’t be so easy to reveal his lifebound divine statue.","Unless he had lost his mind.","People rely on fine clothes, gods rely on golden adornments.","This divine statue was likely his private treasure, used to \"keep up appearances.\"","Of course, in times of crisis, it could also be used to \"take shelter.\"","\"Alright, shall I paint the formation for you then?\" Mo Hua asked.","Lord Yellow Mountain clasped his hands in thanks, \"I am in your debt...\"","Mo Hua took out paper and pen, and began painting a formation stroke by stroke around Lord Yellow Mountain’s \"golden adorned\" divine statue.","Lord Yellow Mountain watched silently from the side, curious about what kind of formation Mo Hua would paint for him.","But as he continued to watch, Lord Yellow Mountain’s expression changed again.","\"This...\"","His body trembled, hesitated for a long time, and finally stammered, \"Little... little friend, isn’t this a... Divine Tao Array?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded.","It really was!","Lord Yellow Mountain drew in a cold breath.","This Little Plague God, how did he even learn the Divine Tao Array?","Remarkable indeed...","In the future, wouldn’t he be even more unstoppable?","What does he mean by painting a Divine Tao Array on his statue?","Lord Yellow Mountain’s face stiffened, and his heart was filled with regret, deep regret.","Truly, the human heart is unfathomable; cultivators are not to be trusted at all.","Had he known earlier, he wouldn’t have revealed the statue’s location...","Lord Yellow Mountain’s face soured with helplessness, and he could only beg, \"Little friend, mercy! Don’t seal my statue...\"","If the statue were sealed, he’d have no retreat.","Mo Hua asked puzzled, \"Who said I was going to seal you?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain looked aggrieved.","Mo Hua then consoled him, \"Don’t worry, it’s not what you think...\"","\"I use the Divine Tao Array to seal your statue, leaving an opening so you can move freely in and out. In this way, the Divine Tao Array will instead become your refuge, concealing your presence.\"","\"In the future, if you encounter danger, just hide inside, and others, even other evil spirits, may not discover you.\"","Lord Yellow Mountain paused in realization.","He hadn’t expected that the \"Divine Tao Array\" used to counter deities could have such a use.","But upon reflection, it did make sense.","Authentic deities, receiving incense openly, have no need to hide, nor rely on such methods for refuge."]},{"number":1472,"title":"Chapter 1472 - 799 Blood Sacrifice_2","paragraphs":["The deities who fall into the evil path will be opposed by the Divine Practitioners.","Formation Masters naturally strive to completely seal them, leaving no loopholes.","Using the \"seal\" formation as a means to \"hide\" is truly an ingenious idea.","Lord Yellow Mountain admired it in his heart and glanced at Mo Hua with great curiosity.","He wondered where exactly this Divine Tao Array was learned from...","Lord Yellow Mountain wanted to ask, but wisely chose not to.","Considering the little cultivator’s astuteness, it’s likely he wouldn’t tell him.","Once Mo Hua finished the ink painting, he indeed left an opening in the formation behind the Divine Statue, saying to Lord Yellow Mountain: \"Try going inside...\"","Lord Yellow Mountain frowned.","Being a deity, it instinctively repelled formations that restrained deities.","Furthermore, this formation came from the mysterious hands of Mo Hua.","Once inside, if he seals it, there would truly be tears with no way out.","But being watched by Mo Hua’s clear and bright eyes, Lord Yellow Mountain felt a bit ashamed.","Oh well...","It gritted its teeth and eventually turned into a wisp of white smoke, trembling, and slipped into the Divine Statue.","Within the statue, the surrounding formations felt like narrow mountain walls, making it somewhat suffocated and uncomfortable.","It had a premonition that if Mo Hua sealed the opening at this moment,","it would be trapped inside the statue, sealed by the formation, never to see the light of day again.","Lord Yellow Mountain felt uneasy.","Fortunately, after a while, Mo Hua asked: \"How do you feel?\"","\"It’s... it’s alright...\" Lord Yellow Mountain replied.","\"Good.\" Mo Hua nodded, \"Then come out. There’s no need to go inside regularly. Only in times of danger should you hide inside.\"","He didn’t know what exactly Lord Yellow Mountain was hiding from in the dilapidated temple.","But leaving a means of retreat is always good.","Lord Yellow Mountain transformed into green smoke and floated out from the seal, instantly feeling relieved, took a long breath, and then bowed to Mo Hua sincerely:","\"Thank you, my friend.\"","\"Alright, I’m leaving now. I’ll visit you again when I have time.\" Mo Hua waved and then departed from the cave.","Lord Yellow Mountain escorted Mo Hua to the door of the ruined temple, feeling a mix of emotions; after pondering for a long time, he finally spoke:","\"In the Qian Learning State Boundary, there is an Evil God...\"","\"Does the Evil God have goat horns?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Yes...\" Lord Yellow Mountain nodded, then suddenly paused, \"You... you know?\"","Not only did he know, he’d seen it and even \"experienced\" it...","\"How do you know?\" Lord Yellow Mountain was a bit shocked.","Mo Hua said: \"Near the state boundary, I encountered a few evil spirits; they seem to be the minions of this Evil God.\"","Lord Yellow Mountain looked at Mo Hua with a startled expression and asked:","\"Are you alright?\"","Mo Hua smiled and replied: \"I’m fine...\"","Lord Yellow Mountain nodded, thinking that with mastery of the Divine Tao Array, a few evil spirits shouldn’t trouble this \"Little Plague God.\"","Lord Yellow Mountain remained silent for a moment, then spoke with a serious face:","\"Minions are not terrifying; what’s terrifying is this Evil God...\"","\"This Evil God has been asleep for a long time, ancient and full of evil thoughts. Its current strength is feared to be less than one thousandth of its peak state. Once it awakens, even if it births a single Divine Fetus, it would be catastrophic for the world...\"","Upon hearing this, Mo Hua’s expression also fell.","Though Lord Yellow Mountain was in decline now, he once had \"grandeur,\" and his insights were still sharp.","His words implied that the true form of the Great Wilderness Evil God is possibly far more terrifying than imagined.","Especially because it might be \"awakening\"...","\"Do you remember what I said to you before?\" Lord Yellow Mountain continued.","Mo Hua intended to ask, \"Which words?\"","He had seen Lord Yellow Mountain many times and said many things, but couldn’t remember which words were being referred to.","Then, pondering the context, a frown emerged as he recalled.","\"Are you saying, ’Qian Learning State Boundary is not a place to stay for long’?\"","\"Correct,\" Lord Yellow Mountain sighed, \"I previously said, cultivate in the sect until the Foundation Establishment Late Stage then leave. Even if delayed for a few years, don’t exceed ten years. Within ten years, it might still be in time...\"","\"But now, it seems more dangerous.\"","Mo Hua remained still for a moment, \"What do you mean?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain looked up at the seemingly clear sky, furrowing his brow:","\"Recently, for unknown reasons, the evil thoughts have suddenly become restless; it seems someone is plotting in secret, forcing this Evil God to accelerate the process. Now, it seems it might not last ten years...\"","\"Someone... plotting in secret?\" Mo Hua also furrowed his brow.","Who could be so capable?","To even force the Evil God to accelerate its plans?","As Mo Hua pondered this, his heart suddenly skipped a beat.","The person Lord Yellow Mountain mentioned... could it be myself?","Am I pushing the Evil God?","No way...","Mo Hua remained silent for a moment, then quietly asked Lord Yellow Mountain:","\"Mountain Lord, what exactly is the Evil God’s conspiracy? If it wants to awaken, what must it do?\"","Lord Yellow Mountain’s expression was conflicted.","\"Can’t say?\" Mo Hua asked.","Lord Yellow Mountain sighed, \"I don’t know the exact conspiracy. I only know that whenever ancient evil gods awaken, it’s often accompanied by a...\"","Lord Yellow Mountain’s expression turned solemn; his voice was icy, \"A grand blood sacrifice!\"","Mo Hua’s pupils constricted.","A grand... blood sacrifice!","In the Qian Learning State Boundary?!","Lord Yellow Mountain looked at Mo Hua, speaking heavily:","\"I can only share this much. If it truly happens, once the blood sacrifice begins, life would be devastated, all things wither, my friend... take care of yourself.\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brow, \"But... in the Qian Learning State Boundary, there are many Fourth-grade and even Fifth-grade families and sects, with many Ancestors stationed. How could a blood sacrifice happen?\""]},{"number":1473,"title":"Chapter 1473 - 799 Blood Sacrifice_3","paragraphs":["Lord Yellow Mountain shook his head, \"This, even I, a Minor God, am not clear about.\"","Mo Hua wasn’t sure if he truly didn’t know or was hesitant to say more due to some concerns, so he just nodded and cupped his hands, saying:","\"Thank you, Mountain Lord, I will remember.\"","Afterward, Mo Hua took his leave.","Lord Yellow Mountain watched Mo Hua depart, but before the final farewell, he said something with deep meaning:","\"The evil within human nature is the best bait for the Evil God...\"","Mo Hua’s expression was dazed.","This phrase lingered in Mo Hua’s mind, and even when he left Kushan Mountain and boarded the carriage heading to Mistwater City, he couldn’t shake it off.","\"The evil within human nature is the best bait for the Evil God...\"","Lord Yellow Mountain seemed to be hinting at something.","Or perhaps it was an insight based on his own past experiences?","Mo Hua silently pondered in his heart.","And then... the grand blood sacrifice?","A small-scale blood sacrifice might exist, but to sacrifice the entire Qian Learning State Boundary, such a large-scale blood sacrifice, with Mo Hua’s understanding, seems unlikely...","Besides, Lord Yellow Mountain only said that the revival of the ancient Evil God must be accompanied by a grand blood sacrifice.","He didn’t say that this Evil God must be the Great Wilderness Evil God.","The place of his revival might not necessarily be in the Qian Learning State Boundary.","It could very well be in... the Great Wilderness?","Mo Hua shook his head.","\"Forget it, let’s not think about it for now...\"","This grand scheme of the Evil God is not something I can get involved in at the moment.","At best, I’ve only stolen a little bit of His authority, eaten a bit of His Demon Monster, and destroyed just a few of His altars.","And they were only Second Grade.","To the Great Wilderness Evil God, whose level is unknown but certainly very high, this should be of little consequence.","I should focus my time and energy on improving myself...","Mo Hua silently said to himself.","Then he began to meditate, closing his eyes to rest.","The carriage carried him leisurely toward Mistwater City.","Nothing happened along the way.","When he reached Mistwater City, it was already evening.","He inquired about the location of the Ye family, determined their position, and went directly to their gate, only to find the Ye family heavily guarded, barring entry to all non-family cultivators.","Mo Hua couldn’t sneak in.","Asking around recklessly probably wouldn’t be good either, as he might be considered a \"suspicious cultivator.\"","And if the Ye family truly had something to hide, it might alert them.","Mo Hua circled the Ye family’s perimeter, taking a closer look at the formation.","He could roughly guess the general layout of the formation.","But the Ye family is a Third Grade family, with many Third Grade Arrays within their residence, which Mo Hua’s current level in formations would find difficult to handle.","Breaking a Second Grade Array to sneak in was feasible.","But once discovered, it would be troublesome.","Mo Hua turned around twice, couldn’t find an opportunity to make a move, and seeing it was getting late, he found a nearby noodle shop to eat.","The noodle shop was plain and simple, and was called \"Wang’s Noodle House.\"","The shop was small, with only one lively, chatterbox-like middle-aged woman as the shopkeeper.","Mo Hua specifically chose this shop after walking two rounds, precisely for the shopkeeper’s \"chatterbox\" nature, known for her liking to chat.","By this time, it was already late, the meal time had passed, and there were only a few customers eating.","Mo Hua called out \"Sister,\" which delighted the woman, prompting her to give Mo Hua extra noodles and two extra servings of pickles.","After chatting for a while, Mo Hua subtly asked about the Ye family.","Some things outsiders find hard to investigate, but these Loose Cultivators, who grew up among the common folk and are used to hearing all sorts of rumors, are quite aware.","Chatting with the shopkeeper for a bit, Mo Hua had a general understanding.","The Ye family in Mistwater City had a poor reputation.","They oppressed Loose Cultivators and bullied villagers, not to the point of triggering an inquiry from the Taoist Court, but their actions were looked down upon.","To those above, they were sycophantic and climbing.","Within the family, even the relationships between disciples were not harmonious.","Furthermore, the Ye family was infamous for one thing, \"selling daughters.\"","\"The Ye family, trying to curry favor and gain power, would do anything, even last year they married off a twenty-something legitimate daughter to an elder from some sect who was nearly three hundred years old and recently widowed.\"","\"Only the Ye family would do such a thing...\" the shopkeeper said disdainfully.","Mo Hua’s gaze shifted, he suddenly lowered his voice and whispered:","\"I’ve heard about that too, it seems the Ye family’s legitimate daughter couldn’t bear the humiliation and committed suicide...\"","The shopkeeper paused, \"Committed suicide? No...\"","\"Didn’t commit suicide?\" Mo Hua acted confused.","The shopkeeper frowned, thought for a moment, and shook her head, \"She shouldn’t have committed suicide; I haven’t heard anyone say that.\"","Mo Hua mumbled, \"Could I have remembered wrong, she wasn’t the one? Are there others in the Ye family who committed suicide?\"","\"Suicide...\" the shopkeeper shook her head, \"I haven’t heard of any recent cases... Life is tough, but unless one has no choice, who would commit suicide for no reason?\"","\"Is that so...\" Mo Hua’s gaze slightly focused.","\"But you never know...\" the shopkeeper added, \"The Ye family often commits injustices, even if someone died, they might hide it, likely wouldn’t let anyone find out.\"","\"For the girls married off to climb the social ladder, if they were insulted and committed suicide, the Ye family probably wouldn’t publicize it and might just select another woman to send into the fire pit...\"","\"Sister, do these things happen often?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Who knows?\"","The shopkeeper couldn’t help but serve Mo Hua another spoonful of noodles.","\"Even if a direct lineage boy from the Ye family died, they wouldn’t publicize it; who knows how many people have been wronged in secret...\"","\"A direct lineage boy died?\"","\"Yes,\" the shopkeeper said, \"last year, or was it the year before? The Ye family’s boy was indulging in pleasures and died on the Mistwater River...\"","Mo Hua’s pupils slightly contracted.","The Ye family boy, indulging in pleasures, died on the Mistwater River..."]},{"number":1474,"title":"Chapter 1474 - 800 Rouge Boat","paragraphs":["Mo Hua quietly asked: \"Revelry... what’s it like?\"","The store owner was about to speak, but upon seeing Mo Hua’s fair and delicate face, shook her head and said:","\"It’s nothing good, not suitable for children, you’re a good kid, don’t get involved in those messy things.\"","\"Oh.\" Mo Hua was somewhat displeased and asked again, \"Then... how did this Young Master Ye die?\"","\"How else?\" the store owner smirked, \"I heard it was a shipwreck, six people on board, all drowned, and were gnawed beyond recognition by the Water Demons in the water...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes slightly narrowed, thinking it was indeed as expected.","\"Why did the ship suddenly sink out of nowhere?\" Mo Hua asked in confusion.","The store lady hesitated for a moment, looked around, and then lowered her voice, saying:","\"It’s not that simple. These circles of young masters from great families are very messy...\"","\"This Young Master Ye was a playboy, unrestrained in behavior, extravagant and lustful. I heard this time he quarreled over a romantic rivalry with another young master, got envied, and someone secretly hired people to sink his ship, drowning everyone on board.\"","The store lady chattered on.","\"Who did he offend?\" Mo Hua asked.","The store lady shook her head, \"Who knows.\"","\"Didn’t the Ye family pursue this?\"","\"They don’t dare,\" the store owner said, \"The Ye family is quite notable in Mistwater City, but in the entire Qianxue Territory, they’re insignificant. That Young Master Ye, around Mistwater City, could be called a ’young master’, but compared to those in the great families, like dragons out of reach, heavenly people, he’s probably not even as good as a follower...\"","Upon hearing this, Mo Hua felt some sentiment.","People are divided into high and low, noble and humble, and trample on each other.","Those who step on others will eventually be stepped on by those higher up.","The Ye family is just like that.","Unknowingly, Mo Hua finished his noodles and couldn’t ask for more information, so he paid the bill, and incidentally gave two extra Spirit Stones.","The store lady couldn’t refuse and enthusiastically saw Mo Hua off, saying a lot of good words.","After leaving, Mo Hua wandered around nearby some more, and in the evening found an inn to stay at.","During the period, some news was inquired about, but it wasn’t very useful, and many were obviously rumors, not credible.","By the next morning, after eating some big buns, Mo Hua hired a cart and left Mistwater City.","With only two days for the holiday, time was limited, he couldn’t afford to delay and had to head back to the Sect first.","However, before returning to the Sect, Mo Hua thought to make a side trip to the small fishing village.","Ever since experiencing the Blood-colored Fishing Village incident, dismantling the River God Temple, slaying the corrupted River God, and swallowing an incarnation of the Evil God, Mo Hua hadn’t returned to the small fishing village, and didn’t know how things were there now.","It was morning at this time, with bright sunlight.","The Mistwater River sparkled, the grass was lush green, the river flowed gently into the distance like an emerald ribbon.","The scenery was beautiful, but Mo Hua, upon seeing it, inexplicably felt a sense of unease.","As if hidden filth lay unseen in this beautiful river.","About more than an hour later, Mo Hua arrived at the small fishing village.","Upon reaching the village entrance, many Fish Cultivators greeted him, \"Hello, Young Lord!\"","\"Young Lord is here!\"","\"Long time no see...\"","Mo Hua smiled and greeted them.","Soon, Old Yu also came over, seeing Mo Hua, he expressed endless gratitude, repeatedly calling him benefactor, and said:","\"It’s almost noon, if benefactor doesn’t mind, come to our house for some fish soup.\"","Drinking fish soup...","Mo Hua’s feelings were a bit complex.","But he didn’t refuse. This time coming to the small fishing village was to ask Old Yu some questions.","At Old Yu’s house, it was still that dilapidated courtyard, but fortunately, the family was reunited, bustling and full of life.","Upon entering, Old Yu called over his two grandsons, \"Little Shunzi, Little Shuizi, come, kowtow to the benefactor.\"","Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi didn’t hesitate, knelt with a thud, and kowtowed twice.","Mo Hua couldn’t stop it.","\"No need to be so polite...\"","Mo Hua said helplessly.","But Old Yu was very stubborn, \"You saved these two children’s lives, their cultivation is low, they’re not capable of much, what are two kowtows?\"","After the two children kowtowed, they stood up, with two pairs of bright eyes looking at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua also gave them a once-over.","The first time Mo Hua met these two children, it was by the Mistwater River, when he and Cheng Mo, along with others, were staking out to catch the Crossing River Dragon.","Poor childrens take on responsibilities early.","Back then these two children, though young and with only Qi Refinement cultivation, were already quite sensible, knowing to help the adults.","During the temple incident, they were taken as sacrifices to the Evil God.","After being rescued, their breaths were weak, faces pale.","Now, more than a year later, the two children’s Vital Energy had obviously recovered, their faces were tanned a bit darker, but looked more spirited, and having cultivated the \"White Wave Skill\" given by Mo Hua, water energy circulated around them, Spiritual Power was refined, and their cultivation had also improved quite a bit.","Their cultivation progress was much faster than Mo Hua had imagined.","Mo Hua felt joy in his heart, took out two small gifts from his Storage Bag, and gave them.","It was a pair of water-repelling Jade Pendants.","These were lunar new year gifts from some Elder in the Gu Family.","Old Yu, seeing these two precious Jade Pendants, was shocked, hurriedly declined, saying: \"This is way too much, how can we dare accept gifts from our benefactor.\"","\"It’s fine, take them...\" Mo Hua said.","He usually didn’t have much use for them anyway.","Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi scratched their heads, also declined, \"Benefactor, we’re good with water, we don’t need it...\""]},{"number":1475,"title":"Chapter 1475 - 800 Rouge Boat_2","paragraphs":["Mo Hua warned them: \"Precisely because you’re good with water, you should carry a water-repelling Jade Pendant, just in case...\"","\"As the saying goes, ’He who is best at swimming, drowns.’ The better you are with water, the more arrogant you become, losing respect for it.\"","\"Water and fire are ruthless.\"","\"A lifetime spent in wind and water, one slip and your life could be claimed, without any chance of redemption...\"","Mo Hua spoke quite frankly.","The two children felt a chill in their hearts upon hearing this.","Old Yu glanced at his two beloved grandsons, ultimately unable to refuse. In the end, he said: \"Come, bow two more times to your benefactor.\"","Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi were about to kneel again, but Mo Hua quickly stopped them, \"Alright, alright, that’s enough...\"","Old Yu stopped being pretentious and started preparing lunch.","Living by the water.","For the Fish Cultivator, lunch mainly consisted of fish.","\"The other day, I caught an emerald-scaled fish with tender flesh and delicious soup. It’s quite rare, and usually, I only catch a few in a year. Because it’s so rare, people don’t recognize its worth, and it doesn’t sell for much.\"","Old Yu beamed, \"I was wondering why my luck was so good. Turns out it’s because an honored guest is visiting today. The River God sent me this fish to properly entertain you, my benefactor.\"","He has earned his livelihood on the water his whole life, no matter what happens, he always likes to associate it with the \"River God.\"","After a while, Yu Dachuan returned from fishing, and upon seeing Mo Hua, thanked him profusely.","Afterward, everyone gathered around the table for a meal, and Mo Hua was given the seat of honor.","A bowl of emerald-scaled fish soup was brought up, with tender flesh, a thick broth, and a fragrant aroma.","Mo Hua stared at the soup for a long time, ensuring there were no little red fish or any other similar evil spirits inside, then relaxed.","After eating some meat and sipping some soup, Old Yu’s family went around to offer toasts to Mo Hua.","The wine wasn’t fine wine.","Fish Cultivators can’t afford the good stuff either.","But Old Yu’s family was so gracious, Mo Hua drank and found it quite decent, though the taste was a bit strong and stung the throat a bit.","After being well-fed and wined, Yu Dachuan was about to head down to the river again.","The two kids, Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi, sprawled out under the eaves for a nap.","Old Yu brewed a pot of tea and chatted with Mo Hua inside the house.","After chatting for a while, Mo Hua seized the chance to ask:","\"Uncle Yu, do you still remember that ’young master’ who drowned in Mistwater River?\"","\"Which young master?\" Old Yu didn’t recall at first.","\"The first time we met, I told you I was fishing, and you urged me to leave quickly, saying that someone had recently died by the river, and the body was gnawed beyond recognition by a Water Demon...\"","\"Oh...\" Old Yu remembered, nodding, \"Yes, that’s what happened.\"","Mo Hua asked: \"Do you know who that young master was?\"","Old Yu shook his head, \"I really don’t know. I just heard he was from Mistwater City, a young master from a Third Grade family, but I don’t know who exactly he was.\"","\"Such things, when spoken of, are a loss of face. I suppose their family didn’t make too much noise about it either...\"","Mo Hua nodded, his eyes shifting, and whispered: \"Uncle Yu, did you mention... the Rouge Boat before?\"","Old Yu hesitated, giving Mo Hua a subtle look.","He was serious, hesitating repeatedly, finally speaking earnestly:","\"Benefactor, I know you’re young, and it’s easy to be interested in these things, but when you’re young and full of Blood Qi, you must guard against desires. That kind of place, with smoke and willows, should never be touched carelessly, or it will harm your Tao Cultivation foundation...\"","\"Wait until you’re older, settle down with a proper match, marry a wife, and then consider these matters between men and women...\"","Old Yu advised in a tone of experience.","Mo Hua was momentarily speechless, not knowing what to say.","He could only resign himself: \"Uncle Yu, you’ve got it wrong, I have official business.\"","\"Official business?\" Old Yu was startled.","Mo Hua lowered his voice: \"It’s a murder case from the Taoist Court.\"","Old Yu immediately became tense.","Mo Hua said: \"I’m only telling you secretly, you mustn’t tell anyone else.\"","Old Yu had a natural respect for the words \"Taoist Court,\" although he often complained about its corruption and inefficiency behind its back, when faced with the Taoist Court, he was still respectful and dared not slack off.","\"Definitely, definitely!\" Old Yu nodded vigorously like a rattle drum.","Mo Hua then asked: \"What exactly is the Rouge Boat?\"","Old Yu’s eyes darted back and forth, seeing that the adults had gone to the river to work, the two grandsons were sound asleep, and there was no one else nearby. He spoke softly:","\"It’s a Flower Boat.\"","\"Flower Boat?\"","\"The word ’flower’ doesn’t mean floral, it refers to people, those young, beautiful female cultivators. A Flower Boat means a boat full of these female cultivators, engaged in... flesh trades,\" Old Yu whispered.","Mo Hua understood, \"So it’s like a floating brothel?\"","\"Yes.\" Old Yu nodded.","Mo Hua frowned, \"But isn’t it true that within the Qianxue state boundary, Sects are everywhere, disciples are numerous, and it is mandated to promote Tao instruction and learning, with a thriving academic atmosphere, so establishments like brothels and whorehouses are prohibited?\"","Not only within the Qianxue state boundary but also in surrounding areas, such businesses are not permitted according to regulations.","Old Yu sighed: \"Human nature is such, how can it be completely forbidden...\"","\"That Flower Boat,\" Mo Hua asked, \"Uncle Yu, have you been on it?\"","Old Yu quickly waved his hands, \"A place like that, how could someone like me possibly go there?\"","\"Then how do you know that what they do there is really flesh trade?\" Mo Hua asked.","Old Yu chuckled, \"I may be slow and not good at cultivation, but living long enough and seeing enough, you can understand many things at a glance.\"","\"They set up a boat, hang some flowers, and cover it with curtains thinking they can fool others, but instead, it becomes more apparent. Such shenanigans between men and women are like a cat stealing fish, you can’t hide the smell...\""]},{"number":1476,"title":"Chapter 1476 - 800 Rouge Boat_3","paragraphs":["Mo Hua heard this and couldn’t help but look at Old Yu with a bit more respect.","Everyone lives their life, each with their own Dao.","Even some unremarkable individuals will have unique experiences or insights.","Mo Hua asked again, \"Uncle Yu, have you seen the Rouge Boat with your own eyes?\"","Old Yu solemnly nodded, \"I’ve seen it a few times...\"","\"Those few times, I went down to the river to fish, worked too late, just finished collecting the nets, hadn’t rested yet, checked the time, and it was already past 1 a.m...\"","\"At this time, a thick fog would suddenly rise over the river, everything was hazy and indistinct, and after a while, red and green lights would appear, a fleet of Flower Boats would come sailing from upstream, with curtains and colorful lights, incredibly luxurious, and with the laughter of men and women echoing, captivating people’s hearts...\"","\"Across the riverbank, you can smell the strong scent of rouge, so it’s called ’Rouge Boat’.\"","\"These boats don’t stop, they keep sailing to a distant place, and no one knows where they’ll eventually dock...\"","Mo Hua was somewhat surprised, \"Not just one boat?\"","Old Yu nodded, \"That’s right, there are many boats, when I saw them, usually there were seven or eight boats, shrouded in the thick fog, moving forward in a line.\"","Mo Hua frowned slightly.","What Old Yu described seemed to differ slightly from what Mo Hua himself had seen...","That night he had seen Flower Boats on Mistwater River.","The night was deep, the river was dark, yet the Flower Boat was dazzling with lights, surrounded by light smoke and romantic music.","But there was only this one Flower Boat.","Moreover, there were silhouettes of a group of \"young lords\" on the boat.","He even saw, through the dark mist, a remote gaze exchange with a \"young lord\" whose eyes glowed red like a demon monster, surrounded by the stars...","The scene from that night resurfaced in Mo Hua’s mind, making him momentarily absent-minded.","\"Benefactor, benefactor...\"","Old Yu called out several times before Mo Hua came back to his senses.","Seeing Mo Hua’s solemn expression, Old Yu felt nervous and asked softly, \"Does the Rouge Boat involve a murder case, is it very serious?\"","Mo Hua didn’t know.","He was just speaking casually.","\"It’s hard to say...\" Seeing Old Yu a bit apprehensive, Mo Hua said, \"But, this case doesn’t have much to do with you all, I’m just asking casually.\"","Only then did Old Yu feel relieved.","Mo Hua wanted to ask more, but saw Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi under the eaves in the distance, turning over and rubbing their eyes, seemingly already awake, so he didn’t continue the conversation.","Some things are indeed not suitable for children to hear.","It was already past noon, the heat dissipated, and the sun began to set.","Mo Hua then took his leave.","Old Yu tried hard to retain him, wanting Mo Hua to stay overnight, \"I didn’t have a chance to prepare much for lunch, but I’ve already instructed Dacuan to catch a big fish from the river for dinner, to make a full fish feast for the benefactor to taste...\"","Full fish feast...","Mo Hua was indeed craving.","But he really had no time.","The month’s break had ended, he needed to return to the Sect as soon as possible, otherwise he would have to travel at night.","\"Uncle Yu, I appreciate your hospitality, maybe next time...\" Mo Hua politely declined.","Old Yu tried to retain him repeatedly, but seeing he couldn’t keep him, he packed some silver fishes in a basket for Mo Hua to take back to eat, and personally accompanied Mo Hua to the gate.","Before Mo Hua left, he extended his Divine Sense once more to scan the small fishing village, ensuring there was no presence of Evil God, only then did he feel completely at ease.","However, as soon as he withdrew his Divine Sense and turned to leave, he suddenly sensed something, his expression changed slightly, and he turned to ask:","\"Is there a shrine in the fishing village?\"","\"Yes,\" Old Yu nodded, with a devoted expression, \"Recently, we have been worshipping a Little Immortal Child for everyone’s safety.\"","\"Little Immortal Child?\"","Mo Hua was stunned.","Who is it?"]},{"number":1477,"title":"Chapter 1477 - 801 Little Immortal Child (Extra - for Boss Wood White Gold Jade’s Silver League~)","paragraphs":["Who exactly is this little Immortal child?","Where did he come from?","Mo Hua has no impression of him at all.","\"When did this happen?\"","Old Yu said, \"Over a year ago, after Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi were rescued, the villagers opened a Shrine at the back of the village, erected a statue, and even offered incense.\"","Mo Hua’s gaze flickered, \"Can you take me to see it?\"","\"Of course, but...\" Old Yu hesitated, \"Benefactor, are you not in a hurry?\"","\"I’ll just take a look, and leave after I see it.\"","\"Alright then.\"","Old Yu nodded, instructed his grandsons Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi to look after the house, and then led the way at the front, taking Mo Hua to the back of the village.","The back of the village was still the same as before, with few residents.","The well leading to the Blood-colored Fishing Village was still there; of course, the Formation to open the entrance had already been wiped away by Mo Hua.","And not far from the well, a small Shrine was carved into the cliff.","In front of the Shrine, there was a small offering table with some fruit offerings, and in the center, a small clay figure was worshipped.","Mo Hua looked at this clay figure and fell into contemplation.","This clay figure is a \"little Immortal child\", rather roughly made, clearly crafted by this group of Fish Cultivators themselves, but it looked nice enough, holding a Golden Sword, sitting majestically in the Shrine, appearing quite dignified.","The key point is, the appearance and eyebrows of this clay figure felt very familiar to Mo Hua...","Mo Hua’s expression was subtle, and he asked Old Yu:","\"Why erect the clay figure of this Immortal child?\"","Old Yu’s face turned solemn, and he began to explain slowly, \"Honestly, benefactor, previously, the cultivators in our village all had the same nightmare...\"","\"In the nightmare, there was a giant fish monster; its head was as large as a temple, whiskers as thick as trees, fangs glaringly white, its body blood-soaked, looking extremely terrifying as it went everywhere devouring people.\"","\"Just when this fish monster was wreaking havoc, a little Immortal descended from the heavens.\"","\"This little Immortal, shimmering with golden light all over, floated in from the sky, holding a Golden Sword, radiant as the sun. With a wave of his hand, he subdued the monstrous fish, then with a flash of golden light, he swung his Sword down and chopped off the creature’s head, quelling this disaster, letting our fishing village escape a great calamity...\"","Speaking here, Old Yu looked relieved, then sighed and continued:","\"But this little Immortal only revealed his form in the dream, came without a trace, and vanished completely after killing the fish monster.\"","\"Grateful for the little Immortal’s kindness, we built this Shrine for him here, erected a Divine Statue, placing offerings during festivals.\"","\"When the year doesn’t go well, when storms are too fierce, or when strange things happen, we also come here to burn 30 minutes of incense, praying to this little Immortal with the Golden Sword to maintain the peace, ensuring safety in the region...\"","Mo Hua was stunned.","The things Old Yu mentioned, weren’t those all things Mo Hua had done...","So in the end...","The Immortal child turned out to be myself?","Mo Hua’s feelings were somewhat complicated.","Feeling curious, he secretly asked Old Yu, \"When you pray to me... do you really find praying to this little Immortal effective?\"","Old Yu nodded repeatedly, \"It’s effective, it’s effective!\"","\"Really?\"","\"Naturally,\" Old Yu said with a face full of reverence, \"If it’s a cloudy rainy spell, praying to this little Immortal child will bring sunshine shortly; if there are no fish to catch, praying will turn luck around; the second Yu one time went into the river and had a leg bitten by a Water Demon, almost dragged into the river, but luckily survived, he said it was fortunate that he prayed to the little Immortal before entering the water, otherwise he might have lost his life...\"","\"Old Zhao’s wife at the village head had difficulty giving birth, and it was only after praying to this little Immortal child that both mother and child were saved...\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","He did not realize he was so powerful, able to protect both mother and child...","\"Has there never been a time when it wasn’t effective?\" Mo Hua asked again.","Old Yu thought for a while, \"Occasionally there is, but surely it’s because we’re not sincere enough, or too greedy, asking for too much, so the little Immortal didn’t bother with us...\"","\"Surely, the little Immortal must be very busy, it’s impossible to take care of us all the time, helping us is kind, not helping is justified, we shouldn’t hold any grudges.\"","\"A greedy heart will swallow an elephant, if one is too greedy, they will face retribution.\"","Old Yu said with a serious face, feeling deeply about it.","Mo Hua nodded.","It must be said, Old Yu’s reasoning was quite meticulous.","Mo Hua once again stared at the Shrine, observing the \"little Immortal\" with the Golden Sword, imposing there, receiving the incense offerings, and a question suddenly surfaced in his mind:","\"Can I really consume the incense offerings?\"","He remembered Lord Yellow Mountain said that only deities can consume incense.","How could he, a living person, consume incense?","Moreover, throughout the days he was worshiped as the \"little Immortal child\" by the villagers of the small fishing village, he felt no special sensations.","If he cannot consume incense, then where have all these incense offerings gone?","Some kind of cause and effect in the unseen?","Mo Hua couldn’t figure it out, stared at his clay figure again, suddenly his Divine Thought moved, eyes showing surprise, but he said nothing, instead he addressed Old Yu:","\"I’ve seen enough, it’s getting late, Uncle Yu, I should head back.\"","\"Take care, benefactor,\" Old Yu said, \"Let me escort you.\"","Old Yu personally took Mo Hua to the edge of the village, watched Mo Hua leave from afar, then went back home and instructed his two grandsons:","\"Keep the things benefactor gave you safe.\"","The two kids cherished and carefully tied the Water-Repelling Jade gifted by Mo Hua around their necks.","Old Yu nodded and said, \"Don’t underestimate the benefactor’s age, he is a Sect Disciple from a Great Sect, with Superior inheritance, foresight, knowledge, and skills that are first-class.\""]},{"number":1478,"title":"Chapter 1478 - 801 Little Immortal Child (Extra - for Wood White Gold Jade Boss’s Silver Alliance~)_2","paragraphs":["\"The words he speaks, you must remember them well and never forget.\"","\"And also...\" Old Yu sighed and said with emotion:","\"Although we are Loose Cultivators and live a life of poverty, we must uphold righteousness.\"","\"I am old, my life is thus, without much ability to repay the benefactor’s kindness, but you two children are different. You are young, the road ahead is long...\"","\"If in the future your Tao Cultivation is successful, you must find a way to repay this great kindness well.\"","The two grandsons nodded earnestly:","\"Yes, Grandpa, we remember!\"","\"Good.\"","Old Yu nodded in relief.","...","At this moment, behind the small fishing village.","In front of the Little Immortal’s shrine, incense smoke curled up, and there was no one around.","Mo Hua, who had already left, gradually revealed his figure again.","His gaze was deep, staring at the shrine for a few more glances, and then slowly said: \"Come out.\"","There was no movement within the shrine.","Mo Hua frowned slightly.","Just as he was becoming a bit impatient, from inside the shrine, a silver light flashed slightly, and a pure white little silver fish swam out shakily, nodding towards Mo Hua as if bowing.","At the same time, a slender and crisp voice entered Mo Hua’s ears.","\"Greetings, Benefactor...\"","Mo Hua was somewhat stunned.","He only knew that something sneaky was hidden in his shrine, but he never thought it would be a silver little fish.","Moreover, this little fish had pure Divine Thought, without a trace of evil spirit.","Recalling the past, Mo Hua understood.","\"You are... the River God I killed before?\"","The little silver fish shivered and said softly, \"In response to the benefactor, yes...\"","\"That’s not right...\" Mo Hua frowned, \"Old Yu calls me benefactor because I saved him, but I killed you, why do you also call me ’Benefactor’?\"","The little silver fish said in a soft voice: \"The benefactor killed me but also saved me, showing me mercy by sparing my life...\"","\"Showed mercy?\"","Mo Hua was taken aback and then remembered...","Back then, when he killed the corrupted River God and searched its altar, he indeed discovered a blood-colored small fish.","At that time, he had a spontaneous urge to crush it.","The little fish desperately shook its body, shaking off the filthy blood and revealing its silver-white form.","Mo Hua noticed it didn’t have a bloody abnormal aura, nor was it tainted by evil spirits, so he felt compassion and spared its life.","And that little fish turned into a silver light and swam away, its destination unknown.","So it was that little fish from back then.","Mo Hua realized and asked again: \"What is your origin exactly?\"","The little silver fish replied softly:","\"To be honest with the benefactor, this minor god was originally the River God of the Mistwater River, protecting the local waters, relying on the offerings from Fish Cultivators to continue the Divine Way...\"","\"Then one day, a terrifying Evil God invaded my Taoist Field, polluted my Divine Thought, and eventually even destroyed the entire fishing village, completely eradicating the foundation of my Divine Way...\"","\"I lost my foundation and could only become a puppet of the Evil God, gradually degenerating over the years, retaining only this sliver of clarity.\"","\"Originally, this sliver of ’Clarity’ of Divine Thought was about to extinguish when the young master killed the Evil God, severing my corrupted Divine Body, also letting me go free, and even the shrine I’m now inhabiting belongs to the young master, feeding on the young master’s incense.\"","\"The young master indeed gave this minor god a ’rebirth grace’, naturally making him my ’benefactor’.\"","Mo Hua was a little dazed.","Even he didn’t realize that unknowingly, he had done so many good deeds...","\"Severing the Divine Body, preserving a sliver of Divine Thought...\"","Mo Hua shuddered in his heart.","This is quite similar to Lord Yellow Mountain.","Back then, Lord Yellow Mountain had fallen, walked the wrong path, and was severed of his powerful Divine Body by the Taixu Gate predecessors using Divine Thought into a sword, leaving a sliver of pure Divine Thought, thus ’reborn’ into a desolate Mountain God.","This little silver fish is the same.","Except, it was cut by himself.","\"Are you still the River God now?\" Mo Hua asked.","The little silver fish nodded its tiny head, \"This minor god still has some of the River God’s authority, but most of the divine skills and the memories of the deities were all severed...\"","\"Severed?\" Mo Hua was slightly startled and asked: \"Then do you remember anything from before? The divine skills of the deities, and the Evil God who polluted you.\"","The little silver fish shook its head, \"After being severed, most of it isn’t remembered.\"","\"Alright...\"","Mo Hua felt a bit regretful.","He was quite curious about how the Evil God degenerated and how the deities managed to develop divine skills.","Especially the blood sea divine skill of the River God, which left a deep impression on him.","It seems there’s little chance of that now.","The deities are born from the Dao.","This Dao seems to include not only part of the ability but also part of the memory.","The two complement each other, innately present.","But if severed, both would be lost.","Mo Hua silently pondered in his heart.","The little silver fish suddenly seemed a bit ashamed and said softly: \"Apologies, benefactor, this minor god secretly consumed your ’incense’...\"","\"No matter, you can eat it.\" Mo Hua generously said.","After all, he couldn’t consume it himself.","\"However, since you’ve taken the incense, you have accepted the obligation, you must ensure the safety of this fishing village.\"","\"You don’t have to mind greedy people, nor force impossible tasks, but for things within your ability, do not shirk away.\"","\"And never tread the path of evil again...\"","Mo Hua instructed.","The little silver fish received Mo Hua’s approval, happily wagged its tail, and nodded repeatedly:","\"Many thanks, benefactor, this minor god will definitely remember benefactor’s teachings!\"","Mo Hua nodded.","\"Alright, I should be going too.\"","The little silver fish respectfully said: \"Take care, benefactor.\""]},{"number":1479,"title":"Chapter 1479 - 801 Little Immortal Child (Extra - for Wood White Gold Jade Boss’s Silver Alliance~)_3","paragraphs":["Mo Hua glanced again at the Little Immortal’s shrine, then turned and left.","Seeing Mo Hua leave, the Little Silver Fish quietly hid inside the shrine, behind the imposing statue of the Little Immortal, contentedly consuming Mo Hua’s incense.","Most deities, once they stray from the path and their Divine Way is destroyed, will immediately perish and disappear.","It’s already a heaven-given fortune that it can leave behind a life.","Not to mention, after leaving behind a life, it can still have a shrine to reside in, consuming incense, and reinforcing its divine position; this is an immense favor.","The Little Silver Fish eats the incense, feeling grateful.","...","Mo Hua no longer delayed, took a horse-drawn carriage, and returned directly to Taixu Gate.","Upon returning to Taixu Gate, Mo Hua sent a letter token to Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, is Crossing River Dragon still alive?\"","After a while, Gu Changhuai replied:","\"Alive.\"","Mo Hua: \"Actually alive?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"...Are you hoping he’s dead?\"","\"No, I thought with all those secrets and so much information leaked, he would surely be killed in the Taoist Prison, didn’t expect he has a tough life...\" Mo Hua said.","Gu Changhuai: \"I’m watching.\"","When it’s time to die, he will die, watching is useless...","Mo Hua whispered in his heart.","But he didn’t say it out loud, otherwise Uncle Gu with his petty mind would surely bear a grudge.","Gu Changhuai was somewhat alert, \"Why did you suddenly ask about Crossing River Dragon?\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and asked, \"Uncle Gu, do you know about the matter at Hundred Flower Valley?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"What matter?\"","Mo Hua: \"It’s about a Senior Sister who committed suicide.\"","Gu Changhuai sighed deeply.","This kid, could it be he has a keen ear? How can he find out about everything...","Gu Changhuai responded with an \"Hmm\".","Mo Hua was a bit surprised, \"Uncle Gu, you actually know?\"","Gu Changhuai emphasized, \"I am the Dao Court Canon.\"","\"Wasn’t it said to have been marginalized?\"","Gu Changhuai paused, then said irritably, \"Even marginalized, it’s still a Supervisor!\"","Mo Hua then asked, \"Did you go check at Hundred Flower Valley?\"","\"No...\" Gu Changhuai replied, \"Hundred Flower Valley doesn’t allow men to enter, not even Daoist Court officials.\"","Mo Hua: \"Then does Dao Court just leave it alone?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"It will be handled.\"","Mo Hua was puzzled, \"Isn’t it said men can’t enter?\"","Gu Changhuai couldn’t help but say, \"Is it possible that there are female supervisors in the Daoist Court?\"","Mo Hua was shocked, \"There are female supervisors? Who?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"Transferred from outside, you don’t know her, even if I told you, you wouldn’t know.\"","\"Oh...\" Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, and he asked, \"Why suddenly transfer female supervisors from outside...\"","\"Stop!\" Gu Changhuai said displeased, \"Don’t ask about these things, it’s about Daoist Court personnel transfer, even if you ask, you won’t be told.\"","\"Alright then...\" Mo Hua muttered.","Gu Changhuai said, \"You haven’t said why you suddenly asked about Crossing River Dragon? Is it related to the Hundred Flower Valley matter?\"","\"Hmm.\" Mo Hua said, \"The Senior Sister who committed suicide at Hundred Flower Valley, her surname is Ye, she is from the Ye family in Mistwater City.\"","\"And a Young Master Ye from the Ye family in Mistwater City was killed last year.\"","\"The one who killed Young Master Ye was Crossing River Dragon.\"","\"And I suspect that the killed Young Master Ye and the Senior Sister Ye who committed suicide should be somewhat related.\"","Gu Changhuai initially didn’t pay much attention but the more he listened, the more intense his expression became.","He didn’t expect Mo Hua had already investigated the connections so deeply and organized them so clearly.","With this ability, he could easily become a Supervisor at Dao Court...","\"So, you want me to interrogate Crossing River Dragon, ask him why he killed Young Master Ye, and at the same time use the Dao Court’s background to investigate this Young Master Ye, and the female disciple with the surname Ye who committed suicide at Hundred Flower Valley, to see what relation they have?\"","Mo Hua nodded, praised, \"As expected from Uncle Gu, so smart.\"","Gu Changhuai: \"...\"","Mo Hua then worried a bit, \"Uncle Gu, you’ve been marginalized, can you still investigate now?\"","Gu Changhuai snorted coldly, \"Marginalized doesn’t mean dismissed, just wait, I will inform you when there is news.\"","\"Hmm hmm.\" Mo Hua nodded.","After that, the letter token had no more messages.","Gu Changhuai seemed to be busy.","Mo Hua still had classes, and could only patiently wait for news.","However, outside of class, he had other matters to attend to.","During a trip to Kushan Mountain, after chatting with Lord Yellow Mountain for a while, Mo Hua gained a lot.","Firstly, it was the matter of transforming Divine Thought into a sword; through Lord Yellow Mountain’s description, Mo Hua had some inspiration.","Divine Thought into sword might be able to discard Sword Weapon and Sword Qi, trying to use the eyes to refine Sword Intent.","The eyes are the windows of Divine Sense, allowing the maximum extent of Divine Sense to be externalized.","Perhaps, through training, I can explore techniques to drive Divine Thought into a sword using just a gaze.","When no one was around, Mo Hua tried it.","As expected, all failed.","No matter how he squinted, he couldn’t release sword light from his eyes.","Though it failed, Mo Hua was not discouraged.","Any spell point is not achieved overnight.","The more powerful the sword technique, the more it requires persistent refining over years to reach mastery.","Mo Hua decided to practice every day when he had time.","Maybe one day, he could gather sword light in his eyes.","Another thing Mo Hua particularly cared about was what Lord Yellow Mountain referred to as...\"Divine Sense Taoism!\"","Mo Hua follows the path of Divine Sense Proving the Dao.","He always thought he was on that path.","But after chatting with Lord Yellow Mountain, he suddenly realized he might have accidentally taken a very strange route.","His Divine Sense Proving the Dao might differ greatly from other Divine Practitioners, and even more from the path his master planned for him.","His Divine Sense Proving the Dao, to be precise, should be called \"Divine Sense Sublimation.\"","It’s the path of Divine Sense engaging in deity Taoism, the \"Divine Sense Taoism\" route.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but sigh.","Most likely, his master didn’t foresee that as he practiced Heaven Yan Jue, and as the Evil Spirit feasted, he unintentionally veered off to the path of deity.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but worry.","\"Without my master, and I’ve learned wrongly, who knows how the future will unfold...\"","But upon careful thought, Mo Hua realized that what he learned wrongly wasn’t just one or two things.","With so many lice, they don’t itch; with so much debt, one doesn’t worry.","Having learned the Heaven Yan Jue, he can only forge ahead blindly, worrying is useless.","Mo Hua set his mind at ease, casting all these concerns far away.","Let’s take it step by step.","Tao cultivation is just a matter of walking step by step, steadily moving forward; no one knows where they will reach in the end.","Determined in his Taoist Heart, persisting forward is enough, no need for excessive worry.","Mo Hua nodded.","He then peacefully cultivated, tried in his free time to release Divine Thought into a sword using his eyes.","All the while, he waited for news from Gu Changhuai.","However, after several days, there was still no news from Gu Changhuai.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but frown.","If Uncle Gu can’t find any leads, where should he start himself?","Couldn’t possibly sneak into Hundred Flower Valley for investigation, right?","With this thought, Mo Hua’s mind stirred but he quickly shook his head.","\"Probably couldn’t sneak in...\""]},{"number":1480,"title":"Chapter 1480 - 802 Hua Qianqian","paragraphs":["Entry of male cultivators is strictly forbidden in the Hundred Flower Valley.","Even the Supervisor from the Taoist Court isn’t allowed in, let alone a minor disciple like me from the Taixu Gate.","\"Can’t go, can’t go...\"","Mo Hua shook his head repeatedly, abandoning the idea.","Fortunately, two days later, news finally came from Gu Changhuai’s side.","\"The interrogation is over...\" Gu Changhuai said.","Mo Hua: \"Crossing River Dragon isn’t dead, right?\"","Gu Changhuai was speechless: \"Why do you always hope he’s dead...\"","Mo Hua replied: \"Not really, it’s just that I feel like he’s always on the brink of dying, so I asked.\"","These henchmen of the Evil God tend to die suddenly if anything goes wrong.","Mo Hua was quite experienced.","Gu Changhuai: \"Don’t worry...\"","\"Did you find out anything?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Yes.\" Gu Changhuai sent a transmission, saying, \"We found something, but it’s different from what you mentioned.\"","Mo Hua: \"What’s the discrepancy?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"The young master who died wasn’t surnamed Ye, but Lin.\"","\"A Lin?\" Mo Hua was stunned.","\"Yes.\"","How could it be Lin?","Mo Hua frowned.","He had studied Heavenly secret Calculation and had a strong premonition in his heart that Young Master Ye was the one who died on the Mistwater River, his throat slit by Crossing River Dragon.","But Crossing River Dragon claimed the person he killed was surnamed \"Lin,\" not Ye...","Could Crossing River Dragon be lying?","Mo Hua shook his head.","At this point, considering Crossing River Dragon’s crimes, he would either face execution or spend a life in Taoist Prison, so he had no reason to lie about such a trivial matter.","\"Lin... Ye...\"","Mo Hua’s thoughts stirred, and he asked: \"Could it be that Young Master Ye was using a false name? Maybe he used ’Young Master Lin’ to conceal his identity while indulging in festivities?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"There’s a possibility.\"","Mo Hua asked again: \"Did Crossing River Dragon say anything else?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"He did, but not much useful. He only mentioned acting on orders to kill a young master surnamed Lin to silence him, with the intent to eliminate everyone on board without leaving any trace.\"","\"For Crossing River Dragon, killing is routine. As for other matters, he neither inquires nor dares to inquire.\"","So, there are no clues...","Mo Hua frowned, hesitated for a moment, but still asked: \"Uncle Gu, have you heard of the ’Rouge Boat’?\"","On the other side, Gu Changhuai was reviewing dossiers at the Taoist Court when he saw Mo Hua’s message, especially the words \"Rouge Boat,\" and was startled.","He couldn’t help but ask: \"How much do you know?\"","Mo Hua was suddenly enlightened.","It turned out Uncle Gu knew as well.","Mo Hua replied: \"Not much, just heard recently...\"","Gu Changhuai didn’t entirely believe him, but he had no way to force Mo Hua to talk.","Mo Hua wouldn’t speak, and Gu couldn’t pry his mouth open to force a confession.","Gu Changhuai could only advise: \"Be cautious, don’t be too curious, that place is dangerous...\"","A place where lewdness and filth reside.","The people there are dubious and have varied quirks.","For Mo Hua, it’s dangerous in every sense.","Naive Mo Hua clearly didn’t understand what Gu Changhuai meant; he only thought it was \"dangerous\" in the general sense.","\"Rest assured, Uncle Gu, I know what I’m doing.\" Mo Hua said.","No, you really don’t...","Gu Changhuai wanted to say more but hesitated, ultimately remaining silent.","Mo Hua added: \"Crossing River Dragon surely knows about Rouge Boat, did you ask him?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"I did, but as soon as I mentioned those words, Crossing River Dragon looked horror-stricken and shook his head desperately.\"","\"He dared not speak?\"","\"Yes, likely subjected to some kind of ’silence curse.’ If he speaks about Rouge Boat, he might die instantly.\" Gu Changhuai said.","Only then did Mo Hua remember that Gu Changhuai had mentioned similar matters before.","\"Is it a silence curse?\"","\"Hard to say, there are many methods to silence someone, it’s difficult for the Taoist Court here to judge quickly.\" Gu Changhuai said, \"I feared for his life, so I didn’t press further.\"","Mo Hua frowned.","Crossing River Dragon knows about Rouge Boat, but he dares not speak; once he does, he’ll lose his life.","That explains why those young masters employ Crossing River Dragon for murder.","Because his mouth is sealed.","Which means the clues are severed...","\"This Young Master Lin, does he have a confirmed identity?\"","\"No, the Taoist Court couldn’t find it.\" Gu Changhuai said.","Mo Hua felt a bit disappointed.","Gu Changhuai hesitated for a moment, sighed, and transmitted to Mo Hua:","\"The deceased ’Young Master Lin’ is untraceable, but I found that on the Ye family’s side, there is a deceased ’Young Master Ye.’\"","Mo Hua was taken aback.","Gu Changhuai: \"I had someone retrieve a dossier from the Taoist Court in Mistwater City. According to the records, over a year ago, the Ye family went to the Taoist Court to deregister a lineage, the deregistered cultivator being a direct lineage of the Ye family, named ’Ye Xiu.’\"","\"Ye Xiu?\" Mo Hua’s eyes narrowed, \"Ye Jin, Ye Xiu, Jinxiu... Is it possible he’s...\"","\"Yes.\" Gu Changhuai said, \"The one whose lineage was deregistered is Ye Jin’s elder brother.\"","As Gu Changhuai spoke, he opened a dossier beside him and transmitted:","\"Ye Xiu, a direct lineage of the Ye family in Mistwater City, age twenty-eight, Mid-stage Foundation Establishment cultivation, died from a violent water poison after a water demon attack while traveling by boat.\"","\"His father, Ye Yun, applied, and the Taoist Court approved the deregistration.\"","Mo Hua suddenly realized.","Now it’s clear.","The Ye Xiu deregistered by the Ye family is the elder brother of the deceased Ye Jin’s master sister.","He went to Rouge Boat to indulge and didn’t use his real name, instead going under the alias \"Young Master Lin.\"","Something unknown happened on Rouge Boat.","After that, Ye Xiu was eliminated by Crossing River Dragon.","But Ye Xiu used the name \"Young Master Lin,\" so the Crossing River Dragon didn’t know his true identity, thinking he killed a \"Young Master Lin.\""]},{"number":1481,"title":"Chapter 1481 - 802 Hua Qianqian_2","paragraphs":["The Ye family discovered Ye Xiu’s death, probably investigated briefly, and realized the situation was too deep to handle. They didn’t dare to inquire further, choosing instead to let the matter die down, citing that Ye Xiu succumbed to water poison, died from the toxin, and had his residency records canceled at the Taoist Court.","In this way, the \"Young Master Lin\" who died on the Mistwater River never actually existed, and the Taoist Court naturally couldn’t trace it.","The Ye family’s \"Young Master Ye\" died, but they didn’t know the cause, thus only quietly canceled his registry.","Both sides have muddled accounts that naturally do not match.","If Mo Hua hadn’t investigated Ye Jin’s death and uncovered old accounts, it would be impossible to discover that \"Young Master Lin,\" who was found with a slit throat on the Mistwater River, and the Ye family’s \"Young Master Ye\" who \"died from poisoning,\" were, in fact, the same person.","Mo Hua sighed inwardly with some relief.","Thankfully, Uncle Gu was there to assist.","Uncle Gu, being the Supervisor, could access the Taoist Court’s archives; otherwise, communicating with the Taoist Court would be akin to crossing mountains, and Mo Hua would be clueless about the convolutions inside.","\"This pretty much confirms it...\"","\"Senior Sister Ye Jin from the Hundred Flower Valley committed suicide.\"","\"And her brother, Ye Xiu, was killed by the Crossing River Dragon over a year ago on the Mistwater River.\"","The cause of Ye Xiu’s death must be related to the Rouge Boat.","Thus, Senior Sister Ye Jin’s reason for suicide likely also connects to the \"Rouge Boat\"...","Mo Hua’s gaze darkened slightly.","Gu Changhuai’s face wasn’t pleasant either.","The implications of this matter ran deeper than he had imagined...","\"Are there any other clues?\" Mo Hua asked again.","\"No,\" Gu Changhuai replied.","\"Really?\"","Gu Changhuai ignored Mo Hua.","Mo Hua refrained from pressing further.","Based on his experience, when Uncle Gu chose not to respond, it generally meant there truly were no clues left.","Gu Changhuai finally added:","\"Regarding the Rouge Boat, if you learn anything, remember to tell me. Don’t take risks on your own.\"","\"Yes, definitely,\" Mo Hua promised.","Gu Changhuai could not be sure if Mo Hua’s \"definitely\" was sincere or not.","Mo Hua’s actions were fundamentally \"uncontrollable.\"","At this moment, Gu Changhuai somewhat understood the feelings of their Taoist Court Leader.","In the eyes of the Court Leader, Mo Hua mirrored himself...","Gu Changhuai silently sighed.","He turned to Ye Xiu’s document page again, noting the vibrant red seal of the Taoist Court from the Xiao family deepening his thoughts.","...","In Taixu Gate, Mo Hua continued to silently ponder.","Now the deceased’s identity was somewhat understood.","Yet Ye Jin was gone, and Ye Xiu was also deceased.","On Ye Xiu’s matters, Uncle Gu had already investigated, but further exploration might take time without significant progress.","This clue was temporarily severed.","Efforts must now center on Senior Sister Ye Jin’s suicide, hoping to uncover other leads.","However, Senior Sister Ye Jin was a disciple of the Hundred Flower Valley.","Unable to access the Hundred Flower Valley himself, Mo Hua could only trust others to inquire.","The most familiar person within the Hundred Flower Valley was Senior Sister Qianqian...","Mo Hua devised a plan.","He aimed to find time to ask Senior Sister Qianqian.","But, he couldn’t resort to Young Master Hao Se’s method of waiting by the Hundred Flower Valley gate; otherwise, he might be treated like Hao Se and mistaken for a \"suspicious cultivator,\" inevitably facing a beating.","Unable to wait at the Hundred Flower Valley, waiting at the Taixu Gate was the solution.","Senior Sister Qianqian and Senior Sister Murong were close and frequently visited the Taixu Gate together to cultivate, take on rewards, or hunt monster beasts.","Mo Hua would use any opportunity to approach Murong Caiyun under the guise of \"learning formation.\"","However, after days of inquiry, he still hadn’t encountered Hua Qianqian.","On the contrary, after a session, Mo Hua went to the Taixu Gate’s entrance to collect the Formation Diagram and pastries sent by Aunt Wan for himself and Yu Er, when he saw Hua Qianqian wandering at the foot of the mountain.","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, promptly approaching, greeting:","\"Senior Sister Qianqian.\"","Hua Qianqian paused, lifted her head to see Mo Hua, then smiled a faint smile, \"Junior Brother Mo...\"","She seemed burdened, in low spirits, making her smile appear reluctant.","Mo Hua thus asked: \"Senior Sister Qianqian, are you here to find Senior Sister Murong?\"","Hua Qianqian nodded slightly.","Mo Hua said: \"Then I shall call for her on your behalf.\"","Who knew Hua Qianqian would tug at Mo Hua’s sleeve, hesitating several times, and sighed: \"It’s... alright, not much to discuss...\"","Mo Hua’s gaze flickered.","He roughly understood that Senior Sister Qianqian had concerns she wished to share with Senior Sister Murong, but was hesitant, unsure whether to speak, hence her lingering at the mountain’s base.","Mo Hua’s mind stirred, and he gently asked:","\"Is something troubling you, Senior Sister?\"","His voice was crisp and clear, like a clear spring, containing a thread of Divine Thought imbued with tranquil divine charm.","Following this, Hua Qianqian’s anxious thoughts naturally settled.","She looked up at Mo Hua, meeting his clear eyes, which further calmed her mood.","\"I...\"","Hua Qianqian hesitated to speak.","Mo Hua said: \"Senior Sister, if there’s trouble, tell me, perhaps I can help.\"","Hua Qianqian froze, \"You... help me?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"when I first joined, thanks to you and Senior Sister Murong’s care. Among Senior Sister and Junior Brother, one should look after the other; now you have trouble, naturally, I should assist you.\"","Hua Qianqian looked at the genuinely earnest Mo Hua, her heart soothed, yet she still shook her head, saying:","\"You are currently at a crucial stage of cultivation; you should focus on your cultivation, not getting entangled in unnecessary troubles...\"","\"Alright,\" Mo Hua sighed, then his eyes brightened, taking a step back and saying:"]},{"number":1482,"title":"Chapter 1482 - 802 Hua Qianqian_3","paragraphs":["\"Senior Sister, why don’t you tell me what happened first? Maybe I can give you some advice.\"","\"This...\"","Hua Qianqian pondered for a moment, and eventually nodded.","She had a lively nature, and her thoughts were shallow, so she couldn’t hide things.","With this matter in her heart, she was restless and eager to confide in someone, but it was inconvenient for her to speak with fellow disciples of Hundred Flower Valley.","She thought of seeking Senior Sister Murong, but hesitated.","Mo Hua’s words brought her to this point where she couldn’t hold back anymore.","Moreover, she was fairly acquainted with Mo Hua and knew that despite his young age, he was always intelligent, unflappable in crises, quite resourceful, and at times more reliable than even herself as a senior sister.","Hua Qianqian sighed deeply and then asked, \"Do you still remember... that Senior Sister Ye?\"","\"Senior Sister Ye?\" Mo Hua pretended not to know, recalled for a bit, and nodded:","\"Is it the one with the oval face, fair and pretty, with a refined temperament, Senior Sister Ye? I remember... What happened to Senior Sister Ye?\"","Hua Qianqian’s expression reflected pain, \"She...\"","Her voice choked slightly, she bit her lips and finally said, \"...died.\"","A faint sadness appeared in Mo Hua’s eyes.","\"Senior Sister Ye... How did she die?\" Mo Hua asked softly.","\"She committed suicide...\"","Mo Hua feigned surprise, \"Why would she commit suicide out of the blue?\"","Hua Qianqian’s heart was suffering.","Some words, if kept in the heart, would never be spoken.","But once spoken, they cannot be concealed.","Hua Qianqian said, \"The elders all claim that Jin Er sister died by suicide, but I feel that’s not the case, at least not that simple...\"","\"Jin Er sister is... very introverted, not from a good background, but she’s very kind. Although she seems cold, she’s quite caring. She loves magnolia flowers, and occasionally, when she has free time, she bakes pastries to share with us.\"","\"Everyone treats her well on a daily basis.\"","\"How could someone like Jin Er sister commit suicide without reason?\"","\"I want to find out clearly how Jin Er sister really died...\"","\"But everyone is tight-lipped. The elders insist Jin Er committed suicide. I want to ask my fellow sisters for help with the investigation, but some are indifferent, others are perfunctory, and some even advise me not to get involved...\"","At this point, Hua Qianqian looked somewhat saddened.","\"So, you wanted to approach Senior Sister Murong to help you investigate this matter?\" Mo Hua asked.","Hua Qianqian nodded, \"I wanted to ask Sister Murong for help, but...\"","Hua Qianqian sighed, \"...I’m afraid of disturbing her. Next year is the Dao conference, and Sister Murong is unlike me. She has great talent and is held in high expectations, expected to place in the Dao conference, and I don’t want my matter to distract her...\"","Dao conference?","Mo Hua was momentarily stunned, then recalled that Senior Sister Murong was a year ahead of him, and indeed, next year was the time for them to participate in the Dao conference.","Hua Qianqian appeared melancholic.","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then said, \"Senior Sister Qianqian, why don’t I help you investigate?\"","Hua Qianqian was slightly taken aback, \"How will you investigate?\"","Mo Hua said, \"Whatever clues you have, you can tell me. Whatever you want to investigate, you can tell me. To be honest...\"","Mo Hua leaned close to Hua Qianqian and spoke in a lowered voice:","\"...I have contacts in the Taoist Court. Whatever you want to know, as long as it doesn’t break the Taoist Law, I can mostly help you find out.\"","Hua Qianqian was shocked.","Contacts in the Taoist Court?","You’re just a mid-stage Foundation Establishment junior disciple, and you have contacts in the Taoist Court of the Fifth Grade Qianxue State Boundary?","\"Really!\"","Mo Hua worried she wouldn’t believe him, so he secretly took out his Taoist Court badge from Tongxian City to \"blend in\" and also showed the letter token given to him by Gu Changhuai, which was exclusive to the Taoist Court.","Hua Qianqian stared blankly and nodded.","But she still had some concerns, \"This matter might involve some trouble, you...\"","\"It’s alright,\" Mo Hua said, \"I have strong ’connections’. Elder Master Xun told me that as long as I conduct myself righteously and don’t do bad things, if anyone bullies me, he will back me up.\"","Besides, after the incident in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, he’s well acquainted with the likes of Xun Ziyou and Xun Zixian.","Some minor issues wouldn’t even need to bother Elder Master Xun.","Hua Qianqian had also heard Murong Caiyun mention Elder Master Xun of the Taixu Gate, and she felt a shock in her heart, her gaze towards Mo Hua changed.","He never realized that Junior Brother Mo, who seemed harmless, actually had such capabilities and a deep background.","With a solemn expression, Hua Qianqian nodded earnestly, \"Alright, then I’ll be troubling Junior Brother Mo!\"","\"No need to be polite, it’s what I should do.\" Mo Hua waved his hand, and then he laid out the plan he had already thought of:","\"Senior Sister, when you return to Hundred Flower Valley, conduct investigations quietly without exposing your intentions.\"","\"Note down discreetly all matters related to Senior Sister Ye Jin, including whom she interacted with, where she went, and what she said.\"","\"Whether there are any enmities, any grudges with others, and so on...\"","\"Also...\"","Mo Hua spoke fluently, listing a slew of details.","Hua Qianqian appeared somewhat dazed.","Junior Brother Mo, how is he so adept at this...","But then she thought, given his connection with the Taoist Court, his knowledge in investigating cases seemed quite fitting?","Hua Qianqian nodded, \"Alright, Junior Brother Mo, I remembered it.\"","Mo Hua then arranged, \"If we discover anything, we’ll still meet here. If I find out anything, I’ll also inform you.\"","\"Okay!\" Hua Qianqian’s gaze was resolute.","She was determined to uncover the true cause of Jin Er’s death!","Afterward, Hua Qianqian returned to Hundred Flower Valley, and Mo Hua returned to Taixu Gate.","In Hundred Flower Valley, Mo Hua now had a \"spy\".","Days later, the two met as agreed at the foot of Taixu Gate’s mountain.","Hua Qianqian secretly conveyed the information she had gathered to Mo Hua:","\"Just like other sisters, Jin Er sister usually interacted with the elders, instructors, or fellow disciples of the sect, and there wasn’t anything special.\"","\"I haven’t heard of her bearing grudges against anyone either.\"","\"Her words and deeds were as usual, except for one thing, which seemed strange...\"","Hua Qianqian’s expression was puzzled, \"According to one of my senior sisters, Jin Er previously asked her a very strange question.\"","\"A strange question?\"","\"Yes,\" Hua Qianqian said slowly, \"She asked... After a person dies, can they become a ghost?\"","Mo Hua’s pupils involuntarily shrunk.","Ghost?!"]},{"number":1483,"title":"Chapter 1483 - 803 Ghost","paragraphs":["When people die, do they turn into ghosts?","Why would Senior Sister Ye ask this?","Could it be...","Mo Hua’s expression darkened slightly. After some thought, he said to Hua Qianqian, \"Senior Sister Qianqian, are there any belongings left of Senior Sister Ye Jin?\"","Hua Qianqian thought for a moment and shook her head, \"It’s hard to say, Sister Jin Er died by self-immolation, the entire house was burned down, nothing was left. Even if anything was left, it was all collected by the Sect and handed over to the Ye family.\"","\"There aren’t any, then...\"","Mo Hua frowned, contemplated for a moment, then suddenly had a flash of inspiration, \"Are there any books? Or a jade slip.\"","\"Those were all burned too...\"","\"No,\" Mo Hua said, \"Not her own, the ones she borrowed from the Sect, the books and jade slips.\"","Hua Qianqian was taken aback and then understood.","Mo Hua said, \"Try to check in the Book Pavilion, see if Senior Sister Ye Jin borrowed any books or jade slips before her death, there might be some clues in them.\"","Hua Qianqian gave Mo Hua a surprised glance, admiring him in her heart.","Junior Brother Mo is indeed remarkably astute.","Hua Qianqian said, \"The records in the Book Pavilion are confidential, but I have an aunt who is an Elder there, I can ask her for help. At this time tomorrow, I will bring you the books and jade slips, and if I can’t get them, I will come to tell you.\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Alright.\"","The next day, after finishing his class, Mo Hua came early to wait at the foot of the mountain.","After a while, Hua Qianqian, dressed in brocade and with a stunning appearance, arrived.","The two of them sat side by side under a large tree.","Hua Qianqian handed Mo Hua a storage bag embroidered with a hundred flowers, letting out a long breath:","\"It was a bit troublesome... no matter what I said, my aunt refused to agree, I coaxed and pestered her for a long time and even promised that in this Sect assessment, I would definitely achieve a ’Grade A’ in Alchemy before she relented and checked the records for me.\"","Hua Qianqian pointed at the storage bag, \"All the Tao cultivation books that Sister Jin Er borrowed from the Book Pavilion in the past month are in this storage bag.\"","Then she reminded, \"These are not supposed to be shown to outsiders, Junior Brother Mo, please don’t lose them, or I won’t be able to explain to my aunt...\"","\"Understood, Senior Sister, rest assured!\" Mo Hua assured.","Hua Qianqian felt relieved but still had some doubts, \"But... is there really a clue in them?\"","\"Let’s hope so...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes brightened slightly.","...","Inside the Taixu Gate.","After returning to the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua opened the storage bag Hua Qianqian had given him.","This was a storage bag from the Hundred Flower Valley.","It was embroidered with a profusion of colorful flowers.","Inside the storage bag, there were a total of four Tao cultivation canons and one jade slip.","Mo Hua flipped through them one by one.","The jade slip recorded a method of cultivating flowers, explaining how to nurture various kinds of valuable magnolia flowers.","The Hundred Flower Valley is named after \"flowers,\" and flower arts are one of the Tao cultivation courses there. The female disciples of Hundred Flower Valley are all somewhat proficient in flower arts.","And Mo Hua remembered that Senior Sister Qianqian had mentioned that Senior Sister Ye Jin loved magnolia flowers before her death, so in learning floral arts, she focused on \"magnolia.\"","But he himself knew nothing about floral arts.","If it couldn’t be eaten, he wasn’t very fond of growing it.","Mo Hua skimmed through the jade slip, found nothing, and put it aside for the time being.","Then there were several Tao cultivation canons.","Some were about alchemy, some about cultivation, and one taught women how to apply makeup and rouge, but the last one was very peculiar.","The book title was: \"One Hundred Taboos in Cultivation.\"","This was a book about nearly a hundred forbidden acts during cultivation, to prevent disciples from going astray and falling into evil paths.","Mo Hua flipped through the book, and suddenly his gaze stopped on a page.","This page had slight creases.","There were water stains on it that looked like tear marks.","Near the tear marks, there was a line of text:","\"...if one dies tragically, with deep resentment, they can turn into the fiercest of ghostly entities...\"","Tragic death, heavy resentment, transformation into ghosts...","Mo Hua’s heart gradually sank.","He pondered for a moment, put away the storage bag, took out the White Bone Broken Sword, lifted a small seal, and asked:","\"Sword Bone, may I ask you a question.\"","\"Master,\" Sword Bone started to say, then immediately realized Mo Hua disliked those two words and changed his address, \"Young Master, please ask.\"","\"How did you become an ’Evil Spirit’?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"This...\" Sword Bone chuckled awkwardly, \"Didn’t you already know, I was killed by you, my flesh and blood vanished, and my divine soul became parasitic on the broken sword, turning into a Sword Demon...\"","Mo Hua frowned, \"Isn’t your situation... rather special?\"","Sword Bone shivered inside, feeling guilty, \"Young Master, you mean...\"","Mo Hua said, \"I’ve killed others and seen many people die, but those who could turn into ’Evil Spirits’ after death are very few.\"","Among the people Mo Hua encountered, besides the Sword Bone, the only one who turned into an Evil Spirit after death was Zhang Quan, a Foundation Building cultivator collaborating with Lu Chengyun in refining corpses at the Corpse Mountain in South Yue City.","But Zhang Quan’s situation was special.","His entire family were \"Corpse Ghosts.\"","He also had an ancestral \"Zombie Image,\" and after death, the whole family would neatly enter the image.","There must be some inheritance involved here.","However, Mo Hua was not from the Corpse Path, so he couldn’t tell which evil spell point Zhang Quan’s family inherited.","But apart from Zhang Quan, other cultivators just died and that was that.","They wouldn’t easily turn into Evil Spirit ghosts.","Sword Bone was another more unusual case.","It seemed to have been prepared early on, either to refine its own Magical Treasure and achieve Golden Core Demon Cultivator status or to lose its flesh and blood upon death and transform into a Sword Demon."]},{"number":1484,"title":"Chapter 1484 - 803 Ghost_2","paragraphs":["At that time in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, the situation was urgent, and Mo Hua didn’t have time to think much.","Now, upon careful reflection, there seems to be a significant problem here.","A ’Sword Demon,’ even in his eyes, is like an ant, an evil spirit he could crush to death at will. But in some sense, it has shifted from the Human Dao to the ’Ghost Path,’ avoiding true death and Dao extinction.","If it were that easy to choose, a vast number of Cultivators would willingly become ’Sword Demons’ after death.","But clearly, there’s no such good fortune.","Most Cultivators die and it’s simply final.","This Sword Bone, there’s something wrong...","Within the White Bone Broken Sword, the Sword Bone was somewhat trembling.","Being close to the ruler is like being close to a tiger.","Especially, this tiger is not only powerful and fierce but also has a mindset near an evil monster.","The Sword Bone’s voice was hoarse, trying to stay calm as it said:","\"Answering Young Master’s question, in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, there was no daylight, and I only harbored a faint hope in the dire situation, thinking that if by any chance, becoming a Sword Demon was also a path to survival.\"","\"In the end, through a fortunate coincidence, I was killed by you, Young Master, and my Divine Soul entered the White Bone Broken Sword, successfully transforming into a Sword Demon. I believe it was due to the good fortune bestowed by you, Little Young Master.\"","\"Without you, Little Young Master, I might not have walked this path. Perhaps when breaking through the Golden Core, I would have vanished completely, leaving no remains...\"","The Sword Bone subtly flattered Mo Hua.","Mo Hua’s gaze was somewhat intriguing, but he didn’t ask much further, instead saying:","\"Do you know... how can a person turn into a ’ghost’?\"","The Sword Bone did not wish to answer.","It was uncertain how much Mo Hua knew about this Ghost Path and feared that if it slipped up, Mo Hua might detect something.","Yet clearly it couldn’t remain silent either.","The Sword Bone hesitated slightly, then slowly said:","\"Cultivators due to special circumstances lose their bodies, but their Divine Sense lingers, over time becoming ghosts.\"","\"Ghosts covet human bodies, especially those of close kin.\"","\"If there are no close kin, then masters, peers, Taoist friends, anyone related to them, anyone with their memories, will become their prey.\"","\"They will parasitize these people, devouring their Divine Thoughts, and after consuming them, they will seek the next host to continue devouring.\"","\"And those parasitized by ghosts will undergo drastic changes in temperament, lose their senses, and once their Divine Sense is completely devoured by the ghost, they will perish...\"","...","The Sword Bone nervously finished these words.","Mo Hua nodded slightly.","The words of the Sword Bone were similar to what Lord Yellow Mountain had said.","\"Are there any special circumstances?\" Mo Hua asked again.","\"Special circumstances?\"","\"For example...\" Mo Hua thought of the saying from ’Cultivation Taboos,’ \"If a person tragically dies with deep resentful energy, they can become the fiercest of ghosts...\"","Tragic death...","The Sword Bone’s expression turned grim, nodding, \"Yes.\"","It thought for a moment, then truthfully said: \"Anything has exceptions, and so does the Ghost Path. Some people cultivate the Ghost Path, willingly becoming Ghost Cultivators; some lose their bodies, becoming ghosts out of necessity; some meet bad luck, becoming possessed by evil objects, turning into evil spirits...\"","\"But these are usual cases.\"","\"The extreme case is ’tragic death,’ where a cultivator in life suffers tremendous torment and pain, harboring great resentment and hatred. Dying tragically like this transforms them into evil ghosts, fierce ghosts, murderous ghosts, fierce ghosts, and other formidable spirits.\"","\"These fierce ghosts are far stronger than ordinary evil spirits, their resentment extremely intense, making their killing terrifying.\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brow.","These things, Lord Yellow Mountain seemed to have never mentioned.","He turned his head, quietly glancing at the White Bone Broken Sword in his hand.","This Sword Bone seems to know quite a lot...","\"Alright, you’re dismissed.\"","Mo Hua said, then complemented the Divine Lock Array, sealing the Sword Bone again.","In the White Bone Sword, the Sword Bone let out a long sigh of relief.","While a hint of worry clouded Mo Hua’s brow.","\"It’s not good...\"","If it were truly like this, could it be that Senior Sister Ye Jin intended to die tragically, harboring resentment, and transform into a ghost, which is why she set a fire, burning herself alive.","Enduring such pain, all for becoming a fierce ghost.","But transforming into a ghost is not that simple.","If she did not become a fierce ghost, all is well; if she truly transformed, she might start \"devouring\" humans.","And she did not die in the Ye family but in the Hundred Flower Valley.","Inside the Hundred Flower Valley are her fellow sisters with whom she shared bonds.","Even if she does not wish it, driven by the fierce ghost’s instinct, she will begin to possess bodies, search for Divine Sense to devour.","It’s even very likely, she is already \"possessed\"...","Mo Hua’s expression was grave.","...","The next day, was the scheduled rest day.","Mo Hua arranged to meet Hua Qianqian and roughly explained the situation.","He did not mention the ghost matter, only said:","\"Senior Sister Ye Jin’s manner of death is somewhat strange, with residual deep resentment likely to breed evil thoughts. There might be frightening incidents occurring in the Hundred Flower Valley...\"","Mo Hua originally thought he would have to spend more effort explaining.","Unexpectedly, Hua Qianqian’s face turned pale upon hearing this, trembling as she said:","\"Yes, Junior Brother, you’re right!\"","Mo Hua’s heart sank.","Hua Qianqian continued: \"These days, the sisters who were closer to Sister Jin Er often feel restless, occasionally even experiencing nightmares at night. They dream of Senior Sister Ye Jin with a ghastly pale face, devoid of blood, staring quietly at them, saying things like ’so dirty,’ ’can’t live anymore.’","\"After a while, karmic fire rises in the nightmare.\"","\"Sister Jin Er just stands in the sea of flames, burnt beyond recognition, looking like a monster...\"","Hua Qianqian’s expression was filled with both fear and heartache."]},{"number":1485,"title":"Chapter 1485 - 803 Ghost_3","paragraphs":["Mo Hua felt heavy-hearted, and thought indeed, the situation had become somewhat serious.","These signs could already be the harbinger of transforming into a Fierce Ghost.","Hua Qianqian glanced at Mo Hua and couldn’t help but ask:","\"Junior Brother Mo, has something happened to Junior Sister Jin?\"","\"It’s still hard to say...\"","Mo Hua sighed.","There were still relatively few clues, and he could only speculate.","As for the truth, without seeing it firsthand, he found it hard to make a judgment.","After hesitating for a long time, Mo Hua finally spoke: \"Sister Qianqian, can you... take me into the Hundred Flower Valley?\"","Hua Qianqian was stunned, shook her head, and sighed:","\"The rules of the Hundred Flower Valley are very strict; all male cultivators are forbidden to enter.\"","\"Is there really no exception?\"","\"None...\" Hua Qianqian replied.","\"Alright then.\"","Mo Hua felt a bit disappointed.","It seemed he could only think of other ways.","For instance, could he call out all the Hundred Flower Valley disciples who were familiar with Senior Sister Ye Jin to meet?","Especially those who had nightmares about Senior Sister Ye Jin...","While Mo Hua was deep in thought, Hua Qianqian secretly observed him, her gaze flickering, and her heartbeat couldn’t help but quicken.","\"Actually... there’s a way...\"","Hua Qianqian whispered.","\"What?\" Mo Hua was somewhat surprised.","Hua Qianqian’s glistening eyes roamed over Mo Hua’s face, and ultimately, unable to suppress her inner flutter, she whispered:","\"Junior Brother, if you... change into a Hundred Flower Valley Taoist robe, I can take you in.\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, his expression shocked, and immediately refused:","\"No, no!\"","Absolutely not!","As a dignified man and the Junior Brother of Taixu Gate, how could he wear the Taoist robe of the Hundred Flower Valley?","Hua Qianqian was surprised herself when she said this.","Then she immediately realized that this might be the only chance in her life, a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","If she missed it this time, fulfilling her wish later might be forever impossible.","\"Just wear it for a moment to sneak into the valley.\" Hua Qianqian said.","At least let herself see the appearance of Junior Brother Mo wearing the Hundred Flower Valley Taoist robe.","Mo Hua was resolute in his refusal, firmly stating:","\"No means no.\"","\"Alright...\"","Seeing Mo Hua’s determined attitude, Hua Qianqian felt regretful but had no choice but to give up, \"Then how do we investigate Junior Sister Jin’s matter?\"","Mo Hua thought for a while and said: \"Can you call out the senior sisters who’ve had nightmares to let me meet them?\"","Hua Qianqian looked troubled but still said: \"I’ll try, but time is tight, and the sisters all have things to do. They might not all be able to come during this rest period.\"","\"Alright,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"Thank you, Senior Sister.\"","After that, Hua Qianqian returned to the Hundred Flower Valley.","Mo Hua was still considering the matter of Ye Jin, but as he thought about it, he suddenly realized a problem:","Calling out these senior sisters seemed to be of no use.","A person’s Divine Sense is stored in the Sea of Consciousness.","Ghosts invade, invading the Sea of Consciousness as well.","If he couldn’t achieve ’Primordial Spirit Emergence,’ his Divine Sense couldn’t leave his body. Unless the ghosts sucked him in, he could only watch helplessly with no solution.","As for the Sword Bone...","In this situation, the Sword Bone was also of no use.","Moreover, it was a Sword Demon, best not revealed in front of people.","The trickiest part was that Senior Sister Ye Jin, who died in Hundred Flower Valley, perished in the place where grievances were heaviest.","Not resolving the ’source,’ even if he helped some senior sisters dispel ghostly dreams, it was merely treating the symptoms but not the cause, unable to solve the problem.","Mo Hua felt a headache.","During the rest period, he pondered for an entire day and still had no solution.","Nearing evening, after much internal struggle, Mo Hua finally sighed deeply and resignedly sent Hua Qianqian a message:","\"Senior Sister, could wearing the Hundred Flower Valley Taoist robe really allow me to sneak into the Hundred Flower Valley...\""]},{"number":1486,"title":"Chapter 1486 - 804 Heaven and Man","paragraphs":["\"Yes! Yes!\"","Almost instantly, Hua Qianqian responded with lightning speed.","Mo Hua: \"...\"","Is she really that eager...","Hua Qianqian saw Mo Hua remain silent and immediately said: \"As long as you wear the Taoist Robe of Hundred Flower Valley, I’ll do whatever it takes to get you into the valley!\"","\"I can handle any accident that comes up!\"","\"I’ll take full responsibility!\"","Hua Qianqian vowed confidently.","Mo Hua: \"...\"","\"How about it? How about it?\" Without waiting for Mo Hua’s reply, Hua Qianqian immediately said, \"Then it’s settled! This kind of thing should be done sooner rather than later. Come find me first thing tomorrow morning!\"","Hua Qianqian decided unilaterally.","Since Junior Brother Mo has agreed, we should act quickly.","We must move fast. Delays can lead to changes.","If I drag it out for a few days and Junior Brother Mo suddenly changes his mind, my wish will be ruined!","Seize the moment, don’t give him a chance to regret!","Mo Hua didn’t know what to say.","He thought about Senior Sister Ye Jin, and considered the saying from \"The Taboos of Cultivation\" about \"dying a miserable death, the resentment heavy, turning into a Fierce Ghost,\" and sighed helplessly:","\"Alright...\"","\"Great!\"","Inside Hundred Flower Valley, due to the incident with Ye Jin, Hua Qianqian hadn’t been able to eat or drink properly for several days, and had been feeling very down. Suddenly, she felt that life was full of hope again.","\"Let me see which kind of Taoist Robe best suits the adorable Junior Brother Mo...\"","Hua Qianqian was wide awake, got up and rummaged through boxes and cabinets, selecting the perfect Taoist Robe for Mo Hua from an array of colorful garments.","Early the next morning.","Mo Hua made a trip to Hua Qianqian’s cave residence.","The location of the cave residence was told to him by Hua Qianqian.","This cave residence is situated in Hundred Flowers City outside the valley, and it’s an property of the Hua family.","Hua Qianqian is a direct lineage of the Hua family and is well-loved by her family, so this cave residence was assigned to her by the Hua family for her to live, cultivate, rest, practice Alchemy or entertain Taoist Friends during her leisure periods.","At the front of the cave, a plaque with \"Shallow Fragrance Courtyard\" was hanging.","Judging by the handwriting, it seems Senior Sister Qianqian inscribed it herself.","Mo Hua stood at the entrance of the cave residence, looking at the plaque, and immediately regretted, feeling he shouldn’t have impulsively agreed to wearing the Taoist Robe of Hundred Flower Valley.","\"Should I sneak away?\"","The affairs of Hundred Flower Valley have nothing to do with me.","The business with the Rouge Boat isn’t actually so urgent either.","Regarding Senior Sister Ye, all I can do is express regret.","Mo Hua thought anxiously.","He slowly retreated a few steps, turned, and was about to sneak away, but before he could, the door of the cave residence suddenly opened.","\"Junior Brother Mo, you’re here!\"","Hua Qianqian’s eyes sparkled.","She had gotten up early and waited at the door, fearing Mo Hua might think of sneaking away. So as soon as she saw him, she immediately opened the door.","\"Hello, Senior Sister, I...\" Mo Hua hesitated, \"I suddenly remembered, there are some affairs in the Sect, I... still have unfinished Formation drawings, maybe we can talk about entering Hundred Flower Valley next time...\"","Hua Qianqian wouldn’t listen to his excuses, she immediately grabbed Mo Hua.","Mo Hua was momentarily careless, didn’t dodge, and was tightly held by Hua Qianqian, unable to break free, and helplessly was forcibly dragged into the cave residence by Hua Qianqian.","This cave residence had been decorated by Hua Qianqian to be cozy and exquisite, with an abundance of colorful flowers everywhere.","The fragrance of pills and flowers mixed together, refreshing.","Hua Qianqian pulled Mo Hua into the inner chamber, sat him down at the table, then promptly closed the door, sealing it with Formation.","She decided that regardless of whether Junior Brother Mo enters Hundred Flower Valley today, he must wear the Taoist Robe she had meticulously prepared.","Mo Hua only saw a flash before his eyes; suddenly, a large, gold-patterned Storage Box was placed before him.","Hua Qianqian opened the box, in which countless robes were neatly arranged.","The styles were either glamorous, elegant, dignified, or cute, all different.","On them, sewn with precious silk threads and exquisite stitches, were gorgeous patterns.","Some had intricate floral designs, some depicted grand landscapes, some bore luxurious phoenix patterns, with radiant light flowing, stunningly beautiful.","\"I didn’t sleep all night, spent the whole night picking...\" Hua Qianqian eagerly said to Mo Hua, \"Junior Brother Mo, have a look at which style you like.\"","Mo Hua looked at the excited-faced Hua Qianqian and suddenly felt like a \"lamb entering a tiger’s den.\"","He turned his head, glanced at the clothes in the box, meekly said:","\"These seem...not like the Hundred Flower Valley’s Taoist Robes...\"","Hundred Flower Valley’s Taoist Robe, although embroidered with flowers, was actually a standard robe, it wouldn’t have such a variety of peculiar styles.","Hua Qianqian paused.","She almost forgot, Mo Hua had asked for the Taoist Robe of Hundred Flower Valley.","In her excitement, she had chosen only the clothes she liked.","\"Such a small matter shouldn’t impact it...,\" Hua Qianqian whispered, \"As long as it’s women’s Taoist Robe, it should...maybe be able to enter Hundred Flower Valley too.\"","Mo Hua silently looked at Hua Qianqian.","Hua Qianqian felt a bit disappointed, but suddenly her eyes lit up, \"Just wear it for a moment, let me see! Just a look is enough!\"","\"Senior Sister, we have serious business in Hundred Flower Valley.\" Mo Hua said reluctantly.","Hua Qianqian sighed, \"Alright...\"","She had to turn around, and selected a few somewhat plain, not as much to her liking styles of the Hundred Flower Valley’s Taoist Robes, and handed them to Mo Hua.","\"Junior Brother, try it on first.\"","Mo Hua was still somewhat resistant in his heart.","But Hua Qianqian kept urging him on, so he couldn’t refuse, and reluctantly put on a set of gorgeous Taoist Robes from Hundred Flower Valley.","Hua Qianqian took one look, paused for a moment, then couldn’t help but cover her mouth.","Mo Hua was already handsome with defined eyebrows and an elegant demeanor, and now with the dazzling robe, he showed a striking beauty with quiet refinement, exhibiting a clear charm with a gender-neutral allure."]},{"number":1487,"title":"Chapter 1487 - 804: Celestial - 2","paragraphs":["She possessed the innocence of a girl, yet also carried a hint of a young man’s vigor.","His stature, compared to men, wasn’t particularly tall, but when compared to women, he appeared somewhat towering.","And those eyes, bright as the stars.","In their depths lay a touch of compassion, a hint of profundity, and an aura of untouchable majesty.","For a moment, Hua Qianqian felt that this wasn’t the appearance a \"person\" should have.","Immortal beings in legends, perfect in the Dao, with Yin and Yang harmoniously combined, unfettered by worldly dust, probably looked like this.","\"Senior Sister...\"","\"Senior Sister?\"","Only after Mo Hua called twice did Hua Qianqian snap out of her daze.","She immediately pulled out a bunch of clothes from the box, her eyes bright as she looked at Mo Hua, \"Junior Brother, try on these clothes now.\"","Wearing the standard Taoist robe of the Hundred Flower Valley, he already looked like flawless jade, transcendent and otherworldly, beautiful in this way.","What would happen if he put on more exquisite garments?","A monk relies on gold to shine, a person relies on clothes.","Even immortals need impeccable fairy clothes to set them off.","As long as Mo Hua put on these clothes, and let her see, even for just a glance, she would have no regrets.","Mo Hua shook his head vigorously, absolutely refusing.","\"No!\"","\"Just try it on...\"","Hua Qianqian picked up the dress and moved to put it on Mo Hua. Amid the struggle, suddenly a gentle yet reproachful voice came from outside the room:","\"Qianqian, why did you close the door in broad daylight?\"","Murong Caiyun, holding the token of the cave dwelling, pushed open the door, and immediately came upon a floor strewn with disordered clothing and hairpins, a blushing Hua Qianqian, and Mo Hua, whose face was red like an apple, both tangled together in their Hundred Flower Valley Taoist robes.","Murong Caiyun froze instantly.","The two inside also froze.","After a moment, Murong Caiyun trembled with anger, \"You...\"","Hua Qianqian’s heart instantly turned cold halfway.","\"Sister Murong, it’s not what you think...\"","\"Still dare to argue?!\"","\"Sister, listen to me explain...\"","...","After a bout of chaos, the door to the cave dwelling closed again.","Murong Caiyun sat inside, her face stern.","Hua Qianqian and Mo Hua sat side by side, heads bowed like two children who had done something wrong.","\"...Is it really like this?\"","Murong Caiyun asked with a serious face.","\"Yes...\"","Hua Qianqian and Mo Hua murmured.","Murong Caiyun reproached, \"Even if you want to investigate Junior Sister Jin Er’s cause of death, you can’t have Mo Hua wear the Hundred Flower Valley Taoist robe and sneak into the valley. Once the matter gets exposed...\"","Hua Qianqian said, \"I will take full responsibility.\"","Murong Caiyun said with some exasperation, \"You are still just a disciple yourself, with the temperament of a child. What can you take responsibility for?\"","Hua Qianqian muttered, \"At least the blame won’t fall on Junior Brother Mo...\"","Murong Caiyun glared at her angrily.","\"And how could you let Junior Brother Mo wear the female Taoist robe of Hundred Flower Valley?\"","\"Because it looks good...\" Hua Qianqian said weakly.","Murong Caiyun nearly wanted to pull her ears.","Just then, Mo Hua also lifted his head and said quietly, \"Senior Sister...\"","Murong Caiyun turned her gaze to Mo Hua.","Just one look, and she couldn’t look away.","When she entered earlier, she was too shocked, too caught up in anger to see Mo Hua clearly.","Now, calming down and looking at Mo Hua again, she was immediately overwhelmed by his breathtaking appearance, her heart skipping a beat.","In that moment, she even had the absurd and ridiculous thought that \"Junior Sister Qianqian is doing the right thing.\"","Murong Caiyun immediately shook her head, dismissing the thought, while Mo Hua’s voice reached her ears:","\"...Senior Sister, there must be untold secrets behind Senior Sister Ye Jin’s death.\"","\"Also, the way she died was extremely dangerous...\"","Murong Caiyun exerted great effort to force herself not to look at Mo Hua’s face but to focus on what he was saying.","\"Dangerous?\"","Murong Caiyun seemed puzzled.","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded, \"I don’t know what Senior Sister Jin Er experienced before she died, but surely she suffered great injustice and pain, feeling utterly hopeless, thus opting for the taboo in cultivation, ’dying a tragic death, mouth filled with grievance, transforming into a fierce ghost,’ as her only way out.\"","\"Transforming into a fierce ghost...\"","Murong Caiyun’s face turned pale.","Hua Qianqian also turned pale with fright.","She only knew that Ye Jin had once asked whether people turn into ghosts after death, but she never would have thought that she would consider becoming a \"fierce ghost\" and contemplate suicide.","Even to the point of committing suicide in the \"tragic\" manner of self-immolation.","Murong Caiyun also realized the seriousness of the issue.","Though unfamiliar with the Dao of ghosts and gods, she knew that once someone turned into a fierce ghost, they would be exceedingly vicious and cause endless disasters.","Cultivators would tremble at the mention of ghosts, for ghosts differ from humans; they are incorporeal, contrary to the blood and spiritual cultivation system of cultivators, making them not only difficult to deal with but also extremely dangerous.","Some high-rank cultivators, with deep divine senses, might not fear ghosts,","but without means to restrain the supernatural, they would still have no way to handle those ghosts.","If Junior Sister Jin Er really turned into a fierce ghost...","Murong Caiyun glanced at Mo Hua worriedly, \"Wouldn’t that mean you’re also in great danger?\"","Mo Hua shook his head and said, \"I’ll be fine.\"","Murong Caiyun was about to ask why, but seeing Mo Hua’s calm expression, deep eyes, and an aura of reassuring steadiness,","she held back.","In critical moments, stillness prevails.","Upon their first meeting, whenever Mo Hua encountered a crisis, he would occasionally show this expression.","Now, years later, as Mo Hua matured and spent some years as the junior brother, this aura of having everything under control became even more apparent.","Murong Caiyun sighed, \"Alright then...\"","Cultivators all have their secrets."]},{"number":1488,"title":"Chapter 1488 - 804 Heaven and Man_3","paragraphs":["Some things are not meant to be asked.","And with Junior Brother Mo’s personality, he typically won’t do anything he’s uncertain about.","Murong Caiyun thought for a moment and then asked, \"Why not directly tell the elders of the Hundred Flower Valley about this?\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"Can’t say yet...\"","Because right now, it’s unclear whether the higher-ups of the Hundred Flower Valley are involved in this.","Sister Ye Jin’s death—whether they have anything to do with it.","Murong Caiyun was taken aback, but soon understood.","She couldn’t help but sigh again. After pondering for a moment, she solemnly said:","\"The Hundred Flower Valley is full of female disciples, and the rules are strict. No male cultivators are allowed inside.\"","\"If you sneak in, it’s fine as long as nothing goes wrong. If you’re caught, just say I instructed you to investigate.\"","Mo Hua was stunned.","Hua Qianqian also looked shocked, \"Senior Sister Murong...\"","Murong Caiyun shook her head, \"I regret Jin Er’s situation too, and I can’t help with other matters, so I can only take the blame for you.\"","Hua Qianqian said, \"Senior Sister, you don’t need to take the blame, I...\"","Murong Caiyun said sternly, \"You don’t understand, I have the Murong family behind me, and we are close. For Jin Er’s matter, you can ’collude’ with me, but not with Mo Hua, or else in the Hundred Flower Valley, there are people who will use this matter to make trouble for the Hua family.\"","Hua Qianqian seemed to understand but still nodded.","After finishing her words, Murong Caiyun advised Mo Hua, \"Go and come back quickly, don’t stay long. Be careful.\"","She sighed deeply, looked intently at Mo Hua, and earnestly said, \"I’ll leave Jin Er’s matter to you.\"","\"Understood, Senior Sister, don’t worry.\" Mo Hua nodded.","It was getting late, and after Hua Qianqian led Mo Hua to the Hundred Flower Valley.","In the cave, Murong Caiyun was left alone.","Thinking about Jin Er’s matter, she felt sentimental.","Grabbing her attention were the various exquisite dresses on the ground, and she was stunned. Her mind couldn’t help but imagine Mo Hua wearing those dresses, appearing divine.","Murong Caiyun’s heart skipped a beat, and she quickly pinched her arm to divert her thoughts, helplessly thinking:","\"I must have been led astray by that girl Qianqian...\"","...","At the Hundred Flower Valley’s mountain gate.","The morning sun was bright, illuminating the valley filled with blooming flowers, vivid and colorful.","In front of the mountain path, Hua Qianqian whispered to Mo Hua:","\"From now on, you are my little junior sister. Later, when we enter the mountain gate, I’ll hold your hand and pretend to talk with you.\"","\"If anyone asks you anything, just pretend to be shy and do not speak easily.\"","Mo Hua nodded somewhat uneasily.","Hua Qianqian glanced at Mo Hua again, feeling regretful.","So many beautiful clothes that Junior Sister Mo... no, Junior Brother Mo didn’t wear.","Furthermore, no rouge or powder was applied, only a simple hairstyle of a Hundred Flower Valley disciple.","However, Mo Hua’s natural red lips and pearly white teeth, just wearing a Hundred Flower Valley Taoist robe, appeared like a hibiscus emerging from water, needing no embellishment.","Applying powder and rouge would seem superfluous.","Besides, able to make Junior Brother Mo wear a Hundred Flower Valley Taoist robe is difficult enough; perhaps only once in this lifetime, must look more.","Hua Qianqian silently thought to herself.","She treated Mo Hua with more intimacy, her water-like gaze constantly focused on Mo Hua.","Mo Hua was made so uneasy by her gaze.","The two walked along the mountain path towards the mountain gate.","Hua Qianqian had good relations in the Hundred Flower Valley.","Along the way, many female disciples greeted her, and Hua Qianqian returned the greetings one by one.","Some inquired about Mo Hua, and Hua Qianqian explained:","\"This is one of my clan’s little junior sisters.\"","The other female disciples generally only showed amazement and couldn’t help but compliment.","Some were suspicious, but seeing Hua Qianqian’s natural demeanor and close relationship with this little junior sister, they did not suspect anything.","At the mountain gate, the usual practice was to use the Hundred Flowers Order to enter the valley.","But due to resting season, with many disciples coming and going, it was not strictly enforced.","Hua Qianqian secretly gave her token to Mo Hua, then coquettishly pleaded to a sect-guarding female elder:","\"Auntie, I forgot my Hundred Flowers Order, please let me in~\"","The female elder was very troubled, refusing:","\"Absolutely not.\"","\"Please let me in~\"","\"No, the rules don’t allow it.\"","\"Auntie~\"","The female elder glared at her, \"Even if you call me grand-aunt, it’s not allowed. At your age, forgetful mistakes, forgetting even the Hundred Flowers Order, go back and fetch it.\"","\"I just need to go in and fetch a Pill Scripture and come out soon,\" Hua Qianqian was somewhat aggrieved, \"otherwise going back and forth would be so much extra effort. Auntie, you told me yourself; a cultivator’s time is the most precious...\"","The female elder was left helpless.","Hua Qianqian then said, \"Auntie, let me in. You’ll forgive me this once, and I promise this time in the sect exam, the formation can get... grade B!\"","\"Useless,\" the female elder scrutinized Hua Qianqian, \"you don’t even dare to promise a grade A.\"","Hua Qianqian muttered, \"I must be able to get grade A first...\"","\"Fine,\" the female elder saw Hua Qianqian boast big and set such ambition, saying, \"Just this time, next time without a token, no getting in even if you explain to the sky.\"","Hua Qianqian joyfully said, \"Thank you, Auntie!\"","The female elder turned to Hua Qianqian’s side, looking at Mo Hua with brightened eyes, just about to ask something.","Hua Qianqian meanwhile dragged Mo Hua up the mountain.","\"Junior Sister, hurry up!\"","Mo Hua clutched the Hundred Flowers Order, pulled uphill by Hua Qianqian.","The female elder seeing this, could not stop them and could only sigh helplessly, murmuring, \"That girl, always so unruly...\"","...","After entering the sect, Hua Qianqian took Mo Hua to a secluded valley with no one around and breathed a sigh of relief.","\"Finally sneaked in, luckily not discovered...\"","Her heart too was beating rapidly.","If exposed, it would end up \"mission failed before it even started.\"","Mo Hua, seeing her like this, also became nervous.","If exposed, hard to say about physical death, but surely a \"social death.\"","\"Now I’ll take you to Sister Ye Jin’s Disciple’s Residence; follow me.\" Hua Qianqian told Mo Hua.","\"Okay.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Thus, Hua Qianqian held Mo Hua’s hand, walking along the Hundred Flower Valley’s stone steps, toward the back mountain’s Disciple’s Residence.","Meanwhile, in the depths of the Hundred Flower Valley.","At the top of a pavilion.","An exceedingly beautiful woman with a cold expression was frowning, looking at a Hundred Flowers Divination Disk, her gaze focused.","The exceedingly beautiful woman also wore a Hundred Flowers Sect Taoist robe.","But this Taoist robe was dignified and elegant, yet extremely luxurious, truly embroidered with hundreds of different flowers, dazzling and splendid, each vying for beauty yet complementing each other, it was the highest grade \"Hundred Flowers Taoist Robe.\"","The woman watched the mechanism disk spin, flowers withering one by one, her expression growing increasingly heavy.","Finally, she sighed, turned around, gazing into the distance from the pavilion, her gaze taking in the whole Hundred Flower Valley, entering a trance.","In the Hundred Flower Valley, vibrant and colorful.","On the mountain path, female disciples came and went, luxuriant as bustling.","It appeared exceedingly beautiful.","Just then, her gaze tightened, seeing on the mountain path, a pretty female disciple holding hands with another fresh and ethereal as a hibiscus junior sister, whispering as they walked.","The woman’s icy expression flickered with momentary surprise."]},{"number":1489,"title":"Chapter 1489 - 805: Fierce Ghost","paragraphs":["\"There are men in the Hundred Flower Valley...\"","The originally icy expression of the woman gradually became shrouded in frost.","Despite appearing like a delicately crafted little junior sister.","But to a cultivator of such high realm like her, who had studied the Heavenly Secret Calculation, the distinction between Yin and Yang, male and female energies couldn’t be hidden.","The woman extended her pale, slender palm, intending to immediately seize the little brat disguised as a girl infiltrating the Hundred Flower Valley, but in the next moment, she suddenly paused.","Amidst the vibrant energies of the female disciples.","Mo Hua’s aura of cause and effect was pure white like clouds in the sky, clear like a spring of water, and even...","Had a hint of familiarity.","Familiar?","The woman’s expression seemed momentarily wistful.","In her wistfulness, there was a hint of pain.","She pondered for a moment, then slowly lowered her palm, her bright, flower-like eyes tightly fixed on Mo Hua.","\"I must see what this little brat is planning by infiltrating my Hundred Flower Valley...\"","...","On the mountain path, Mo Hua suddenly felt something and couldn’t help but look up at the sky, then glance around.","Hua Qianqian noticed Mo Hua’s unusual behavior and looked puzzled, \"What’s wrong?\"","Mo Hua surveyed the surroundings, his brow lightly furrowing.","He had a persistent feeling of a cool gaze fixed on him.","But upon closer inspection, he found nothing unusual.","\"Discovered?\"","Mo Hua’s heart skipped.","After pondering, he felt something was off. If truly discovered, it must be by a great cultivator or True Man in the Hundred Flower Valley. If they found him, they would surely subdue him on the spot and hold him accountable.","They wouldn’t just ignore him.","So, it was an illusion?","Mo Hua was unsure, so he said, \"Senior Sister, let’s hurry. The sooner we go, the sooner we return.\"","If discovered, it would be a big problem.","Not only would he lose face as the Taixu Gate’s \"Junior Brother,\" but Senior Sister Qianqian and Senior Sister Murong would also be implicated.","Hua Qianqian understood the stakes and nodded.","\"Alright.\"","Then the two quickened their pace.","The Hundred Flower Valley, true to its name, bloomed like a tapestry.","Alongside the mountain path, in the pavilions and yards, from the top to the bottom of the buildings, everywhere was planted with flowers in various colors, vibrant red, rosy pink, pale yellow, lush green, refined white, all competing for beauty.","The air was filled with floral fragrance, cosmetics, and the rich scent of pills.","However, Mo Hua had \"sneaked in\" and had urgent matters, lacking the leisure to enjoy the scenery.","He followed Hua Qianqian, hand in hand, matching her steps.","Passing flowerbeds, flower gardens, flower buildings, flower mountains, and seas, after an unknown amount of time, they arrived at a disciple’s residence ahead.","The shape of the residence was also related to flowers.","From the outside, the whole building resembled a magnificent flower.","Inside the residence, the paths lined with blooming flowers, walls, floors, tables, chairs, and screens within were either adorned with intricate floral carvings or painted with colored patterns.","The disciples’ residence was crowded, all beautiful female disciples with unique charm.","Hua Qianqian greeted a few familiar female disciples, then, without waiting for them to speak, hurriedly pulled Mo Hua upstairs.","Reaching a secluded spot, with no one around, Hua Qianqian instructed Mo Hua:","\"This is the female disciples’ residence, don’t look around!\"","\"Don’t take anything.\"","\"If some sisters approach you for conversation, ignore them. If they try to take advantage of you, you must protect yourself and not suffer any losses!\"","Mo Hua slowly nodded.","The first part he understood.","This is a female disciples’ residence; looking around is impolite.","The latter part puzzled him.","Being taken advantage of?","Protect oneself?","This is the Hundred Flower Valley; who would take advantage of him?","Reluctant to ask, he kept his head down, closely following Hua Qianqian, his gaze on his toes, trying not to look around to avoid seeing anything impolite.","Thus, unbeknownst to him, after some time, Hua Qianqian’s voice reached his ears:","\"We’re there.\"","Mo Hua slightly raised his head and saw it was indeed quieter, and in the distance, lay a residence marked with scorch marks.","Hua Qianqian sighed, \"Because Sister Jin Er burned herself alive, nearby disciples have all moved away, making this place safe, with no others around.\"","Mo Hua slightly exhaled, relaxing somewhat.","Now, he focused his gaze on the scorched, distant residence.","Sister Ye Jin met a tragic end in self-immolation inside.","The doors were tightly closed, yet icy Yin Qi seeped through the cracks.","Despite the sunny morning, Hua Qianqian felt a chill.","Mo Hua whispered, \"Let’s take a look.\"","Hua Qianqian nodded.","This time, Mo Hua led, Hua Qianqian unconsciously followed behind, finding unexpected reassurance in his presence.","The corridor was eerily silent.","The two approached step by step, fortunately without any abnormal occurrences.","Upon reaching the closed door, Mo Hua noticed it was sealed by a formation.","\"It’s sealed by a formation...\" Hua Qianqian remarked.","\"No problem, it’s just a second-grade array.\" Mo Hua said casually.","Simply... a second-grade array...","Hua Qianqian’s expression momentarily froze, inadvertently realizing Mo Hua had already unlocked the formation, her gaze naturally startled.","\"So fast...\"","Years apart, Junior Brother Mo’s mastery of formations seemed to have improved...","Hua Qianqian couldn’t help but glance at Mo Hua more.","With the formation unlocked, Mo Hua prepared to open the door, but before doing so, he remembered something, turning to Hua Qianqian:","```"]},{"number":1490,"title":"Chapter 1490 - 805 Fierce Ghost_2","paragraphs":["\"Senior Sister, when we go inside, be extremely careful. If you feel uncomfortable, tell me—matters involving ghosts are no small affair, so don’t force yourself.\"","Mo Hua spoke earnestly.","Hua Qianqian clenched her clothes, cold sweat seeping in her palms, she nodded seriously.","After speaking, Mo Hua gently opened the door.","A strong eerie atmosphere instantly rushed towards them.","Though chillingly cold, it also carried a searing heat, as if burnt by flames, appearing unusually strange and bizarre.","Mo Hua and the two endured the discomfort and walked inside.","The room was indeed charred black; everything was almost completely burned away.","There were still some black marks where the bed used to be.","While Mo Hua was reluctant to think about it, she knew this was the ashes left behind after Senior Sister Ye Jin was burned to death.","These ashes resembled her lingering resentment in the world, refusing to dissipate.","\"But...\"","Mo Hua glanced around, her brows slightly furrowed.","Nothing...","There were no evil spirits at all.","Nor were there fierce ghosts.","This was just a haunted room, where someone had died; besides that, there was no other abnormality.","What’s going on?","Mo Hua was puzzled.","Just then, he suddenly felt a chill spreading along his neck.","A pair of pale, delicate hands slowly extended, seemingly about to grasp his throat.","Mo Hua’s pupils shrunk, immediately using Water Passing Step to evade the chilling murderous intent, turning around to see Hua Qianqian with empty eyes, glaring at Mo Hua, her arms extended as though about to choke him.","\"Ghost possession?!\"","Mo Hua felt a slight chill.","When did it happen? He hadn’t noticed at all?","The possessed \"Hua Qianqian,\" seeing she hadn’t strangled Mo Hua, immediately grew furious, opening her white hands, pouncing at him again.","Mo Hua had no choice, but to temporarily employ Water Passing Step to maneuver.","The two then chased each other inside the scorched room.","Hua Qianqian had already reached Foundation Establishment Late Stage, her cultivation much stronger than Mo Hua, but as a spiritual cultivator skilled in the Hundred Flowers Needle Skill, once possessed, only her instincts remained, attacking like a body cultivator, posing little threat to Mo Hua, who excelled in movement technique.","But this can’t continue.","If a commotion is caused and others discover it, it would be very troublesome.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and whispered, \"Senior Sister, forgive me.\"","The possessed \"Hua Qianqian,\" driven by ghost thought, lunged at Mo Hua, he moved like flowing water, nimbly dodging, circled behind \"Hua Qianqian,\" retrieving a \"Thousand Jun Stick,\" activated the formation, and struck at \"Hua Qianqian’s\" back of the head.","Though \"Hua Qianqian\" had trained her body, her physical form was not strong, taking this stick, her divine sense trembled, body slowly falling.","Mo Hua hurriedly supported her, laying her flat on the ground.","Yet moments later, \"Hua Qianqian\" opened her eyes again, inside them was like lodging a fierce ghost, the ferocity glaring.","Mo Hua was quick to act, immediately taking out a strip of yellow cloth, covering \"Hua Qianqian’s\" forehead.","This black cloth had a sealing Divine Formation drawn by Mo Hua.","The cloth wrapped her head, sealing the fierce ghost in her Sea of Consciousness, also suppressing its power to some extent.","\"Hua Qianqian’s\" expression twisted, but her body couldn’t move.","But this can’t continue.","A fierce ghost consumes divine thought.","If it remains sealed in Senior Sister Qianqian’s sea of consciousness, she’ll be in danger.","Mo Hua pondered and then sternly attempted:","\"I’ll unseal you in a moment, if you don’t come out, I’ll seal you forever, letting you rot and die along with this body!\"","After speaking, Mo Hua carefully unveiled a small bit of the yellow cloth.","Yet \"Hua Qianqian\" still tried to strangle him.","He had no choice but to seal the fierce ghost once more, this time changing his words, coldly sneering:","\"Don’t blame me for not warning you, if you perish along with this flesh, your grievance will extinguish, and your pre-death wishes will vanish into the underworld, never to be fulfilled this lifetime.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Mo Hua could clearly perceive that the ghost thought in Hua Qianqian’s sea of consciousness trembled.","Mo Hua’s eyes slightly narrowed, gently unveiling the seal.","Indeed, a chilling ghost thought rushed out like icy water in the coldest winter from Hua Qianqian’s Sea of Consciousness.","Once it emerged, Mo Hua promptly took out another black cloth and covered Hua Qianqian’s forehead.","On this strip of black cloth, was drawn a Divine Barrier Array.","Using divine thought to make barriers, locking the sea of consciousness.","Thus the ghost thought couldn’t invade Senior Sister Qianqian’s sea of consciousness for a while.","And at this moment, the room was encircled with ghost thoughts, suddenly even colder.","Mo Hua’s bright gaze held golden light, looking inside the room.","He saw a space appearing empty, with a seemingly real but surreal dark shadow, emanating astounding resentment, full of immense hatred towards all living beings.","This was the jealousy of the deceased towards the living.","And the resentment of the tragically deceased towards the fortunate survivors.","This ghostly shadow differed from any Taoist spirits, corpse ghosts, demon monsters and other evil presence he had encountered.","It appeared more like a collection of \"resentment and hatred.\"","Lacking clear will, retaining pre-death grievances, acting on instinct.","Almost like...","A Taoist Demon?","Mo Hua’s pupils slightly shivered, feeling vaguely that he understood something, but couldn’t quite sort it out.","\"Regardless of what it is, it cannot be left unchecked, or it would surely bring great calamity.\"","But staring at this overwhelming ghost thought, Mo Hua felt somewhat helpless."]},{"number":1491,"title":"Chapter 1491 - 805 Fierce Ghost_3","paragraphs":["His Divine Sense could not come out.","Divine Thought into Sword, in reality, it couldn’t be used either.","Otherwise, with just one sword, this ghostly thought could be eradicated.","Unable to slay it, he could only find a way to lure the ghostly thought into his own Sea of Consciousness.","Mo Hua’s eyes flickered slightly, spreading his arms, he pretended to be arrogant and said:","\"Don’t you want to ’eat’ people? Come on, let me see if you have the ability to eat me.\"","But the ghostly thought was not moved in the slightest.","Although Mo Hua was wearing a Hundred Flower Valley Taoist Robe, looking like a harmless Senior Sister who had just emerged from hibiscus water, the ghostly thought could instinctively feel an aura from Mo Hua that made it palpitate.","Yet the ghostly thought needed a host.","In the room, apart from Hua Qianqian who had fainted and whose Sea of Consciousness was sealed by Mo Hua, Mo Hua was the only living person left.","Its craving for a living person’s Divine Thought finally overcame the fear in its heart.","After much hesitation, the ghostly thought indeed turned into a gust of eerie wind and rushed into Mo Hua’s Sea of Consciousness.","And the moment it entered Mo Hua’s Sea of Consciousness, the outcome was already sealed.","In the Sea of Consciousness, Mo Hua’s Divine Thought avatar opened golden eyes and looked at the eerie, sinister, and fierce ghostly thought in front of him.","He had golden blood patterns flowing over him, exuding a powerful majesty.","Every part of the ghostly thought’s essence was trembling.","It knew that this human was enough to make ghosts fear, yet it never imagined that entering the Sea of Consciousness would reveal such a terrifying existence.","The ghostly thought transformed into eerie wind again, turning to flee.","But it couldn’t escape at all.","Mo Hua extended his palm, and golden formation patterns appeared, condensing into chains that completely locked down this ghostly thought’s phantom. No matter how it struggled and roared, it could not break through.","A moment later, the ghostly thought’s phantom fell silent.","Mo Hua frowned.","The next instant, a piercing howl sounded, like the shrill scream of a woman suffering torture before death.","The ghostly thought’s phantom suddenly turned crimson.","Mo Hua’s pupils contracted.","\"Is this... a precursor to becoming a Fierce Ghost?\"","Is it about to transform into a true Fierce Ghost?","At the same time, a karmic mutation aura emanated from it. This karmic mutation aura seemed to contain some bizarre and mutated laws that could twist the Great Dao and corrode Divine Thought.","The Golden Lock Formation condensed by Mo Hua’s powerful Divine Thought was also being eroded by this karmic mutation aura, inch by inch.","Mo Hua’s expression changed slightly.","Indeed, it was the aura of a Taoist Demon, although still weak, it was very apparent.","\"I can’t let her truly undergo karmic mutation and become a Fierce Ghost...\"","Mo Hua sighed, and a golden sword appeared in his hand, piercing the ghostly thought’s forehead with just one sword.","The ghostly thought didn’t dodge.","It seemed to know that in the face of the near \"deity\" Mo Hua, all its efforts were just desperate struggles.","It was simply unwilling.","Before dying, it slightly solidified its form, revealing its original appearance.","It was a woman completely disfigured and burned by Karmic Fire, looking hideously terrifying.","But Mo Hua knew that in life, she had a very beautiful appearance.","\"Why?\"","The ghost woman’s voice was hoarse, seemingly interwoven with multiple strands of resentment, filled with grief and indignation.","\"Why...\"","\"I died miserably, turned into a Fierce Ghost, yet I still can’t kill them?\"","\"Why, is it me who suffers, is it me who should die?\"","\"Just because I had a beautiful shell?\"","\"Why, even as a ghost, I can’t get my revenge?\"","\"Why, living or dead, I’m still the one who should die?\"","\"Heavenly Dao claims to be just? Where is it?\"","She let out an extremely wretched laugh, akin to an owl at night.","Mo Hua found it difficult to associate her with the delicate, demure, and quiet Senior Sister Ye Jin with an oval face.","For a moment, Mo Hua felt sympathy.","But this ghostly thought, already half a step into becoming a Fierce Ghost, had to die.","Mo Hua sighed deeply, his gaze resolute, speaking slowly:","\"If you stay in the world, you will only indiscriminately kill the innocent, go at peace...\"","\"Those you want to kill... I will kill for you.\"","\"The Heavenly Dao may not be fair, but as your grievance perished by my hand, your enemies will also die by my hand...\"","Mo Hua’s voice was both cold and compassionate.","The ghost woman was stunned.","It stood there blankly, allowing Mo Hua’s sword light to cut it into fragments of power.","But at the same time, its ferocious face gradually disintegrated, and the scorch marks on its body began to recover little by little, seemingly transforming back into the gentle and elegant ’Senior Sister Ye’.","She looked deeply at Mo Hua, gazing into Mo Hua’s eyes, her voice as delicate and graceful as when she was alive, nodded and said:","\"Alright.\"","After that, the sword light flashed.","Her figure, along with resentment and the fierce ghost from the karmic mutation, all dissipated together.","But at the same time, Mo Hua could sense that there seemed to be a thread of \"cause and effect\" entangling him.","This is a kind of promise in terms of cause and effect.","Also the vow he made to the fierce ghost from the karmic mutation.","The net of heaven is vast and loose, but nothing escapes.","Good begets good, evil begets evil.","In this world, good people may die, but evil ones cannot live.","Mo Hua’s gaze was sharp as a sword.","He glanced around, released his divine sense to inspect his own sea of consciousness, and confirmed that there was no abnormality, only then did he exit from the sea of consciousness.","Divine sense retrieved, Mo Hua opened his eyes.","The room was full of scorch marks, but the Yin Qi had subsided a lot, without that chilling eerie feeling.","As if some kind of longstanding grievance had been resolved.","Or perhaps, this grievance had entwined with his own cause and effect.","Mo Hua looked around and found Hua Qianqian still lying on the ground, so he immediately went forward to help her up, checked her breath, and only then did he sigh in relief.","No big deal...","The blow he struck wasn’t heavy.","After all, he wasn’t into body cultivation.","The reason she remained unconscious might be because she was briefly possessed by the fierce ghost, her divine sense affected and somewhat depleted, causing her to still be in a coma.","But regarding the matters inside others’ sea of consciousness, Mo Hua was powerless.","He could only solve problems within his own sea of consciousness.","Even if it was the incarnation of an evil god, once it entered his sea of consciousness, he would strip it down, detoxify it, and make \"iron plate grill\" out of it.","But in other people’s sea of consciousness, he had no way.","Even the evil spirits in reality, as long as they don’t enter his sea of consciousness, Mo Hua temporarily couldn’t deal with them.","Mo Hua lightly sighed, then shook Hua Qianqian’s body.","\"Senior Sister...\"","\"Hey, Senior Sister, wake up...\"","But just before he could shake Hua Qianqian awake, Mo Hua’s expression suddenly changed.","Someone?","A female cultivator, perhaps aware of the disturbance here, was gradually approaching.","Not good...","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then immediately performed the concealment technique.","However, after performing it, his figure didn’t disappear.","Mo Hua was taken aback.","What’s going on?","He sensed the surroundings, and only then did he discover with astonishment that the entire Disciple’s Residence of Hundred Flower Valley had been cleverly laid out with an Expose Shadow Formation.","Estimated to be at least Third Grade.","When Mo Hua arrived, fearing exposure, he didn’t release his divine sense to observe around, so he didn’t detect it at the moment.","Mo Hua felt a bit of a headache.","\"There’s nothing I can do...\"","He thought for a moment, then rummaged through Hua Qianqian’s storage bag, found a few flowers, and among them, a few coincidentally were magnolias.","Mo Hua placed the magnolias at the spot where Ye Jin self-immolated and died.","Then he returned to Hua Qianqian’s side, pretending to be worried as he shook her body, while anxiously murmuring:","\"Senior Sister, Senior Sister what’s wrong, Senior Sister wake up...\"","The cultivator’s presence drew nearer.","Footsteps could be heard faintly.","A moment later, a woman dressed in Hundred Flower Valley’s Taoist robe and heavily made-up, appeared at the door.","She glanced into the room with a rather cautious expression, happened to see Hua Qianqian lying on the ground, and Mo Hua standing in front of Hua Qianqian, his face full of worry.","As the woman looked at Mo Hua, Mo Hua used the corner of his eye to subtly assess her.","At a glance, Mo Hua couldn’t help but feel astonished.","This woman, he actually recognized.","During the New Year, in the Gu Family courtyard, when Elder Gu Hong introduced a blind date for Uncle Gu, a portrait was displayed.","Mo Hua had also seen that portrait.","And the person in the portrait was precisely this heavily made-up woman in front of him."]},{"number":1492,"title":"Chapter 1492 - 806 Hua Ruyu","paragraphs":["Mo Hua remembered her name, it seemed to be...","Hua Ruyu?","Mo Hua glanced at her again and realized that this woman indeed had a beautiful and delicate face, like a flower or jade, but her makeup was excessive, the powder applied too thickly, and there was a hint of frivolous charm between her brows.","At this moment, her gaze was sharp, carrying a hint of caution as she looked at Mo Hua.","\"What are you doing here?\" Hua Ruyu asked guardedly.","Mo Hua stammered, giving the reason he had just contemplated:","\"Sister Qianqian said that Sister Jin Er passed away, there’s no one to mourn her, no one to pay respects, and every time she thinks about it, her heart is in pain, unable to sleep or eat, so she prepared Magnolia Flower, which Sister Jin Er loved most in life, to pay respects to Sister Jin Er...\"","Mo Hua’s voice was naturally clear and now, speaking softly, it had a neutral and somewhat magnetic quality, one that didn’t feel out of place.","Hua Ruyu did not raise suspicions; instead, she slightly furrowed her brow.","\"Pay respects?\"","She turned her head and saw the place where Jin Er had immolated herself, now indeed adorned with a few white Magnolias.","These were just placed there by Mo Hua.","The suspicion in Hua Ruyu’s heart slightly retreated as she glanced at Hua Qianqian and then asked:","\"What’s wrong with Qianqian?\"","Mo Hua looked panicked and said softly:","\"I don’t know either, Sister Jin Er entered the room, placed the Magnolia, said a few words to Sister Jin Er, and then suddenly turned pale and fainted.\"","\"I don’t know if it’s from excessive sadness, or...\"","Mo Hua looked around, his expression fearful, eyes showing terror, \"...or if she was possessed by Sister Jin Er...\"","As soon as he said this, a chilling wind suddenly arose within the room.","Hua Ruyu’s face instantly became ashen.","She looked around in fear, then forced herself to calm down and angrily rebuked, \"What nonsense are you talking about, in broad daylight, in our dignified Hundred Flower Valley, there’s no such thing as ghost possession!\"","Mo Hua looked at Hua Ruyu, displaying a complex expression, then collected his thoughts and put on a gentle and weak appearance, stammering:","\"Yes... I’m just too scared, so I misspoke...\"","Hua Ruyu sneered coldly, \"Misspeaking is no excuse for speaking nonsense.\"","Mo Hua lowered his head.","Hua Ruyu scrutinized Mo Hua for a moment, and her eyes suddenly showed sharpness, \"I don’t think... I’ve seen you before?\"","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat.","Hua Ruyu’s voice also grew heavy, her gaze cold, as she asked, \"Are you a disciple of our Hundred Flower Valley?\"","Mo Hua suppressed the anxiety in his heart, feigning a confused expression, \"I, I am...\"","Hua Ruyu’s gaze was keen, pressing step by step, sneering:","\"Good, since you are a disciple of the Hundred Flower Valley, then tell me, who am I? What is my name? What is my status?\"","Mo Hua was stunned, then silently breathed a sigh of relief.","Alright, it’s an easy question.","Fortunately, during the New Year’s, he visited the Gu family’s place, listened to Uncle Gu’s \"Eight Trigrams,\" and Elder Gu Hong had clearly explained the identity of this woman; otherwise, he would definitely have been exposed.","People who love gossip always have good fortunes.","\"You are... Instructor Hua, like Sister Hua, also from the Hua family, serving as an instructor in the Hundred Flower Valley...\"","Mo Hua answered slowly and deliberately.","Hua Ruyu’s gaze slightly narrowed.","He actually knew my identity...","She rarely interacted with external cultivators, residing deep within the Hundred Flower Valley.","Within the clan, although she was of direct lineage, her bloodline was somewhat distant, and there was no ancestor or respected elder cultivators in the same branch for support, rendering her somewhat marginalized.","Generally speaking, besides disciples within the Hundred Flower Valley, no one would know her so well.","To recognize her meant it should be fine.","However...","Hua Ruyu frowned.","Why does she have no impression of this stunningly beautiful disciple?","But then she thought, with so many disciples in the Hundred Flower Valley, it seemed reasonable to overlook one or two.","\"What’s your name, and what family do you come from?\"","Mo Hua was about to speak, but suddenly had a flash of inspiration, showing a \"self-deprecating\" expression:","\"To be honest, Instructor, I come from a Third Grade family, not a very good background, and my name is...\"","He had not finished speaking when a soft moan was heard, and Hua Qianqian, who was lying on the ground, slowly opened her eyes.","Mo Hua was delighted, \"Sister, you’re awake?\"","Hua Qianqian’s head was still somewhat dizzy, upon seeing Mo Hua, she opened her mouth and said, \"Mo...\"","Mo Hua secretly tugged at her sleeve and gave her a look.","Hua Qianqian got a jolt and then realized there were others in the room.","Her expression became apprehensive, and she slowly turned her head to see Hua Ruyu, then let out a long breath of relief, \"So it’s Sister Yu...\"","Hua Ruyu’s expression immediately changed.","She treated Hua Qianqian with extreme kindness, even affectionately chided, \"You little girl, what are you doing here?\"","\"I...\"","Mo Hua immediately secretly tugged at Hua Qianqian’s sleeve again, giving her a hint with his eyes.","Hua Qianqian followed Mo Hua’s gaze, seeing the Magnolia flowers placed not far away, she instantly understood, her expression showing sorrow, \"I came to see Sister Jin Er...\"","Hua Ruyu looked thoughtful, then sighed softly, her expression sympathetic, \"We are all deeply saddened by the matter of Jin Er, but she acted impulsively, and we are helpless.\"","\"This place is where Jin Er committed suicide, it’s best you don’t come here in the future, lest you get affected by the memories and delay your cultivation.\"","\"The deceased are gone, those living can only strive to live on...\"","Hua Qianqian looked dazed and nodded her head.","\"Alright, quickly go back...\" Hua Ruyu said gently.","\"Yes,\" Hua Qianqian nodded, \"Then, Sister Hua, I’ll leave first.\"","\"Go ahead.\"","Hua Qianqian looked back once more at the place where Ye Jin had immolated herself, looking wistful, then took Mo Hua’s hand and left."]},{"number":1493,"title":"Chapter 1493 - 806 Hua Ruyu_2","paragraphs":["After Hua Qianqian left, the gentle look on Hua Ruyu’s face gradually turned cold again.","She walked around the room, found nothing unusual, and finally her gaze fell on the bed where Ye Jin self-immolated, and the white magnolia flowers that Mo Hua had placed there, her eyes unfriendly.","\"Magnolia...\"","Hua Ruyu snorted coldly, suddenly feeling a chill in her heart, as if someone was watching her.","Feeling uncomfortable, unwilling to stay longer, she left the room and closed the door.","As the door closed, she suddenly thought of Mo Hua again, and couldn’t help but admire her in her heart.","\"What a charming little girl...\"","\"Most special is that unrefined and celestial-like aura, completely different from other women adorned with makeup and powder in this world.\"","\"A Third Grade family, neither too noble nor too humble.\"","\"Such a good seedling, how did I not notice before...\"","Hua Ruyu found it hard to believe and felt a secret joy.","She silently etched Mo Hua’s face into her heart, then closed the door and left with graceful steps.","...","Meanwhile, at the top of the Hundred Flower Valley.","A woman wearing the ornate attire of the Hundred Flowers Sect, with a cold demeanor and unparalleled beauty, had her attention constantly focused on Mo Hua, now showing an unusual expression.","The resentment within the room had dissipated...","Ghost banishment?","Divine Way inheritance?","This young cultivator already possesses such skills?","The woman’s expression showed slight surprise.","In her Tao cultivation experience, cultivators with Divine Way inheritance were already few and far between.","And those who could learn the Divine Way inheritance to a degree sufficient to restrain ghosts and exorcise evil spirits, were mostly cultivators with centuries of age, deep cultivation, rich experience, and exceedingly deep Divine Thought.","The young ones simply couldn’t compare.","Young cultivators, with low cultivation, unstable Taoist hearts, and unsteady Divine Thought, when encountering malevolent ghosts, would mostly end up as their toys or prey.","So those able to take on the world as Divine Formation Masters and survive were surely old fellows.","The woman stole another glance at Mo Hua, who was leaving the Disciple’s Residence of the Hundred Flower Valley, her gaze slightly tightening.","This little cultivator, appearing to be only in his twenties or so, what was his background, and who was his master, to be able to dispel the ghostly resentment of the deceased?","Her expression was indifferent, her thoughts stirred, more than once she considered capturing the little cultivator to ask clearly.","But after some contemplation, she abandoned the idea.","Capturing him would cause a commotion.","A male cultivator entering the Hundred Flower Valley — although this male cultivator was not very old and did nothing outrageous, it could still easily lead to gossip.","A sect full of women, these rumors were most unwelcome.","Moreover, young as he was, it was exceptionally rare for a cultivator to be proficient in Divine Way knowledge.","And those who could teach such a disciple, his master, could not be an ordinary person.","Cultivators proficient in Divine Thought, either eccentric in temperament or with mysterious means, were best not easily provoked.","Considering he was not a wandering libertine, nor did he enter the Hundred Flower Valley to seek pleasure, but rather to eliminate ghostly threats and safeguard the cultivators, she decided to turn a blind eye and no longer pursue the matter...","The woman turned her back, resuming her position in front of the Hundred Flowers Divination Disk, intending to continue her observations of the evolution of flowers, seeking insights into future heavenly secrets.","Just as she focused her gaze, her pupils contracted immediately.","On the divination disk, once teeming with vibrant blossoms, the flowers were now wilting.","Yet now, the wilting speed of the flowers had clearly slowed...","The dark purple decay on the withered flowers was also gradually disappearing.","The \"Flower Withering\" pattern... was being delayed?!","She was initially incredulous.","After spending nearly a hundred years searching every possible method to reverse the \"Flower Withering\" situation, a sudden turn of events?","Immediately, she turned her gaze from the flower-fragrance-cloud-shrouded pavilion to the outside of the Hundred Flower Valley.","Beyond the valley, on the mountain path adorned with blossoms.","Mo Hua’s silhouette was moving farther and farther away.","Her expression shifted a few times, before regaining her calm, icy composure, though her heart was in turmoil.","\"Who exactly... is this little cultivator?\"","\"So young, with such skills, surely guided by an expert... Who on earth is his master?\"","Her heart suddenly quivered, almost involuntarily glancing toward the sides of the high hall.","Within the high hall, concealed by screens, hung a precious sword.","The sword was sheathed, with its ancient sword pattern, resembling a treasure sealed away from the ages and its sharpness hidden.","On it, engraved like iron through silver hook strokes, were two words:","Dragon Spring.","...","Outside the Hundred Flower Valley.","Mo Hua and Hua Qianqian, along the mountain path, left the Hundred Flower Valley, headed straight to Hundred Flowers City, and returned to Hua Qianqian’s cave residence, named \"Shallow Fragrance Courtyard.\"","Within the cave residence, Murong Caiyun was still waiting for them.","Seeing the two return safely, Murong Caiyun breathed a sigh of relief, then asked: \"How did it go?\"","Hua Qianqian was stunned.","As soon as she entered the door, she felt an inexplicable chill enter her mind, and she passed out without knowing what happened afterward.","She could only turn her head to look at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then said: \"It should be fine now...\"","\"Before Senior Sister Jin died, a lot of resentment remained, but now most of the resentment in that room has dissipated...\"","Yet the karma of the fierce ghost lingered on herself.","But Mo Hua didn’t mention this.","Once said, it would involve explaining a lot and worry Senior Sister Qianqian and Senior Sister Murong.","\"That’s good.\"","Murong Caiyun nodded, then frowned again:"]},{"number":1494,"title":"Chapter 1494 - 806 Hua Ruyu_3","paragraphs":["\"About Jin’er’s death...\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"It’s still unclear for now, there must be some hidden truth involved. But don’t worry, I’ll ask an uncle of mine who is a Supervisor in the Taoist Court to help investigate. If Senior Sister Jin’er has indeed suffered any injustice, we will surely clear her name.\"","Murong Caiyun felt relieved in her heart.","Hua Qianqian also showed gratitude in her eyes and said sincerely:","\"Thank you, Junior Sister Mo.\"","Mo Hua’s face darkened, immediately realizing that he was still wearing the Taoist Robe of the Hundred Flower Valley and styled with their hairdo. Right then, he took the robe off.","Hua Qianqian wanted to stop him but couldn’t, feeling somewhat unhappy, she said:","\"Can’t you just wear it a little longer...\"","She hadn’t had enough of it yet.","Next to them, Murong Caiyun felt a slight sense of regret in her heart too.","Mo Hua had already changed back to the Taoist Robe of Taixu Gate, returning to being the clear as jade, cool-eyed \"Junior Brother\" of Taixu Gate.","It was late, and Mo Hua needed to head back to the sect.","Before leaving, he particularly reminded Hua Qianqian:","\"Senior Sister Qianqian, you were affected by resentment just now, which caused you to faint. For the next three days, you should focus on rest and avoid any mental or physical stress. Do not overuse your Divine Sense either.\"","\"Also, wear some calming jade pendants, burn sandalwood incense indoors, and eat some light and nourishing food.\"","\"If you find any abnormalities in your Divine Sense, such as having nightmares or seeing strange illusions, make sure to tell me as soon as possible.\"","Hua Qianqian saw the seriousness in Mo Hua’s expression and nodded obediently.","Murong Caiyun looked at Mo Hua with a somewhat astonished gaze.","\"Alright, I’m heading back.\" Mo Hua waved.","\"Okay,\" Hua Qianqian thought for a moment, then added, \"If there’s anything I can help with concerning Jin’er, don’t hesitate to ask.\"","\"Sure!\"","Mo Hua nodded.","...","Afterwards, Mo Hua returned to Taixu Gate.","It was late, within the Disciple’s Residence.","Mo Hua recalled the events of the day, silently pondering in his mind.","Firstly, dealing with fierce ghosts is quite troublesome.","Within the Sea of Consciousness, or in a nightmare, his own Divine Thought is indeed quite strong.","But in reality, ghosts possessing others, or parasitizing evil objects, or wandering with eerie Yin Qi in the air for a short time,","there’s not much he can do.","Senior Sister Jin’er, who transformed into a half-step \"fierce ghost\", only left Senior Sister Qianqian’s body due to fear of being completely sealed with her physical body, unable to resolve her grievances; otherwise, she wouldn’t have departed Qianqian’s body.","In such cases, Senior Sister Qianqian would be in grave danger.","Even if saved later, her Vital Energy would be greatly damaged.","And he could only watch helplessly, unable to do anything.","\"It seems I need to learn more about the means of exorcism and suppression of spirits within the Divine Way...\"","Otherwise, in the future, if a cheeky little ghost dares to act up, despite having a powerful Divine Thought, unable to leave the body, unable to kill or fight, and having no way against such little ghosts, it would be too frustrating.","For now, the most accessible is the true technique of \"Divine Thought into Sword\".","The technique of infusing sword light in the eyes needs further practice.","Moreover, there’s the \"Taoist Demon\".","After Senior Sister Jin’er’s tragic death, she has already shown signs of becoming a fierce ghost, considered a half-step \"fierce ghost\".","At the same time, \"Taoist Demon\" marks appeared on her body.","\"Taoist Demon...\"","For some reason, whenever the Taoist Demon is mentioned, Mo Hua involuntarily thinks of his Uncle.","He’s not sure if it’s an illusion, but he always feels that there’s a touch of his Uncle’s shadow in this matter.","However, upon careful thought, it’s quite unlikely.","From his experience in Li Mountain City, it is known that his Uncle should be in the Feather Transformation Realm, and very likely at the Peak of Feather Transformation, just a step away from the Heaven Void.","But in any case, he is not yet in the Heaven Void.","And the Qianxue State Boundary, being a fifth-grade territory, harbors several great families and great sects, with numerous Heaven Void ancestors present.","No matter how strong his Uncle is, he shouldn’t possibly risk such a huge risk, under the nose of the Taoist Court, surrounded by so many family sects, in front of so many Heaven Void ancestors, to plant a devil in a Taoist Heart or stir trouble.","Mo Hua shook his head.","Maybe I’ve overthought it...","If I were Uncle, the most pressing issue now would definitely be to find a way to cross the Heavenly Chasm, break into the Heaven Void Realm, and then use the power to shatter the void, spreading the Taoist Demon across the world.","He probably doesn’t have time to spend here in the Qian Learning State Boundary.","Mo Hua put this thought aside and continued considering the matter of Senior Sister Ye Jin.","After this trip to the Hundred Flower Valley, Mo Hua mostly understood the situation.","Senior Sister Ye Jin did commit suicide.","But she likely came up with such a cruel and painful method of setting herself on fire after seeing the record in the \"Taboos of Cultivation\" about \"a person’s tragic death, harboring resentment, turning into a Fierce Ghost.\"","There must be an underlying story to this.","Moreover, Mo Hua could almost conclude that Senior Sister Ye Jin’s death was definitely related to someone.","A heavily made-up face appeared in Mo Hua’s mind.","\"Hua Ruyu!\"","This instructor from the Hundred Flower Valley is very suspicious!","Why was it that when Junior Sister Qianqian and I stealthily went to check Senior Sister Ye Jin’s room where she burned herself, none of the other elders noticed, but only she, an Instructor at the Late Stage of Foundation Establishment, did?","Why did she look at me with such caution?","Why did she appear guilty when in Senior Sister Ye Jin’s room?","Additionally, there were some subtle expressions in her demeanor, which seemed very peculiar. She was overly cold to me but unusually enthusiastic towards Junior Sister Qianqian...","I need to find a way to investigate...","Mo Hua immediately took out the Letter Token and wrote to Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, go on a blind date quickly!\"","After sending the message, Gu Changhuai didn’t respond to Mo Hua for a long time.","He probably saw it but didn’t want to bother.","Mo Hua then said, \"It’s serious business!\"","After sending that, Mo Hua suddenly realized that everyone who urges someone else to go on a blind date thinks they are doing \"serious business.\"","Mo Hua promptly added, \"It’s related to Senior Sister Ye Jin’s death.\"","Sure enough, after sending this, Gu Changhuai replied:","\"Really?\"","\"Really!\"","\"What’s the connection?\" Gu Changhuai asked.","\"Not sure yet,\" Mo Hua replied, \"that’s why you need to go on a blind date—to see her with your own eyes, ask about her background, and use your experience as the Dao Court Canon to judge whether this Instructor Hua has any issues.\"","\"Why do I feel...\" Gu Changhuai frowned, \"that you’re tricking me into a blind date?\"","Mo Hua replied speechlessly, \"How could I use such a serious matter to trick you?\"","After all, it involves the murder case of Senior Sister Ye Jin.","Gu Changhuai nodded slightly, thinking it made sense.","Although Mo Hua was often unreliable, most of the time, he still acted quite dependably.","But Gu Changhuai still refused, saying, \"I’m not going.\"","\"Why not?\"","\"I can go for inquiry, but not for a blind date.\"","Mo Hua replied with a hint of annoyance, \"If you go ’inquiring’ as the Dao Court Canon, won’t it alert the enemy? Blind dating is so much better—natural, flawless, and you can inquire about information justifiably. Even if you ask some offensive questions, people will just think you’re socially inept and won’t suspect anything else...\"","Gu Changhuai: \"...\"","\"Uncle Gu, please go. As the Dao Court Canon, it’s your duty and part of your moral obligation.\"","Gu Changhuai remained silent.","Mo Hua added, \"Just go this once. In the future, I’ll handle anything related to Elder Gu Hong.\"","Gu Changhuai pondered for a long time before finally sighing and relenting:","\"Alright...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes brightened, \"I’ll send you some suspicious points right away. Uncle Gu, try to subtly inquire more about her, and make sure to go on the blind date as soon as possible, the sooner the better...\"","Mo Hua wrote a long list and sent it over.","But Gu Changhuai didn’t reply anymore.","However, Mo Hua knew, given Uncle Gu’s character, that once he agreed, he would definitely follow through. He would never go back on his word.","In the following days, he stayed in the Sect, cultivating peacefully while waiting for news of Uncle Gu’s \"blind date.\""]},{"number":1495,"title":"Chapter 1495 - 807: Red Line","paragraphs":["After some time, Mo Hua learned through his \"spy\" in the Gu Family, Aunt Wan, that Uncle Gu should have already gone on a blind date, so he picked a time to secretly send a letter to ask Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, how was the blind date?\"","This question was probably quite annoying.","Gu Changhuai didn’t want to answer, so he didn’t reply for a long time.","However, since this matter was related to the cause of Ye Jin’s death, after about two hours, Gu Changhuai finally replied, enduring his discomfort:","\"It failed.\"","\"What kind of failure?\" Mo Hua was puzzled, \"Did the blind date fail, or did the ’interrogation’ fail?\"","A failed blind date is quite normal.","Interrogation failure, failing to get any clues, is the real issue.","Gu Changhuai: \"Both failed.\"","Mo Hua sighed: \"Uncle Gu, you’re an old Supervisor, how can you not handle such a small matter, not get any information at all...\"","This old and pedantic tone was reminiscent of the Old Chief questioning him.","Gu Changhuai on the other end of the Letter Token looked distressed.","Mo Hua, that kid, was really good at being annoying.","Mo Hua curiously asked again:","\"What did you talk about during the blind date? Did you discuss family background? What about Spirit Stone compensation? Tao Cultivation plans? What did you think of Instructor Hua?\"","Gu Changhuai, unable to bear it any longer, directly closed the Letter Token, out of sight, out of mind, and ignored Mo Hua.","Mo Hua felt helpless.","Uncle Gu’s tolerance really needed improvement.","Couldn’t handle a few words, not generous at all.","Since Uncle Gu wouldn’t say, Mo Hua would have to find another way to inquire.","Two days later, during the break.","Mo Hua personally went to the Gu Family, asked around, and found Elder Gu Hong drinking tea in the living room.","Elder Gu Hong’s eyes lit up when he saw Mo Hua, and he immediately called out:","\"Mo Hua, come over, I have some pastries here.\"","Mo Hua muttered to himself:","I’m not a kid anymore...","But he still sat down next to Elder Gu Hong, drinking tea and eating the pastries Elder Gu Hong offered him.","The tea was sweet and slightly bitter, the pastries were refreshing and slightly sweet, the two flavors balanced each other, creating a unique taste.","As he ate, Mo Hua quietly asked:","\"Elder Gu Hong, how did Uncle Gu’s blind date go?\"","As soon as this was mentioned, Elder Gu Hong’s face fell, seemingly quite angry, and he complained to Mo Hua:","\"You see, Changhuai, that person is just a stubborn mule, acting like a fool, just wasting a good appearance.\"","\"At first meeting, the young lady couldn’t help staring at his handsome face for a long time, blushing, but he was just like a block of wood, not saying a word.\"","\"And that’s not the most irritating part. The most infuriating is that as soon as he sat down, before even drinking the tea, he started asking her questions like he was at the Taoist Court, interrogating her like a criminal...\"","\"He asked where she was from, where she lived, and where she usually went?\"","Elder Gu Hong held her forehead, in extreme annoyance, and said to Mo Hua:","\"How can a date proceed like this?\"","\"I could only smile and apologize, saying he was so busy with Taoist Court business that it became a habit, and that he’d change after getting married.\"","\"Even so, I barely managed to smooth things over, but you could tell, the young lady looked obviously upset...\"","\"Sigh...\"","Elder Gu Hong let out a long sigh, her teeth itching with anger.","\"If he weren’t my nephew, I wouldn’t bother to look at him even if I had to drink the northwest wind at the front door.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","Indeed, the handsome and cold Supervisor at the Taoist Court ends up getting scolded by elders at home anyway.","\"So... Elder Hong,\" Mo Hua quietly asked again, \"What do you think of that ’Instructor Hua’?\"","Elder Gu Hong was startled, \"What do I think?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded, \"I’m a bit curious, so I asked.\"","Curious?","Elder Gu Hong pondered for a moment, furrowing her brows, \"Honestly, I felt something was off...\"","\"Off in what way?\"","\"Too bold with her makeup, unnatural expressions, when she looked at Changhuai, there was a certain lascivious gleam that looked somewhat...\"","Elder Gu Hong lowered her voice, whispering to Mo Hua, \"Somewhat flirtatious.\"","Mo Hua seemed pensive.","Elder Gu Hong deliberated for a moment, then curiously said, \"Her behavior is a bit unlike a Sect Instructor, more like...\"","Mid-sentence, she suddenly realized she was in front of Mo Hua, not her group of \"old sisters\", so she hesitantly shut her mouth.","\"Like what?\" Mo Hua asked curiously.","\"Nothing,\" Elder Gu Hong said, \"it’s better not said.\"","Mo Hua grumbled inwardly.","Why does everyone like to stop mid-sentence in front of him?","Elder Gu Hong saw Mo Hua still wanted to ask, and promptly pushed the pastries in front of him, \"Eat the pastries, you’re at an age to grow, eat more...\"","Speaking of this, Mo Hua was a bit worried.","\"Elder Gu Hong, I won’t end up short, right?\"","Elder Gu Hong solemnly said:","\"What nonsense, you’re just innately weak and lack Blood Qi, so you’re growing a bit slowly; there’s no helping that. Once your Cultivation advances, you’ll transform and surely become a tall and handsome young man, even more so than Changhuai... no, even more handsome than Changhuai.\"","\"Your temperament is gentle, refined like jade, unlike Changhuai, who is as stubborn as stone, completely impossible to deal with.\"","Elder Gu Hong still felt quite angry when mentioning this.","\"You tell me, with that appearance of his, if he had any sense, how many girls would be flocking around him, why do I need to fuss so much?\"","\"He can’t be helped!\"","Mo Hua asked, \"So, what about Uncle Gu’s future blind dates?\""]},{"number":1496,"title":"Chapter 1496 - 807 Red Line_2","paragraphs":["\"What else can we do?\" Elder Gu Hong said, \"For now, just leave it like this. In a short time, where can I find another for him? If he still has this bad temper, I’ll find one, he’ll offend one, then where will my face go?\"","\"Let’s just make do and force Changhuai to meet with this girl again, see if they can get along.\"","Mo Hua was puzzled, \"But didn’t you say this instructor seemed somewhat ’flirtatious’?\"","\"That’s what I said,\" Elder Gu Hong pondered, \"but sometimes, you can’t judge a book by its cover, especially at a first meeting. Making a judgment based on first impressions is still too arbitrary, let’s observe further...\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Makes sense.\"","He also thought of letting Uncle Gu sacrifice his ’looks’ and talk with this Hua Ruyu to see if any other clues could be found.","Elder Gu Hong glanced at Mo Hua, showing admiration, and said:","\"Changhuai is hopeless. When you grow a little older, I’ll think of a way to arrange a good match for you.\"","Mo Hua’s expression froze.","He hadn’t expected that while he was just a bystander, the issue would come to affect him.","Mo Hua whispered, \"Elder, I’m not in a rush...\"","Elder Gu Hong shook her head, saying, \"It’s time to be in a rush. For matters like this, planning early is key.\"","She sincerely said, \"You’re different from other kids. Even though Elder Master Xun supports you, you don’t have much of a family background, and your spiritual root isn’t great either...\"","\"Of course, in my eyes, you’re great in every way, but when it comes down to negotiating marriage, those great families and sects are still very realistic. Family background and spiritual roots are weaknesses.\"","\"From my experience, you absolutely can’t pursue those prestigious daughters from big families.\"","\"These girls are often proud and arrogant, with temperaments that disregard others. They’re not suitable for you.\"","\"Moreover, the bigger the family, the more rules there are, and the stricter and more realistic the marriage becomes. Even if you like each other, those elders, ancestors, etc., in the family won’t agree.\"","\"No matter how capable you are, it won’t help.\"","\"After all, how can you alone compare to their family’s thousands, even tens of thousands of years of accumulation?\"","\"An arm can’t twist the thigh, let alone push against a mountain.\"","Elder Gu Hong sighed, pondering:","\"It’s best to find a girl from a middle-sized family; third grade is a bit low, around the fourth grade is most suitable.\"","\"Gentle temperament, caring, knows how to look after someone, preferably a formation master.\"","\"A bit higher, a quasi-fifth rank would also do...\"","At that point, Elder Gu Hong’s eyes suddenly lit up, \"If you’re willing, I can choose one for you in the Gu Family!\"","That’s right, why hadn’t she thought of this before?","The Gu Family is quasi-fifth rank.","She is a powerful elder in the Gu Family, with considerable influence in the clan.","She knows the Gu Family’s girls well.","She has observed Mo Hua’s character and talent.","Marrying a girl from the Gu Family might even keep Mo Hua in the Gu Family.","Elder Gu Hong became cheerful, quickly asking Mo Hua:","\"How about it?\"","Mo Hua felt a bit dizzy, \"Please, Elder Hong, it’s still too early for this matter.\"","\"It’s not early, but you don’t need to worry, just concentrate on cultivation, and I’ll keep an eye out for you.\"","Elder Gu Hong’s eyes were bright as she looked at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua couldn’t withstand this, hurriedly said, \"I’ll go check on Uncle Gu.\"","He said this, then ran off in a flash.","Elder Gu Hong shook her head with a smile, leaving Mo Hua be, but she silently kept this matter in her heart.","After contemplating for a moment, she murmured:","\"I need to tie a red string for him and see...\"","She was an impatient person by nature, whatever she thought, she would immediately do. With this thought, she returned to her elder’s quarters, took out the Gu Family’s genealogy from a box.","Within the genealogy, there was a separate page, recording the names and birthdates of the Gu Family’s girls.","This was a secret to the family, except for special-status elders like her; no one else was allowed to casually view it.","Elder Gu Hong took out a red string, her eyes flashed with a red light as she guided the string over the names of the girls in the genealogy one by one.","\"I wonder which little girl in the Gu Family has a fate with Mo Hua...\"","She thought silently.","But after guiding for a long time, there was no reaction from the red string.","Elder Gu Hong frowned, her eyes flashed even more intensely. Then, in the next moment, a sudden change occurred.","The red string in her hand suddenly snapped.","Elder Gu Hong was taken aback.","If the string couldn’t connect it couldn’t connect, but why did it snap?","She had no choice but to take another red string, then recite a mind incantation, her eyes flashing, continuing to tie the red string for Mo Hua.","However, after trying just a few names, the red string snapped again.","Elder Gu Hong was unconvinced, tried several more times, and each time it broke.","Her expression grew serious.","\"It’s not a coincidence? Could it be...\"","Elder Gu Hong’s gaze focused as she took out an even thicker red string, woven with golden threads and inlaid with red jade, symbolizing a ’Golden Jade Marriage’ red string.","\"I just don’t believe it today...\"","Elder Gu Hong continued to tie the red string for Mo Hua.","The ’Golden Jade Marriage’ red string was indeed extraordinary. Though she tried it several times to no effect, the red string remained intact.","Even as she brought the string to the name of a direct lineage girl in the Gu Family, there was a faint reaction on the string.","Elder Gu Hong’s expression was slightly joyful, but at that moment, a wave of anxiety swept over her.","She looked down to see, in an instant, a crimson flame of void engulfed the string, burning it completely...","Not only was the red string burnt, but the golden threads on it snapped one by one, and the inlaid red jade turned into dust."]},{"number":1497,"title":"Chapter 1497 - 807 Red Thread_3","paragraphs":["Elder Gu Hong was stunned on the spot.","The red threads... were all broken...","The Golden Jade Marriage was burned too.","It seems Mo Hua’s red threads were not meant for her to connect.","The marriages within can’t tolerate outsiders coveting.","Elder Gu Hong gradually formed a suspicion in his heart, his face turned pale, and he couldn’t help murmuring:","\"Mo Hua, this child, who is he destined to marry in the future, what kind of terrifying person...\"","...","On the other side, unbeknownst to how many red threads Elder Hong had cut, Mo Hua wandered around the Gu Family, eventually finding Gu Changhuai in a secluded study.","\"Uncle Gu, I have talked with Elder Hong, and she decided not to arrange matchmaking for you for now.\"","Mo Hua said directly.","Gu Changhuai showed some suspicion, \"Aunt doesn’t give up so easily...\"","Before, it was always like this, Aunt Gu Hong would say, \"I won’t bother with you anymore,\" but after ten days or half a month, at most one or two months, she would say, \"I picked another girl for you, you’ll definitely like her, take some time to meet her.\"","\"Really!\" Mo Hua nodded, \"But, there’s a small condition.\"","Gu Changhuai had a look of \"as expected,\" asking, \"What condition?\"","\"You need to meet with Instructor Hua from the Hundred Flower Valley again, chat and investigate the clues,\" Mo Hua said.","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"Is this Aunt’s condition?\"","\"The former was said by Elder Hong, the latter I added,\" Mo Hua admitted candidly.","Gu Changhuai was silent.","He didn’t want to deal with boring people, especially boring women.","Mo Hua solemnly said: \"This is the only clue left in this case so far, at my age, I can’t help you with matchmaking. Uncle Gu, if you don’t investigate, the world will have one more wronged soul, Senior Sister Ye Jin will die with unclosed eyes!\"","Gu Changhuai, experienced and seasoned, would not be swayed by Mo Hua’s few words.","But Mo Hua was indeed not wrong.","Matchmaking is irrelevant, but the case must be investigated.","\"Alright,\" Gu Changhuai sighed, \"I’ll take some time to see her.\"","Mo Hua advised: \"Be gentle, don’t flaunt the attitude of the Dao Court Canon, if needed, try to adopt the demeanor of a graceful gentleman.\"","Gu Changhuai gave Mo Hua a faint look, \"Why don’t you go?\"","Mo Hua chuckled awkwardly, \"This ’adult’ matter is more suitable for Uncle Gu.\"","After all, you are over two hundred years old...","Gu Changhuai frowned, looking very troubled.","...","After the break, Mo Hua returned to the Sect.","According to his speculations, Uncle Gu would have a psychological preparation period of one or two days, and then on the third day, meet Instructor Hua from the Hundred Flower Valley.","On the fourth day, the two would probably meet.","If Uncle Gu indeed manages to find out anything, it would be four or five days later.","During this period, Mo Hua mainly spent his days at the Refining Demon Mountain.","In the ongoing Tao cultivation courses of Taixu Gate, a new \"Monster Hunting\" class was opened, formally teaching disciples how to hunt monster beasts efficiently within the Refining Demon Mountain.","This course was opened as per tradition.","Disciples of Taixu Gate from previous years would formally and widely enter the Refining Demon Mountain to participate in monster hunting in their fifth year of joining the Sect.","Not only Taixu Gate, other sects do the same.","During the first year of the Foundation Building Middle Stage, disciples consolidate their cultivation, occasionally testing the waters in the Refining Demon Mountain.","During the second year, after the cultivation is consolidated, the sects teach monster hunting courses, allowing disciples to widely enter the mountain for hunting.","But Mo Hua’s batch was special.","With Brother Mo, proficient in Formation, leading the way, disciples had already been \"militarized\" hunting in the Refining Demon Mountain early on.","Sect plans did not catch up with changes.","The elder teaching monster hunting, upon \"employment,\" found himself \"unemployed.\"","Because there wasn’t much left to teach...","What he taught, these disciples were already thoroughly familiar with, even killing monsters effortlessly.","Helplessly, he had to report back to the Sect Leader.","\"It’s Mo Hua again...\"","The Taixu Sect Master sighed.","This name he hears from time to time.","Eventually, after the Elder Council’s discussion, the Sect Leader specially approved that the progress of the monster hunting course be advanced, allowing disciples to directly transition from theory to practice, entering the Refining Demon Mountain to hunt monsters.","The monster hunting course usually lasts a whole day.","Thus, besides regular breaks, Taixu Sect disciples had extra time each period to remain in the Refining Demon Mountain for hunting.","Mo Hua now feels at home in the Refining Demon Mountain.","Besides, he also encountered Ouyang Mu and Linghu Xiao.","The demon hunting progress of the Taixu Gate and Chongxu Sect disciples wasn’t as fast, but upon hearing that Taixu Gate had already allowed disciples to extensively enter the mountain, they too didn’t want to lag behind, so they hurriedly relaxed the restrictions.","Since the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons incident, this was the first meeting of the three.","Ouyang Mu and Linghu Xiao were extremely grateful to Mo Hua.","After all, in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, the group faced life and death together, and ultimately it was Mo Hua who saved them, allowing them to escape safely, marking a \"life-debt\" friendship.","\"Brother Mo, whatever happens in the future, feel free to tell me, I will definitely do it!\"","Ouyang Mu said with a serious and solemn face.","Linghu Xiao added: \"Same here.\"","Mo Hua waved his hand generously, saying: \"It’s just a small matter, don’t mind it.\"","Since it was still \"class\" time, they could only occasionally meet and chat briefly, unable to say much.","But their relationship had grown more familiar.","Mo Hua also secretly shared with Ouyang Mu some sword casting insights he \"extorted\" from Sword Bone, allowing him to secretly view and learn, advancing his sword casting skills.","Ouyang Mu, in turn, looked at Mo Hua as if he were an older brother.","As for Linghu Xiao, Mo Hua directly and openly began calling him \"Xiao Xiao.\"","He had always wanted to call him that, just didn’t feel comfortable due to lack of familiarity before.","Linghu Xiao was a bit annoyed.","Probably because this name didn’t match his solitary and high-cold personality.","Nor did it fit the demeanor of a future Great Sword Cultivator destined to reach the pinnacle of Sword Dao.","But urged by Mo Hua’s \"debt of gratitude,\" he had no choice but to \"accept\" it begrudgingly.","Moreover, as Mo Hua continued calling him, he got used to it.","Surely, until now, only Mo Hua dared call him \"Xiao Xiao\" in person.","These two words he only allowed Mo Hua to call, no one else.","After all, Mo Hua had saved his life, setting him apart from others.","This is the bottom line he’s willing to endure as an aloof Sword Dao genius, and the last bit of \"stubbornness\" he had."]},{"number":1498,"title":"Chapter 1498 - 808: Traitor","paragraphs":["Besides, there was another issue that Mo Hua was more concerned about.","During the break, under a large shady tree on Refining Demon Mountain.","Mo Hua looked around, seeing no one else, then whispered: \"The two of you being captured into the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, does it mean that... your Sect...\"","Mo Hua paused, lowering his voice even further, \"... has a traitor?\"","Ling Huxiao and Ouyang Mu both had complicated expressions.","After a moment, Ling Huxiao also whispered: \"Elder Shangguan told me not to mention it to others, but...\"","But Mo Hua was not an outsider either.","Moreover, Mo Hua already knew everything about the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","Ling Huxiao continued: \"Elder Shangguan... suspects that in the Sect, there are some disciples, even elders, who collude with other Sects, selling our disciples’ information.\"","\"He said he had already reported to the Ancestor, who was furious, and the Rushing Void Sect will conduct a secret investigation internally, and told me to keep silent, not to let the news leak out.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","The exact situation is still undetermined.","It is possible that there are outright traitors within the Rushing Void Sect, betraying the Sect for personal gain.","It could also be that simply because Ling Huxiao’s talent was too outstanding, some old-school elders, out of jealousy and fear, sold out Ling Huxiao’s information, plotting to remove this promising Sword Dao genius through others’ hands.","If Ling Huxiao could grow, leading the way, it would naturally be beneficial for the Rushing Void Sect.","But sometimes, the Sect’s interests do not align with certain elders’ interests.","Some people only want to leech off the Sect.","Whether the Sect prospers means little to them; once the Sect declines, they change allegiances, leeching off another influence.","Mo Hua looked again at Ouyang Mu.","Ouyang Mu seemed a bit lost.","\"That day, I really didn’t know anything...\"","\"I was just cultivating normally in the Disciple’s Residence, felt a bit sleepy, took a nap, and when I woke up, I found myself in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.\"","\"Did you come into contact with any suspicious people before that?\" Mo Hua asked.","Ouyang Mu thought for a moment, then shook his head.","\"Did you take any Pills?\"","\"Yes.\" Ouyang Mu nodded, \"But they were all Pills used for regular cultivation, like Foundation Building Pills and Spirit Gathering Pills.\"","Mo Hua frowned slightly, suddenly recalling something, \"Were all these Pills yours?\"","\"Some were mine, and some...\" Ouyang Mu thought for a moment, suddenly startled, \"Brother Ma gave them to me...\"","Mo Hua’s gaze slightly hardened.","As expected...","That day at the foot of the mountain, he encountered Brother Ma from the Tai’a Sect with Little Wood, claiming to be entrusted by Senior Brother Ouyang Feng to deliver cultivation Pills, Spiritual Artifacts, and Jade Slips to Little Wood.","At that time, he felt that this \"Brother Ma\" had an indistinct air of Evil Qi about him.","Initially, he thought it might have been accidentally picked up.","Now it seemed, this Brother Ma might really have a problem.","\"Where are those Pills?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"I gave them all to my brother.\"","\"Senior Brother Feng?\"","\"Yes,\" Ouyang Mu replied, \"After I returned from the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, my brother came to my room and took some things away, saying he wanted to check them.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","Senior Brother Feng was mature and meticulous, evidently he also sensed something.","Since this was the case, it would not be good for him to interfere.","Moreover, this was a matter internal to the Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect, which had nothing to do with him, a little disciple of the Taixu Sect, after all, he wasn’t a junior brother of Tai’a Sect or Rushing Void Sect either.","After class, the disciples are free to go Monster Hunting.","Ouyang Mu was wooden in demeanor, not well acquainted with his peers.","Ling Huxiao was solitary, also not very sociable.","So, this direct lineage of the Tai’a Sect and a Heavenly Pride of the Rushing Void Sect ended up mingling more with the disciples of the Taixu Sect.","The elders of the Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect, seeing this, could only sigh helplessly.","...","A few days later, Mo Hua unexpectedly encountered Song Jian on Refining Demon Mountain.","This was also the first time Mo Hua had seen Song Jian since the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons incident.","Song Jian had not changed much, he was wearing a dazzling Taoist Robe of the Sever Gold Sect, paired with a luxurious Spirit Sword, with fair skin, looking quite the pretty boy.","What had changed were his followers.","Recently, the situation in the Sever Gold Sect had been turbulent.","After the incident in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, the Jin family was ousted, the Song family rose to power, and began reshuffling, sidelining the Jin family cultivators, supporting the Song family factions to gradually seize control of the influence within the Sever Gold Sect.","The Jin family declined, and the Song family was no longer what it used to be.","And Song Jian, as the core direct lineage of the Song family and a \"meritorious young disciple\" in the chaos of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, naturally received heavy use.","Nowadays, when he went out, the number of his followers was almost double what it had been before.","Even some minor branches of the Jin family, seeking to survive, willingly became his \"tagalongs,\" going out of their way to please him.","Nowadays, Song Jian was quite swaggering when going out.","However, upon seeing Mo Hua, Song Jian’s flamboyant demeanor slightly subsided, his expression became somewhat complex, hesitating to speak several times.","\"Mo...\"","Before he could speak, another disciple of the Sever Gold Sect sneered:","\"That kid from the Taixu Sect in front! You’re clueless, daring to block Young Master Song’s path.\"","\"Indeed, if you don’t move aside soon, be careful not to get into trouble...\"","\"Move quickly!\"","Song Jian’s followers said arrogantly, one after another.","Mo Hua’s expression was subtle.","The Taixu Sect tore down the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, causing the Jin family to step down and allowing the Song family to rise.","Yet, the Song family’s attitude towards the Taixu Sect didn’t seem much different from the Jin family’s.","Not only was this the case with the upper echelons of the Sever Gold Sect, but the disciples below were the same.","Moreover, they caused trouble arbitrarily in the Refining Demon Mountain, recklessly stirring up trouble, and were almost all beaten by the Taixu Sect disciples, who were \"armed to the teeth\" with formations by Mo Hua, thus fostering a deep-seated hostility towards the Taixu Sect."]},{"number":1499,"title":"Chapter 1499 - 808: Traitor_2","paragraphs":["At this moment, seeing Mo Hua in the Taixu Gate Taoist Robe, they naturally looked at him with hostility.","But they didn’t know who Mo Hua was.","Mo Hua hid behind the scenes, barely showing himself.","Therefore, these disciples of the Sever Gold Sect did not realize that the \"Hidden Hand\" at Taixu Gate, who had given them trouble, was this little cultivator before them.","Upon meeting him, they just assumed Mo Hua was a junior disciple of Taixu Gate and shouted at him.","Mo Hua’s temper was not that mild either.","As for Sever Gold Sect disciples, it wasn’t like he hadn’t beaten them before.","As he was considering whether to call someone to come and teach these oblivious Sever Gold Sect disciples a lesson,","Song Jian suddenly said, \"Mo Hua!\"","He drew a sword, pointed it at Mo Hua, and said with a cold sneer:","\"Back then, you offended me and destroyed the sword embryo I had nurtured for eighteen years to forge my own Magical Treasure. I remember this clearly, and today I will settle this One Sword’s grudge!\"","The lackeys nearby started clamoring:","\"To deal with such small fry, why should Young Master personally step in?\"","\"I only need to make a slight move to cut him down with my sword!\"","\"Such Taixu Gate trash, I can easily crush them. I am willing to serve Young Master and avenge this One Sword’s grudge!\"","\"Young Master, I’m willing to make a move!\"","Song Jian’s gaze was icy, \"Where do you get the right to interfere with my grudges?\"","The group of lackeys said again, \"Yes, what Young Master says is true.\"","\"This brat is definitely not a match for Young Master Song in a single bout!\"","Unexpectedly, this flattery stepped on the toes.","Song Jian’s face flushed slightly with shame and anger.","\"Shut up!\"","\"Yes, yes...\" echoed the group.","Song Jian said, \"You stay here, while I...\"","Song Jian glanced at Mo Hua, his tone a bit unnatural, \"will have a showdown with this brat, and then head back to the sect.\"","\"As you command.\"","The crowd said in unison.","Song Jian looked around, then pointed his sword towards a small grove, and said to Mo Hua coldly:","\"I don’t want to win without honor, so in this mountain forest, you and I will have a one-on-one duel, without any interference, to the death!\"","Mo Hua nodded slightly, \"Alright.\"","Then the two of them, one in front and one behind, entered the forest.","The Sever Gold Sect group, following Song Jian’s orders, stayed outside, but they were puzzled, looking at each other.","Someone frowned and said, \"Why would Young Master bother with such a gesture? If there’s a grudge, why don’t we all just go up together and take this kid down?\"","\"Indeed...\"","Someone sneered, \"That’s why I say Young Master Song is a fool.\"","With Song Jian absent, some of them became a bit less respectful and more arrogant.","What they clung to was Song Jian’s status, not Song Jian himself.","In terms of personal ability, they felt they were not inferior to Song Jian, only their birth was lacking.","\"It could also be...\" another disciple smiled and said, \"Young Master Song is afraid of losing, disgracing himself, so he chose a place away from the public eye to compete. Even if he loses to that brat, he won’t lose face in public.\"","\"Young Master Song, could he really lose...\"","\"Lose to that brat?\"","\"Why not?\"","\"Regardless, it shouldn’t be possible. That brat’s Blood Qi and Spiritual Power are so weak; if the Young Master loses, that would be too pathetic...\"","Everyone laughed gloatingly.","In the mountain forest.","Song Jian walked to a secluded spot, sheathed his sword, found a large stone to sit on, and sighed.","Mo Hua was a bit puzzled, \"Aren’t you going to fight?\"","Song Jian said speechlessly, \"I couldn’t beat you anyway, how could I fight?\"","Previously, he still had some arrogance in his heart, thinking that with his strength, he could defeat Mo Hua and avenge his \"Sever Gold Sword\" that had been tortured beyond recognition by Mo Hua.","But after returning from the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, he completely dispelled this notion.","Unbeatable, completely unbeatable.","Not to mention fighting, if he really got into a fight, he might not even know where Mo Hua was.","Moreover, in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, Mo Hua even saved his life...","Song Jian hesitated for a moment, finally sighed deeply and said in a voice almost inaudible:","\"Th-thank you...\"","Mo Hua asked, \"What?\"","Song Jian said angrily and shamefully, \"Thank you!\"","\"Oh...\"","Mo Hua nodded.","\"So, you came to me to thank me for saving your life in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Sort of...\"","After Song Jian finished speaking, his expression changed and he fell silent again.","Mo Hua observed, his gaze moved slightly, and curiously asked, \"Do you... have something on your mind?\"","\"No.\" Song Jian said with a stern face.","Mo Hua naturally didn’t believe him.","\"If you have something on your mind, you can share it with me. I may not help you, but I might be able to give you some advice.\"","Song Jian originally didn’t want to say anything, but looking up at Mo Hua and seeing his clear and profound eyes, he inexplicably felt that saying it wouldn’t be bad.","Besides Mo Hua, he felt there was no one else he could turn to.","Especially regarding matters related to the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons...","Song Jian’s expression was somewhat forlorn, and he said slowly:","\"I find that my father and mother... don’t really care whether I live or die...\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, \"Why do you say that?\"","Song Jian said, \"In the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, I had a little finger cut off and sent to my parents, but there was no reaction from them.\"","\"Jin Gui said that my parents were weighing the pros and cons, considering whether to save me, and if the cost was too great, they’d rather let me die. They’d shed a few tears, but it wouldn’t matter, after all, the Song family doesn’t only have me as a son.\"","\"Initially, I didn’t believe what Jin Gui said...\"","\"But after I returned from the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, I found my parents were delighted, but not as ecstatic as I had imagined...\"","\"They knew early on that I was trapped in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, but took no action at all. Even the elders of the Song family knew, but it seems after some weighing, they planned to just let me...\""]},{"number":1500,"title":"Chapter 1500 - 808 Traitor_3","paragraphs":["Song Jian’s face was grim, \"...treated as a discarded pawn...\"","\"Discarded pawn?\"","Mo Hua was somewhat surprised.","\"Yes,\" Song Jian murmured, \"They are plotting something, even my parents have gained some benefits from it, so they don’t care much about my life or death.\"","\"Me coming back alive seemed to them just an unexpected joy, even...\"","Song Jian’s gaze was ice cold, \"...I seem more like a ’free gift.’","Mo Hua frowned.","The cruelty and indifference based on interest calculations within those families, he had heard of it long ago.","But such a thing happening to Song Jian, he truly hadn’t anticipated before.","\"How many brothers do you have?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Two older brothers,\" Song Jian said, \"I am the youngest, but my talent is far from being as good as my two brothers’, my cultivation is not as diligent as theirs, and I am not as ruthless as them in doing things...\"","Song Jian pointed towards the outside of the woods, \"Moreover, I can’t rally the crowds easily.\"","\"Now that the Song family is gaining influence, there are more hangers-on around me, can’t chase them away, but in truth, I know they look down on me in their hearts.\"","These things, he previously lived comfortably and never thought through.","But in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, having walked once on the edge of the knife, seeing these problems clearly became naturally inevitable.","\"In this world, no one is reliable...\"","\"The sect is unreliable, the family is unreliable, parents are unreliable, brothers are unreliable, let alone those hangers-on.\"","Song Jian’s expression was somewhat dazed.","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then patted Song Jian’s shoulder, \"So, you can only rely on yourself.\"","Song Jian’s expression was indifferent, \"I know I have to rely on myself, but... I can’t even rely on myself...\"","\"It’s fine,\" Mo Hua said generously, \"I’ll help you.\"","Song Jian looked at Mo Hua silently, feeling there was something off about the words.","You’re a disciple of Taixu Gate, having no familial connection or cause to help me, a disciple of Sever Gold Sect?","Mo Hua then said, \"Didn’t I save you?\"","Song Jian nodded, \"Sort of...\"","\"Wouldn’t you say we have shared life-and-death camaraderie?\"","\"Well, sort of...\" Song Jian hesitantly said.","\"There you go then,\" Mo Hua said, \"The Great Dao is a long journey, seeking up and down, surely it is an extremely long process. The most important is to have Taoist friends with aligned ambitions, mutual support, and benefit!\"","\"I’ve saved your life, yet you still don’t trust me?\"","Song Jian hesitated a bit, \"But... our stances are different after all.\"","\"What stance?\"","\"Different sects...\"","\"What does that have to do with you?\" Mo Hua said with a face full of confusion, \"You’re not the Sect Leader of Sever Gold Sect, just a regular disciple, why worry about that?\"","\"But my Song family... after all, is the Song family of Sever Gold Sect, I am a Song family disciple...\"","Before Song Jian could finish, Mo Hua sighed and said:","\"What does that have to do with you then?\"","\"You are a Song family disciple, but at a critical moment, you’ll still be discarded by the Song family. You yourself already said that the family is unreliable, your parents, with three sons, cannot be impartial, they may not always keep you in their hearts; they balance things with interests.\"","\"Since that’s the case, what are you worrysing about by yourself?\"","Song Jian was somewhat bewildered by Mo Hua’s \"persuasion.\"","\"But, you destroyed my Lifebound Sword embryo...\"","Mo Hua: \"A mere Lifebound Sword embryo...\"","Song Jian angrily said: \"What do you mean ’a mere’ Lifebound Sword embryo? This Sword embryo, I’ve carried it since I started learning swordsmanship, nurturing it all the way till now, it cost me eighteen years, never leaving my side! Eighteen years!\"","The more Song Jian thought, the angrier he got, and the more his heart ached.","Mo Hua sighed deeply once again, and asked in return: \"What is the ultimate pursuit of us cultivators?\"","Song Jian was taken aback by Mo Hua’s question, paused for a moment, and said, \"To attain immortality?\"","\"Yes! Immortality!\" Mo Hua asked again, \"How long is immortality?\"","Song Jian frowned, \"Having attained immortality, naturally one would live as long as heaven and earth, why care about the years?\"","\"Exactly!\" Mo Hua said again, \"Therefore, your lifelong pursuit is immortality, to live as long as heaven and earth, for tens of millions of years. What’s the need to care about the mere eighteen years spent nurturing a sword embryo?\"","Song Jian was a bit stunned.","He suddenly felt that what Mo Hua said seemed to make some sense...","Since his goal was to become immortal, to have longevity, to live as long as heaven and earth.","Then the eighteen years of nurturing the sword embryo was but a flick of the fingers, why bother to worry about it?","Mo Hua patted Song Jian on the shoulder, \"So, keep your vision long-term, don’t worry about the gains and losses in front of you, otherwise your heart will be narrow, and it will be difficult to reach the peak of the Great Dao...\"","Song Jian couldn’t help but nod.","But he was still a little worried, \"You say mutual support, how exactly will we support each other? I will not betray the Song family, and I will not betray the Sever Gold Sect either.\"","\"Not asking you to betray...\" Mo Hua said, \"just that we exchange some information, if there’s intelligence I want to know, you tell me, if you encounter trouble, I’ll help you solve it.\"","\"On the surface, you are still a core disciple of the Sever Gold Sect, a direct lineage of the Song family, and at odds with my Taixu Gate, but secretly, we cooperate and progress together.\"","\"This way, we both leave ourselves a way out, and in the future, there will be an extra path for survival when things happen.\"","\"What do you think?\"","Song Jian thought this through and couldn’t help but feel that Mo Hua’s proposal was good.","Asking him to betray the family or the sect was definitely not possible.","But secretly seeking a powerful ally for himself was undoubtedly the best.","The various matters of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons resurfaced in Song Jian’s mind.","He silently sighed in his heart.","Among cultivators of the same realm, Mo Hua was truly too strong...","Not the kind of strength written on paper, but a kind of shrewd, incomprehensible strength.","Leaving people completely in the dark.","If he were Mo Hua’s enemy, he’d have no certainty in his heart.","But if he were an \"ally,\" then he’d be much more at ease.","\"Alright...\"","Song Jian silently nodded, also feeling a huge sense of relief in his heart.","Mo Hua wanted to say something more but suddenly heard someone calling his name from outside the forest, so he said, \"Remember, if you need anything in the future, come find me at Refining Demon Mountain.\"","\"Hmm.\" Song Jian responded.","Afterwards, Mo Hua cast a few Fireball Techniques onto the clearing.","Song Jian was slightly dazed, and then immediately understood, also channeling his spiritual power to slash many swords at the nearby trees, creating a scene of a fierce battle.","Then the two walked out of the forest one after the other, cautiously guarding against each other.","Outside the forest, Cheng Mo and Situ Jian were calling Mo Hua’s name while confronting disciples of the Sever Gold Sect.","Seeing Mo Hua coming out safe and sound, Cheng Mo and the others were relieved.","Mo Hua wiped the nonexistent sweat from his forehead, pointing at Song Jian and sneering coldly:","\"Pretty boy, next time you’ll be sorry!\"","Song Jian was taken aback, then also sneered, \"This time you were lucky, next time we meet, I’ll have you torn to pieces!\"","Afterward, he scoffed coldly, arrogantly turned his head and walked away.","Cheng Mo couldn’t stand his behavior and immediately said angrily, \"You brat, speaking such arrogance, let’s see if I don’t chop you up?\"","\"Alright, alright,\" Mo Hua stopped him, \"it’s getting late, we should head back.\"","\"Junior Brother, are you alright?\" Situ Jian asked.","\"I’m fine, in Refining Demon Mountain, how could anything happen to me?\" Mo Hua said.","Situ Jian thought about it, then nodded and said, \"That’s true.\"","After that, both sides left.","The forest returned to silence once more.","Except for Mo Hua and Song Jian, no one knew about the agreement they secretly reached.","And because this happened during the sect’s \"lesson\" period, Elder Xun Ziyou was not watching Mo Hua, so he knew nothing about it.","On the way back, Mo Hua silently pondered in his heart:","\"Tai’a Sect has an insider, Rushing Void Sect has an insider, now in the Sever Gold Sect, it’s as if there’s also an ’insider’.\"","And it was planted by himself.","The better Song Jian does, the more convenient things will be for him in the future.","\"If one day, he could become an elder, that would be ideal...\"","At this thought, Mo Hua suddenly paused, unable to help but think:","\"This kid Song Jian, could he even become the Sect Leader of the Sever Gold Sect in the future...\""]}]);
